#: ../../export/content/applications/general.rst:3
msgid "General settings"
msgstr "Generelle indstillinger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:3
msgid "Apps and modules"
msgstr "Apps og moduler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:5
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>`, :ref:`upgrade <general/upgrade>` "
"and :ref:`uninstall <general/uninstall>` any needed apps and modules from "
"the :menuselection:`Apps` dashboard."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Installer <general/install>`, :ref:`opgrader <general/upgrade>` "
"og :ref:`afinstaller <general/uninstall>` alle nødvendige apps og moduler "
"fra :menuselection:`Apps`-dashboardet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:8
msgid ""
"By default, an :guilabel:`Apps` filter is applied. To search for modules "
"too, select :guilabel:`Extra` from the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters`."
msgstr ""
"Som standard anvendes et :guilabel:`Apps`-filter. For også at søge efter "
"moduler skal du vælge :guilabel:`Extra` fra :icon:`fa-"
"filter` :guilabel:`Filtre`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:11
msgid "Add \"Extra\" filter in Odoo Apps."
msgstr "Tilføj \"Extra\"-filter i Odoo Apps."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:15
msgid ""
"Adding or removing apps can significantly affect other apps in the database "
"and modify subscription costs. Consider carefully or test the changes in a "
"staging environment before proceeding."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjelse eller fjernelse af apps kan have betydelig indflydelse på andre "
"apps i databasen og ændre abonnementsomkostninger. Overvej nøje eller test "
"ændringerne i et staging-miljø, før du fortsætter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Administrators manage the database**: The administrator of the database is "
"responsible for its usage, as they know best how their organization works."
msgstr ""
"**Administratorer administrerer databasen**: Administratoren af databasen er "
"ansvarlig for dens brug, da de bedst ved, hvordan deres organisation "
"fungerer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Odoo apps can have dependencies**: Installing some apps and features with "
"dependencies may also install additional apps and modules that are "
"technically required, even if database users do not actively use them."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo-apps kan have afhængigheder**: Installation af nogle apps og "
"funktioner med afhængigheder kan også installere yderligere apps og moduler, "
"der er teknisk nødvendige, selvom databasebrugere ikke aktivt bruger dem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Duplicate the database to test apps**: Testing on a duplicate database "
"reveals what app dependencies may be required or what database may be "
"erased. Learn how to duplicate an :doc:`Odoo Online database <../../"
"administration/odoo_online>` or an :doc:`Odoo On-premise database <../../"
"administration/on_premise>`."
msgstr ""
"**Dupliker databasen for at teste apps**: Test på en duplikeret database "
"afslører, hvilke app-afhængigheder der muligvis kræves, eller hvilken "
"database der kan blive slettet. Lær hvordan du duplikerer en :doc:`Odoo "
"Online-database <../../administration/odoo_online>` eller en :doc:`Odoo On-"
"premise-database <../../administration/on_premise>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:32
msgid "Install apps and modules"
msgstr "Installer apps og moduler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:34
msgid ""
"From the main Odoo dashboard, open the :menuselection:`Apps` app, then click "
"on the search bar to find the app to be installed or scroll to find it. From "
"here, click :guilabel:`Activate` on the app's card."
msgstr ""
"Fra Odoos hoveddashboard skal du åbne :menuselection:`Apps`-appen og "
"derefter klikke på søgefeltet for at finde den app, der skal installeres, "
"eller rulle for at finde den. Herfra skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Aktiver` "
"på appens kort."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:39
msgid ""
"If the app or module to be installed is not listed, update the app list by "
"activating :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, and then go "
"to :menuselection:`Apps --> Update Apps List`, and then "
"click :guilabel:`Update`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis den app eller det modul, der skal installeres, ikke er angivet, skal du "
"opdatere app-listen ved at aktivere :ref:`udviklertilstand <developer-mode>` "
"og derefter gå til :menuselection:`Apps --> Opdater app-liste` og derefter "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Opdater`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:46
msgid "Upgrade apps and modules"
msgstr "Opgrader apps og moduler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:48
msgid ""
"With each :doc:`new Odoo release <../../administration/"
"standard_extended_support>`, new improvements or app features are added. "
"Upgrade the app to use these new improvements and features."
msgstr ""
"Med hver :doc:`ny Odoo-udgivelse <../../administration/"
"standard_extended_support>` tilføjes nye forbedringer eller app-funktioner. "
"Opgrader appen for at bruge disse nye forbedringer og funktioner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:51
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Apps` and then on the app to upgrade, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon and "
"select :guilabel:`Upgrade`."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :menuselection:`Apps`, og klik derefter på appen, der skal "
"opgraderes, klik på :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(lodret ellipse)`-"
"ikonet og vælg :guilabel:`Upgrade`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:57
msgid "Uninstall apps and modules"
msgstr "Afinstaller apps og moduler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:60
msgid ""
"Uninstalling apps also deletes their database records. Test uninstalling "
"apps on a duplicated database before removing apps on a production database."
msgstr ""
"Afinstallation af apps sletter også deres database-poster. Test "
"afinstallation af apps på en duplikeret database, før apps fjernes fra en "
"produktionsdatabase."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:64
msgid ""
"Some apps have dependencies, meaning that one app requires another. "
"Therefore, uninstalling one app may uninstall multiple apps and modules."
msgstr ""
"Nogle apps har afhængigheder, hvilket betyder, at én app kræver en anden. "
"Derfor kan afinstallation af én app afinstallere flere apps og moduler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:67
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Apps` and then on the app to uninstall, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon and "
"select :guilabel:`Uninstall` to open the :guilabel:`Uninstall module` pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :menuselection:`Apps`, og klik derefter på appen, der skal "
"afinstalleres, klik på :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(lodret ellipse)`-"
"ikonet og vælg :guilabel:`Uninstall` for at åbne pop-up-"
"vinduet :guilabel:`Uninstall module`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:71
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Apps to Uninstall` section lists the applications to be "
"uninstalled."
msgstr ""
"Sektionen :guilabel:`Apps to Uninstall` viser de applikationer, der skal "
"afinstalleres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:74
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Show All` checkbox to display all module dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Markér afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Show All` for at vise alle "
"modulafhængigheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:76
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Documents to Delete` section lists the database records to be "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Sektionen :guilabel:`Documents to Delete` viser de database-poster, der skal "
"slettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:78
msgid ""
"To proceed with uninstalling the app, its dependencies, and all related "
"database records, click :guilabel:`Uninstall`."
msgstr ""
"For at fortsætte med at afinstallere appen, dens afhængigheder og alle "
"relaterede database-poster, klik på :guilabel:`Uninstall`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:81
msgid "An app's card with the \"Uninstall\" menu option highlighted."
msgstr "En app-kort med menupunktet \"Uninstall\" fremhævet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:85
msgid ""
"The **Restaurant** app requires the **Point of Sale** app to function, so "
"uninstalling the **Point of Sale** app will also uninstall the "
"**Restaurant** app, and any related records."
msgstr ""
"Appen **Restaurant** kræver appen **POS** for at fungere, så afinstallation "
"af appen **POS** vil også afinstallere appen **Restaurant** og alle "
"relaterede poster."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/apps_modules.rst:88
msgid ""
"A warning message showing apps that are uninstalled if the uninstallation is "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"En advarselsbesked, der viser apps, som afinstalleres, hvis afinstallationen "
"gennemføres."

