msgstr ":guilabel:`Sammendragnavn`: navnet på sammendrag-e-mailen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/companies/digest_emails.rst:47
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/companies/digest_emails.rst:177
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Periodicity`: control how often digest emails are sent "
