msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Hyppighed`: angiv, hvor ofte sammendrag-e-mails sendes "
"(:guilabel:`Dagligt`, :guilabel:`Ugentligt`, :guilabel:`Månedligt` "
"eller :guilabel:`Kvartalsvis`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/companies/digest_emails.rst:49
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/companies/digest_emails.rst:179
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Next Send Date`: the date on which the digest email will be sent "
"again."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Næste afsendelsesdato`: datoen, hvor sammendrag-e-mailen sendes "
"igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/companies/digest_emails.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/companies/digest_emails.rst:180
msgid ""
":guilabel:`KPIs` tab: check/uncheck each calculated :abbr:`KPI (key "
"performance indicator)` that appears in digest emails. A ticked box "
"indicates an active :abbr:`KPI (key performance indicator)` in the digest "
