msgid "Manually send digest email"
msgstr "Send digest-e-mail manuelt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/companies/digest_emails.rst:77
msgid ""
"To manually send a digest email, first navigate to :menuselection:`Settings "
"app --> Emails section`, and click :guilabel:`Configure Digest Emails`. "
"Then, select the desired digest email, and click :guilabel:`SEND NOW`. This "
"button is located in the top menu, just above the :guilabel:`Digest Name`."
msgstr ""
"For manuelt at sende en digest-e-mail skal du først navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Settings app --> Emails section` og klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Configure Digest Emails`. Vælg derefter den ønskede digest-e-"
"mail og klik på :guilabel:`SEND NOW`. Denne knap findes i topmenuen lige "
"over :guilabel:`Digest Name`."

