#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:3
msgid "Connect Microsoft Outlook 365 to Odoo using Azure OAuth"
msgstr "Forbind Microsoft Outlook 365 til Odoo ved hjælp af Azure OAuth"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo is compatible with Microsoft's Azure OAuth for Microsoft 365. In order "
"to send and receive secure emails from a custom domain, all that is required "
"is to configure a few settings on the Azure platform and on the back end of "
"the Odoo database. This configuration works with either a personal email "
"address or an address created by a custom domain."
msgstr ""
"Odoo er kompatibel med Microsofts Azure OAuth til Microsoft 365. For at "
"sende og modtage sikre e-mails fra et brugerdefineret domæne kræves det kun "
"at konfigurere nogle få indstillinger på Azure-platformen og i backend af "
"Odoo-databasen. Denne konfiguration fungerer med både en personlig e-"
"mailadresse eller en adresse oprettet af et brugerdefineret domæne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:11
