#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:22
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:40
msgid "Create a new application"
msgstr "Opret en ny applikation"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:24
msgid ""
"To get started, go to `Microsoft's Azure Portal <https://portal.azure.com/"
">`_. Log in with the :guilabel:`Microsoft Outlook Office 365` account if "
"there is one, otherwise log in with the personal :guilabel:`Microsoft "
"account`. A user with administrative access to the Azure Settings will need "
"to connect and perform the following configuration. Next, navigate to the "
"section labeled :guilabel:`Manage Microsoft Entra ID` (formally *Azure "
"Active Directory*)."
msgstr ""
"For at komme i gang, gå til `Microsofts Azure Portal <https://"
"portal.azure.com/>`_. Log ind med :guilabel:`Microsoft Outlook Office 365`-"
"kontoen, hvis der er en, ellers log ind med den "
"personlige :guilabel:`Microsoft-konto`. En bruger med administrativ adgang "
"til Azure-indstillingerne skal forbinde og udføre følgende konfiguration. Gå "
"derefter til sektionen mærket :guilabel:`Administrer Microsoft Entra ID` "
"(tidligere *Azure Active Directory*)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:30
msgid ""
"Now, click on :guilabel:`Add (+)`, located in the top menu, and then "
"select :guilabel:`App registration`. On the :guilabel:`Register an "
"application` screen, rename the :guilabel:`Name` to `Odoo` or something "
"recognizable. Under the :guilabel:`Supported account types` section "
"select :guilabel:`Accounts in any organizational directory (Any Microsoft "
"Entra ID directory - Multitenant) and personal Microsoft accounts (e.g. "
"Skype, Xbox)`."
msgstr ""
"Klik nu på :guilabel:`Tilføj (+)`, placeret i topmenuen, og vælg "
"derefter :guilabel:`Appregistrering`. På skærmbilledet :guilabel:`Registrer "
"en applikation`, omdøb :guilabel:`Navn` til `Odoo` eller noget genkendeligt. "
"Under sektionen :guilabel:`Understøttede kontotyper`, vælg :guilabel:`Konti "
"i enhver organisationsmappe (enhver Microsoft Entra ID-mappe - Multitenant) "
"og personlige Microsoft-konti (f.eks. Skype, Xbox)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:36
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Redirect URL` section, select :guilabel:`Web` as the "
"platform, and then input `https://<web base url>/microsoft_outlook/confirm` "
"in the :guilabel:`URL` field. The `web.base.url` is subject to change "
"depending on the URL used to log in to the database."
msgstr ""
"Under sektionen :guilabel:`Omdirigerings-URL`, vælg :guilabel:`Web` som "
"platform, og indtast derefter `https://<web base url>/microsoft_outlook/"
"confirm` i feltet :guilabel:`URL`. `web.base.url` kan ændres afhængigt af "
"den URL, der bruges til at logge ind på databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:41
msgid ""
"The documentation about the :ref:`web.base.url <domain-name/existing/db-map/"
"web-base-url>` explains how to freeze a unique URL. It is also possible to "
"add different redirect URLs on the Microsoft app."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentationen om :ref:`web.base.url <domain-name/existing/db-map/web-base-"
"url>` forklarer, hvordan man fastfryser en unik URL. Det er også muligt at "
"tilføje forskellige redirect-URL'er på Microsoft-appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:45
msgid ""
"After the URL has been added to the field, :guilabel:`Register` the "
"application, so it is created."
msgstr ""
"Når URL'en er blevet tilføjet til feltet, :guilabel:`Registrer` "
"applikationen, så den oprettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:112
msgid "API permissions"
msgstr "API-tilladelser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:50
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`API permissions` should be set next. Odoo will need specific "
"API permissions to be able to read (IMAP) and send (SMTP) emails in the "
"Microsoft 365 setup. First, click the :guilabel:`API permissions` link, "
"located in the left menu bar. Next, click on the :guilabel:`(+) Add a "
"Permission` button and select :guilabel:`Microsoft Graph` "
"under :guilabel:`Commonly Used Microsoft APIs`. After, select "
"the :guilabel:`Delegated Permissions` option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`API-tilladelserne` bør indstilles herefter. Odoo har brug for "
"specifikke API-tilladelser for at kunne læse (IMAP) og sende (SMTP) e-mails "
"i Microsoft 365-opsætningen. Først, klik på linket :guilabel:`API-"
"tilladelser`, placeret i venstre menubjælke. Klik derefter på "
"knappen :guilabel:`(+) Tilføj en tilladelse` og vælg :guilabel:`Microsoft "
"Graph` under :guilabel:`Almindeligt anvendte Microsoft API'er`. Vælg "
"derefter indstillingen :guilabel:`Delegerede tilladelser`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:56
msgid ""
"In the search bar, search for the following :guilabel:`Delegated "
"permissions` and click :guilabel:`Add permissions` for each one:"
msgstr ""
"I søgefeltet, søg efter følgende :guilabel:`Delegerede tilladelser` og klik "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj tilladelser` for hver enkelt:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:59
msgid ":guilabel:`SMTP.Send`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`SMTP.Send`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:60
msgid ":guilabel:`IMAP.AccessAsUser.All`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`IMAP.AccessAsUser.All`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:63
msgid "The :guilabel:`User.Read` permission will be added by default."
msgstr "Tilladelsen :guilabel:`User.Read` tilføjes som standard."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:65
msgid ""
"API permissions needed for Odoo integration are listed under the Microsoft "
"Graph."
msgstr ""
"API-tilladelser, der er nødvendige for Odoo-integration, er angivet under "
"Microsoft Graph."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:70
msgid "Assign users and groups"
msgstr "Tildel brugere og grupper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:72
msgid ""
"After adding the API permissions, navigate back to the :guilabel:`Overview` "
"of the :guilabel:`Application` in the top of the left sidebar menu."
msgstr ""
"Efter tilføjelse af API-tilladelserne skal du navigere tilbage "
"til :guilabel:`Oversigt` for :guilabel:`Application` øverst i venstre "
"sidebjælkemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:75
msgid ""
"Now, add users to this application. Under the :guilabel:`Essentials` "
"overview table, click on the link labeled :guilabel:`Managed Application in "
"Local Directory`, or the last option on the bottom right-hand side of the "
"table."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj nu brugere til denne applikation. Under "
"oversigtstavlen :guilabel:`Essentials` skal du klikke på linket "
"mærket :guilabel:`Managed Application in Local Directory` eller den sidste "
"indstilling nederst i højre side af tabellen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:79
msgid ""
"Add users/groups by clicking the Managed application in local directory link "
"for the\n"
"created application."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj brugere/grupper ved at klikke på linket Managed application in local "
"directory for den oprettede applikation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:84
msgid ""
"In the left sidebar menu, select :guilabel:`Users and Groups`. Next, click "
"on :guilabel:`(+) Add User/Group`. Depending on the account, either "
"a :guilabel:`Group` and a :guilabel:`User` can be added, or "
"only :guilabel:`Users`. Personal accounts will only allow "
"for :guilabel:`Users` to be added."
msgstr ""
"I venstre sidebjælkemenu skal du vælge :guilabel:`Users and Groups`. Klik "
"derefter på :guilabel:`(+) Add User/Group`. Afhængigt af kontoen kan enten "
"en :guilabel:`Group` og en :guilabel:`Bruger` tilføjes, eller "
"kun :guilabel:`Brugere`. Personlige konti tillader kun, "
"at :guilabel:`Brugere` tilføjes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:89
msgid ""
"Under :guilabel:`Users` or :guilabel:`Groups`, click on :guilabel:`None "
"Selected` and add the users or group of users that will be sending emails "
"from the :guilabel:`Microsoft account` in Odoo. :guilabel:`Add` the users/"
"groups, click :guilabel:`Select`, and then :guilabel:`Assign` them to the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Under :guilabel:`Brugere` eller :guilabel:`Grupper` skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`None Selected` og tilføje de brugere eller brugergrupper, der "
"skal sende e-mails fra :guilabel:`Microsoft-kontoen` i "
"Odoo. :guilabel:`Tilføj` brugerne/grupperne, klik på :guilabel:`Select`, "
"og :guilabel:`tildel` dem derefter til applikationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:95
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:59
msgid "Create credentials"
msgstr "Opret legitimationsoplysninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:97
msgid ""
"Now that the Microsoft Azure app is set up, credentials need to be created "
"for the Odoo setup. These include the :guilabel:`Client ID` "
"and :guilabel:`Client Secret`. To start, the :guilabel:`Client ID` can be "
"copied from the :guilabel:`Overview` page of the app. The :guilabel:`Client "
"ID` or :guilabel:`Application ID` is located under the :guilabel:`Display "
"Name` in the :guilabel:`Essentials` overview of the app."
msgstr ""
"Nu hvor Microsoft Azure-appen er konfigureret, skal der oprettes "
"legitimationsoplysninger til Odoo-opsætningen. Disse "
"omfatter :guilabel:`Client ID` og :guilabel:`Client Secret`. Til at starte "
"med kan :guilabel:`Client ID` kopieres fra :guilabel:`Oversigts`siden for "
"appen. :guilabel:`Client ID` eller :guilabel:`Application ID` findes "
"under :guilabel:`Display Name` i :guilabel:`Essentials`-oversigten for appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:103
msgid "Application/Client ID located in the Overview of the app."
msgstr "Application/Client ID placeret i oversigten for appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:107
msgid ""
"Next, the :guilabel:`Client Secret Value` needs to be retrieved. To get this "
"value, click on :guilabel:`Certificates & Secrets` in the left sidebar menu. "
"Then, a :guilabel:`Client Secret` needs to be produced. In order to do this, "
"click on the :guilabel:`(+) New Client Secret` button."
msgstr ""
"Derefter skal :guilabel:`Client Secret Value` hentes. For at få denne værdi "
"skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Certificates & Secrets` i venstre "
"sidebjælkemenu. Derefter skal en :guilabel:`Client Secret` oprettes. For at "
"gøre dette skal du klikke på knappen :guilabel:`(+) New Client Secret`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:111
msgid ""
"A window on the right will populate with a button labeled :guilabel:`Add a "
"client secret`. Under :guilabel:`Description`, type in `Odoo Fetchmail` or "
"something recognizable, and then set the :guilabel:`expiration date`."
msgstr ""
"Et vindue til højre åbnes med en knap mærket :guilabel:`Add a client "
"secret`. Under :guilabel:`Description` skal du skrive `Odoo Fetchmail` eller "
"noget genkendeligt og derefter indstille :guilabel:`udløbsdatoen`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:116
msgid ""
"A new :guilabel:`Client Secret` will need to be produced and configured if "
"the first one expires. In this event, there could be an interruption of "
"service, so the expiration date should be noted and set to the furthest "
"possible date."
msgstr ""
"En ny :guilabel:`Client Secret` skal oprettes og konfigureres, hvis den "
"første udløber. I så fald kan der opstå en afbrydelse af tjenesten, så "
"udløbsdatoen bør noteres og indstilles til den længst mulige dato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:120
msgid ""
"Next, click on :guilabel:`Add` when these two values are entered. "
"A :guilabel:`Client Secret Value` and :guilabel:`Secret ID` will be created. "
"It is important to copy the :guilabel:`Value` or :guilabel:`Client Secret "
"Value` into a notepad as it will become encrypted after leaving this page. "
"The :guilabel:`Secret ID` is not needed."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Add`, når disse to værdier er indtastet. "
"En :guilabel:`Client Secret Value` og et :guilabel:`Secret ID` oprettes. Det "
"er vigtigt at kopiere :guilabel:`Value` eller :guilabel:`Client Secret "
"Value` til en notesblok, da den vil blive krypteret efter at have forladt "
"denne side. :guilabel:`Secret ID` er ikke nødvendigt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:125
msgid "Client Secret Value or Value in the app's credentials."
msgstr "Client Secret Value eller Value i appens legitimationsoplysninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:129
msgid ""
"After these steps, the following items should be ready to be set up in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Efter disse trin bør følgende elementer være klar til at blive konfigureret "
"i Odoo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:131
msgid "A client ID (:guilabel:`Client ID` or :guilabel:`Application ID`)"
msgstr "Et client ID (:guilabel:`Client ID` eller :guilabel:`Application ID`)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:132
msgid "A client secret (:guilabel:`Value` or :guilabel:`Client Secret Value`)"
msgstr ""
"En client secret (:guilabel:`Value` eller :guilabel:`Client Secret Value`)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:134
msgid ""
"This completes the setup on the :guilabel:`Microsoft Azure Portal` side."
msgstr ""
"Dette afslutter opsætningen på :guilabel:`Microsoft Azure Portal`-siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:137
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:111
msgid "Setup in Odoo"
msgstr "Opsætning i Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:140
msgid "Enter Microsoft Outlook credentials"
msgstr "Indtast Microsoft Outlook-legitimationsoplysninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:142
msgid ""
"First, open the Odoo database and navigate to the :guilabel:`Apps` module. "
"Then, remove the :guilabel:`Apps` filter from the search bar and type in "
"`Outlook`. After that, install the module called :guilabel:`Microsoft "
"Outlook`."
msgstr ""
"Åbn først Odoo-databasen og naviger til modulet :guilabel:`Apps`. Fjern "
"derefter :guilabel:`Apps`-filteret fra søgelinjen og skriv `Outlook`. "
"Installer derefter modulet kaldet :guilabel:`Microsoft Outlook`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:146
msgid ""
"Next, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> General Settings`, and under "
"the *Emails* section, ensure that the checkbox for :guilabel:`Use Custom "
"Email Servers` is checked. This populates a new option "
"for :guilabel:`Outlook Credentials`."
msgstr ""
"Gå derefter til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Generelle indstillinger`, "
"og under afsnittet *E-mails* skal du sikre dig, at afkrydsningsfeltet "
"for :guilabel:`Brug brugerdefinerede e-mailservere` er markeret. Dette giver "
"en ny mulighed for :guilabel:`Outlook-legitimationsoplysninger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:150
msgid ":guilabel:`Save` the progress."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Gem` fremskridtet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:152
msgid ""
"Then, copy and paste the :guilabel:`ID` (Application ID) "
"and :guilabel:`Secret (Client Secret Value)` into the respective fields "
"and :guilabel:`Save` the settings."
msgstr ""
"Kopier og indsæt derefter :guilabel:`ID` (applikations-ID) "
"og :guilabel:`Hemmelighed (klienthemmelig værdi)` i de respektive felter, "
"og :guilabel:`Gem` indstillingerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:155
msgid "Outlook Credentials in Odoo General Settings."
msgstr "Outlook-legitimationsoplysninger i Odoos generelle indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:160
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:127
msgid "Configure outgoing email server"
msgstr "Konfigurer udgående e-mailserver"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:162
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`General Settings` page, under the :guilabel:`Custom Email "
"Servers` setting, click the :guilabel:`Outgoing Email Servers` link to "
"configure the Microsoft account."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Generelle indstillinger` under "
"indstillingen :guilabel:`Brugerdefinerede e-mailservere` klik på "
"linket :guilabel:`Udgående e-mailservere` for at konfigurere Microsoft-"
"kontoen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:165
msgid ""
"Then, create a new email server and check the box for :guilabel:`Outlook`. "
"Next, fill in the :guilabel:`Name` (it can be anything) and the Microsoft "
"Outlook email :guilabel:`Username`."
msgstr ""
"Opret derefter en ny e-mailserver og markér afkrydsningsfeltet "
"for :guilabel:`Outlook`. Udfyld dernæst :guilabel:`Navn` (det kan være hvad "
"som helst) og Microsoft Outlook-e-mail :guilabel:`Brugernavn`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:168
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`From Filter` field is empty, enter either a :ref:`domain "
"or email address <email-outbound-unique-address>`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis feltet :guilabel:`Fra-filter` er tomt, indtast enten et :ref:`domæne "
"eller e-mailadresse <email-outbound-unique-address>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:171
msgid "Then, click on :guilabel:`Connect your Outlook account`."
msgstr "Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Tilslut din Outlook-konto`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:173
msgid ""
"A new window from Microsoft opens to complete the :guilabel:`authorization "
"process`. Select the appropriate email address that is being configured in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Et nyt vindue fra Microsoft åbnes for at "
"fuldføre :guilabel:`autorisationsprocessen`. Vælg den relevante e-"
"mailadresse, der konfigureres i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:176
msgid "Permission page to grant access between newly created app and Odoo."
msgstr "Tilladelses side til at give adgang mellem nyoprettet app og Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:180
msgid ""
"Then, allow Odoo to access the Microsoft account by clicking "
"on :guilabel:`Yes`. After this, the page will navigate back to the newly "
"configured :guilabel:`Outgoing Mail Server` in Odoo. The configuration "
"automatically loads the :guilabel:`token` in Odoo, and a tag "
"stating :guilabel:`Outlook Token Valid` appears in green."
msgstr ""
"Tillad derefter Odoo at få adgang til Microsoft-kontoen ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Ja`. Herefter navigerer siden tilbage til den nyligt "
"konfigurerede :guilabel:`udgående mailserver` i Odoo. Konfigurationen "
"indlæser automatisk :guilabel:`tokenet` i Odoo, og en tag med "
"teksten :guilabel:`Outlook-token gyldigt` vises med grønt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:185
msgid "Valid Outlook Token indicator."
msgstr "Indikator for gyldigt Outlook-token."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:189
msgid ""
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Test Connection`. A confirmation message should "
"appear. The Odoo database can now send safe, secure emails through Microsoft "
"Outlook using OAuth authentication."
msgstr ""
"Klik endelig på :guilabel:`Test forbindelse`. En bekræftelsesmeddelelse "
"skulle vises. Odoo-databasen kan nu sende sikre e-mails gennem Microsoft "
"Outlook ved hjælp af OAuth-godkendelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:195
msgid "Configuration with a single outgoing mail server"
msgstr "Konfiguration med en enkelt udgående mailserver"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:197
msgid ""
"Configuring a single outgoing server is the simplest configuration available "
"for Microsoft Azure and it doesn't require extensive access rights for the "
"users in the database."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguration af en enkelt udgående server er den enkleste tilgængelige "
"konfiguration for Microsoft Azure, og den kræver ikke omfattende "
"adgangsrettigheder for brugerne i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:200
msgid ""
"A generic email address would be used to send emails for all users within "
"the database. For example it could be structured with a `notifications` "
"alias (`notifications@example.com`) or `contact` alias "
"(`contact@example.com`). This address must be set as the :guilabel:`FROM "
"Filtering` on the server. This address must also match the "
"`{mail.default.from}@{mail.catchall.domain}` key combination in the system "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"En generisk e-mailadresse ville blive brugt til at sende e-mails for alle "
"brugere i databasen. Den kunne for eksempel struktureres med et "
"`notifications`-alias (`notifications@example.com`) eller et `contact`-alias "
"(`contact@example.com`). Denne adresse skal angives som :guilabel:`FRA-"
"filtrering` på serveren. Denne adresse skal også matche nøglekombinationen "
"`{mail.default.from}@{mail.catchall.domain}` i systemparametrene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:207
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:249
msgid ""
"Visit the :ref:`From Filtering <email-outbound-different-servers-"
"personalized-from-filtering>` documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Besøg dokumentationen for :ref:`Fra-filtrering <email-outbound-different-"
"servers-personalized-from-filtering>` for mere information."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:211
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:257
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`System Parameters` can be accessed by "
"activating :ref:`developer-mode` in the :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Technical --> Parameters --> System Parameters` menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Systemparametre` kan tilgås ved at aktivere :ref:`developer-mode` "
"i menuen :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> Parametre --> "
"Systemparametre`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:214
msgid ""
"When using this configuration, every email that is sent from the database "
"will use the address of the configured `notification` mailbox. However it "
"should be noted that the name of the sender will appear but their email "
"address will change:"
msgstr ""
"Når denne konfiguration bruges, vil hver e-mail, der sendes fra databasen, "
"bruge adressen på den konfigurerede `notification`-postkasse. Det bør dog "
"bemærkes, at afsenderens navn vises, men deres e-mailadresse ændres:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:218
msgid "Name from real sender with static email."
msgstr "Navn fra rigtig afsender med statisk e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:223
msgid "Single outgoing mail server configuration:"
msgstr "Konfiguration af enkelt udgående mailserver:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:225
msgid "Outgoing mail server **username** (login) = `notifications@example.com`"
msgstr ""
"Udgående mailserver **brugernavn** (login) = `notifications@example.com`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:226
msgid ""
"Outgoing mail server :guilabel:`FROM Filtering` = `notifications@example.com`"
msgstr ""
"Udgående mailserver :guilabel:`FRA-filtrering` = `notifications@example.com`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:227
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:282
msgid "`mail.catchall.domain` in system parameters = `example.com`"
msgstr "<mail.catchall.domain> i systemparametre = `example.com`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:228
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:283
msgid "`mail.default.from` in system parameters = `notifications`"
msgstr "<mail.default.from> i systemparametre = `notifications`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:231
msgid "User-specific (multiple user) configuration"
msgstr "Brugerspecifik (flere brugere) konfiguration"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:233
msgid ""
"In addition to a generic email server, individual email servers can be set "
"up for users in a database. These email addresses must be set as "
"the :guilabel:`FROM Filtering` on each individual server for this "
"configuration to work."
msgstr ""
"Ud over en generisk e-mailserver kan individuelle e-mailservere oprettes for "
"brugere i en database. Disse e-mailadresser skal angives som :guilabel:`FRA-"
"filtrering` på hver enkelt server, for at denne konfiguration kan fungere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:237
msgid ""
"This configuration is the more difficult of the two Microsoft Azure "
"configurations, in that it requires all users configured with email servers "
"to have access rights to settings in order to establish a connection to the "
"email server."
msgstr ""
"Denne konfiguration er den sværeste af de to Microsoft Azure-"
"konfigurationer, idet den kræver, at alle brugere, der er konfigureret med e-"
"mailservere, har adgangsrettigheder til indstillinger for at etablere en "
"forbindelse til e-mailserveren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:242
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Opsætning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:244
msgid ""
"Each user should have a separate email server set up. The :guilabel:`FROM "
"Filtering` should be set so that only the user's email is sent from that "
"server. In other words, only a user with an email address that matches the "
"set :guilabel:`FROM Filtering` is able to use this server."
msgstr ""
"Hver bruger skal have en separat e-mailserver opsat. :guilabel:`FRA-"
"filtrering` skal angives, så kun brugerens e-mail sendes fra den pågældende "
"server. Med andre ord kan kun en bruger med en e-mailadresse, der matcher "
"den angivne :guilabel:`FRA-filtrering`, bruge denne server."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:252
msgid ""
"A :ref:`fallback server <azure_oauth/notifications>` must be setup to allow "
"for the sending of :guilabel:`notifications`. The :guilabel:`FROM Filtering` "
"for this server should have the value of the `{mail.default.from}"
"@{mail.catchall.domain}`."
msgstr ""
"En :ref:`fallback-server <azure_oauth/notifications>` skal oprettes for at "
"tillade afsendelse af :guilabel:`notifikationer`. :guilabel:`FRA-filtrering` "
"for denne server skal have værdien `{mail.default.from}"
"@{mail.catchall.domain}`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:261
msgid ""
"The configuration for this transactional email server can work alongside an "
"outgoing mass-mailing email server. The :guilabel:`FROM Filtering` for the "
"mass-mailing email server can remain empty, but it's require to be added in "
"the settings of the *Email Marketing* application."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurationen for denne transaktionelle e-mailserver kan fungere sammen "
"med en udgående masse-e-mailserver. :guilabel:`FRA-filtrering` for masse-e-"
"mailserveren kan forblive tom, men den skal tilføjes i indstillingerne for "
"applikationen *E-mailmarketing*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:266
msgid ""
"For more information on setting the mass-mailing email server "
"visit :ref:`email-outbound-custom-domain-smtp-server`."
msgstr ""
"For mere information om opsætning af masse-e-mailserveren besøg :ref:`email-"
"outbound-custom-domain-smtp-server`."

