#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:281
msgid "System Parameters"
msgstr "Systemparametre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:286
msgid "Configure incoming email server"
msgstr "Konfigurer indgående e-mailserver"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:288
msgid ""
"The incoming account should be configured in a similar way to the outgoing "
"email account. Navigate to the :guilabel:`Incoming Mail Servers` in "
"the :guilabel:`Technical Menu` and :guilabel:`Create` a new configuration. "
"Check or Select the button next to :guilabel:`Outlook Oauth Authentication` "
"and enter the :guilabel:`Microsoft Outlook username`.  Click "
"on :guilabel:`Connect your Outlook account`. Odoo will "
"state: :guilabel:`Outlook Token Valid` Now :guilabel:`Test and Confirm` the "
"account. The account should be ready to receive email to the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Den indgående konto skal konfigureres på samme måde som den udgående e-"
"mailkonto. Naviger til :guilabel:`Indgående mailservere` i "
"den :guilabel:`Tekniske menu` og :guilabel:`Opret` en ny konfiguration. "
"Marker eller vælg knappen ved siden af :guilabel:`Outlook Oauth-godkendelse` "
"og indtast :guilabel:`Microsoft Outlook-brugernavn`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Forbind din Outlook-konto`. Odoo vil "
"angive: :guilabel:`Outlook-token gyldigt`. :guilabel:`Test og bekræft` nu "
"kontoen. Kontoen skulle være klar til at modtage e-mails til Odoo-databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:3
msgid "Configure DNS records to send emails in Odoo"
msgstr "Konfigurer DNS-poster for at sende e-mails i Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:5
msgid ""
"This documentation presents three complementary authentication protocols "
"(SPF, DKIM, and DMARC) used to prove the legitimacy of an email sender. Not "
"complying with these protocols will greatly reduce chances of your emails to "
"reach their destination."
msgstr ""
"Denne dokumentation præsenterer tre komplementære godkendelsesprotokoller "
"(SPF, DKIM og DMARC), der bruges til at bevise legitimiteten af en e-"
"mailafsender. Manglende overholdelse af disse protokoller vil i høj grad "
"reducere chancerne for, at dine e-mails når deres destination."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:9
msgid ""
"**Odoo Online** and **Odoo.sh** databases using the **default Odoo subdomain "
"address** (e.g., `\\@company-name.odoo.com`) are pre-configured to **send "
"authenticated emails** compliant with the SPF, DKIM, and DMARC protocols."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo Online** og **Odoo.sh** databaser, der bruger **standard Odoo-"
"subdomæneadressen** (f.eks. `\\@virksomhedsnavn.odoo.com`), er "
"forudkonfigureret til at **sende godkendte e-mails**, der overholder SPF-, "
"DKIM- og DMARC-protokollerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:13
msgid ""
"If choosing to use a **custom domain** instead, **configuring SPF and DKIM "
"records correctly is essential** to prevent emails from being quarantined as "
"spam or not being delivered to recipients."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du vælger at bruge et **brugerdefineret domæne** i stedet, er **korrekt "
"konfiguration af SPF- og DKIM-poster afgørende** for at forhindre, at e-"
"mails sættes i karantæne som spam eller ikke leveres til modtagere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:16
msgid ""
"If using :ref:`the default Odoo email server to send emails from a custom "
"domain <email-outbound-custom-domain-odoo-server>`, the SPF and DKIM records "
"must be configured as presented below. If using an outgoing email server, it "
"is required to use the SPF and DKIM records specific to that email service "
"and a custom domain."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du bruger :ref:`standard Odoo-e-mailserveren til at sende e-mails fra "
"et brugerdefineret domæne <email-outbound-custom-domain-odoo-server>`, skal "
"SPF- og DKIM-posterne konfigureres som vist nedenfor. Hvis du bruger en "
"udgående e-mailserver, er det nødvendigt at bruge de SPF- og DKIM-poster, "
"der er specifikke for den pågældende e-mailtjeneste og et brugerdefineret "
"domæne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:22
msgid ""
"Email service providers apply different rules to incoming emails. An email "
"may be classified as spam even if it passes the SPF and DKIM checks."
msgstr ""
"E-mailudbydere anvender forskellige regler for indgående e-mails. En e-mail "
"kan blive klassificeret som spam, selvom den består SPF- og DKIM-"
"kontrollerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:28
msgid "SPF (Sender Policy Framework)"
msgstr "SPF (Sender Policy Framework)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:30
msgid ""
"The Sender Policy Framework (SPF) protocol allows the owner of a domain name "
"to specify which servers are allowed to send emails from that domain. When a "
"server receives an incoming email, it checks whether the IP address of the "
"sending server is on the list of allowed IPs according to the "
"sender's :abbr:`SPF (Sender Policy Framework)` record."
msgstr ""
"Sender Policy Framework (SPF)-protokollen giver ejeren af et domænenavn "
"mulighed for at specificere, hvilke servere der må sende e-mails fra det "
"pågældende domæne. Når en server modtager en indgående e-mail, kontrollerer "
"den, om IP-adressen på den afsendende server er på listen over tilladte "
"IP'er i henhold til afsenderens :abbr:`SPF (Sender Policy Framework)`-post."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:35
msgid ""
"In Odoo, the **SPF test is performed on the bounce address** defined under "
"the :guilabel:`Alias Domain` field found under the "
"database's :guilabel:`General Settings`. If using a custom domain "
"as :guilabel:`Alias Domain`, it is necessary to configure it to be SPF-"
"compliant."
msgstr ""
"I Odoo udføres **SPF-testen på bounce-adressen**, der er defineret under "
"feltet :guilabel:`Aliasdomæne`, som findes under "
"databasens :guilabel:`Generelle indstillinger`. Hvis du bruger et "
"brugerdefineret domæne som :guilabel:`Aliasdomæne`, er det nødvendigt at "
"konfigurere det til at være SPF-kompatibelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:39
msgid ""
"The SPF policy of a domain is set using a TXT record. The way to create or "
"modify this record depends on the provider hosting the :abbr:`DNS (Domain "
"Name System)` zone of the domain name."
msgstr ""
"SPF-politikken for et domæne angives ved hjælp af en TXT-post. Måden at "
"oprette eller ændre denne post på afhænger af udbyderen, der "
"hoster :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`-zonen for domænenavnet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:42
msgid ""
"If the domain name does not yet have an SPF record, create one using the "
"following input:"
msgstr ""
"Hvis domænenavnet endnu ikke har en SPF-post, skal du oprette en ved hjælp "
"af følgende input:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:48
msgid ""
"If the domain name **already has an SPF record, the record must be "
"updated**. Do not create a new one, as a domain must have only one SPF "
"record."
msgstr ""
"Hvis domænenavnet **allerede har en SPF-post, skal posten opdateres**. Opret "
"ikke en ny, da et domæne kun må have én SPF-post."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:52
msgid ""
"If the TXT record is `v=spf1 include:_spf.google.com ~all`, edit it to add "
"`include:_spf.odoo.com`: `v=spf1 include:_spf.odoo.com "
"include:_spf.google.com ~all`"
msgstr ""
"Hvis TXT-posten er `v=spf1 include:_spf.google.com ~all`, skal du redigere "
"den for at tilføje `include:_spf.odoo.com`: `v=spf1 include:_spf.odoo.com "
"include:_spf.google.com ~all`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:55
msgid ""
"Check the SPF record using a tool like `MXToolbox SPF Record Check <https://"
"mxtoolbox.com/spf.aspx>`_. The process to create or modify an SPF record "
"depends on the provider hosting the DNS zone of the domain name. "
"The :ref:`most common providers <email-domain-providers-documentation>` and "
"their documentation are listed below."
msgstr ""
"Kontroller SPF-posten ved hjælp af et værktøj som `MXToolbox SPF Record "
"Check <https://mxtoolbox.com/spf.aspx>`_. Processen til at oprette eller "
"ændre en SPF-post afhænger af udbyderen, der hoster DNS-zonen for "
"domænenavnet. De :ref:`mest almindelige udbydere <email-domain-providers-"
"documentation>` og deres dokumentation er listet nedenfor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:63
msgid "DKIM (DomainKeys Identified Mail)"
msgstr "DKIM (DomainKeys Identified Mail)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:65
msgid ""
"The DomainKeys Identified Mail (DKIM) allows a user to authenticate emails "
"with a digital signature."
msgstr ""
"DomainKeys Identified Mail (DKIM) giver en bruger mulighed for at godkende e-"
"mails med en digital signatur."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:67
msgid ""
"When sending an email, the Odoo email server includes a unique :abbr:`DKIM "
"(DomainKeys Identified Mail)` signature in the headers. The recipient's "
"server decrypts this signature using the DKIM record in the database's "
"domain name. If the signature and the key contained in the record match, it "
"proves the message is authentic and has not been altered during transport."
msgstr ""
"Når der sendes en e-mail, inkluderer Odoos e-mailserver en unik :abbr:`DKIM "
"(DomainKeys Identified Mail)`-signatur i headerne. Modtagerens server "
"dekrypterer denne signatur ved hjælp af DKIM-posten i databasens domænenavn. "
"Hvis signaturen og nøglen i posten stemmer overens, beviser det, at beskeden "
"er ægte og ikke er blevet ændret under transporten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:72
msgid ""
"Enabling DKIM is **required** when sending emails **from a custom domain** "
"using the Odoo email server."
msgstr ""
"Aktivering af DKIM er **påkrævet**, når du sender e-mails **fra et "
"brugerdefineret domæne** ved hjælp af Odoo-e-mailserveren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:75
msgid ""
"To enable DKIM, add a :abbr:`CNAME (Canonical Name)` record to "
"the :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)` zone of the domain name:"
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere DKIM skal du tilføje en :abbr:`CNAME (Canonical Name)`-post "
"til :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`-zonen for domænenavnet:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:83
msgid ""
"If the domain name is `company-name.com`, make sure to create a subdomain "
"`odoo._domainkey.company-name.com` whose canonical name is "
"`odoo._domainkey.odoo.com.`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis domænenavnet er `company-name.com`, skal du sørge for at oprette et "
"underdomæne `odoo._domainkey.company-name.com`, hvis kanoniske navn er "
"`odoo._domainkey.odoo.com.`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:86
msgid ""
"The way to create or modify a CNAME record depends on the provider hosting "
"the DNS zone of the domain name. The :ref:`most common providers <email-"
"domain-providers-documentation>` and their documentation are listed below."
msgstr ""
"Måden at oprette eller ændre en CNAME-post på afhænger af udbyderen, der "
"hoster DNS-zonen for domænenavnet. De :ref:`mest almindelige udbydere <email-"
"domain-providers-documentation>` og deres dokumentation er listet nedenfor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:90
msgid ""
"Check if the DKIM record is valid using a tool like `MXToolbox DKIM Record "
"Lookup <https://mxtoolbox.com/dkim.aspx>`_. Enter `example.com:odoo` in the "
"DKIM lookup tool, specifying that the selector being tested is `odoo` for "
"the custom domain `example.com`."
msgstr ""
"Tjek om DKIM-posten er gyldig ved hjælp af et værktøj som `MXToolbox DKIM "
"Record Lookup <https://mxtoolbox.com/dkim.aspx>`_. Indtast "
"`example.com:odoo` i DKIM-opslagsværktøjet for at angive, at den selektor, "
"der testes, er `odoo` for det brugerdefinerede domæne `example.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:97
msgid "DMARC (Domain-based Message Authentication, Reporting and Conformance)"
msgstr "DMARC (Domain-based Message Authentication, Reporting and Conformance)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:99
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`DMARC (Domain-based Message Authentication, Reporting, & "
"Conformance)` record is a protocol that unifies :abbr:`SPF (Sender Policy "
"Framework)` and :abbr:`DKIM (DomainKeys Identified Mail)`. The instructions "
"contained in the DMARC record of a domain name tell the destination server "
"what to do with an incoming email that fails the SPF and/or DKIM check."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`DMARC (Domain-based Message Authentication, Reporting, & "
"Conformance)`-recorden er en protokol, der forener :abbr:`SPF (Sender Policy "
"Framework)` og :abbr:`DKIM (DomainKeys Identified Mail)`. Instruktionerne i "
"DMARC-recorden for et domænenavn fortæller destinationsserveren, hvad den "
"skal gøre med en indgående e-mail, der fejler SPF- og/eller DKIM-kontrollen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:105
msgid ""
"The aim of this documentation is to help **understand the impact DMARC has "
"on the deliverability of emails**, rather than give precise instructions for "
"creating a DMARC record. Refer to a resource like `DMARC.org <https://"
"dmarc.org/>`_ to set the DMARC record."
msgstr ""
"Formålet med denne dokumentation er at hjælpe med at **forstå den "
"indvirkning DMARC har på levering af e-mails**, snarere end at give præcise "
"instruktioner til oprettelse af en DMARC-record. Se en ressource som "
"`DMARC.org <https://dmarc.org/>`_ for at opsætte DMARC-recorden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:109
msgid "There are three DMARC policies:"
msgstr "Der er tre DMARC-politikker:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:111
msgid "`p=none`"
msgstr "`p=none`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:112
msgid "`p=quarantine`"
msgstr "`p=quarantine`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:113
msgid "`p=reject`"
msgstr "`p=reject`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:115
msgid ""
"`p=quarantine` and `p=reject` instruct the server that receives an email to "
"quarantine that email or ignore it if the SPF or DKIM check fails."
msgstr ""
"`p=quarantine` og `p=reject` instruerer serveren, der modtager en e-mail, om "
"at sætte den e-mail i karantæne eller ignorere den, hvis SPF- eller DKIM-"
"kontrollen fejler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:119
msgid ""
"**For the DMARC to pass, the DKIM or SPF check needs to pass** and the "
"domains must be in alignment. If the hosting type is Odoo Online, DKIM "
"configuration on the sending domain is required to pass the DMARC."
msgstr ""
"**For at DMARC kan bestå, skal DKIM- eller SPF-kontrollen bestå**, og "
"domænerne skal være i overensstemmelse. Hvis hostingtypen er Odoo Online, "
"kræves DKIM-konfiguration på det afsendende domæne for at bestå DMARC."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:123
msgid ""
"Passing DMARC generally means that the email will be successfully delivered. "
"However, it's important to note that **other factors like spam filters can "
"still reject or quarantine a message**."
msgstr ""
"At bestå DMARC betyder generelt, at e-mailen vil blive leveret. Det er dog "
"vigtigt at bemærke, at **andre faktorer som spamfiltre stadig kan afvise "
"eller sætte en besked i karantæne**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:126
msgid ""
"`p=none` is used for the domain owner to receive reports about entities "
"using their domain. It should not impact the deliverability."
msgstr ""
"`p=none` bruges til, at domæneejeren kan modtage rapporter om enheder, der "
"bruger deres domæne. Det bør ikke påvirke leveringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:130
msgid ""
":literal:`_dmarc IN TXT “v=DMARC1; p=none; "
"rua=mailto:postmaster@example.com”` means that aggregate DMARC reports will "
"be sent to `postmaster\\@example.com`."
msgstr ""
":literal:`_dmarc IN TXT “v=DMARC1; p=none; "
"rua=mailto:postmaster@example.com”` betyder, at aggregerede DMARC-rapporter "
"vil blive sendt til `postmaster\\@example.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:137
msgid "SPF, DKIM and DMARC documentation of common providers"
msgstr "SPF-, DKIM- og DMARC-dokumentation fra almindelige udbydere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:139
msgid ""
"`OVH DNS <https://docs.ovh.com/us/en/domains/"
"web_hosting_how_to_edit_my_dns_zone/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`OVH DNS <https://docs.ovh.com/us/en/domains/"
"web_hosting_how_to_edit_my_dns_zone/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:140
msgid ""
"`GoDaddy TXT record <https://www.godaddy.com/help/add-a-txt-record-19232>`_"
msgstr ""
"`GoDaddy TXT record <https://www.godaddy.com/help/add-a-txt-record-19232>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_domain.rst:141
msgid ""
"`GoDaddy CNAME record <https://www.godaddy.com/help/add-a-cname-"
