#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:5
msgid ""
"An inbound message is an email delivered to an Odoo database. Anyone can "
"send an email to an email alias created in the database or reply to an email "
"that was previously sent from the database based on the *reply-to* header."
msgstr ""
"En indgående besked er en email, der leveres til en Odoo-database. Enhver "
"kan sende en email til et emailalias oprettet i databasen eller svare på en "
"email, der tidligere er sendt fra databasen baseret på *reply-to*-headeren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:12
msgid "Email aliases"
msgstr "Emailaliaser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:17
msgid "Model specific aliases"
msgstr "Modelspecifikke aliaser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:19
msgid ""
"Some applications have their specific aliases (sales teams, helpdesk teams, "
"projects, etc.). These aliases are used to:"
msgstr ""
"Nogle applikationer har deres specifikke aliaser (salgsteams, "
"kundeserviceteams, projekter osv.). Disse aliaser bruges til at:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:22
msgid "Create a record when an email is sent directly to the alias,"
msgstr "Oprette en post, når en email sendes direkte til aliaset,"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:23
msgid "Receive replies to an email initially sent from a record."
msgstr "Modtage svar på en email, der oprindeligt blev sendt fra en post."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:27
msgid "The local-part \"info\" is used for the alias of the sales team."
msgstr "Den lokale del \"info\" bruges til salgsteamets alias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:30
msgid ""
"In the example displayed above, sending an email to `info@company-"
"name.odoo.com` will create a new opportunity or a new lead automatically "
"assigned to the corresponding sales team. If an email is sent from the "
"chatter of an existing opportunity, the *reply-to* will be `info@company-"
"name.odoo.com`. The reply will be posted in the right chatter, according to "
"the *message-id* header."
msgstr ""
"I eksemplet vist ovenfor vil afsendelse af en email til `info@company-"
"name.odoo.com` automatisk oprette en ny mulighed eller et nyt lead, der "
"tildeles det tilsvarende salgsteam. Hvis en email sendes fra chatteren på en "
"eksisterende mulighed, vil *reply-to* være `info@company-name.odoo.com`. "
"Svaret vil blive postet i den rigtige chatter i henhold til *message-id*-"
"headeren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:39
msgid "Catchall"
msgstr "Catchall"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:41
msgid ""
"If an application does not have an alias, a generic fallback alias is used: "
"the catchall. An email sent from a chatter has a reply address set to this "
"catchall alias. A reply sent to the catchall is posted to the right chatter "
"thanks to the *message-id* header."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en applikation ikke har et alias, bruges et generisk fallback-alias: "
"catchall. En email sendt fra en chatter har en svaradresse sat til dette "
"catchall-alias. Et svar sendt til catchall postes i den rigtige chatter "
"takket være *message-id*-headeren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:45
msgid ""
"By default, the local-part *catchall* will be used. Enable :ref:`developer-"
"mode` and go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Emails: Alias "
"Domains` to access the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Som standard bruges den lokale del *catchall*. Aktivér :ref:`developer-"
"mode`, og gå til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> Emails: "
"Aliasdomæner` for at få adgang til konfigurationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:48
msgid ""
"An email to the catchall always needs to be a reply to a previous email sent "
"from the database. If an email is sent directly to the catchall, the sender "
"will receive the following message:"
msgstr ""
"En email til catchall skal altid være et svar på en tidligere email sendt "
"fra databasen. Hvis en email sendes direkte til catchall, vil afsenderen "
"modtage følgende besked:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:51
msgid ""
"Bounce email from \"MAILER-DEAMON\" explaining how to contact the database."
msgstr ""
"Bounce-email fra \"MAILER-DEAMON\", der forklarer, hvordan man kontakter "
"databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:55
msgid ""
"The email address `info@company-name.com` displayed in the screenshot above "
"is the email address set on the company. Upon entering the developer mode on "
"a company profile, additional configuration options (such as catchall and "
"bounce) become readable. It can be modified by clicking on the internal link "
"of the Email Domain. It is generally not recommended to modify these options "
"unless specific needs dictate, as it will affect all replies to previously "
"sent emails."
msgstr ""
"Emailadressen `info@company-name.com`, der vises i skærmbilledet ovenfor, er "
"den emailadresse, der er angivet på virksomheden. Når udviklertilstand "
"aktiveres på en virksomhedsprofil, bliver yderligere "
"konfigurationsindstillinger (såsom catchall og bounce) læsbare. Det kan "
"ændres ved at klikke på det interne link til emaildomænet. Det anbefales "
"generelt ikke at ændre disse indstillinger, medmindre specifikke behov "
"kræver det, da det vil påvirke alle svar på tidligere sendte emails."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:63
msgid ""
"An alias can be configured on a sales team in the CRM app. When a customer "
"replies to an email coming from the CRM app, the *reply-to* is `info@company-"
"name.odoo.com`."
msgstr ""
"Et alias kan konfigureres på et salgsteam i CRM-appen. Når en kunde svarer "
"på en email fra CRM-appen, er *reply-to* `info@company-name.odoo.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:66
msgid ""
"When an email is sent from the Contact app, the reply address is "
"`catchall@company-name.odoo.com` because there is no alias on the contact "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Når en email sendes fra Kontakt-appen, er svaradressen `catchall@company-"
"name.odoo.com`, fordi der ikke er noget alias på kontaktmodellen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:70
msgid ""
"It is advised to keep the local-part of the catchall and the bounce "
"unchanged. If this value is modified, previous emails sent from the database "
"will still have the previous local-part values. This could lead to replies "
"not being correctly received in the database."
msgstr ""
"Det anbefales at holde den lokale del af catchall og bounce uændret. Hvis "
"denne værdi ændres, vil tidligere emails sendt fra databasen stadig have de "
"tidligere lokale delværdier. Dette kan føre til, at svar ikke modtages "
"korrekt i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:77
msgid "Bounce"
msgstr "Afvisning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:79
msgid ""
"In the same way the catchall alias is used to build the reply address, the "
"bounce alias is used to build the *return-path* of the email. The *return-"
"path* is used when emails cannot be delivered to the recipient and an error "
"is returned to the sender."
msgstr ""
"På samme måde som catchall-aliaset bruges til at opbygge svaradressen, "
"bruges bounce-aliaset til at opbygge emailens *return-path*. *Return-path* "
"bruges, når emails ikke kan leveres til modtageren, og en fejl returneres "
"til afsenderen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:83
msgid ""
"By default the name *bounce* will be used. Enable :ref:`developer-mode` and "
"go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Emails: Alias Domains` to "
"access the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Som standard bruges navnet *bounce*. Aktivér :ref:`developer-mode`, og gå "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> Emails: Aliasdomæner` for "
"at få adgang til konfigurationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:87
msgid ""
"On Odoo Online, when using the default outgoing email server, the return-"
"path address is forced to the value `bounce@company-name.odoo.com` "
"independently of the value set as bounce alias."
msgstr ""
"På Odoo Online, når standardserveren for udgående e-mails bruges, tvinges "
"return-path-adressen til værdien `bounce@virksomhedsnavn.odoo.com` "
"uafhængigt af den værdi, der er angivet som bounce-alias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:90
msgid ""
"When an error occurs, a notification is received and displayed in a red "
"envelope in the chatter. In some cases, the red envelope can just contain a "
"`no error` message, meaning there is an error that could not be handled by "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Når der opstår en fejl, modtages en meddelelse og vises i en rød konvolut i "
"chatteren. I nogle tilfælde kan den røde konvolut blot indeholde en `ingen "
"fejl`-besked, hvilket betyder, at der er en fejl, som ikke kunne håndteres "
"af Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:94
msgid ""
"A notification will also be displayed in the Discuss icon on the navigation "
"bar."
msgstr "En meddelelse vises også i ikonet Beskeder på navigationslinjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:96
msgid ""
"An email sent to a contact had an issue and the error is reported on the "
"navbar."
msgstr ""
"En e-mail sendt til en kontakt havde et problem, og fejlen rapporteres på "
"navigationslinjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:100
msgid ""
"If the email address of the recipient is incorrect, by clicking on the red "
"envelope in the chatter an error message containing the reason for the "
"failure will be given."
msgstr ""
"Hvis modtagerens e-mailadresse er forkert, vil der ved at klikke på den røde "
"konvolut i chatteren blive givet en fejlmeddelelse, der indeholder årsagen "
"til fejlen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:103
msgid ""
"An email sent to a wrong domain generates a bounce displayed as a red "
"envelope."
msgstr ""
"En e-mail sendt til et forkert domæne genererer en bounce, der vises som en "
"rød konvolut."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:109
msgid "Receive emails with Odoo's default configuration"
msgstr "Modtag e-mails med Odoos standardkonfiguration"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:111
msgid ""
"On **Odoo Online** and **Odoo.sh**, the email alias, reply, and bounce "
"addresses are pre-configured. These addresses use the alias domain "
"automatically added to a standard database."
msgstr ""
"På **Odoo Online** og **Odoo.sh** er e-mailalias, svar- og bounce-adresser "
"forudkonfigureret. Disse adresser bruger aliasdomænet, der automatisk "
"tilføjes til en standard database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:115
msgid ""
"Assuming the database URL is `https://mydatabase.odoo.com`, the alias domain "
"`mydatabase.odoo.com` is automatically created. Catchall and bounce can be "
"used and their address is respectively `catchall@mydatabase.odoo.com`, and "
"`bounce@mydatabase.odoo.com`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis databasens URL er `https://mindatabase.odoo.com`, oprettes aliasdomænet "
"`mindatabase.odoo.com` automatisk. Catchall og bounce kan bruges, og deres "
"adresse er henholdsvis `catchall@mindatabase.odoo.com` og "
"`bounce@mindatabase.odoo.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:119
msgid ""
"If the CRM app is installed, and a sales team with the alias `info` is "
"created, the `info@mydatabase.odoo.com` address can be used immediately. The "
"same goes for any other alias created in other applications."
msgstr ""
"Hvis CRM-appen er installeret, og et salgsteam med aliasset `info` oprettes, "
"kan adressen `info@mindatabase.odoo.com` bruges med det samme. Det samme "
"gælder for alle andre aliasser oprettet i andre applikationer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:123
msgid ""
"The database domain is ready to be used to receive emails without any "
"additional configuration."
msgstr ""
"Databasedomænet er klar til at blive brugt til at modtage e-mails uden "
"yderligere konfiguration."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:128
msgid "Use multiple Odoo subdomains"
msgstr "Brug flere Odoo-subdomæner"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:130
msgid ""
"On **Odoo Online**, the only Odoo subdomain is the one defined at the "
"database creation."
msgstr ""
"På **Odoo Online** er det eneste Odoo-subdomæne det, der defineres ved "
"oprettelsen af databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:132
msgid ""
"On **Odoo.sh**, it is possible to use several Odoo subdomains. In the "
"settings of the branch, additional Odoo subdomains can be added as long as "
"they are not used yet in another branch. These domains must then be added to "
"the alias domains to be used by a company."
msgstr ""
"På **Odoo.sh** er det muligt at bruge flere Odoo-subdomæner. I "
"indstillingerne for grenen kan yderligere Odoo-subdomæner tilføjes, så længe "
"de ikke allerede bruges i en anden gren. Disse domæner skal derefter "
"tilføjes til aliasdomænerne for at blive brugt af en virksomhed."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:136
msgid "Setting up an Odoo subdomain on a branch."
msgstr "Opsætning af et Odoo-subdomæne på en gren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:140
msgid ""
"For more information on configuring DNS records for subdomains, "
"see :ref:`DNS record setup <dns_record_setup>`."
msgstr ""
"For mere information om konfiguration af DNS-poster for underdomæner, "
"se :ref:`opsætning af DNS-poster <dns_record_setup>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:146
msgid "Use a custom domain for inbound messages"
msgstr "Brug et brugerdefineret domæne til indgående beskeder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:148
msgid ""
"The :ref:`alias domain <email-outbound-alias-domain>` must be selected in "
"the general settings. If you have multiple companies, each one must be "
"configured."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Aliasdomænet <email-outbound-alias-domain>` skal vælges i de generelle "
"indstillinger. Hvis du har flere virksomheder, skal hver enkelt konfigureres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:151
msgid "The alias domain in the general settings."
msgstr "Aliasdomænet i de generelle indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:154
msgid ""
"All the aliases will use this custom domain. Replies on models for which an "
"alias is configured are done to `[alias]@my-custom-domain.com`. Replies to "
"other models are sent to the catchall through `catchall@my-custom-"
"domain.com`."
msgstr ""
"Alle aliasserne vil bruge dette brugerdefinerede domæne. Svar på modeller, "
"for hvilke et alias er konfigureret, sendes til `[alias]@mit-"
"brugerdefinerede-domæne.com`. Svar på andre modeller sendes til catchall via "
"`catchall@mit-brugerdefinerede-domæne.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:158
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:297
msgid "Technical schema of mailing route when using a custom domain in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Teknisk skema over mailingrute ved brug af et brugerdefineret domæne i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:162
msgid ""
"If emails are sent using Odoo's email servers while using a custom domain, "
"follow the :ref:`\"Using a custom domain with Odoo’s email server\" "
"instructions <email-outbound-custom-domain-odoo-server>`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis e-mails sendes ved hjælp af Odoos e-mailservere, mens der bruges et "
"tilpasset domæne, skal du følge :ref:`instruktionerne \"Brug af et tilpasset "
"domæne med Odoos e-mailserver\" <email-outbound-custom-domain-odoo-server>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:166
msgid ""
"Since this custom domain is used, all emails using an alias (replies, "
"bounces and direct sends) are sent to an address of the domain. They are "
"thus delivered to the email server linked to the domain (MX record). To "
"display them in the chatter or to create new records, it is necessary to "
"retrieve these incoming emails in the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Da dette tilpassede domæne bruges, sendes alle e-mails, der bruger et alias "
"(svar, bounces og direkte afsendelser), til en adresse på domænet. De "
"leveres således til den e-mailserver, der er tilknyttet domænet (MX-post). "
"For at vise dem i chatteren eller oprette nye poster er det nødvendigt at "
"hente disse indgående e-mails i Odoo-databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:175
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:176
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "Fordele"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:177
