msgstr ":ref:`Omdirigeringer <email-inbound-custom-domain-redirections>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:179
msgid "Easy to set up, emails are directly sent to the database."
msgstr "Nemt at opsætte, e-mails sendes direkte til databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:180
msgid "Each alias of a database needs to be configured."
msgstr "Hvert alias for en database skal konfigureres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:181
msgid ""
":ref:`Incoming mail servers <email-inbound-custom-domain-incoming-server>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Indgående mailservere <email-inbound-custom-domain-incoming-server>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:182
msgid ""
"Allows to keep a copy of the email in your mailbox (with IMAP). Allows to "
"create records in the chosen model."
msgstr ""
"Gør det muligt at beholde en kopi af e-mailen i din postkasse (med IMAP). "
"Gør det muligt at oprette poster i den valgte model."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:184
msgid ""
"Depends on a CRON, meaning emails are not retrieved immediately in the "
"database. Each alias of a database needs to be configured."
msgstr ""
"Afhænger af en CRON, hvilket betyder, at e-mails ikke hentes øjeblikkeligt i "
"databasen. Hvert alias for en database skal konfigureres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:186
msgid ":ref:`DNS records <email-inbound-custom-domain-dns>`"
msgstr ":ref:`DNS-poster <email-inbound-custom-domain-dns>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:187
msgid "Only one record needs to be created to make all aliases work properly."
msgstr ""
"Kun én post skal oprettes for at få alle aliaser til at fungere korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:188
msgid "Using a subdomain is required. Requires advanced technical knowledge."
msgstr "Det er påkrævet at bruge et subdomæne. Kræver avanceret teknisk viden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:192
msgid ""
"For **on-premise databases**, the redirection and the DNS record methods "
"also require configuring the :doc:`mail gateway script <../../../../"
"administration/on_premise/email_gateway>`. Going through this script "
"requires **advanced technical and infrastructure knowledge**."
msgstr ""
"For **on-premise-databaser** kræver metoderne med omdirigering og DNS-poster "
"også konfiguration af :doc:`mailgateway-scriptet <../../../../administration/"
"on_premise/email_gateway>`. Gennemgang af dette script kræver **avanceret "
"teknisk viden og infrastrukturviden**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:197
msgid ""
"Refer to your provider’s documentation for more detailed information on how "
"to handle the methods detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Se din udbyders dokumentation for mere detaljerede oplysninger om, hvordan "
"du håndterer metoderne, der er beskrevet nedenfor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:203
msgid "Redirections"
msgstr "Omdirigeringer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:205
msgid ""
"If the database is hosted on **Odoo Online** or **Odoo.sh**, using "
"redirections is recommended. They allow messages to be received without "
"delay in the database."
msgstr ""
"Hvis databasen er hostet på **Odoo Online** eller **Odoo.sh**, anbefales det "
"at bruge omdirigeringer. De gør det muligt at modtage beskeder uden "
"forsinkelse i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:209
msgid ""
"When configuring email redirections with Microsoft 365 (Exchange Online), be "
"aware that certain technical limitations may affect your setup. Some users "
"have reported that Microsoft 365 does not support true redirection and only "
"allows forwarding, which may not behave as needed for Odoo's email routing."
msgstr ""
"Når du konfigurerer e-mailomdirigeringer med Microsoft 365 (Exchange "
"Online), skal du være opmærksom på, at visse tekniske begrænsninger kan "
"påvirke din opsætning. Nogle brugere har rapporteret, at Microsoft 365 ikke "
"understøtter ægte omdirigering og kun tillader videresendelse, hvilket "
"muligvis ikke fungerer som nødvendigt for Odoos e-mailrouting."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:214
msgid ""
"For more information on Microsoft Exchange configuration, visit `Microsoft "
"Learn <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/exchange/exchange-online>`_."
msgstr ""
"For mere information om Microsoft Exchange-konfiguration, besøg `Microsoft "
"Learn <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/exchange/exchange-online>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:217
msgid ""
"It is mandatory to redirect the catchall and bounce address to the Odoo "
"subdomain of the database. Every other alias used must be redirected as well."
msgstr ""
"Det er obligatorisk at omdirigere catchall- og bounce-adressen til Odoo-"
"subdomænet for databasen. Alle andre aliaser, der bruges, skal også "
"omdirigeres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:221
msgid "With one sales team, the following redirections are required:"
msgstr "Med ét salgsteam kræves følgende omdirigeringer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:223
msgid "`catchall@company-name.com` → `catchall@company-name.odoo.com`"
msgstr "`catchall@company-name.com` → `catchall@company-name.odoo.com`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:224
msgid "`bounce@company-name.com` → `bounce@company-name.odoo.com`"
msgstr "`bounce@company-name.com` → `bounce@company-name.odoo.com`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:225
msgid "`info@company-name.com` → `info@company-name.odoo.com`"
msgstr "info@firmanavn.com` → `info@firmanavn.odoo.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:228
msgid ""
"Some providers ask to validate the redirection by sending a link to the "
"target email address. This procedure is an issue for catchall and bounce "
"since they are not used to create records."
msgstr ""
"Nogle udbydere beder om at validere omdirigeringen ved at sende et link til "
"mål-e-mailadressen. Denne procedure er et problem for catchall og bounce, da "
"de ikke bruges til at oprette poster."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:231
msgid ""
"Modify the catchall value on the mail alias domain. :ref:`developer-mode` "
"must be enabled to access this menu. For example, it can be changed from "
"`catchall` to `temp-catchall`. This will allow to use `catchall` as the "
"local-part of another alias."
msgstr ""
"Modificer catchall-værdien på mail alias-domænet. :ref:`developer-mode` skal "
"være aktiveret for at få adgang til denne menu. Det kan for eksempel ændres "
"fra `catchall` til `temp-catchall`. Dette gør det muligt at bruge `catchall` "
"som den lokale del af et andet alias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:234
msgid ""
"Open an app that uses an alias. For example, CRM contains aliases for each "
"sales team. Set `catchall` as the local-part of the alias of a sales team."
msgstr ""
"Åbn en app, der bruger et alias. CRM indeholder for eksempel aliaser for "
"hvert salgsteam. Indstil `catchall` som den lokale del af aliaset for et "
"salgsteam."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:236
msgid ""
"The validation email will create a record in the CRM app. The email sent "
"will be visible in the chatter, allowing you to validate the redirection."
msgstr ""
"Validerings-e-mailen vil oprette en post i CRM-appen. Den sendte e-mail vil "
"være synlig i chatter, så du kan validere omdirigeringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:238
msgid ""
"Do not forget to change back the alias of the sales team and the catchall "
"value on the mail alias domain, just as they were before this procedure."
msgstr ""
"Glem ikke at ændre salgsgruppens alias og catchall-værdien på mail alias-"
"domænet tilbage til, som de var før denne procedure."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:241
msgid ""
"An alternative to redirections is **forwarding**. With forwarding, **the "
"address forwarding the email will be identified as the sender**, while with "
"redirections, the original sender will always remain."
msgstr ""
"Et alternativ til omdirigeringer er **videresendelse**. Med videresendelse "
"**vil adressen, der videresender e-mailen, blive identificeret som "
"afsenderen**, mens den originale afsender altid vil forblive med "
"omdirigeringer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:246
msgid ""
"When using email redirection to manage incoming messages, additional "
"configuration may be required to ensure correct behavior."
msgstr ""
"Når der bruges e-mail-omdirigering til at håndtere indgående beskeder, kan "
"yderligere konfiguration være nødvendig for at sikre korrekt adfærd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:249
msgid ""
"Some email providers, such as Gmail, require the redirection address to be "
"explicitly confirmed before emails are forwarded, otherwise the redirection "
"may not function."
msgstr ""
"Nogle e-mail-udbydere, såsom Gmail, kræver, at omdirigeringsadressen "
"eksplicit bekræftes, før e-mails videresendes, ellers fungerer "
"omdirigeringen muligvis ikke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:252
msgid ""
"In addition, when redirection is used instead of an incoming mail server, "
"the alias may appear with the `@yourdb.odoo.com` domain unless *Local-part "
"based incoming detection* is enabled on the corresponding alias. This "
"setting can be found under :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> "
"Aliases`."
msgstr ""
"Desuden kan aliasset vises med domænet `@yourdb.odoo.com`, når der bruges "
"omdirigering i stedet for en indgående mailserver, medmindre *Local-part "
"based incoming detection* er aktiveret på det tilsvarende alias. Denne "
"indstilling findes under :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Aliases`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:260
msgid "Incoming mail servers"
msgstr "Indgående mailservere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:262
msgid ""
"As mentioned earlier, using redirections is the recommended method to "
"receive emails in Odoo. However, it is also possible to set up incoming mail "
"servers. Using this method means creating an incoming email server for each "
"mailbox on your server, catchall, bounce, and every alias of the database, "
"in order to fetch all incoming emails."
msgstr ""
"Som nævnt tidligere er brug af omdirigeringer den anbefalede metode til at "
"modtage e-mails i Odoo. Det er dog også muligt at opsætte indgående "
"mailservere. Brug af denne metode betyder, at der oprettes en indgående e-"
"mailserver for hver mailboks på din server, catchall, bounce og hvert alias "
"i databasen for at hente alle indgående e-mails."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:268
msgid ""
"Odoo's *Incoming Mail Servers* feature is designed for shared inboxes (e.g., "
"`sales@yourcompany.com` or `support@yourcompany.com`) to route messages to "
"team pipelines, tickets, or documents."
msgstr ""
"Odoos funktion til *indgående mailservere* er designet til delte indbakker "
"(f.eks. `salg@ditfirma.com` eller `support@ditfirma.com`) for at dirigere "
"beskeder til teampipelines, tickets eller dokumenter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:272
msgid ""
"Using personal email addresses (e.g., `mitchell.admin@yourcompany.com`) as "
"incoming mail servers is **not** recommended. Doing so can lead to increased "
"security risks, unintended message routing, privacy issues, and difficulties "
"syncing replies correctly."
msgstr ""
"Brug af personlige e-mailadresser (f.eks. `mitchell.admin@ditfirma.com`) som "
"indgående mailservere anbefales **ikke**. Det kan føre til øgede "
"sikkerhedsrisici, utilsigtet beskedruting, privatlivsproblemer og "
"vanskeligheder med at synkronisere svar korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:276
msgid ""
"Incoming mail servers are created by going to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Technical --> Emails: Incoming Mail Servers`."
msgstr ""
"Indgående mailservere oprettes ved at gå til :menuselection:`Indstillinger → "
"Teknisk → E-mails: Indgående mailservere`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:280
msgid ""
"We recommend using the IMAP protocol over the POP protocol, as IMAP fetches "
"all unread emails, while POP fetches all the emails' history and then tags "
"them as deleted in your mailbox."
msgstr ""
"Vi anbefaler at bruge IMAP-protokollen frem for POP-protokollen, da IMAP "
"henter alle ulæste e-mails, mens POP henter alle e-mails' historik og "
"derefter markerer dem som slettet i din mailboks."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:284
msgid ""
"It is also possible to connect a mailbox through :doc:`Gmail with Google "
"OAuth <google_oauth>` or :doc:`Outlook with Microsoft Azure OAuth "
"<azure_oauth>`."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at tilslutte en mailboks via :doc:`Gmail med Google OAuth "
"<google_oauth>` eller :doc:`Outlook med Microsoft Azure OAuth <azure_oauth>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:287
msgid ""
"Regardless of the protocol chosen, emails are fetched using the *Mail: "
"Fetchmail Service* scheduled action."
msgstr ""
"Uanset hvilken protokol der vælges, hentes e-mails ved hjælp af den "
"planlagte handling *Mail: Fetchmail Service*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:290
msgid ""
"Additionally, using an incoming mail server in Odoo gives the opportunity to "
"create new records in a specified model. Each incoming mail server can "
"create records in a different model."
msgstr ""
"Derudover giver brug af en indgående mailserver i Odoo mulighed for at "
"oprette nye poster i en specificeret model. Hver indgående mailserver kan "
"oprette poster i en forskellig model."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:294
msgid ""
"Emails received on `task@company-name.com` are fetched by the Odoo database. "
"All fetched emails will create a new project task in the database."
msgstr ""
"E-mails modtaget på `opgave@firmanavn.com` hentes af Odoo-databasen. Alle "
"hentede e-mails vil oprette en ny projektopgave i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:305
msgid "DNS records"
msgstr "DNS-poster"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:307
msgid ""
"A third option is to use a dedicated subdomain (for example, "
"`mail.mydomain.com`) and configure its DNS records so that emails sent to "
"addresses on that subdomain are handled by Odoo and processed directly "
"within your database."
msgstr ""
"En tredje mulighed er at bruge et dedikeret underdomæne (f.eks. "
"`mail.mydomain.com`) og konfigurere dets DNS-poster, så e-mails sendt til "
"adresser på dette underdomæne håndteres af Odoo og behandles direkte i din "
"database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:311
msgid ""
"For Odoo Online and Odoo.sh, CNAME-based routing is only supported when "
"using a dedicated subdomain. It cannot be configured on your root domain "
"(e.g., `mydomain.com`)."
msgstr ""
"For Odoo Online og Odoo.sh understøttes CNAME-baseret routing kun ved brug "
"af et dedikeret underdomæne. Det kan ikke konfigureres på dit rodddomæne "
"(f.eks. `mydomain.com`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:314
msgid ""
"Note that this subdomain will be dedicated to email traffic. If it is "
"accessed in a web browser, users will be redirected to the first website "
"configured on the database (if applicable)."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk, at dette underdomæne vil være dedikeret til e-mailtrafik. Hvis det "
"tilgås i en webbrowser, vil brugere blive omdirigeret til den første "
"hjemmeside, der er konfigureret på databasen (hvis relevant)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:318
msgid ""
"Since a new subdomain is being configured for inbound mail, its :doc:`DNS "
"records must also be set up for outbound mail <email_domain>`."
msgstr ""
"Da et nyt underdomæne konfigureres til indgående mail, skal dets :doc:`DNS-"
"poster også konfigureres til udgående mail <email_domain>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:322
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:296
msgid "Odoo Online"
msgstr "Odoo Online"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:324
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:386
msgid "Access your DNS settings"
msgstr "Få adgang til dine DNS-indstillinger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:326
msgid ""
"If your domain is hosted with a third-party registrar (for example, GoDaddy, "
"Namecheap, Cloudflare), log in to the registrar and open the DNS management "
"zone for your domain."
msgstr ""
"Hvis dit domæne hostes hos en tredjeparts registrator (f.eks. GoDaddy, "
"Namecheap, Cloudflare), skal du logge ind hos registratoren og åbne DNS-"
"administrationszonen for dit domæne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:329
msgid "If Odoo manages your DNS:"
msgstr "Hvis Odoo administrerer din DNS:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:331
msgid "Open the `database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_."
msgstr "Åbn `database manageren <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:332
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon beside the database and "
"choose :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Domain Names`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`tandhjul`) ud for databasen, og "
"vælg :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Domænenavne`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:334
msgid "Click :guilabel:`DNS`, then :guilabel:`Add DNS record`."
msgstr "Klik på :guilabel:`DNS`, og derefter på :guilabel:`Tilføj DNS-post`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:336
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:390
msgid "Create a CNAME record"
msgstr "Opret en CNAME-post"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:338
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:392
msgid "**Name / Host:** the subdomain you want to use (for example, `mail`)."
msgstr "**Navn / Vært:** det underdomæne, du vil bruge (f.eks. `mail`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:339
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:393
msgid ""
"**Content / Target:** your database root domain (for example, "
"`dbname.odoo.com.`)."
msgstr "**Indhold / Mål:** dit database-roddomæne (f.eks. `dbname.odoo.com.`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:341
msgid "Add the subdomain to your Odoo portal"
msgstr "Tilføj underdomænet til din Odoo-portal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:343
msgid ""
"In the `database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_, click "
"the :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon for your database and "
"select :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Domain Names`."
msgstr ""
"I `databasemanageren <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_ skal du klikke på "
"ikonet :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`tandhjul`) for din database og "
"vælge :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Domænenavne`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:346
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Use my own domain`, enter the full subdomain (for example, "
"`mail.mydomain.com`). When verification succeeds, click :guilabel:`I "
"confirm, it's done`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Brug mit eget domæne`, og indtast det fulde underdomæne "
"(f.eks. `mail.mydomain.com`). Når bekræftelsen lykkes, skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Jeg bekræfter, det er udført`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:351
msgid ""
"If verification fails, double-check that the CNAME target ends with a "
"trailing dot (for example, `dbname.odoo.com.`), as some DNS providers "
"require it. Also allow some time for DNS changes to propagate — this can "
"take anywhere from a few minutes up to 48 hours depending on your provider. "
"Once propagation is complete, try verifying again."
msgstr ""
"Hvis bekræftelsen mislykkes, skal du dobbelttjekke, at CNAME-målet slutter "
"med et afsluttende punktum (f.eks. `dbname.odoo.com.`), da nogle DNS-"
"udbydere kræver det. Giv også DNS-ændringerne tid til at udbrede sig – dette "
"kan tage alt fra et par minutter op til 48 timer afhængigt af din udbyder. "
"Prøv at bekræfte igen, når udbredelsen er fuldført."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:356
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:407
