msgstr ""
"I feltet :guilabel:`Aliasdomæne` skal du indtaste det underdomæne, du "
"konfigurerede (f.eks. `mail.mydomain.com`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:362
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:412
