msgstr "Eksempel på en konfiguration af DNS-poster i Odoo-portalen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:379
msgid ""
"The second record enables Odoo to send authenticated emails from your custom "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"Den anden post gør det muligt for Odoo at sende godkendte e-mails fra dit "
"tilpassede domæne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:382
msgid ":doc:`Configure DNS records to send emails in Odoo <email_domain>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Konfigurer DNS-poster til at sende e-mails i Odoo <email_domain>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:384
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:301
msgid "Odoo.sh"
msgstr "Odoo.sh"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:388
msgid ""
"Log in to your third-party registrar (for example, GoDaddy, Namecheap, "
"Cloudflare) and open the DNS management zone for your domain."
msgstr ""
"Log ind hos din tredjeparts registrator (f.eks. GoDaddy, Namecheap, "
"Cloudflare) og åbn DNS-administrationszonen for dit domæne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:395
msgid "Add the subdomain to Odoo.sh settings"
msgstr "Tilføj subdomænet til Odoo.sh-indstillinger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:397
msgid "Log in to the Odoo.sh platform and open your project."
msgstr "Log ind på Odoo.sh-platformen og åbn dit projekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:398
msgid ""
"Select the production branch, go to the :guilabel:`Settings` tab, and locate "
"the **Custom domains** section."
msgstr ""
"Vælg produktionsgrenen, gå til fanen :guilabel:`Indstillinger`, og find "
"sektionen **Brugerdefinerede domæner**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:400
msgid ""
"Enter the full subdomain (e.g., `mail.mydomain.com`) and "
"click :guilabel:`Add domain`."
msgstr ""
"Indtast det fulde subdomæne (f.eks. `mail.mydomain.com`), og klik "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj domæne`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:403
msgid "Adding a custom subdomain for mail to Odoo.sh project settings."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjelse af et brugerdefineret subdomæne til mail i Odoo.sh-"
"projektindstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:417
msgid ""
"Instead of a CNAME record, you can alternatively create an MX record for "
"your subdomain (e.g., `mail`), pointing to `dbname.odoo.com.` with a "
"priority of `10`. The rest of the configuration steps remain the same."
msgstr ""
"I stedet for en CNAME-post kan du alternativt oprette en MX-post for dit "
"subdomæne (f.eks. `mail`), der peger på `dbname.odoo.com.` med en prioritet "
"på `10`. Resten af konfigurationstrinene forbliver de samme."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:421
msgid ""
"Note that unlike CNAME, an MX record does not inherit SPF or other DNS "
"records from the target domain, so you may need to configure these "
"separately for outbound mail to be properly authenticated."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk, at en MX-post i modsætning til CNAME ikke arver SPF eller andre DNS-"
"poster fra måldomænet, så du kan være nødt til at konfigurere disse separat, "
"for at udgående mails bliver korrekt godkendt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:427
msgid "Infinite email loops"
msgstr "Uendelige e-mail-løkker"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:429
msgid ""
"In some cases, infinite mailing loops can be created. Odoo provides some "
"protection against such loops, ensuring the same sender cannot send too many "
"emails **that would create records** to an alias in a specific time span."
msgstr ""
"I nogle tilfælde kan der opstå uendelige mailløkker. Odoo tilbyder "
"beskyttelse mod sådanne løkker og sikrer, at den samme afsender ikke kan "
"sende for mange e-mails **der vil oprette poster** til et alias inden for et "
"bestemt tidsrum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:433
msgid ""
"By default, an email address can send up to 20 emails in 120 minutes. If "
"more emails are sent, they are blocked and the sender receives the following "
"message:"
msgstr ""
"Som standard kan en e-mailadresse sende op til 20 e-mails på 120 minutter. "
"Hvis der sendes flere e-mails, blokeres de, og afsenderen modtager følgende "
"besked:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:436
msgid "Bounce email received after attempting contact too many times an alias."
msgstr ""
"Bounce-e-mail modtaget efter at have forsøgt at kontakte et alias for mange "
"gange."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:439
msgid ""
"To change the default behavior, enable :ref:`developer-mode`, then go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Parameters: System Parameters` "
"to add two parameters."
msgstr ""
"For at ændre standardadfærden skal du aktivere :ref:`developer-mode`, og "
"derefter gå til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> Parametre: "
"Systemparametre` for at tilføje to parametre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:442
msgid ""
"For the first parameter, enter `mail.gateway.loop.minutes` as "
"the :guilabel:`Key` and choose a number of minutes as the :guilabel:`Value` "
"(`120` is the default behavior)."
msgstr ""
"For den første parameter skal du indtaste `mail.gateway.loop.minutes` "
"som :guilabel:`Nøgle` og vælge et antal minutter som :guilabel:`Værdi` "
"(`120` er standardadfærden)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:444
msgid ""
"For the second parameter, enter `mail.gateway.loop.threshold` as "
"the :guilabel:`Key` and choose a number of emails as the :guilabel:`Value` "
"(`20` is the default behavior)."
msgstr ""
"For den anden parameter skal du indtaste `mail.gateway.loop.threshold` "
"som :guilabel:`Nøgle` og vælge et antal e-mails som :guilabel:`Værdi` (`20` "
"er standardadfærden)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:448
msgid "Allow alias domain system parameter"
msgstr "Tillad alias-domænesystemparameter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:450
msgid ""
"Incoming aliases are set in the Odoo database to create records by receiving "
"incoming emails. To view aliases set in the Odoo database, first activate "
"the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`. Then, go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> Aliases`."
msgstr ""
"Indgående aliaser indstilles i Odoo-databasen for at oprette poster ved at "
"modtage indgående e-mails. For at se aliasser indstillet i Odoo-databasen "
"skal du først aktivere :ref:`udviklertilstand <developer-mode>`. Gå derefter "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger-app --> Teknisk --> Aliasser`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:454
msgid ""
"The following system parameter, `mail.catchall.domain.allowed`, set with "
"allowed alias domain values, separated by commas, filters out correctly "
"addressed emails to aliases. Setting the domains for which the alias can "
"create a ticket, lead, opportunity, etc., eliminates false positives where "
"email addresses with only the prefix alias, not the domain, are present."
msgstr ""
"Følgende systemparameter, `mail.catchall.domain.allowed`, indstillet med "
"tilladte alias-domæneværdier adskilt af kommaer, filtrerer korrekt "
"adresserede e-mails til aliasser. Indstilling af de domæner, som aliaset kan "
"oprette en sag, lead, mulighed osv. for, eliminerer falske positiver, hvor e-"
"mailadresser kun med alias-præfikset, ikke domænet, er til stede."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:459
msgid ""
"In some instances, matches have been made in the Odoo database when an email "
"is received with the same alias prefix and a different domain on the "
"incoming email address. This is true in the sender, recipient, and :abbr:`CC "
"(Carbon Copy)` email addresses of an incoming email."
msgstr ""
"I nogle tilfælde er der fundet match i Odoo-databasen, når en e-mail "
"modtages med det samme alias-præfiks og et andet domæne på den indgående e-"
"mailadresse. Dette gælder i afsender-, modtager- og :abbr:`CC (Carbon Copy)`-"
"e-mailadresserne i en indgående e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:464
msgid ""
"When Odoo receives emails with the `commercial` prefix alias in the sender, "
"recipient, or :abbr:`CC (Carbon Copy)` email addresses (e.g. "
"commercial\\@example.com), the database falsely treats the email as the full "
"`commercial` alias, with a different domain, and therefore, creates a ticket/"
"lead/opportunity/etc."
msgstr ""
"Når Odoo modtager e-mails med `commercial`-præfiksaliaset i afsender-, "
"modtager- eller :abbr:`CC (Carbon Copy)`-e-mailadresserne (f.eks. "
"commercial\\@example.com), behandler databasen fejlagtigt e-mailen som det "
"fulde `commercial`-alias med et andet domæne og opretter derfor en sag/lead/"
"mulighed/osv."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:469
msgid ""
"To add the `mail.catchall.domain.allowed` system parameter, first, activate "
"the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`. Then, go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> System Parameters`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New`. Then, type in `mail.catchall.domain.allowed` for "
"the :guilabel:`Key` field."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje systemparameteren `mail.catchall.domain.allowed` skal du "
"først aktivere :ref:`udviklertilstand <developer-mode>`. Gå derefter "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger-app --> Teknisk --> Systemparametre`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Ny`. Indtast derefter `mail.catchall.domain.allowed` i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Nøgle`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:473
msgid ""
"Next, for the :guilabel:`Value` field, add the domains separated by commas. "
"Manually :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Save)`, and the system "
"parameter takes immediate effect."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj derefter domænerne adskilt af kommaer i feltet :guilabel:`Værdi`. Gem "
"manuelt :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Gem)`, og systemparameteren "
"træder i kraft med det samme."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:476
msgid "mail.catchall.domain.allowed system parameter set."
msgstr "mail.catchall.domain.allowed systemparameter indstillet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:480
msgid "Local-part based incoming detection"
msgstr "Lokal-del baseret indgående detektion"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_inbound.rst:482
msgid ""
"When creating a new alias, there is an option to enable :guilabel:`Local-"
"part based incoming detection`. If enabled, Odoo only requires the local-"
"part to match for routing an incoming email. If this feature is turned off, "
"Odoo requires the whole email address to match for routing an incoming email."
msgstr ""
"Når der oprettes et nyt alias, er der en mulighed for at "
"aktivere :guilabel:`Lokal-del baseret indgående detektion`. Hvis aktiveret, "
"kræver Odoo kun, at den lokale del matcher for at dirigere en indgående e-"
"mail. Hvis denne funktion er slået fra, kræver Odoo, at hele e-mailadressen "
"matcher for at dirigere en indgående e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:3
msgid "Manage outbound messages"
msgstr "Administrer udgående beskeder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:8
msgid "Sending emails with Odoo's default configuration"
msgstr "Afsendelse af e-mails med Odoos standardkonfiguration"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:10
msgid ""
"On **Odoo Online** and **Odoo.sh**, sending and receiving emails works out "
"of the box. No configuration is required."
msgstr ""
"På **Odoo Online** og **Odoo.sh** fungerer afsendelse og modtagelse af e-"
"mails uden videre. Ingen konfiguration er påkrævet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:13
msgid ""
"When a database is created, the subdomain `company-name.odoo.com` is used to "
"send and receive emails. The deliverability is optimized for this subdomain "
"as it uses Odoo’s DNS configuration."
msgstr ""
"Når en database oprettes, bruges subdomænet `company-name.odoo.com` til at "
"sende og modtage e-mails. Leveringsevnen er optimeret for dette subdomæne, "
"da det bruger Odoos DNS-konfiguration."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:17
msgid ""
"If the database subdomain is `company-name.odoo.com` and all mailing "
"configurations are the default ones, all emails will be sent from "
"`notifications@company-name.odoo.com`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis databasens subdomæne er `company-name.odoo.com`, og alle "
"mailkonfigurationer er standardindstillingerne, vil alle e-mails blive sendt "
"fra `notifications@company-name.odoo.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:22
msgid ""
"This configuration is handled by the system parameter "
"`mail.default.from_filter`. In case where the sender's domain do not match "
"the value of this parameter, the notification address is used instead. "
"Multiple values can be defined in this system parameter: comma-separated, "
"domains or full email addresses are all allowed. Once an :ref:`outgoing mail "
"server is configured <email-outbound-different-servers-personalized>`, the "
"system parameter is no longer considered and the value used is "
"the :ref:`FROM filtering <email-outbound-different-servers-personalized-from-"
"filtering>` of the mail server."
msgstr ""
"Denne konfiguration håndteres af systemparameteren "
"`mail.default.from_filter`. I tilfælde hvor afsenderens domæne ikke matcher "
"værdien af denne parameter, bruges meddelelsesadressen i stedet. Flere "
"værdier kan defineres i denne systemparameter: kommaseparerede, domæner "
"eller fulde e-mailadresser er alle tilladt. Når en :ref:`udgående mailserver "
"er konfigureret <email-outbound-different-servers-personalized>`, tages "
"systemparameteren ikke længere i betragtning, og den anvendte værdi "
"er :ref:`FROM-filtrering <email-outbound-different-servers-personalized-from-"
"filtering>` for mailserveren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:30
msgid "Odoo’s default outbound messages configuration."
msgstr "Odoos standardkonfiguration for udgående beskeder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:33
msgid ""
"Emails are sent with `catchall@company-name.odoo.com` as the *reply-to* "
"address. In addition, delivery errors are sent to `bounce@company-"
"name.odoo.com`."
msgstr ""
"E-mails sendes med `catchall@company-name.odoo.com` som *reply-to*-adresse. "
"Desuden sendes leveringsfejl til `bounce@company-name.odoo.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:37
msgid ""
"The catchall, bounce, and notification addresses do not work like other "
"aliases. They do not have the vocation to create records in a database. "
"Emails sent to an alias are automatically routed and will reply to an "
"existing and linked record or will create a new one in the database."
msgstr ""
"Catchall-, bounce- og meddelelsesadresserne fungerer ikke som andre "
"aliasser. De har ikke til formål at oprette poster i en database. E-mails "
"sendt til et alias dirigeres automatisk og vil svare til en eksisterende og "
"tilknyttet post eller oprette en ny i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:44
msgid "Using a custom domain to send emails"
msgstr "Brug af et brugerdefineret domæne til at sende e-mails"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:46
msgid ""
"The database can be configured to use a custom domain, in which case all "
"default email addresses are built using the custom domain. If the custom "
"domain is `company-name.com`, the sender address will be "
"`notifications@company-name.com`, the *reply-to* address `catchall@company-"
"name.com`, and the *bounce* address `bounce@company-name.com`. The custom "
"domain can be utilized when sending emails either with Odoo’s email servers "
"or an external one."
msgstr ""
"Databasen kan konfigureres til at bruge et brugerdefineret domæne, i hvilket "
"tilfælde alle standard-e-mailadresser bygges ved hjælp af det "
"brugerdefinerede domæne. Hvis det brugerdefinerede domæne er `company-"
"name.com`, vil afsenderadressen være `notifications@company-name.com`, "
"*reply-to*-adressen `catchall@company-name.com` og *bounce*-adressen "
"`bounce@company-name.com`. Det brugerdefinerede domæne kan anvendes ved "
"afsendelse af e-mails enten med Odoos mailservere eller en ekstern."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:52
msgid ""
"This section assumes ownership of a custom domain. If not, a custom domain "
"must be purchased from a domain registrar such as GoDaddy, Namecheap, or any "
"alternative provider."
msgstr ""
"Dette afsnit forudsætter ejerskab af et brugerdefineret domæne. Hvis ikke, "
"skal et brugerdefineret domæne købes fra en domæneregistrator såsom GoDaddy, "
"Namecheap eller en alternativ udbyder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:56
msgid ""
"`Magic Sheet - Email domain name configuration [PDF] <https://"
"drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cW3watvBO4h190rz-a08AshUepVzDeg5>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Magic Sheet - Email domain name configuration [PDF] <https://"
"drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cW3watvBO4h190rz-a08AshUepVzDeg5>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:62
msgid "Using a custom domain with Odoo’s email server"
msgstr "Brug af et brugerdefineret domæne med Odoos mailserver"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:64
msgid ""
"On **Odoo Online** or **Odoo.sh**, some configurations are mandatory in the "
"custom domain's DNS to ensure good deliverability."
msgstr ""
"På **Odoo Online** eller **Odoo.sh** er nogle konfigurationer obligatoriske "
"i det brugerdefinerede domænes DNS for at sikre god leveringsevne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:68
msgid ""
"Most of the configuration will be done on the domain provider’s side, and it "
"might require some configuration on the mail server itself. **Some technical "
"knowledge is required.**"
msgstr ""
"Det meste af konfigurationen vil blive udført på domæneudbyderens side, og "
"det kan kræve noget konfiguration på selve mailserveren. **Noget teknisk "
"viden er påkrævet.**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:71
msgid ""
"The first step is to configure the :ref:`SPF <email-domain-spf>` "
"and :ref:`DKIM <email-domain-dkim>` to be compliant with Odoo’s mail server."
msgstr ""
"Det første skridt er at konfigurere :ref:`SPF <email-domain-spf>` "
"og :ref:`DKIM <email-domain-dkim>`, så de er kompatible med Odoos mailserver."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:74
msgid ""
"Next, the custom domain must be set as the alias domain of a company. Select "
"the company, open the :guilabel:`Settings`, and add the custom domain under "
"the :guilabel:`Alias Domain` field."
msgstr ""
"Dernæst skal det brugerdefinerede domæne indstilles som aliasdomænet for en "
"virksomhed. Vælg virksomheden, åbn :guilabel:`Indstillinger`, og tilføj det "
"brugerdefinerede domæne under feltet :guilabel:`Aliasdomæne`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:77
msgid ""
"After adding the alias domain, click the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` "
"(:guilabel:`internal link`) icon to assign more companies to the custom "
"domain if needed. Enable the :ref:`developer-mode` mode to modify the "
"default aliases if desired:"
msgstr ""
"Efter tilføjelse af aliasdomænet skal du klikke på ikonet :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` (:guilabel:`internt link`) for at tildele flere virksomheder til det "
"brugerdefinerede domæne, hvis det er nødvendigt. Aktivér :ref:`developer-"
"mode`-tilstand for at ændre standardaliasserne, hvis ønsket:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bounce Alias`: the mailbox used to catch delivery errors and "
"populate the :ref:`red envelope <email-issues-outgoing-delivery-failure>` on "
"the corresponding message."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bounce-alias`: postkassen, der bruges til at fange leveringsfejl "
"og udfylde den :ref:`røde konvolut <email-issues-outgoing-delivery-failure>` "
"på den tilsvarende besked."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Catchall Alias`: the default mailbox used to centralize all "
"replies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Catchall-alias`: standardpostkassen, der bruges til at "
"centralisere alle svar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:84
msgid ":guilabel:`Default From Alias`: the default sender address."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Standard Fra-alias`: standardafsenderadressen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:87
msgid ""
"At the creation of the first alias domain, all companies will use it. If you "
"create a new company, the alias domain automatically set is the one with the "
"lowest priority (ad displayed on the alias domain list in :ref:`developer-"
"mode`)."
msgstr ""
"Ved oprettelsen af det første aliasdomæne vil alle virksomheder bruge det. "
"Hvis du opretter en ny virksomhed, er det automatisk indstillede aliasdomæne "
"det med laveste prioritet (som vist på aliasdomænelisten i :ref:`developer-"
"mode`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:91
msgid ""
"All email aliases (e.g., related to CRM or Helpdesk teams) must have their "
"corresponding mailbox in the custom domain mail server."
msgstr ""
"Alle e-mail-aliasser (f.eks. relateret til CRM- eller Kundeservice-teams) "
"skal have deres tilsvarende postkasse i den tilpassede domænes mailserver."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:94
msgid "Technical schema of external mail server configuration with Odoo."
msgstr "Teknisk skema over ekstern mailserverkonfiguration med Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:97
msgid ""
"To receive emails in the Odoo database within the corresponding chatter "
"(CRM, invoices, sales orders, etc.), one of these three methods must be used:"
msgstr ""
"For at modtage e-mails i Odoo-databasen inden for den tilsvarende chatter "
"(CRM, fakturaer, salgsordrer osv.) skal en af disse tre metoder bruges:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:100
msgid ""
":ref:`Redirections/forwarding <email-inbound-custom-domain-redirections>`,"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Omdirigeringer/videresendelse <email-inbound-custom-domain-"
"redirections>`,"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:101
msgid ""
":ref:`Incoming mail servers <email-inbound-custom-domain-incoming-server>`,"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Indgående mailservere <email-inbound-custom-domain-incoming-server>`,"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:102
msgid ""
":ref:`DNS records <email-inbound-custom-domain-dns>` (requires advanced "
"technical knowledge)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`DNS-poster <email-inbound-custom-domain-dns>` (kræver avanceret "
"teknisk viden)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:104
msgid ""
"Using a custom domain implies that specific :ref:`local-parts <email-"
"outbound-custom-domain-smtp-server-local-part>` might be used by Odoo to "
"send emails."
msgstr ""
"Brug af et tilpasset domæne indebærer, at specifikke :ref:`lokale dele "
"<email-outbound-custom-domain-smtp-server-local-part>` kan bruges af Odoo "
"til at sende e-mails."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:110
msgid "Sending emails with an external SMTP server"
msgstr "Afsendelse af e-mails med en ekstern SMTP-server"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:113
msgid ""
"If utilizing your own outgoing mail server, it must be paired with your own "
"domain, as updating the DNS of an Odoo subdomain is not feasible."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du bruger din egen udgående mailserver, skal den parres med dit eget "
"domæne, da opdatering af DNS for et Odoo-subdomæne ikke er muligt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:116
msgid ""
"To add an external SMTP server in Odoo, open :guilabel:`Settings`, and "
"enable the :guilabel:`Use Custom Email Servers` option found under "
"the :guilabel:`Emails` section. Then, click :guilabel:`Save` at the top of "
"the page to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje en ekstern SMTP-server i Odoo skal du "
"åbne :guilabel:`Indstillinger` og aktivere indstillingen :guilabel:`Brug "
"tilpassede e-mailservere`, der findes under sektionen :guilabel:`E-mails`. "
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Gem` øverst på siden for at gemme ændringerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:120
msgid ""
"Returning to the :guilabel:`Emails` section, click :guilabel:`Outgoing Email "
"Servers`, then `New` to create an outgoing mail server record. Most fields "
"are the common parameters used to set up a connection to an SMTP server; use "
"the values provided by your email provider."
msgstr ""
"Vend tilbage til sektionen :guilabel:`E-mails`, klik på :guilabel:`Udgående "
"e-mailservere`, derefter `New` for at oprette en udgående mailserver-record. "
"De fleste felter er de almindelige parametre, der bruges til at oprette "
"forbindelse til en SMTP-server; brug de værdier, der leveres af din e-"
"mailudbyder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:124
msgid ""
"Once completed, click :guilabel:`Test Connection`. Note that a successful "
"test connection does not confirm that the email will go out as some "
"restriction might remain on the provider side, thus, it is recommended to "
"consult your provider’s documentation."
msgstr ""
"Når det er færdigt, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Test forbindelse`. Bemærk, "
"at en vellykket testforbindelse ikke bekræfter, at e-mailen vil blive sendt, "
"da nogle begrænsninger kan forblive på udbyderens side, derfor anbefales det "
"at konsultere din udbyders dokumentation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:131
msgid "Local-part values"
msgstr "Værdier for lokal del"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:133
msgid ""
"Below are presented the different local-part values that can be used by Odoo "
"to send emails. It might be required to whitelist them in your mail server:"
msgstr ""
"Nedenfor præsenteres de forskellige værdier for lokal del, som kan bruges af "
"Odoo til at sende e-mails. Det kan være nødvendigt at whiteliste dem i din "
"mailserver:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:136
msgid "The Alias Domain Bounce Alias (default value = `bounce`),"
msgstr "Aliasdomænets bounce-alias (standardværdi = `bounce`),"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:137
msgid "The Alias Domain Default From (default value = `notifications`),"
msgstr "Aliasdomænets standard Fra (standardværdi = `notifications`),"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:138
msgid ""
"The default admin address `admin@company-name.odoo.com` or, if changed, the "
"new value),"
msgstr ""
"Standardadministratoradressen `admin@company-name.odoo.com` eller, hvis "
"ændret, den nye værdi),"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:139
msgid ""
"The default Odoobot address `odoobot@company-name.odoo.com` or, if changed, "
"the new value),"
msgstr ""
"Standardadressen for Odoobot `odoobot@company-name.odoo.com` eller, hvis "
"ændret, den nye værdi),"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:140
msgid "The specific FROM defined on an email marketing campaign,"
msgstr "Den specifikke FROM defineret på en e-mailmarketingkampagne,"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:141
msgid "The specific FROM that can be defined in an email template."
msgstr "Den specifikke FROM der kan defineres i en e-mailskabelon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:144
msgid ":doc:`google_oauth`"
msgstr ":doc:`google_oauth`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:145
msgid ":doc:`azure_oauth`"
msgstr ":doc:`azure_oauth`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:150
msgid "Setting up different servers for transactional and mass emails"
msgstr ""
"Opsætning af forskellige servere til transaktionelle e-mails og massemails"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:155
msgid "Personalized mail servers"
msgstr "Personlige mailservere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:157
msgid ""
"Transactional emails and mass mailings can be sent using separate email "
"servers in Odoo. Doing so means day-to-day emails, quotations, or invoices "
"sent to clients will be handled as *transactional emails*. *Mass mailing "
"emails*, including the sending of batches of invoices or quotations, will be "
"managed by the Marketing Automation or Email Marketing application."
msgstr ""
"Transaktionelle e-mails og masseudsendelser kan sendes ved hjælp af separate "
"e-mailservere i Odoo. Dette betyder, at daglige e-mails, tilbud eller "
"fakturaer sendt til klienter vil blive håndteret som *transaktionelle e-"
"mails*. *Massemails*, herunder afsendelse af batches af fakturaer eller "
"tilbud, vil blive administreret af Marketing automatisering eller E-"
"mailmarketing-applikationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:163
msgid ""
"You can use services like Gmail, Amazon SES, or Brevo for transactional "
"emails, and services like Mailgun, Sendgrid, or Mailjet for mass mailings."
msgstr ""
"Du kan bruge tjenester som Gmail, Amazon SES eller Brevo til transaktionelle "
"e-mails og tjenester som Mailgun, Sendgrid eller Mailjet til "
"masseudsendelser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:166
msgid ""
"First, activate the :ref:`developer-mode` and go to :menuselection:`Settings "
"--> Technical --> Email: Outgoing Mail Servers`. There, add two outgoing "
"email server records, one for the transactional emails server and one for "
"the mass mailings server. Enter a lower :guilabel:`Priority` value for the "
"transactional server (e.g., `1`) over the mass mailings server (e.g., `2`) "
"so transactional emails are given priority."
msgstr ""
"Aktiver først :ref:`developer-mode`, og gå til :menuselection:`Indstillinger "
"--> Teknisk --> E-mail: Udgående mailservere`. Tilføj der to udgående e-"
"mailserverposter, én til den transaktionelle e-mailserver og én til "
"massemailserveren. Angiv en lavere :guilabel:`Prioritet`-værdi for den "
"transaktionelle server (f.eks. `1`) end massemailserveren (f.eks. `2`), så "
"transaktionelle e-mails får prioritet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:172
msgid "Example of split between transaction and mass mailing mail servers."
msgstr "Eksempel på opdeling mellem transaktions- og massemailing-mailservere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:175
msgid ""
"Now, go to :menuselection:`Email Marketing --> Configuration --> Settings`, "
"enable :guilabel:`Dedicated Server`, and select the appropriate email "
"server. Odoo uses the server with the lowest priority value for "
"transactional emails, and the server selected here for mass mailings."
msgstr ""
"Gå nu til :menuselection:`E-mailmarketing --> Konfiguration --> "
"Indstillinger`, aktiver :guilabel:`Dedikeret server`, og vælg den relevante "
"e-mailserver. Odoo bruger serveren med den laveste prioritetsværdi til "
"transaktionelle e-mails og den server, der er valgt her, til "
"masseudsendelser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:179
msgid "Dedicated mail server on Email Marketing app settings."
msgstr "Dedikeret mailserver i E-mailmarketing-appens indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:185
msgid "FROM filtering"
msgstr "FROM-filtrering"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:188
msgid ""
"It’s **highly recommended** to configure the FROM Filtering on the outgoing "
"mail servers as per the instructions of your provider."
msgstr ""
"Det er **stærkt anbefalet** at konfigurere FROM-filtreringen på de udgående "
"mailservere i henhold til din udbyders instruktioner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:191
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`FROM Filtering` field allows for the use of a specific "
"outgoing email server depending on the *From* email address or domain that "
"Odoo is sending on behalf of. The **value must be a domain or a complete "
"address** that matches the sender’s email address and is trusted on the "
"outgoing mail server provider's side."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`FROM-filtrering` giver mulighed for brug af en specifik "
"udgående e-mailserver afhængigt af den *Fra*-e-mailadresse eller det domæne, "
"som Odoo sender på vegne af. **Værdien skal være et domæne eller en komplet "
"adresse**, der matcher afsenderens e-mailadresse og er pålidelig på den "
"udgående mailserverudbyders side."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:196
msgid ""
"If FROM filtering is not used, emails will go out using the notification "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Hvis FROM-filtrering ikke anvendes, sendes e-mails ved hjælp af "
"meddelelelsesadressen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:199
msgid ""
"Some outgoing mail servers require a specific configuration of the FROM "
"filter."
msgstr ""
"Nogle udgående mailservere kræver en specifik konfiguration af FROM-filteret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:201
msgid ""
"When an email is sent from Odoo, the following sequence is used to choose "
"the outgoing email server:"
msgstr ""
"Når en e-mail sendes fra Odoo, bruges følgende sekvens til at vælge den "
"udgående e-mailserver:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:203
msgid ""
"First, Odoo searches for a server that has the same FROM filtering value as "
"the From value (i.e., email address) defined in the outgoing email. This "
"configuration is ideal if all users of a company share the same domain but "
"have different local-parts."
msgstr ""
"Først søger Odoo efter en server, der har samme FROM-filtreringsværdi som "
"den Fra-værdi (dvs. e-mailadresse), der er defineret i den udgående e-mail. "
"Denne konfiguration er ideel, hvis alle brugere i en virksomhed deler det "
"samme domæne, men har forskellige lokale dele."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:208
msgid ""
"If the sender's email address is `test@example.com`, only an email server "
"having a FROM filtering value equal to `test@example.com` or `example.com` "
"can be used."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je adresa odesílatele `test@example.com`, může být použit pouze "
"emailový server s hodnotou filtru FROM rovnou `test@example.com` nebo "
"`example.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:211
msgid ""
"If no server is found based on the first criteria, Odoo looks for the first "
"server without a FROM filtering value set. The email will be overridden with "
"the notification address."
msgstr ""
"Pokud není nalezen žádný server na základě prvního kritéria, Odoo hledá "
"první server bez nastavené hodnoty filtru FROM. Email bude přepsán adresou "
"pro meddelelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:214
msgid ""
"If no server is found based on the second criteria, Odoo uses the first "
"server, and the email will be overridden with the notification address."
msgstr ""
"Pokud není nalezen žádný server na základě druhého kritéria, Odoo použije "
"první server a email bude přepsán adresou pro meddelelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:218
msgid ""
"To determine which server is first, Odoo uses the priority value (the lower "
"the value is, the higher the priority is). Failing to do so, the first "
"server is determined by the servers' names, using alphabetical order."
msgstr ""
"K určení, který server je první, Odoo používá hodnotu priority (čím nižší "
"hodnota, tím vyšší priorita). Pokud to selhá, první server je určen podle "
"názvů serverů v abecedním pořadí."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:222
msgid ""
"If there is no mail server, Odoo relies on the :ref:`system parameter <email-"
"outbound-default-from-filtering>` value."
msgstr ""
"Pokud není k dispozici žádný poštovní server, Odoo se spoléhá na "
"hodnotu :ref:`systémového parametru <email-outbound-default-from-filtering>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:225
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use Odoo's mail server for transactional emails in "
"addition to mass mailings."
msgstr ""
"Je také možné používat poštovní server Odoo pro transakcřní emaily navíc k "
"hromadným rozesylkám."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:230
msgid "Using an external email server and Odoo’s default server"
msgstr "Použití externího emailového serveru a výchozího serveru Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:232
msgid ""
"On Odoo Online and Odoo.sh, databases are started with Odoo's SMTP server. "
"If no outgoing mail server is set, the default Odoo's SMTP server will be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo Online a Odoo.sh jsou databaze spuštěny se SMTP serverem Odoo. Pokud "
"není nastaven žádný odesylací poštovní server, bude použit výchozí SMTP "
"server Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:235
msgid ""
"Adding a mail server using the Odoo's mail server with the CLI "
"authentication."
msgstr ""
"Přidání poštovního serveru pomocí poštovního serveru Odoo s CLI autentizací."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:239
msgid ""
"If an outgoing mail server is used simultaneously with Odoo’s default server "
"(CLI), the FROM filter of the outgoing mail server must contain a custom "
"domain, and the FROM filter of the CLI must contain Odoo’s subdomain. If "
"there is no FROM filtering, the email will go out using the notification "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je odesylací poštovní server používán současně s výchozím serverem "
"Odoo (CLI), musí filtr FROM odesylacího poštovního serveru obsahovat vlastní "
"doménu a filtr FROM CLI musí obsahovat subdoménu Odoo. Pokud není nastaveno "
"žádné filtrování FROM, email bude odeslán s použitím adresy pro meddelelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:244
msgid ""
"Splitting of Odoo mail server for transactional emails and Mail server for "
"Mass mailing."
msgstr ""
"Rozdělení poštovního serveru Odoo pro transakcřní emaily a poštovního "
"serveru pro hromadné rozesylky."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:248
msgid ""
"On Odoo Online, the command line interface is equivalent to the default Odoo "
"mail server, using the same limit as if there was no outgoing mail server in "
"place."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo Online je rozhraní příkazového řádku ekvivalentní výchozímu "
"poštovnímu serveru Odoo a používá stejný limit, jako kdyby nebyl nastaven "
"žádný odesylací poštovní server."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:252
msgid ""
"On Odoo Online, the page also shows your daily email usage and your daily "
"limit. On Odoo.sh, you need to check on the monitor page the number of "
"outgoing emails that were sent."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo Online stránka také zobrazuje vaše denní použití emailů a váš denní "
"limit. V Odoo.sh je potřeba zkontrolovat na stránce monitoru počet "
"odeslaných odchozích emailů."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:256
msgid ""
"On Odoo.sh, to use the command-line interface, an outgoing mail server can "
"be configured on the configuration file."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo.sh lze pro použití rozhraní příkazového řádku nakonfigurovat "
"odesylací poštovní server v konfiguračním souboru."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:260
msgid ""
"Odoo’s mail server is meant for transactional emails and small-scale "
"marketing campaigns. The :ref:`daily limit <email-issues-outgoing-delivery-"
"failure-messages-limit>` depends on the database type and the applications "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Poštovní server Odoo je určen pro transakcřní emaily a malé marketingové "
"kampaně. :ref:`Denní limit <email-issues-outgoing-delivery-failure-messages-"
"limit>` závisí na typu databaze a používaných aplikacích."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:267
msgid "Using a custom domain with an external email server"
msgstr "Použití vlastní domény s externím emailovým serverem"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:269
msgid ""
"Similar to the :ref:`previous chapter <email-outbound-different-servers-"
"external-odoo>`, proper configuration might be needed to ensure that the "
"external email server is allowed to send emails using your custom domain. "
"Refer to your provider’s documentation to properly set up the relevant "
"records (SPF, DKIM, and DMARC). A list of the :ref:`most common providers is "
"available <email-domain-providers-documentation>`."
msgstr ""
"Podobně jako v :ref:`předchozí kapitole <email-outbound-different-servers-"
"external-odoo>` může být potřeba správná konfigurace, aby bylo zajištěno, že "
"externí emailový server smí odesílat emaily s použitím vaší vlastní domény. "
"Pro správné nastavení příslušných záznamů (SPF, DKIM a DMARC) se podívejte "
"do dokumentace svého poskytovatele. :ref:`Seznam nejčastějších poskytovatelů "
"je k dispozici <email-domain-providers-documentation>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:276
msgid ""
"DNS configuration is required when you use your own domain. If an external "
"outgoing mail server is used, configuring the records as described in "
"the :doc:`Odoo DNS configuration for our mail servers documentation "
"<email_domain>` **will not have the desired effect**, as it is independent "
"of Odoo when using a custom email server. Odoo does not allow the "
"configuration of Odoo's subdomain."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurace DNS je vyžadována při použití vlastní domény. Pokud je použit "
"externí odesylací poštovní server, konfigurace záznamů podle popisu "
"v :doc:`dokumentaci konfigurace DNS Odoo pro naše poštovní servery "
"<email_domain>` **nebude mít požadovaný efekt**, protože je nezávislá na "
"Odoo při použití vlastního emailového serveru. Odoo neumožňuje konfiguraci "
"subdomény Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:285
msgid "Port restriction"
msgstr "Omezení portu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:287
msgid ""
"Port 25 is blocked for security reasons on Odoo Online and Odoo.sh. Try "
"using port 465, 587, or 2525 instead."
msgstr ""
"Port 25 je z bezpečnostních důvodů blokovaný v Odoo Online a Odoo.sh. Zkuste "
"místo toho použít port 465, 587 nebo 2525."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:293
msgid "Alias domain"
msgstr "Aliasdomæne"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:295
msgid ""
"The catchall domain is company-specific. By default, all companies share "
"Odoo’s subdomain (e.g., `company-name.odoo.com`), but each company may have "
"its own custom email domain."
msgstr ""
"Catchall-domænet er virksomhedsspecifikt. Som standard deler alle "
"virksomheder Odoos subdomæne (f.eks. `company-name.odoo.com`), men hver "
"virksomhed kan have sit eget brugerdefinerede e-maildomæne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:298
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`developer-mode` is activated, the alias domain options are "
"available by going to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Email: "
"Alias Domains`."
msgstr ""
"Når :ref:`developer-mode` er aktiveret, er aliasdomæneindstillingerne "
"tilgængelige ved at gå til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> E-"
"mail: Aliasdomæner`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:302
msgid ""
"Any modification of the alias domain must be done very carefully. If one of "
"the aliases (bounce, catchall, default from) is changed, all previous emails "
"that are not properly redirected to the new aliases will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Enhver ændring af aliasdomænet skal udføres meget forsigtigt. Hvis en af "
"aliaserne (bounce, catchall, default from) ændres, vil alle tidligere e-"
"mails, der ikke er korrekt omdirigeret til de nye aliaser, gå tabt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:306
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Default From Alias` field can be filled with a local-part of "
"the email address (by default `notifications`) or a full email address. "
"Configure it to determine the `FROM` header of your emails. If a full email "
"address is used, all outgoing emails will be overwritten with this address."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Standard fra-alias` kan udfyldes med en lokal del af e-"
"mailadressen (som standard `notifications`) eller en fuld e-mailadresse. "
"Konfigurer det for at bestemme `FROM`-headeren i dine e-mails. Hvis en fuld "
"e-mailadresse bruges, vil alle udgående e-mails blive overskrevet med denne "
"adresse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:314
msgid "Notification system"
msgstr "Meddelelses-system"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:316
msgid ""
"When an email is sent from the chatter, customers can reply directly to it. "
"If a customer replies directly to an email, the answer is logged in the same "
"chatter, thus functioning as a message thread related to the record."
msgstr ""
"Når en e-mail sendes fra chatteren, kan kunder svare direkte på den. Hvis en "
"kunde svarer direkte på en e-mail, logges svaret i den samme chatter og "
"fungerer dermed som en meddelelseståd relateret til posten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:320
msgid ""
"Upon receiving the reply, Odoo then uses the subscribed followers (based on "
"the subscribed subtypes) to send them a notification by email, or in the "
"Odoo inbox, depending on the user’s preferences."
msgstr ""
"Ved modtagelse af svaret bruger Odoo derefter de abonnerede følgere (baseret "
"på de abonnerede undertyper) til at sende dem en meddelelse via e-mail eller "
"i Odoo-indbakken, afhængigt af brugerens præferencer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:324
msgid ""
"If a customer with the email address `“Mary” <mary@customer.example.com>` "
"makes a direct reply to an email coming from the Odoo database, Odoo's "
"default behavior is to redistribute the email's content to all other "
"followers within the thread."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en kunde med e-mailadressen `„Mary” <mary@customer.example.com>` svarer "
"direkte på en e-mail fra Odoo-databasen, er Odoos standardadfærd at "
"omfordele e-mailens indhold til alle andre følgere i tråden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:328
msgid ""
"As Mary’s domain does not belong to the alias domain, Odoo overrides the "
"email address and uses the notification email address to notify the "
"followers. This override depends on the configuration done in the database. "
"By default, on Odoo Online and Odoo.sh, the email `FROM` address will be "
"overridden with the value `notifications@company-name.odoo.com` instead of "
"`mary@customer.example.com`."
msgstr ""
"Da Marys domæne ikke tilhører aliasdomænet, tilsidesætter Odoo e-"
"mailadressen og bruger meddelelsesadressen til at underrette følgerne. Denne "
"tilsidesættelse afhænger af konfigurationen i databasen. Som standard på "
"Odoo Online og Odoo.sh vil e-mail `FROM`-adressen blive tilsidesat med "
"værdien `notifications@company-name.odoo.com` i stedet for "
"`mary@customer.example.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:334
msgid ""
"The address is constructed using the name of the sender and `{alias domain, "
"default from alias}`@`{alias domain, domain name}`, by default, "
"`notifications@company-name.odoo.com`."
msgstr ""
"Adressen konstrueres ved hjælp af afsenderens navn og `{aliasdomæne, "
"standard fra-alias}`@`{aliasdomæne, domænenavn}`, som standard "
"`notifications@company-name.odoo.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:341
msgid "Using a unique email address for all outgoing emails"
msgstr "Brug af en unik e-mailadresse til alle udgående e-mails"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:343
msgid ""
"To force the email address from which emails are sent, activate "
"the :ref:`developer-mode`, and go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical "
"--> Email: Alias Domains`. On the :guilabel:`Default From Alias`, use the "
"local-part or a complete email address as the value."
msgstr ""
"For at tvinge e-mailadressen, som e-mails sendes fra, "
"aktiver :ref:`developer-mode`, og gå til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> "
"Teknisk --> E-mail: Aliasdomæner`. På :guilabel:`Standard fra-alias` skal du "
"bruge den lokale del eller en komplet e-mailadresse som værdi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:348
msgid ""
"If a **complete address** is used as the :guilabel:`Default From Alias` "
"value, **all** outgoing emails will be overwritten by this address."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en **komplet adresse** bruges som værdi for :guilabel:`Standard fra-"
"alias`, vil **alle** udgående e-mails blive overskrevet af denne adresse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:3
msgid "Common emailing issues and solutions"
msgstr "Almindelige e-mail-problemer og løsninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:5
msgid "This page lists the most common emailing issues and their solutions."
msgstr ""
"Denne side viser de mest almindelige e-mail-problemer og deres løsninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:10
msgid "Odoo is not an email provider"
msgstr "Odoo er ikke en e-mail-udbyder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:12
msgid ""
"Odoo does not function like a classic email inbox, such as Gmail, Outlook, "
"Yahoo, etc."
msgstr ""
"Odoo fungerer ikke som en klassisk e-mail-indbakke, såsom Gmail, Outlook, "
"Yahoo osv."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:14
msgid ""
"While Odoo uses emails as a way to notify and communicate with users/"
"customers, it is, by design, not a replacement for a dedicated email server. "
"Therefore, it might not behave in the expected way when compared to a "
"traditional email inbox."
msgstr ""
"Selvom Odoo bruger e-mails som en måde at underrette og kommunikere med "
"brugere/kunder på, er det efter design ikke en erstatning for en dedikeret e-"
"mailserver. Derfor opfører det sig muligvis ikke på den forventede måde "
"sammenlignet med en traditionel e-mail-indbakke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:18
msgid "The main differences are the following:"
msgstr "De vigtigste forskelle er følgende:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:20
msgid ""
"By default, once a notification or transactional email (quote, invoice, "
"direct message to a contact) is sent out successfully, the email object is "
"deleted. The email message's content lives in the chatter of the related "
"record. It prevents cluttering the database with multiple copies of the "
"content of the same email (when sent to multiple recipients) if the content "
"is already present in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Som standard slettes e-mailobjektet, når en meddelelse eller transaktionse-"
"mail (tilbud, faktura, direkte besked til en kontakt) er sendt succesfuldt. "
"E-mailbeskedens indhold lever i chatteren på den relaterede post. Dette "
"forhindrer, at databasen fyldes med flere kopier af indholdet af samme e-"
"mail (når den sendes til flere modtagere), hvis indholdet allerede er til "
"stede i chatteren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:25
msgid ""
"There is no concept of (blind) carbon copy ([B]CC). Odoo uses the concept of "
"*followers* added to a chatter to automatically decide when and how :ref:`a "
"contact is notified <email-outbound-notifications>` or receives a copy of an "
"email."
msgstr ""
"Der er ikke noget begreb om (blind) karbonkopi ([B]CC). Odoo bruger begrebet "
"*følgere* tilføjet til en chatter til automatisk at beslutte, hvornår og "
"hvordan :ref:`en kontakt får besked <email-outbound-notifications>`, eller "
"modtager en kopi af en e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:28
msgid ""
"Incoming emails are handled by checking if the *TO* email address is a valid "
"email address in the Odoo database or, in case of a reply email, if there is "
"a reference in the email header that matches a message sent from the Odoo "
"database. All other emails will be bounced and **not** temporarily parked in "
"a spam or quarantine folder. In other words, any email unrelated to an Odoo "
"database is lost."
msgstr ""
"Indgående e-mails håndteres ved at kontrollere, om *TIL*-e-mailadressen er "
"en gyldig e-mailadresse i Odoo-databasen, eller, i tilfælde af en svar-e-"
"mail, om der er en reference i e-mail-headeren, der matcher en besked sendt "
"fra Odoo-databasen. Alle andre e-mails vil blive afvist og **ikke** "
"midlertidigt parkeret i en spam- eller karantænemappe. Med andre ord vil "
"enhver e-mail, der ikke er relateret til en Odoo-database, gå tabt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:37
msgid "Outgoing emails"
msgstr "Udgående e-mails"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:42
msgid "Changing the email address of the admin user account"
msgstr "Ændring af e-mailadressen på administratorbrugerkontoen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:44
msgid ""
"When an Odoo database is created, the main admin account is assigned a "
"placeholder email address. It is recommended to **replace the admin email "
"address** with a valid email address to prevent outgoing email issues."
msgstr ""
"Når en Odoo-database oprettes, tildeles hovedadministratorkontoen en "
"midlertidig e-mailadresse. Det anbefales at **erstatte administratorens e-"
"mailadresse** med en gyldig e-mailadresse for at forhindre problemer med "
"udgående e-mails."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:48
msgid ""
"To do so, on the admin account, click the user icon, click :guilabel:`My "
"Profile` (or :guilabel:`Preferences`), and update the :guilabel:`Email` "
"field found under the :guilabel:`Preferences` tab. Either use any other "
"email address or use your Odoo subdomain (e.g., `company-name.odoo.com`) and "
"`admin` for the local-part (e.g., `admin@company-name.odoo.com`)."
msgstr ""
"For at gøre dette skal du på administratorkontoen klikke på brugerikonet, "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Min profil` (eller :guilabel:`Præferencer`) og opdatere "
"feltet :guilabel:`E-mail`, der findes under fanen :guilabel:`Præferencer`. "
"Brug enten en anden e-mailadresse eller brug dit Odoo-subdomæne (f.eks. "
"`firmanavn.odoo.com`) og `admin` til den lokale del (f.eks. "
"`admin@firmanavn.odoo.com`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:56
msgid "Delivery failure"
msgstr "Leveringsfejl"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:58
msgid ""
"When a message is sent, an :icon:`fa-envelope-o` :guilabel:`(envelope)` icon "
"is displayed in the chatter. The icon turns red when delivery has failed for "
"at least one recipient."
msgstr ""
"Når en besked sendes, vises et :icon:`fa-envelope-o` :guilabel:`(konvolut)` "
"ikon i chatteren. Ikonet bliver rødt, når leveringen er mislykket for mindst "
"én modtager."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:61
msgid "Red envelope icon displayed in the chatter."
msgstr "Rødt konvolutikon vist i chatteren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:64
msgid ""
"Left-click the envelope to display information about the delivery, and, if "
"possible, the relevant :ref:`error messages <email-issues-outgoing-delivery-"
"failure-messages>`."
msgstr ""
"Venstreklik på konvolutten for at vise information om leveringen og, hvis "
"muligt, de relevante :ref:`fejlmeddelelser <email-issues-outgoing-delivery-"
"failure-messages>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:67
msgid "Example of a sending failure."
msgstr "Eksempel på en afsendelsesfejl."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:70
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`See Error Details` to get extra information for the fail "
"reason, **if** Odoo was able to process the original error or bounce email."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Se fejldetaljer` for at få ekstra information om årsagen "
"til fejlen, **hvis** Odoo var i stand til at behandle den oprindelige fejl- "
"eller bounce-e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:73
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send & close` to retry sending the email to all **toggled-"
"on** (:icon:`fa-toggle-on`) recipients under the :guilabel:`Try Again` "
"column. All **toggled-off** (:icon:`fa-toggle-off`) recipients will be "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Send og luk` for at prøve at sende e-mailen igen til alle "
"**aktiverede** (:icon:`fa-toggle-on`) modtagere under "
"kolonnen :guilabel:`Prøv igen`. Alle **deaktiverede** (:icon:`fa-toggle-"
"off`) modtagere vil blive ignoreret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:77
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Ignore all` to ignore all currently failing emails and turn "
"the envelope icon from red to white."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Ignorer alle` for at ignorere alle aktuelt fejlende e-"
"mails og ændre konvolutikonet fra rødt til hvidt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:80
msgid ""
"Unsent emails also appear in the Odoo email queue. To access it, activate "
"the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` and go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Email: Emails`."
msgstr ""
"Usendte e-mails vises også i Odoo-e-mailkøen. For at få adgang til den skal "
"du aktivere :ref:`udviklertilstand <developer-mode>` og gå "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> E-mail: E-mails`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:83
msgid "Example of the technical email queue view."
msgstr "Eksempel på den tekniske e-mailkøvisning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:86
msgid ""
"Failed emails display the :guilabel:`Delivery Failed` status. "
"Click :guilabel:`Retry` to put a failed email in the email queue again. It "
"will then appear with the :guilabel:`Outgoing` status. The email will be "
"sent again the next time the scheduled action for the email queue runs."
msgstr ""
"Mislykkede e-mails viser status :guilabel:`Levering mislykkedes`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Prøv igen` for at sætte en mislykket e-mail i e-mailkøen igen. "
"Den vises derefter med status :guilabel:`Udgående`. E-mailen sendes igen "
"næste gang den planlagte handling for e-mailkøen kører."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:90
msgid ""
"Optionally, queued emails can be sent immediately by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Send Now`. Click :guilabel:`Cancel Email` to remove it "
"from the email queue."
msgstr ""
"Valgfrit kan e-mails i kø sendes med det samme ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Send nu`. Klik på :guilabel:`Annuller e-mail` for at fjerne "
"den fra e-mailkøen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:94
msgid ""
"Sent emails are periodically cleaned from the queue. This is controlled by "
"the *Auto-Vacuum* scheduled action that cleans redundant data on your Odoo "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Sendte e-mails renses periodisk fra køen. Dette styres af den planlagte "
"handling *Auto-Vacuum*, der renser overflødige data i din Odoo-database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:100
msgid "Common error messages"
msgstr "Almindelige fejlmeddelelser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:105
msgid "Daily limit reached"
msgstr "Daglig grænse nået"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:107
msgid "Email limit reached warning."
msgstr "Advarsel om nået e-mailgrænse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:110
msgid ""
"Odoo limits the number of emails that can be sent from an Odoo Online "
"database. Most email service providers (e.g., Google, Yahoo, etc.) will "
"blacklist Odoo's server IP if Odoo's email server is sending too many emails "
"to addresses that do not exist or are no longer valid. It also applies to "
"unsolicited spam emails sent through an Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Odoo begrænser antallet af e-mails, der kan sendes fra en Odoo Online-"
"database. De fleste e-mailudbydere (f.eks. Google, Yahoo osv.) vil sortliste "
"Odoos server-IP, hvis Odoos e-mailserver sender for mange e-mails til "
"adresser, der ikke eksisterer eller ikke længere er gyldige. Det gælder også "
"for uopfordrede spam-e-mails sendt gennem en Odoo-database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:115
msgid ""
"The default daily email limit varies between **5 and 200 emails**. The exact "
"limit is depends on several factors (subject to change):"
msgstr ""
"Den daglige e-mailgrænse varierer som standard mellem **5 og 200 e-mails**. "
"Den nøjagtige grænse afhænger af flere faktorer (kan ændres):"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:118
msgid ""
"Type of database subscription (one app free, trial, paying subscription)"
msgstr ""
"Type af databaseabonnement (én gratis app, prøveversion, betalende "
"abonnement)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:119
msgid "Apps installed (i.e., Email Marketing, Marketing Automation)"
msgstr "Installerede apps (dvs. E-mailmarketing, Marketing automatisering)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:120
msgid "If a database migration is ongoing"
msgstr "Hvis en databasemigrering er i gang"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:122
msgid "If the daily limit is reached, you can:"
msgstr "Hvis den daglige grænse er nået, kan du:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:124
msgid ""
"Contact :ref:`Odoo Support <email-issues-support>` to increase your email "
"quota. The following factors will be taken into account:"
msgstr ""
"Kontakte :ref:`Odoo Support <email-issues-support>` for at øge din e-"
"mailkvote. Følgende faktorer vil blive taget i betragtning:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:127
msgid "Numbers of users on the database"
msgstr "Antal brugere på databasen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:128
msgid "Apps installed"
msgstr "Installerede apps"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:129
msgid ""
"Bounce rate (the percentage of email addresses that did not receive emails "
"because they were returned by an email server on their way to the final "
"recipient)."
msgstr ""
"Bounce rate (procentdelen af e-mailadresser, der ikke modtog e-mails, fordi "
"de blev returneret af en e-mailserver på vej til den endelige modtager)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:131
msgid ""
"Whether your :ref:`email aliases are correctly set up and use the "
"appropriate custom domains <email-outbound-alias-domain>`."
msgstr ""
"Om dine :ref:`e-mailaliaser er korrekt konfigureret og bruger de passende "
"tilpassede domæner <email-outbound-alias-domain>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:135
msgid ""
"When using a custom domain, verify that :ref:`SPF <email-domain-"
"spf>`, :ref:`DKIM <email-domain-dkim>`, and :ref:`DMARC <email-domain-"
"dmarc>` are correctly configured so that :ref:`Odoo's email servers are "
"allowed to send emails on your custom domain's behalf <email-outbound-custom-"
"domain-odoo-server>`."
msgstr ""
"Når du bruger et tilpasset domæne, skal du verificere, at :ref:`SPF <email-"
"domain-spf>`, :ref:`DKIM <email-domain-dkim>` og :ref:`DMARC <email-domain-"
"dmarc>` er korrekt konfigureret, så :ref:`Odoos e-mailservere har tilladelse "
"til at sende e-mails på vegne af dit tilpassede domæne <email-outbound-"
"custom-domain-odoo-server>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:140
msgid ""
":doc:`Use an external outgoing email server <../email_communication>` to be "
"independent of Odoo's email limit."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Brug en ekstern udgående e-mailserver <../email_communication>` for at "
"være uafhængig af Odoos e-mailgrænse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:142
msgid ""
"Wait until the next day, and retry sending the email. To do so, activate "
"the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, go to :menuselection:`Settings --"
"> Technical --> Email: Emails`, and click :guilabel:`Retry` next to the "
"unsent email."
msgstr ""
"Vent til næste dag og prøv at sende e-mailen igen. For at gøre dette skal du "
"aktivere :ref:`udviklertilstand <developer-mode>`, gå "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> E-mail: E-mails` og klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Prøv igen` ved siden af den usendte e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:147
msgid ""
"The daily email limit counts every email leaving your Odoo database, "
"triggered either manually or automatically. By default, any internal "
"message, notification, logged note, etc., counts as an email if it notifies "
"someone via email. This can be mitigated by receiving :ref:`notifications in "
"Odoo <discuss_app/notification_preferences>` instead of by email."
msgstr ""
"Den daglige e-mailgrænse tæller hver e-mail, der forlader din Odoo-database, "
"udløst enten manuelt eller automatisk. Som standard tæller enhver intern "
"besked, meddelelse, logget note osv. som en e-mail, hvis den giver nogen "
"besked via e-mail. Dette kan afbødes ved at modtage :ref:`meddelelser i Odoo "
"<discuss_app/notification_preferences>` i stedet for via e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:155
msgid "SMTP error"
msgstr "SMTP-fejl"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:157
msgid ""
"`Simple Mail Transport Protocol (SMTP) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Simple_Mail_Transfer_Protocol>`_ is a standard used to transmit emails "
"between email servers and/or email clients."
msgstr ""
"`Simple Mail Transport Protocol (SMTP) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Simple_Mail_Transfer_Protocol>`_ er en standard, der bruges til at "
"transmittere e-mails mellem e-mailservere og/eller e-mailklienter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:161
msgid ""
"If you use :ref:`an external STMP server to send emails <email-outbound-"
"custom-domain-smtp-server>`, a standard set of `SMTP error codes exists "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_SMTP_server_return_codes#Common_status_codes>`_. While the code "
"numbers are not specific to Odoo, the exact content of the error message "
"might vary from email server to email server."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du bruger :ref:`en ekstern SMTP-server til at sende e-mails <email-"
"outbound-custom-domain-smtp-server>`, findes der et standardsæt af `SMTP-"
"fejlkoder <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_SMTP_server_return_codes#Common_status_codes>`_. Selvom kodenumrene "
"ikke er specifikke for Odoo, kan det præcise indhold af fejlbeskeden variere "
"fra e-mailserver til e-mailserver."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:168
msgid "A 550 SMTP permanent delivery error from sendgrid.com:"
msgstr "En 550 SMTP permanent leveringsfejl fra sendgrid.com:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:179
msgid ""
"The error message indicates that you tried sending an email from an "
"unverified email address. Investigating the outgoing email server "
"configuration or the default *FROM* address of your database is a good "
"starting point to troubleshoot the issue, and verify that you whitelisted "
"the email address on the side of sendgrid.com."
msgstr ""
"Fejlbeskeden indikerer, at du forsøgte at sende en e-mail fra en ubekræftet "
"e-mailadresse. Undersøgelse af den udgående e-mailserverkonfiguration eller "
"databasens standard *FROM*-adresse er et godt udgangspunkt for at fejlfinde "
"problemet og verificere, at du har hvidlistet e-mailadressen på "
"sendgrid.com's side."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:184
msgid ""
"Usually, inputting the error message content in a Google search can yield "
"information on what the root cause might be and how to correct the issue."
msgstr ""
"Normalt kan indtastning af fejlbeskedens indhold i en Google-søgning give "
"information om, hvad årsagen kan være, og hvordan problemet kan løses."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:187
msgid ""
"If the issue cannot be resolved and keeps occurring, contact :ref:`Odoo "
"Support <email-issues-support>`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis problemet ikke kan løses og fortsætter med at opstå, skal du "
"kontakte :ref:`Odoo Support <email-issues-support>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:193
msgid "No error populated"
msgstr "Ingen fejl vist"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:195
msgid ""
"Odoo is not always capable of providing information on the reason a delivery "
"failed. The different email providers implement their own policy on bounced "
"emails, and it is not always possible for Odoo to interpret it correctly."
msgstr ""
"Odoo er ikke altid i stand til at give information om årsagen til, at en "
"levering mislykkedes. De forskellige e-mailudbydere implementerer deres egen "
"politik for returnerede e-mails, og det er ikke altid muligt for Odoo at "
"fortolke den korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:199
msgid ""
"If there is a recurring problem with the same customer or the same domain, "
"contact :ref:`Odoo Support <email-issues-support>`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der er et tilbagevendende problem med samme kunde eller samme domæne, "
"skal du kontakte :ref:`Odoo Support <email-issues-support>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:203
msgid ""
"One of the most common reasons for an email failing to be sent with no error "
"message is related to the :ref:`SPF <email-domain-spf>` or :ref:`DKIM <email-"
"domain-dkim>` configuration. Also, verify that the implemented email "
"notification setup is adapted to your business needs. See "
"the :doc:`Communication in Odoo by email documentation <../"
"email_communication>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"En af de mest almindelige årsager til, at en e-mail ikke kan sendes uden "
"fejlbesked, er relateret til :ref:`SPF <email-domain-spf>`- eller :ref:`DKIM "
"<email-domain-dkim>`-konfigurationen. Verificer også, at den implementerede "
"e-mailmeddelelses-opsætning er tilpasset dine forretningsbehov. "
"Se :doc:`dokumentationen om kommunikation i Odoo via e-mail <../"
"email_communication>` for mere information."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:212
msgid "Execution time"
msgstr "Udførelsestidspunkt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:214
msgid ""
"The exact time of an email is sent is handled by a system utility *cron* "
"(scheduled action) that can be used to schedule tasks to run automatically "
"at predetermined intervals. Odoo uses this approach to send emails that are "
"considered \"not urgent\" (i.e., newsletters formats such as mass mailing, "
"marketing automation, and events). This avoids cluttering the mail servers "
"and, instead, prioritizes individual communication."
msgstr ""
"Det præcise tidspunkt, hvor en e-mail sendes, håndteres af et systemværktøj "
"*cron* (planlagt handling), der kan bruges til at planlægge opgaver til "
"automatisk at køre med forudbestemte intervaller. Odoo bruger denne tilgang "
"til at sende e-mails, der betragtes som \"ikke-hastende\" (dvs. "
"nyhedsbrevsformater såsom masseudsendelse, marketing automatisering og "
"arrangementer). Dette undgår at overbelaste mailserverne og prioriterer i "
"stedet individuel kommunikation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:222
msgid ""
"A cron is an action that Odoo runs in the background to execute particular "
"code to complete a task. Odoo also creates cron triggers in certain "
"workflows that can trigger a scheduled action earlier than its scheduled "
"date. Running a scheduled action manually or changing its frequency is "
"generally not recommended, as it might create errors or break specific "
"workflows."
msgstr ""
"En cron er en handling, som Odoo kører i baggrunden for at udføre bestemt "
"kode til at fuldføre en opgave. Odoo opretter også cron-triggere i visse "
"arbejdsgange, der kan udløse en planlagt handling tidligere end dens "
"planlagte dato. Manuel kørsel af en planlagt handling eller ændring af dens "
"frekvens anbefales generelt ikke, da det kan skabe fejl eller ødelægge "
"specifikke arbejdsgange."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:227
msgid ""
"By default, for the normal email queue, the :guilabel:`Mail: Email Queue "
"Manager` cron runs every 60 minutes. The lowest running interval for a cron "
"is 5 minutes. Odoo recommends an interval of 15 minutes to ensure proper "
"operation. If the interval is too short, not all emails may be processed, "
"which may cause the cron to timeout."
msgstr ""
"Som standard kører :guilabel:`Mail: Email Queue Manager`-cronen for den "
"normale e-mailkø hvert 60. minut. Det laveste kørselsinterval for en cron er "
"5 minutter. Odoo anbefaler et interval på 15 minutter for at sikre korrekt "
"drift. Hvis intervallet er for kort, behandles måske ikke alle e-mails, "
"hvilket kan få cronen til at time out."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:232
msgid ""
"Emails that are considered urgent (from one person to another, such as sales "
"orders, invoices, purchase orders, etc.) are sent immediately. They do not "
"show up under :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Email: Emails`, "
"unless their delivery fails."
msgstr ""
"E-mails, der betragtes som hastende (fra én person til en anden, såsom "
"salgsordrer, fakturaer, indkøbsordrer osv.), sendes med det samme. De vises "
"ikke under :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> Email: E-mails`, "
"medmindre deres levering mislykkes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:236
msgid ""
"Example of sending information header when a mailing campaign is queued."
msgstr ""
"Eksempel på afsendelsesoplysningers header, når en udsendelseskampagne "
"sættes i kø."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:239
msgid ""
"Email campaigns are sent as soon as possible (after clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Send` button) or at a scheduled time (after clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Schedule` button)."
msgstr ""
"E-mailkampagner sendes så hurtigt som muligt (efter at have klikket på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Send`) eller på et planlagt tidspunkt (efter at have "
"klikket på knappen :guilabel:`Planlæg`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:242
msgid ""
"For the email marketing queue, the :guilabel:`Mail Marketing: Process queue` "
"cron runs once a day, but will be **automatically triggered early** if a "
"campaign is scheduled outside of this default frequency. If a mailing list "
"contains a large number of recipients, triggering the cron manually multiple "
"times is **not recommended**, as it will not accelerate the processing time "
"and might create errors."
msgstr ""
"For e-mailmarketingkøen kører :guilabel:`Mail Marketing: Process queue`-"
"cronen én gang om dagen, men vil blive **automatisk udløst tidligt**, hvis "
"en kampagne er planlagt uden for denne standardfrekvens. Hvis en "
"mailingliste indeholder et stort antal modtagere, anbefales det **ikke** at "
"udløse cronen manuelt flere gange, da det ikke vil fremskynde "
"behandlingstiden og kan skabe fejl."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:249
msgid ""
"To edit crons, enable the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` and go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Automation: Scheduled Actions`."
msgstr ""
"For at redigere crons skal du aktivere :ref:`udviklertilstand <developer-"
"mode>` og gå til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> Automation: "
"Planlagte handlinger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:253
msgid ""
"For more information about crons when using Odoo.sh, check out "
"the :ref:`Odoo.sh and scheduled actions documentation <odoo-sh/advanced/"
"scheduled>`."
msgstr ""
"For mere information om crons ved brug af Odoo.sh, se :ref:`dokumentation om "
"Odoo.sh og planlagte handlinger <odoo-sh/advanced/scheduled>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:259
msgid "Email Marketing campaigns stuck in the queue"
msgstr "E-mailmarketingkampagner sidder fast i køen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:261
msgid ""
"If multiple Email Marketing campaigns are put in the queue, they are "
"processed in chronological order based on their creation date."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je do fronty zařazeno několik e-mailmarketingových kampaní, jsou "
"zpracovávány v chronologickém pořadí podle data jejich vytvoření."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:265
msgid ""
"If there are three campaigns: Campaign_1 (created 1st of January), "
"Campaign_2 (created 2nd of January), and Campaign_3 (created 3rd of "
"January), they are put in the queue by clicking :guilabel:`Send` on all "
"three of them."
msgstr ""
"Máme-li tři kampaně: Kampaň_1 (vytvořena 1. ledna), Kampaň_2 (vytvořena 2. "
"ledna) a Kampaň_3 (vytvořena 3. ledna), zařadí se do fronty kliknutím "
"na :guilabel:`Odeslat` u všech tří."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:269
msgid "Example of three email marketing campaigns."
msgstr "Příklad tří e-mailmarketingových kampaní."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:272
msgid ""
"The cron will try to process Campaign_1, then Campaign_2, and finally "
"Campaign_3. It will not start processing Campaign_2 until it finishes "
"processing Campaign_1."
msgstr ""
"Cron se pokusí zpracovat Kampaň_1, poté Kampaň_2 a nakonec Kampaň_3. Nezačne "
"zpracovávat Kampaň_2, dokud nedokončí zpracování Kampaň_1."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:275
msgid ""
"If an email campaign never leaves the queue, there might be an issue with "
"the campaign at the top of the queue. To troubleshoot, we could remove "
"Campaign_1 from the queue by clicking the :guilabel:`Cancel` button, and see "
"if the two other campaigns are sent. Then we could try to fix Campaign_1 or "
"contact :ref:`Odoo Support <email-issues-support>`."
msgstr ""
"Pokud e-mailová kampaň nikdy neopustí frontu, může být problém s kampaní na "
"začátku fronty. Při řešení problémů můžeme odstranit Kampaň_1 z fronty "
"kliknutím na tlačítko :guilabel:`Zrušit` a zjistit, zda se odešlou další dvě "
"kampaně. Poté můžeme zkusit opravit Kampaň_1 nebo kontaktovat :ref:`podporu "
"Odoo <email-issues-support>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:283
msgid "Incoming emails"
msgstr "Příchozí e-maily"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:285
msgid ""
"When there is an issue with incoming emails, there might not be an "
"indication, per se, in Odoo. It is the sending email client, who tries to "
"contact a database, that will get a bounce message (most of the time "
"a :guilabel:`550: mailbox unavailable` error message)."
msgstr ""
"Když je problém s příchozími e-maily, nemusí v Odoo být žádná přímá "
"indikace. E-mailový klient, který se pokouší kontaktovat databázi, obdrží "
"zprávu o vrácení (nejčastěji chybovou hlášku :guilabel:`550: mailbox "
"unavailable`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:292
msgid "Email is not received"
msgstr "E-mail nebyl přijat"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:298
msgid ""
"Contact :ref:`Odoo Support <email-issues-support>` if there is a recurring "
"issue with the same client or domain."
msgstr ""
"Kontaktujte :ref:`podporu Odoo <email-issues-support>`, pokud se vyskytuje "
"opakující se problém se stejným klientem nebo doménou."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:303
msgid ""
"You can use database logs to understand and fix issues. Logs are a stored "
"collection of all the tasks completed in a database. They are a text-only "
"representation, complete with timestamps of every action taken on the Odoo "
"database. This can be helpful to track emails leaving the database. Sending "
"failures can also be seen by logs when they indicate that the message tried "
"to send repeatedly. Logs show every action to the email servers from the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"K pochopení a opravě problémů můžete použít logy databáze. Logy jsou uložená "
"kolekce všech úloh dokončených v databázi. Jedná se o textovou reprezentaci "
"včetně časových razítek každé akce provedené v databázi Odoo. To může být "
"užitečné pro sledování e-mailů opouštějících databázi. Selhání odesílání lze "
"také zjistit z logů, když ukazují, že se zpráva pokusila opakovaně odeslat. "
"Logy zobrazují každou akci z databáze směrem k e-mailovým serverům."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:310
msgid ""
"Live logs are located in the :file:`~/logs/` folder (accessed by the command "
"line or on the Odoo.sh dashboard). Log files are created everyday at 5:00 AM "
"(UTC)."
msgstr ""
"Živé logy se nacházejí ve složce :file:`~/logs/` (přístupné přes příkazový "
"řádek nebo na dashboardu Odoo.sh). Soubory logů se vytvářejí každý den v "
"5:00 ráno (UTC)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:314
msgid ""
"The two most recent files, for the current day and the previous one, are "
"named :file:`odoo.log` and :file:`odoo.log.1`."
msgstr ""
"Dva nejnovější soubory, pro aktuální den a předchozí den, se "
"jmenují :file:`odoo.log` a :file:`odoo.log.1`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:317
msgid ""
"Log files for older dates are named using their dates and are compressed. "
"Use the commands :command:`grep` and :command:`zgrep` (for the compressed "
"ones) to search through the files."
msgstr ""
"Soubory logů pro starší data jsou pojmenovány podle svých dat a jsou "
"komprimovány. K prohledávání souborů použijte příkazy :command:`grep` "
"a :command:`zgrep` (pro komprimované soubory)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:321
msgid ""
"For more information on logs and how to access them via the Odoo.sh "
"dashboard, refer to the :ref:`Odoo.sh logs documentation <odoo-sh/branches/"
"tabs/logs>`."
msgstr ""
"For mere information om logs og hvordan man får adgang til dem via Odoo.sh-"
"dashboardet, se :ref:`Odoo.sh logs-dokumentationen <odoo-sh/branches/tabs/"
"logs>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:324
msgid ""
"For more information on accessing logs via the command line, refer to "
"the :ref:`developer logging documentation <reference/cmdline/server/"
"logging>`."
msgstr ""
"Další informace o přístupu k logům přes příkazový řádek najdete "
"v :ref:`vývojářské dokumentaci logování <reference/cmdline/server/logging>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:330
msgid "Information for Odoo Support"
msgstr "Informace pro podporu Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:332
msgid ""
"Here is a list of helpful information to include when reaching out to `Odoo "
"Support <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_:"
msgstr ""
"Zde je seznam užitečných informací, které je vhodné uvést při kontaktování "
"`podpory Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:335
msgid ""
"An export of the full email from the inbox. These are usually in `.eml` or "
"`.msg` file formats containing technical information required for an "
"investigation. The exact process to download the file depends on your third-"
"party email provider."
msgstr ""
"Export celého e-mailu z příchozí pošty. Obvykle se jedná o formáty souborů "
"`.eml` nebo `.msg` obsahující technické informace potřebné k vyšetření. "
"Přesný postup stažení souboru závisí na vašem externím poskytovateli e-mailu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:340
msgid ""
"`Gmail Help Center: Trace an email with its full header <https://"
"support.google.com/mail/answer/29436>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Centrum nápovědy Gmailu: Sledování e-mailu pomocí úplné hlavičky <https://"
"support.google.com/mail/answer/29436>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:342
msgid ""
"`Microsoft Support: View internet message headers in Outlook <https://"
"support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/view-internet-message-headers-in-outlook-"
"cd039382-dc6e-4264-ac74-c048563d212c#tab=Web>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Podpora Microsoftu: Zobrazení hlaviček internetových zpráv v Outlooku "
"<https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/view-internet-message-headers-in-"
"outlook-cd039382-dc6e-4264-ac74-c048563d212c#tab=Web>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:344
msgid ""
"When using a local email software (e.g., Thunderbird, Apple Mail, Outlook, "
"etc.) to synchronize emails, it is usually possible to export the local "
"copies of emails as EML/MSG files. Refer to the documentation of the "
"software used for more information."
msgstr ""
"Při použití lokálního e-mailového softwaru (např. Thunderbird, Apple Mail, "
"Outlook atd.) k synchronizaci e-mailů je obvykle možné exportovat lokální "
"kopie e-mailů jako soubory EML/MSG. Další informace naleznete v dokumentaci "
"použitého softwaru."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:349
msgid ""
"If possible, the EML/MSG file should be based on the original email that was "
"sent and is failing or is causing issues."
msgstr ""
"Hvis muligt, bør EML/MSG-filen være baseret på den originale e-mail, der "
"blev sendt og fejler eller forårsager problemer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:352
msgid ""
"For **incoming emails**: if possible contact the original email sender and "
"request an EML/MSG copy of the original email. Sending a copy of the "
"original email (forwarded) only contains partial information related to the "
"troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"For **indgående e-mails**: hvis muligt, kontakt den oprindelige afsender af "
"e-mailen og anmod om en EML/MSG-kopi af den originale e-mail. At sende en "
"kopi af den originale e-mail (videresendt) indeholder kun delvise "
"oplysninger relateret til fejlfinding."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:356
msgid ""
"For **outgoing emails**: either provide the EML/MSG of the email or specify "
"what record in the database is affected (e.g., sales order number, contact "
"name, invoice number) and the date/time when the email was sent (e.g., email "
"sent on the 10th January 2024 11:45 AM Central European Time)."
msgstr ""
"For **udgående e-mails**: enten levér EML/MSG af e-mailen eller angiv "
"hvilken post i databasen der er påvirket (f.eks. salgsordrenummer, "
"kontaktnavn, fakturanummer) og dato/tidspunkt for hvornår e-mailen blev "
"sendt (f.eks. e-mail sendt den 10. januar 2024 kl. 11:45 centraleuropæisk "
"tid)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:361
msgid ""
"An explanation of the exact flow that is being followed to normally receive "
"those emails in Odoo. Try to answer the following questions:"
msgstr ""
"En forklaring på det præcise forløb, der normalt følges for at modtage disse "
"e-mails i Odoo. Prøv at besvare følgende spørgsmål:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:364
msgid "Is this a notification message from a reply being received in Odoo?"
msgstr "Er dette en meddelelse fra et svar, der modtages i Odoo?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:365
msgid "Is this a message being sent from the Odoo database?"
msgstr "Er dette en besked, der sendes fra Odoo-databasen?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:366
msgid ""
"Is there an incoming email server being used, or is the email being "
"redirected/forwarded through a custom email server or provider?"
msgstr ""
"Bruges der en indgående e-mailserver, eller bliver e-mailen omdirigeret/"
"videresendt gennem en tilpasset e-mailserver eller udbyder?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:368
msgid "Is there an example of an email that has been correctly forwarded?"
msgstr "Er der et eksempel på en e-mail, der er blevet korrekt videresendt?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:369
msgid ""
"Have you changed any email-related settings recently? Did it stop working "
"after those changes?"
msgstr ""
"Har du ændret nogen e-mailrelaterede indstillinger for nylig? Holdt det op "
"med at virke efter disse ændringer?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:371
msgid "An answer to the following questions:"
msgstr "Et svar på følgende spørgsmål:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:373
msgid ""
"Is it a generic issue or is it specific to a use case? If specific to a use "
"case, which one?"
msgstr ""
"Er det et generelt problem, eller er det specifikt for et bestemt "
"anvendelsestilfælde? Hvis specifikt for et anvendelsestilfælde, hvilket?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/faq.rst:374
msgid ""
"Is it working as expected? In case the email is sent using Odoo, the bounce "
"email should reach the Odoo database and display the :ref:`red envelope "
"<email-issues-outgoing-delivery-failure>`."
msgstr ""
"Virker det som forventet? I tilfælde af at e-mailen sendes ved hjælp af "
"Odoo, bør bounce-e-mailen nå Odoo-databasen og vise :ref:`den røde konvolut "
"<email-issues-outgoing-delivery-failure>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:3
msgid "Connect Gmail to Odoo using Google OAuth"
msgstr "Forbind Gmail til Odoo ved hjælp af Google OAuth"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo is compatible with Google's OAuth for Gmail. In order to send secure "
"emails from a custom domain, all that is required is to configure a few "
"settings on Google's *Workspace* platform, as well as on the back end of the "
"Odoo database. This configuration works by using either a personal email "
"address or an address created by a custom domain."
msgstr ""
"Odoo er kompatibel med Googles OAuth til Gmail. For at sende sikre e-mails "
"fra et tilpasset domæne kræves der kun konfiguration af et par indstillinger "
"på Googles *Workspace*-platform samt på backend af Odoo-databasen. Denne "
"konfiguration fungerer ved at bruge enten en personlig e-mailadresse eller "
"en adresse oprettet af et tilpasset domæne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:11
msgid ""
"For more information, visit `Google's documentation <https://"
"support.google.com/cloud/answer/6158849>`_ on setting up OAuth."
msgstr ""
"For mere information, besøg `Googles dokumentation <https://"
"support.google.com/cloud/answer/6158849>`_ om opsætning af OAuth."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:15
msgid ":doc:`/applications/general/users/google`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/general/users/google`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:16
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/google.rst:18
msgid ":doc:`/applications/productivity/calendar/google`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/productivity/calendar/google`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:19
msgid "Setup in Google"
msgstr "Opsætning i Google"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:22
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:17
msgid "Create a new project"
msgstr "Opret et nyt projekt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:24
msgid ""
"To get started, go to the `Google API Console <https://"
"console.developers.google.com>`_. Log in with your *Google Workspace* "
"account if you have one, otherwise log in with your personal Gmail account "
"(this should match the email address you want to configure in Odoo)."
msgstr ""
"For at komme i gang, gå til `Google API Console <https://"
"console.developers.google.com>`_. Log ind med din *Google Workspace*-konto, "
"hvis du har en, ellers log ind med din personlige Gmail-konto (dette skal "
"matche den e-mailadresse, du vil konfigurere i Odoo)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:28
msgid ""
"After that, click on :guilabel:`Create Project`, located on the far right of "
"the :guilabel:`OAuth consent screen`. If a project has already been created "
"in this account, then the :guilabel:`New Project` option will be located on "
"the top right under the :guilabel:`Select a project` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Derefter klik på :guilabel:`Opret projekt`, placeret yderst til højre "
"på :guilabel:`OAuth-samtykkeskærmen`. Hvis et projekt allerede er oprettet "
"på denne konto, vil :guilabel:`Nyt projekt`-indstillingen være placeret "
"øverst til højre under :guilabel:`Vælg et projekt`-rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:33
msgid ""
"On the :menuselection:`New Project` screen, rename the :guilabel:`Project "
"name` to `Odoo` and browse for the :guilabel:`Location`. Set "
"the :guilabel:`Location` as the *Google Workspace organization*. If you are "
"using a personal Gmail account, then leave the :guilabel:`Location` "
"as :guilabel:`No Organization`."
msgstr ""
"På skærmen :menuselection:`Nyt projekt` skal du "
"omdøbe :guilabel:`Projektnavn` til `Odoo` og søge "
"efter :guilabel:`Placering`. Indstil :guilabel:`Placering` som *Google "
"Workspace-organisationen*. Hvis du bruger en personlig Gmail-konto, skal du "
"lade :guilabel:`Placering` stå som :guilabel:`Ingen organisation`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:38
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:35
msgid "Project Name and Location for Google OAuth."
msgstr "Projektnavn og placering for Google OAuth."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:39
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Create` to finish this step."
msgstr "Klik på :guilabel:`Opret` for at afslutte dette trin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:45
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/google.rst:48
msgid "OAuth consent screen"
msgstr "OAuth-samtykkeskærm"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:47
msgid ""
"If the page doesn't redirect to the :menuselection:`User Type` options, "
"click on :guilabel:`OAuth consent screen` in the left menu."
msgstr ""
"Hvis siden ikke omdirigerer til :menuselection:`Brugertype` "
"valgmulighederne, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`OAuth-samtykkeskærm` i menuen "
"til venstre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:50
msgid ""
"Under :guilabel:`User Type` options, select the appropriate :guilabel:`User "
"Type`, and then click on :guilabel:`Create` again, which will finally "
"navigate to the :menuselection:`Edit app registration` page."
msgstr ""
"Under :guilabel:`Brugertype` valgmulighederne skal du vælge den "
"relevante :guilabel:`Brugertype` og derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Opret` "
"igen, hvilket vil navigere til siden :menuselection:`Rediger app-"
"registrering`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:55
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/google.rst:64
msgid ""
"*Personal* Gmail Accounts are only allowed to be **External** User Type, "
"which means Google may require an approval, or for *Scopes* to be added on. "
"However, using a *Google WorkSpace* account allows for **Internal** User "
"Type to be used."
msgstr ""
"*Personlige* Gmail-konti må kun være **Eksterne** brugertyper, hvilket "
"betyder, at Google muligvis kræver godkendelse eller tilføjelse af *scopes*. "
"Brug af en *Google WorkSpace*-konto tillader dog, at **Intern** brugertype "
"bruges."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:59
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/google.rst:68
msgid ""
"Note, as well, that while the API connection is in the *External* testing "
"mode, then no approval is necessary from Google. User limits in this testing "
"mode is set to 100 users."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk også, at mens API-forbindelsen er i *ekstern* testtilstand, er der "
"ingen godkendelse nødvendig fra Google. Brugergrænsen i denne testtilstand "
"er sat til 100 brugere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:63
msgid "Edit app registration"
msgstr "Rediger app-registrering"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:65
msgid "Next we will configure the app registration of the project."
msgstr "Nu vil vi konfigurere app-registreringen af projektet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:67
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`OAuth consent screen` step, under the :guilabel:`App "
"information` section, enter `Odoo` in the :guilabel:`App name` field. Select "
"the organization's email address under the :guilabel:`User support` email "
"field."
msgstr ""
"På trinnet :guilabel:`OAuth-samtykkeskærm` under afsnittet :guilabel:`App-"
"oplysninger` skal du indtaste `Odoo` i feltet :guilabel:`App-navn`. Vælg "
"organisationens e-mailadresse under e-mailfeltet :guilabel:`Brugersupport`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:71
msgid ""
"Next, under :menuselection:`App Domain --> Authorized domains`, click "
"on :guilabel:`Add Domain` and enter `odoo.com`."
msgstr ""
"Derefter under :menuselection:`App-domæne --> Autoriserede domæner` skal du "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj domæne` og indtaste `odoo.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:74
msgid ""
"After that, under the :guilabel:`Developer contact information` section, "
"enter the organization's email address. Google uses this email address to "
"notify the organization about any changes to your project."
msgstr ""
"Derefter under afsnittet :guilabel:`Udviklerkontaktoplysninger` skal du "
"indtaste organisationens e-mailadresse. Google bruger denne e-mailadresse "
"til at underrette organisationen om eventuelle ændringer i dit projekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:78
msgid ""
"Next, click on the :guilabel:`Save and Continue` button. Then, skip "
"the :menuselection:`Scopes` page by scrolling to the bottom and clicking "
"on :guilabel:`Save and Continue`."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på knappen :guilabel:`Gem og fortsæt`. Spring derefter "
"siden :menuselection:`Scopes` over ved at rulle ned og klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Gem og fortsæt`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:81
msgid ""
"If continuing in testing mode (External), add the email addresses being "
"configured under the :guilabel:`Test users` step, by clicking "
"on :guilabel:`Add Users`, and then the :guilabel:`Save and Continue` button. "
"A summary of the app registration appears."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du fortsætter i testtilstand (ekstern), skal du tilføje de e-"
"mailadresser, der konfigureres, under trinnet :guilabel:`Testbrugere` ved at "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj brugere` og derefter knappen :guilabel:`Gem og "
"fortsæt`. En oversigt over app-registreringen vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:85
msgid ""
"Finally, scroll to the bottom and click on :guilabel:`Back to Dashboard` to "
"finish setting up the project."
msgstr ""
"Rul til sidst ned og klik på :guilabel:`Tilbage til dashboard` for at "
"afslutte opsætningen af projektet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:89
msgid "Create Credentials"
msgstr "Opret legitimationsoplysninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:91
msgid ""
"Now that the project is set up, credentials should be created, which "
"includes the *Client ID* and *Client Secret*. First, click "
"on :guilabel:`Credentials` in the left sidebar menu."
msgstr ""
"Nu hvor projektet er sat op, skal der oprettes legitimationsoplysninger, som "
"inkluderer *klient-id* og *klienthemmelighed*. Klik først "
"på :guilabel:`Legitimationsoplysninger` i venstresidens bjælkemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:94
msgid ""
"Then, click on :guilabel:`Create Credentials` in the top menu and "
"select :guilabel:`OAuth client ID` from the dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Opret legitimationsoplysninger` i topmenuen og "
"vælg :guilabel:`OAuth-klient-id` fra rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:97
msgid ""
"Under :guilabel:`Application Type`, select :guilabel:`Web Application` from "
"the dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"Under :guilabel:`Applikationstype` skal du vælge :guilabel:`Webapplikation` "
"fra rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:98
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Name` field, enter `Odoo`."
msgstr "I feltet :guilabel:`Name` skal du indtaste `Odoo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:99
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Authorized redirect URIs` label, click the "
"button :guilabel:`ADD URI`, and then input `https://yourdbname.odoo.com/"
"google_gmail/confirm` in the :guilabel:`URIs 1` field. Be sure to replace "
"the *yourdbname* part of the URL with the actual Odoo database name."
msgstr ""
"Under etiketten :guilabel:`Authorized redirect URIs` skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`ADD URI` og derefter indtaste `https://"
"yourdbname.odoo.com/google_gmail/confirm` i feltet :guilabel:`URIs 1`. Sørg "
"for at erstatte delen *yourdbname* i URL'en med det faktiske Odoo-"
"databasenavn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:102
msgid ""
"Next, click on :guilabel:`Create` to generate an OAuth :guilabel:`Client ID` "
"and :guilabel:`Client Secret`. Finally, copy each generated value for later "
"use when configuring in Odoo, and then navigate to the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Create` for at generere et "
"OAuth :guilabel:`Client ID` og :guilabel:`Client Secret`. Kopier til sidst "
"hver genereret værdi til senere brug ved konfiguration i Odoo, og naviger "
"derefter til Odoo-databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:106
msgid "Client ID and Client Secret for Google OAuth."
msgstr "Client ID og Client Secret til Google OAuth."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:114
msgid "Enter Google Credentials"
msgstr "Indtast Google-legitimationsoplysninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:116
msgid ""
"First, open Odoo and navigate to the :guilabel:`Apps` module. Then, remove "
"the :guilabel:`Apps` filter from the search bar and type in `Google`. "
"Install the module called :guilabel:`Google Gmail`."
msgstr ""
"Åbn først Odoo og naviger til modulet :guilabel:`Apps`. Fjern derefter "
"filteret :guilabel:`Apps` fra søgefeltet og indtast `Google`. Installer "
"modulet kaldet :guilabel:`Google Gmail`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:120
msgid ""
"Next, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> General Settings`, and under "
"the :guilabel:`Discuss` section, ensure that the checkbox "
"for :guilabel:`Custom Email Servers` or :guilabel:`External Email Servers` "
"is checked. This populates a new option for :guilabel:`Gmail Credentials` "
"or :guilabel:`Use a Gmail Sever`. Then, copy and paste the respective values "
"into the :guilabel:`Client ID` and :guilabel:`Client Secret` fields "
"and :guilabel:`Save` the settings."
msgstr ""
"Naviger derefter til :menuselection:`Settings --> General Settings`, og "
"under afsnittet :guilabel:`Beskeder` skal du sikre dig, at "
"afkrydsningsfeltet for :guilabel:`Custom Email Servers` "
"eller :guilabel:`External Email Servers` er markeret. Dette viser en ny "
"mulighed for :guilabel:`Gmail Credentials` eller :guilabel:`Use a Gmail "
"Sever`. Kopier og indsæt derefter de respektive værdier i "
"felterne :guilabel:`Client ID` og :guilabel:`Client Secret`, "
"og :guilabel:`Gem` indstillingerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:129
msgid ""
"To configure the external Gmail account, return to the top of "
"the :guilabel:`Custom Email Servers` setting and then click "
"the :guilabel:`Outgoing Email Servers` link."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere den eksterne Gmail-konto skal du vende tilbage til toppen "
"af indstillingen :guilabel:`Custom Email Servers` og derefter klikke på "
"linket :guilabel:`Outgoing Email Servers`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:132
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:154
msgid "Configure Outgoing Email Servers in Odoo."
msgstr "Konfigurer udgående e-mailservere i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:136
msgid ""
"Then, click on :guilabel:`New` or :guilabel:`Create` to create a new email "
"server, and fill in the :guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`Description`, and the "
"email :guilabel:`Username` (if required)."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`New` eller :guilabel:`Create` for at oprette en "
"ny e-mailserver, og udfyld :guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`Description` og e-"
"mail-:guilabel:`Username` (hvis påkrævet)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:139
msgid ""
"Next, click on :guilabel:`Gmail OAuth Authentication` or :guilabel:`Gmail` "
"(under the :guilabel:`Authenticate with` or :guilabel:`Connection` section). "
"Finally, click on :guilabel:`Connect your Gmail Account`."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Gmail OAuth Authentication` "
"eller :guilabel:`Gmail` (under afsnittet :guilabel:`Authenticate with` "
"eller :guilabel:`Connection`). Klik til sidst på :guilabel:`Connect your "
"Gmail Account`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:143
msgid ""
"A new window labeled :guilabel:`Google` opens to complete the authorization "
"process. Select the appropriate email address that is being configured in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Et nyt vindue mærket :guilabel:`Google` åbnes for at fuldføre "
"godkendelsesprocessen. Vælg den relevante e-mailadresse, der konfigureres i "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:146
msgid ""
"If the email address is a personal account, then an extra step pops up, so "
"click :guilabel:`Continue` to allow the verification and connect the Gmail "
"account to Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Hvis e-mailadressen er en personlig konto, vises et ekstra trin, så klik "
"på :guilabel:`Continue` for at tillade verifikationen og forbinde Gmail-"
"kontoen til Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:149
msgid ""
"Then, allow Odoo to access the Google account by clicking "
"on :guilabel:`Continue` or :guilabel:`Allow`. After that, the page navigates "
"back to the newly configured outgoing email server in Odoo. The "
"configuration automatically loads the token in Odoo, and a tag "
"stating :guilabel:`Gmail Token Valid` appears in green."
msgstr ""
"Tillad derefter Odoo at få adgang til Google-kontoen ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Continue` eller :guilabel:`Allow`. Herefter navigerer siden "
"tilbage til den nyligt konfigurerede udgående e-mailserver i Odoo. "
"Konfigurationen indlæser automatisk tokenet i Odoo, og en tag med "
"teksten :guilabel:`Gmail Token Valid` vises i grønt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:158
msgid ""
"Finally, :guilabel:`Test the Connection`. A confirmation message should "
"appear. The Odoo database can now send safe, secure emails through Google "
"using OAuth authentication."
msgstr ""
"Til sidst skal du :guilabel:`Test the Connection`. En bekræftelsesmeddelelse "
"skulle vises. Odoo-databasen kan nu sende sikre e-mails gennem Google ved "
"hjælp af OAuth-godkendelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:162
msgid "Google OAuth FAQ"
msgstr "Google OAuth FAQ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:165
msgid "Production VS Testing Publishing Status"
msgstr "Produktions- VS testudgivelsesstatus"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:167
msgid ""
"Choosing :guilabel:`Production` as the :guilabel:`Publishing Status` "
"(instead of :guilabel:`Testing`) will display the following warning message:"
msgstr ""
"Valg af :guilabel:`Production` som :guilabel:`Publishing Status` (i stedet "
"for :guilabel:`Testing`) viser følgende advarselsmeddelelse:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:170
msgid "OAuth is Limited to 100 Sensitive Scope Logins."
msgstr "OAuth er begrænset til 100 følsomme scope-logins."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:174
msgid ""
"To correct this warning, navigate to the `Google API Platform <https://"
"console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials/consent>`_. If "
"the :guilabel:`Publishing status` is :guilabel:`In Production`, "
"click :guilabel:`Back to Testing` to correct the issue."
msgstr ""
"For at rette denne advarsel skal du navigere til `Google API Platform "
"<https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials/consent>`_. "
"Hvis :guilabel:`Publishing status` er :guilabel:`In Production`, skal du "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Back to Testing` for at rette problemet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:179
msgid "No Test Users Added"
msgstr "Ingen testbrugere tilføjet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:181
msgid ""
"If no test users are added to the OAuth consent screen, then a 403 access "
"denied error will populate."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der ikke tilføjes testbrugere til OAuth-samtykkeskærmen, vises en 403 "
"adgang nægtet-fejl."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:184
msgid "403 Access Denied Error."
msgstr "403 adgang nægtet-fejl."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:188
msgid ""
"To correct this error, return to the :guilabel:`OAuth consent screen` "
"under :guilabel:`APIs & Services` and add test user(s) to the app. Add the "
"email that you are configuring in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"For at rette denne fejl skal du vende tilbage til :guilabel:`OAuth-"
"samtykkeskærmen` under :guilabel:`API'er og tjenester` og tilføje "
"testbruger(e) til appen. Tilføj den e-mail, som du konfigurerer i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:192
msgid "Gmail Module not updated"
msgstr "Gmail-modul ikke opdateret"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:194
msgid ""
"If the *Google Gmail* module in Odoo has not been updated to the latest "
"version, then a :guilabel:`Forbidden` error message populates."
msgstr ""
"Hvis *Google Gmail*-modulet i Odoo ikke er blevet opdateret til den seneste "
"version, vises fejlmeddelelsen :guilabel:`Forbudt`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:197
msgid ""
"Forbidden you don't have the permission to access the requested resource."
msgstr ""
"Forbudt, du har ikke tilladelse til at få adgang til den ønskede ressource."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:201
msgid ""
"To correct this error, go to the :menuselection:`Apps` module and clear out "
"the search terms. Then, search for `Gmail` or `Google` and upgrade "
"the :guilabel:`Google Gmail` module. Finally, click on the three dots on the "
"upper right of the module and select :guilabel:`Upgrade`."
msgstr ""
"For at rette denne fejl skal du gå til :menuselection:`Apps`-modulet og "
"rydde søgeordene. Søg derefter efter `Gmail` eller `Google` og "
"opgradér :guilabel:`Google Gmail`-modulet. Klik til sidst på de tre prikker "
"øverst til højre i modulet og vælg :guilabel:`Opgradér`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:206
msgid "Application Type"
msgstr "Applikationstype"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:208
msgid ""
"When creating the credentials (OAuth *Client ID* and *Client Secret*), "
"if :guilabel:`Desktop App` is selected for the :guilabel:`Application Type`, "
"an :guilabel:`Authorization Error` appears."
msgstr ""
"Når legitimationsoplysningerne oprettes (OAuth *Klient-id* og "
"*Klienthemmelighed*), hvis :guilabel:`Skrivebordsapp` vælges "
"som :guilabel:`Applikationstype`, vises fejlen :guilabel:`Autorisationsfejl`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:211
msgid "Error 400 Redirect URI Mismatch."
msgstr "Fejl 400 Redirect URI stemmer ikke overens."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/google_oauth.rst:215
msgid ""
"To correct this error, delete the credentials already created and create new "
"credentials, selecting :guilabel:`Web Application` for "
"the :guilabel:`Application Type`. Then, under :guilabel:`Authorized redirect "
"URIs`, click :guilabel:`ADD URI` and type: `https://yourdbname.odoo.com/"
"google_gmail/confirm` in the field, being sure to replace *yourdbname* in "
"the URL with the Odoo database name."
msgstr ""
"For at rette denne fejl skal du slette de allerede oprettede "
"legitimationsoplysninger og oprette nye legitimationsoplysninger ved at "
"vælge :guilabel:`Webapplikation` som :guilabel:`Applikationstype`. Klik "
"derefter under :guilabel:`Godkendte omdirigerings-URI'er` "
"på :guilabel:`TILFØJ URI` og skriv: `https://yourdbname.odoo.com/"
"google_gmail/confirm` i feltet. Sørg for at erstatte *yourdbname* i URL'en "
"med navnet på Odoo-databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:3
msgid "Mailjet API"
msgstr "Mailjet API"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo is compatible with Mailjet's :abbr:`API (Application Programming "
"Interface)` for mass mailing. Set up a dedicated mass mailing server through "
"Mailjet by configuring settings in the Mailjet account and the Odoo "
"database. In some circumstances, settings need to be configured on the "
"custom domain's :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)` settings as well."
msgstr ""
"Odoo er kompatibel med Mailjets :abbr:`API (Application Programming "
"Interface)` til masseudsendelse. Opsæt en dedikeret masseudsendelsesserver "
"via Mailjet ved at konfigurere indstillinger i Mailjet-kontoen og Odoo-"
"databasen. I nogle tilfælde skal indstillinger også konfigureres i det "
"tilpassede domænes :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`-indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:11
msgid "Set up in Mailjet"
msgstr "Opsætning i Mailjet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:14
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:64
msgid "Create API credentials"
msgstr "Opret API-legitimationsoplysninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:16
msgid ""
"To get started, sign in to the `Mailjet Account Information <https://"
"app.mailjet.com/account>`_ page. Next, navigate to the :guilabel:`Senders & "
"Domains` section and click on :guilabel:`SMTP and SEND API Settings`."
msgstr ""
"For at komme i gang skal du logge ind på siden `Mailjet-kontooplysninger "
"<https://app.mailjet.com/account>`_. Naviger derefter til "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Afsendere og domæner` og klik på :guilabel:`SMTP- og "
"SEND API-indstillinger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:20
msgid ""
"SMTP and Send API Settings link in the Senders & Domains section of Mailjet."
msgstr ""
"SMTP- og Send API-indstillinger-link i afsnittet Afsendere og domæner i "
"Mailjet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:23
msgid ""
"Then, copy the :abbr:`SMTP (Simple Mail Transfer Protocol)` configuration "
"settings onto a notepad. They can be found under "
"the :guilabel:`Configuration (SMTP only)` section. The :abbr:`SMTP (Simple "
"Mail Transfer Protocol)` configuration settings include the server address, "
"the security option needed (Use :abbr:`SSL (Secure Sockets "
"Layer)`/:abbr:`TLS (Transport Layer Security)`), and the port number. The "
"settings are needed to configure Mailjet in Odoo, which is covered in "
"the :ref:`last section <maintain/mailjet-api/odoo-setup>`."
msgstr ""
"Kopiér derefter :abbr:`SMTP (Simple Mail Transfer Protocol)`-"
"konfigurationsindstillingerne til en notesblok. De findes under "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Konfiguration (kun SMTP)`. :abbr:`SMTP (Simple Mail "
"Transfer Protocol)`-konfigurationsindstillingerne inkluderer serveradressen, "
"den nødvendige sikkerhedsmulighed (Brug :abbr:`SSL (Secure Sockets "
"Layer)`/:abbr:`TLS (Transport Layer Security)`) og portnummeret. "
"Indstillingerne er nødvendige for at konfigurere Mailjet i Odoo, hvilket er "
"dækket i :ref:`sidste afsnit <maintain/mailjet-api/odoo-setup>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:31
msgid ""
"`Mailjet: How can I configure my SMTP parameters? <https://"
"documentation.mailjet.com/hc/articles/360043229473>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Mailjet: Hvordan kan jeg konfigurere mine SMTP-parametre? <https://"
"documentation.mailjet.com/hc/articles/360043229473>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:35
msgid ""
"Odoo :ref:`blocks port 25 <email-outbound-port-restriction>` on Odoo Online "
"and Odoo.sh databases."
msgstr ""
"Odoo :ref:`blokerer port 25 <email-outbound-port-restriction>` på Odoo "
"Online og Odoo.sh-databaser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:38
msgid "SMTP configuration from Mailjet."
msgstr "SMTP-konfiguration fra Mailjet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:41
msgid ""
"Next, click on the button labeled :guilabel:`Retrieve your API credentials` "
"to retrieve the Mailjet API credentials."
msgstr ""
"Klik dernæst på knappen mærket :guilabel:`Hent dine API-"
"legitimationsoplysninger` for at hente Mailjet API-"
"legitimationsoplysningerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:44
msgid ""
"Then, click on the eye icon to reveal the :guilabel:`API key`. Copy this key "
"to a notepad, as this serves as the :guilabel:`Username` in the Odoo "
"configuration. Next, click on the :guilabel:`Generate Secret Key` button to "
"generate the :guilabel:`Secret Key`. Copy this key to a notepad, as this "
"serves as the :guilabel:`Password` in the Odoo configuration."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på øjeikonet for at afsløre :guilabel:`API-nøglen`. Kopiér "
"denne nøgle til en notesblok, da den fungerer som :guilabel:`Brugernavn` i "
"Odoo-konfigurationen. Klik dernæst på knappen :guilabel:`Generér hemmelig "
"nøgle` for at generere :guilabel:`Hemmelig nøgle`. Kopiér denne nøgle til en "
"notesblok, da den fungerer som :guilabel:`Adgangskode` i Odoo-"
"konfigurationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:50
msgid "Add verified sender address(es)"
msgstr "Tilføj verificeret(e) afsenderadresse(r)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:52
msgid ""
"The next step is to add a sender address or a domain to the Mailjet account "
"settings so that the email address or domain is approved to send emails "
"using Mailjet's servers. First, navigate to the `Mailjet Account Information "
"<https://app.mailjet.com/account>`_ page. Next, click on the :guilabel:`Add "
"a Sender Domain or Address` link under the :guilabel:`Senders & Domains` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Næste skridt er at tilføje en afsenderadresse eller et domæne til Mailjet-"
"kontoindstillingerne, så emailadressen eller domænet godkendes til at sende "
"emails ved hjælp af Mailjets servere. Naviger først til siden `Mailjet-"
"kontooplysninger <https://app.mailjet.com/account>`_. Klik dernæst på "
"linket :guilabel:`Tilføj et afsenderdomæne eller en adresse` under "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Afsendere og domæner`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:57
msgid "Add a sender domain or address in the Mailjet interface."
msgstr "Tilføj et afsenderdomæne eller en adresse i Mailjet-grænsefladen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:60
msgid ""
"Determine if a sender's email address or the entire domain needs to be added "
"to the Mailjet settings. It may be easier to configure the domain as a whole "
"if :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)` access is available. Jump to "
"the :ref:`Add a domain <maintain/mailjet-api/add-domain>` section for steps "
"on adding the domain."
msgstr ""
"Afgør, om en afsenders emailadresse eller hele domænet skal tilføjes til "
"Mailjet-indstillingerne. Det kan være lettere at konfigurere domænet som "
"helhed, hvis :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`-adgang er tilgængelig. Gå til "
"afsnittet :ref:`Tilføj et domæne <maintain/mailjet-api/add-domain>` for trin "
"til at tilføje domænet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:66
msgid ""
"Either all email addresses of the Odoo database users who are sending emails "
"using Mailjet's servers need to be configured or the domain(s) of the users' "
"email addresses can be configured."
msgstr ""
"Enten skal alle emailadresser for Odoo-databasebrugere, der sender emails "
"ved hjælp af Mailjets servere, konfigureres, eller domænet/domænerne for "
"brugernes emailadresser kan konfigureres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:69
msgid ""
"By default, the email address originally set up in the Mailjet account is "
"added as a trusted sender. To add another email address, click on the button "
"labeled :guilabel:`Add a sender address`. Then, add the email address that "
"is configured to send from the custom domain."
msgstr ""
"Som standard tilføjes den emailadresse, der oprindeligt blev oprettet i "
"Mailjet-kontoen, som en betroet afsender. For at tilføje en anden "
"emailadresse skal du klikke på knappen mærket :guilabel:`Tilføj en "
"afsenderadresse`. Tilføj derefter den emailadresse, der er konfigureret til "
"at sende fra det brugerdefinerede domæne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:73
msgid ""
"At minimum the following email addresses should be set up in the provider "
"and verified in Mailjet:"
msgstr ""
"Som minimum bør følgende emailadresser oprettes hos udbyderen og verificeres "
"i Mailjet:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:75
msgid "notifications\\@yourdomain.com"
msgstr "notifications\\@ditdomaene.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:76
msgid "bounce\\@yourdomain.com"
msgstr "bounce\\@ditdomaene.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:77
msgid "catchall\\@yourdomain.com"
msgstr "catchall\\@ditdomaene.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:80
msgid ""
"Replace `yourdomain` with the custom domain for the Odoo database. If there "
"isn't one, then use the :guilabel:`mail.catchall.domain` system parameter."
msgstr ""
"Erstat `ditdomaene` med det brugerdefinerede domæne for Odoo-databasen. Hvis "
"der ikke er et, skal du bruge "
"systemparameteren :guilabel:`mail.catchall.domain`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:83
msgid ""
"After that, fill out the :guilabel:`Email Information` form, making sure to "
"select the appropriate email type: transactional email or mass emails. After "
"completing the form, an activation email is sent to the email address and "
"the trusted sender can be activated."
msgstr ""
"Udfyld derefter formularen :guilabel:`Emailoplysninger`, og sørg for at "
"vælge den relevante emailtype: transaktionsemail eller massemails. Efter at "
"have udfyldt formularen sendes en aktiveringsmail til emailadressen, og den "
"betroede afsender kan aktiveres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:88
msgid ""
"To prevent emails from being marked as spam, :ref:`set up a custom domain "
"<email-online-sh-domain>`. Using the Odoo-provided subdomain "
"(*dbname.odoo.com*) with the Mailjet server may lead to email deliverability "
"issues, because the email authentication protocols (:abbr:`SPF (Sender "
"Policy Framework)`, :abbr:`DKIM (DomainKeys Identified Mail)`, "
"and :abbr:`DMARC (Domain-based Message Authentication, Reporting & "
"Conformance)`) cannot be configured on that subdomain."
msgstr ""
"Abyste zabránili označování e-mailů jako spam, :ref:`nastavte vlastní doménu "
"<email-online-sh-domain>`. Použití subdomény poskytované Odoo "
"(*dbname.odoo.com*) se serverem Mailjet může vést k problémům s "
"doručitelností e-mailů, protože protokoly ověřování e-mailů (:abbr:`SPF "
"(Sender Policy Framework)`, :abbr:`DKIM (DomainKeys Identified Mail)` "
"a :abbr:`DMARC (Domain-based Message Authentication, Reporting & "
"Conformance)`) nelze na této subdoméně konfigurovat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:97
msgid ""
"`Mailjet's SPF/DKIM documentation <https://documentation.mailjet.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360049641733-Authenticating-Domains-with-SPF-and-DKIM-A-Complete-"
"Guide>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Mailjets SPF/DKIM-dokumentation <https://documentation.mailjet.com/hc/en-us/"
"articles/360049641733-Authenticating-Domains-with-SPF-and-DKIM-A-Complete-"
"Guide>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:99
msgid ""
"`Mailjet's DMARC documentation <https://documentation.mailjet.com/hc/en-us/"
"articles/20531905163419-Understanding-DMARC>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Mailjets DMARC-dokumentation <https://documentation.mailjet.com/hc/en-us/"
"articles/20531905163419-Understanding-DMARC>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:105
msgid "Add a domain"
msgstr "Tilføj et domæne"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:107
msgid ""
"By adding an entire domain to the Mailjet account, all the sender addresses "
"related to that domain are automatically validated for sending emails using "
"Mailjet servers. First, navigate to the `Mailjet Account Information "
"<https://app.mailjet.com/account>`_ page. Next, click on :guilabel:`Add a "
"Sender Domain or Address` link under the :guilabel:`Senders & Domains` "
"section. Then, click on :guilabel:`Add domain` to add the custom domain."
msgstr ""
"Ved at tilføje et helt domæne til Mailjet-kontoen valideres alle "
"afsenderadresser relateret til dette domæne automatisk til at sende emails "
"ved hjælp af Mailjet-servere. Naviger først til siden `Mailjet-"
"kontooplysninger <https://app.mailjet.com/account>`_. Klik dernæst på "
"linket :guilabel:`Tilføj et afsenderdomæne eller en adresse` under "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Afsendere og domæner`. Klik derefter "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj domæne` for at tilføje det brugerdefinerede domæne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:114
msgid ""
"The domain needs to be added to the Mailjet account and then validated "
"through the :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`."
msgstr ""
"Domænet skal tilføjes til Mailjet-kontoen og derefter valideres "
"gennem :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:117
msgid ""
"After that, fill out the :guilabel:`Add a new Domain` page on Mailjet and "
"click :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"Udfyld derefter siden :guilabel:`Add a new Domain` på Mailjet og klik "
"på :guilabel:`Continue`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:120
msgid ""
"After adding the domain, a validation page will populate. Unless the Odoo "
"database is on-premise (in which case, choose :guilabel:`Option 1`), "
"choose :guilabel:`Option 2: Create a DNS Record`. Copy the TXT record "
"information to a notepad and then navigate to the domain's :abbr:`DNS "
"(Domain Name System)` provider to complete validation."
msgstr ""
"Efter tilføjelse af domænet vises en valideringsside. Medmindre Odoo-"
"databasen er on-premise (i hvilket tilfælde skal du vælge :guilabel:`Option "
"1`), skal du vælge :guilabel:`Option 2: Create a DNS Record`. Kopiér TXT-"
"postoplysningerne til en notesblok og naviger derefter til "
"domænets :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`-udbyder for at fuldføre "
"valideringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:125
msgid "The TXT record information to input on the domain's DNS."
msgstr "TXT-postoplysningerne, der skal indtastes i domænets DNS."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:129
msgid "Setup in the domain's DNS"
msgstr "Opsætning i domænets DNS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:131
msgid ""
"After getting the TXT record information from the Mailjet account, add a TXT "
"record to the domain's :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`. This process varies "
"depending on the :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)` provider. Consult the "
"provider for specific configuration processes. The TXT record information "
"consists of the :guilabel:`Host` and :guilabel:`Value`. Paste these into the "
"corresponding fields in the TXT record."
msgstr ""
"Efter at have fået TXT-postoplysningerne fra Mailjet-kontoen skal du tilføje "
"en TXT-post til domænets :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`. Denne proces "
"varierer afhængigt af :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`-udbyderen. Konsultér "
"udbyderen for specifikke konfigurationsprocesser. TXT-postoplysningerne "
"består af :guilabel:`Host` og :guilabel:`Value`. Indsæt disse i de "
"tilsvarende felter i TXT-posten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:138
msgid "Return to Mailjet account information"
msgstr "Vend tilbage til Mailjet-kontooplysninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:140
msgid ""
"After adding the TXT record to the domain's :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name "
"System)`, navigate back to the Mailjet account. Then, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Account Information --> Add a Sender Domain or Address`, "
"click the gear icon next to :guilabel:`Domain`, and "
"select :guilabel:`Validate`."
msgstr ""
"Efter tilføjelse af TXT-posten til domænets :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)` "
"skal du navigere tilbage til Mailjet-kontoen. Gå derefter "
"til :menuselection:`Account Information --> Add a Sender Domain or Address`, "
"klik på tandhjulsikonet ved siden af :guilabel:`Domain` og "
"vælg :guilabel:`Validate`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:144
msgid ""
"This action can also be done by going to the `Sender domains & addresses "
"<https://app.mailjet.com/ account/sender>`_ page on the Mailjet account "
"information and clicking on :guilabel:`Manage`."
msgstr ""
"Denne handling kan også udføres ved at gå til siden `Sender domains & "
"addresses <https://app.mailjet.com/ account/sender>`_ i Mailjet-"
"kontooplysningerne og klikke på :guilabel:`Manage`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:147
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Check Now` to validate the TXT record that was added "
"on the domain. A success screen will appear if the domain is configured "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Check Now` for at validere den TXT-post, der "
"blev tilføjet på domænet. En succeskærm vises, hvis domænet er konfigureret "
"korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:150
msgid "Check DNS record in Mailjet."
msgstr "Kontrollér DNS-post i Mailjet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:153
msgid ""
"After successfully setting up the domain, there is an option "
"to :guilabel:`Authenticate this domain (SPF/DKIM)`. This button "
"populates :abbr:`SPF (Sender Policy Framework)` & :abbr:`DKIM (DomainKeys "
"Identified Mail) records to input into the :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)` "
"provider."
msgstr ""
"Efter vellykket opsætning af domænet er der en mulighed for "
"at :guilabel:`Authenticate this domain (SPF/DKIM)`. Denne knap "
"genererer :abbr:`SPF (Sender Policy Framework)`- og :abbr:`DKIM (DomainKeys "
"Identified Mail) records to input into the :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)`-"
"udbyder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:158
msgid ""
"`Mailjet's SPF/DKIM/DMARC documentation <https://documentation.mailjet.com/"
"hc/articles/ 360042412734-Authenticating-Domains-with-SPF-DKIM>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Mailjet's SPF/DKIM/DMARC documentation <https://documentation.mailjet.com/"
"hc/articles/ 360042412734-Authenticating-Domains-with-SPF-DKIM>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:161
msgid "Authenticate the domain with SPF/DKIM records in Mailjet."
msgstr "Autentificér domænet med SPF/DKIM-poster i Mailjet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:167
msgid "Set up in Odoo"
msgstr "Opsætning i Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:169
msgid ""
"To complete the setup, navigate to the Odoo database and go to "
"the :guilabel:`Settings`. With :ref:`developer-mode` turned on, go to "
"the :menuselection:`Technical Menu --> Email --> Outgoing Mail Servers`. "
"Then, create a new outgoing server configuration by clicking on "
"the :guilabel:`Create` button."
msgstr ""
"For at fuldføre opsætningen skal du navigere til Odoo-databasen og gå "
"til :guilabel:`Settings`. Med :ref:`developer-mode` slået til skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Technical Menu --> Email --> Outgoing Mail Servers`. "
"Opret derefter en ny udgående serverkonfiguration ved at klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Create`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:174
msgid ""
"Next, input the `SMTP server` (in-v3.mailjet.com), `port number` (587 or "
"465), and `Security (SSL/TLS)` that was copied earlier from the Mailjet "
"account. They can also be found `here <https://app.mailjet.com/account/"
"setup>`_. It is recommended to use :abbr:`SSL (Secure Sockets "
"Layer)`/:abbr:`TLS (Transport Layer Security)` even though Mailjet may not "
"require it."
msgstr ""
"Indtast derefter `SMTP server` (in-v3.mailjet.com), `port number` (587 eller "
"465) og `Security (SSL/TLS)`, der blev kopieret tidligere fra Mailjet-"
"kontoen. De kan også findes `here <https://app.mailjet.com/account/setup>`_. "
"Det anbefales at bruge :abbr:`SSL (Secure Sockets Layer)`/:abbr:`TLS "
"(Transport Layer Security)`, selvom Mailjet muligvis ikke kræver det."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:179
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`Username`, input the :guilabel:`API KEY`. For "
"the :guilabel:`Password`, input the :guilabel:`SECRET KEY` that was copied "
"from the Mailjet account to the notepad earlier. These settings can be found "
"on :menuselection:`Mailjet -->  Account Settings --> SMTP and SEND API "
"Settings`."
msgstr ""
"For :guilabel:`Username` skal du indtaste :guilabel:`API KEY`. "
"For :guilabel:`Password` skal du indtaste :guilabel:`SECRET KEY`, der blev "
"kopieret fra Mailjet-kontoen til notesblokken tidligere. Disse indstillinger "
"kan findes under :menuselection:`Mailjet -->  Account Settings --> SMTP and "
"SEND API Settings`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:184
msgid ""
"Then, if the Mailjet server is used for mass emailing, set "
"the :guilabel:`Priority` value higher than that of any transactional email "
"server(s). Finally, save the settings and :guilabel:`Test the Connection`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis Mailjet-serveren derefter bruges til masseudsendelse af e-mails, skal "
"du indstille :guilabel:`Priority`-værdien højere end for eventuelle "
"transaktionelle e-mailservere. Gem til sidst indstillingerne "
"og :guilabel:`Test the Connection`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/mailjet_api.rst:188
msgid "Odoo outgoing email server settings."
msgstr "Odoo udgående e-mailserverindstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations.rst:3
msgid "Integrations"
msgstr "Integrationer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:3
msgid "Address autocomplete"
msgstr "Autofuldførelse af adresse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo integrates with the Google Places API to allow the autocompletion of "
"addresses. As you begin typing an address, the system provides a list of "
"suggested locations, reducing manual errors and saving time."
msgstr ""
"Odoo integrerer med Google Places API for at tillade autofuldførelse af "
"adresser. Når du begynder at indtaste en adresse, viser systemet en liste "
"over foreslåede placeringer, hvilket reducerer manuelle fejl og sparer tid."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:9
msgid "Address autocomplete on the contact form."
msgstr "Autofuldførelse af adresse på kontaktformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:14
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/geolocation.rst:52
msgid ""
"Using the Google Places API could require `payment to Google <https://"
"mapsplatform.google.com/pricing/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Brug af Google Places API kan kræve `betaling til Google <https://"
"mapsplatform.google.com/pricing/>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:18
msgid "`Google Maps Platform <https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-products>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google Maps Platform <https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-products>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:19
msgid ""
"`Google developer documentation: Google Places API <https://"
"developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google-udviklerdokumentation: Google Places API <https://"
"developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:25
msgid "Google Places API configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration af Google Places API"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:27
msgid ""
"To use Google for address autocompletion, you must first :ref:`enable the "
"API <address_autocomplete/enable-api>` and :ref:`create the required "
"credentials <address_autocomplete/generate_api_key>`."
msgstr ""
"For at bruge Google til autofuldførelse af adresser skal du "
"først :ref:`aktivere API'en <address_autocomplete/enable-api>` "
"og :ref:`oprette de nødvendige legitimationsoplysninger "
"<address_autocomplete/generate_api_key>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:34
msgid "Enable the Google Places API"
msgstr "Aktivér Google Places API"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:36
msgid "To enable the Google Places API, follow these steps:"
msgstr "For at aktivere Google Places API skal du følge disse trin:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:38
msgid ""
"Go to the `Google Cloud console <https://console.cloud.google.com/getting-"
"started>`_."
msgstr ""
"Gå til `Google Cloud-konsollen <https://console.cloud.google.com/getting-"
"started>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:39
msgid ""
"`Create <https://dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up>`_ or `sign in <https://"
"dash.cloudflare.com/login>`_ to a Google account."
msgstr ""
"`Opret <https://dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up>`_ eller `log ind <https://"
"dash.cloudflare.com/login>`_ på en Google-konto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:41
msgid ""
"In the upper-left corner, click :guilabel:`Select a project`. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`Select a resource` pop-up, create a :guilabel:`New Project`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Vælg et projekt` i øverste venstre hjørne. Opret derefter "
"et :guilabel:`Nyt projekt` i pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Vælg en ressource`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/address_autocomplete.rst:45
msgid ""
"If you have already created a project, but want to switch to a different "
"one, click the selected project's name in the upper-left corner. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`Select a resource` pop-up, manually select a project. If the "
"desired project is already selected by default, proceed to the next step."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du allerede har oprettet et projekt, men vil skifte til et andet, skal "
