#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/geolocation.rst:37
msgid "OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "**OpenStreetMap**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/geolocation.rst:39
msgid ""
"OpenStreetMap is a free, open geographic database updated and maintained by "
"volunteers. No additional configuration is required to use :guilabel:`Open "
"Street Map`."
msgstr ""
"OpenStreetMap er en gratis, åben geografisk database, der opdateres og "
"vedligeholdes af frivillige. Der kræves ingen yderligere konfiguration for "
"at bruge :guilabel:`Open Street Map`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/geolocation.rst:43
msgid ""
"OpenStreetMap data may not always be accurate. You can `join the "
