#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:3
msgid "Google Translate"
msgstr "Google Oversæt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:5
msgid ""
"*Google Translate* can be used to translate user generated text in the Odoo "
"chatter."
msgstr ""
"*Google Oversæt* kan bruges til at oversætte brugergenereret tekst i Odoo-"
"chatten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:8
msgid "Google API console"
msgstr "Google API-konsol"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:10
msgid ""
"A majority of the setup for integrating *Google Translate* into Odoo is done "
"with the *Google API console*. Once the following processes are complete, an "
"*API key* is created to input in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Størstedelen af opsætningen til integration af *Google Oversæt* i Odoo "
"udføres med *Google API-konsollen*. Når følgende processer er fuldført, "
"oprettes en *API-nøgle*, som skal indtastes i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:14
msgid ""
"`Google Translate setup on Google <https://cloud.google.com/translate/docs/"
"setup>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google Oversæt-opsætning på Google <https://cloud.google.com/translate/docs/"
"setup>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:19
msgid ""
"To get started, go to the `Google API Console <https://"
"console.developers.google.com>`_. Then, log in with a *Google Workspace* "
"account, if there is one. If not, log in with a personal Gmail account (this "
"should match the email address that has billing attached to it)."
msgstr ""
"For at komme i gang skal du gå til `Google API-konsollen <https://"
"console.developers.google.com>`_. Log derefter ind med en *Google Workspace*-"
"konto, hvis der er en. Hvis ikke, log ind med en personlig Gmail-konto "
"(dette skal matche den e-mailadresse, der er knyttet fakturering til)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:23
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Create Project` on the far-right of "
"the :guilabel:`OAuth consent screen`."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Opret projekt` helt til højre "
"på :guilabel:`OAuth-samtykkeskærmen`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:26
msgid ""
"If the *Google API Console* has existing projects, click the drop-down menu "
"next to the :guilabel:`Google Cloud` icon, and a pop-over window appears. "
"Next, click :guilabel:`New Project` top-right of the pop-over window."
msgstr ""
"Hvis *Google API-konsollen* har eksisterende projekter, skal du klikke på "
"rullemenuen ved siden af :guilabel:`Google Cloud`-ikonet, hvorefter et pop-"
"over-vindue vises. Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Nyt projekt` øverst til højre "
"i pop-over-vinduet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:30
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`New Project` screen, rename the :guilabel:`Project name` "
"to `Odoo Translate`, and browse for the :guilabel:`Location`. Set "
"the :guilabel:`Location` as the *Google Workspace organization*. If a "
"personal Gmail account is being used, leave the :guilabel:`Location` "
"as :guilabel:`No Organization`."
msgstr ""
"På skærmen :guilabel:`Nyt projekt` skal du omdøbe :guilabel:`Projektnavn` "
"til `Odoo Translate` og browse efter :guilabel:`Placering`. "
"Indstil :guilabel:`Placering` som *Google Workspace-organisationen*. Hvis "
"der bruges en personlig Gmail-konto, skal du lade :guilabel:`Placering` "
"forblive som :guilabel:`Ingen organisation`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:42
msgid "API library"
msgstr "API-bibliotek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:44
msgid ""
"Next, the *Cloud Translation API* needs to be installed on this newly-"
"created project. To do that, click :menuselection:`Library` in the left "
"menu. Then, search the term `Cloud Translation API`, and click into the "
"result. This should be a *Google Enterprise API* labeled :guilabel:`Cloud "
"Translation API`."
msgstr ""
"Dernæst skal *Cloud Translation API* installeres på dette nyoprettede "
"projekt. For at gøre det skal du klikke på :menuselection:`Bibliotek` i "
"menuen til venstre. Søg derefter efter udtrykket `Cloud Translation API`, og "
"klik på resultatet. Dette bør være en *Google Enterprise API* "
"mærket :guilabel:`Cloud Translation API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:49
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Enable` to install the library on this project."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Aktivér` for at installere biblioteket på dette projekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:52
msgid ""
"Using the *Google Translate* API **requires** a current billing account with "
"`Google <https://myaccount.google.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Brug af *Google Oversæt* API **kræver** en aktuel faktureringskonto hos "
"`Google <https://myaccount.google.com/>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:55
