msgid ""
"Now that the project is set up, and the *Cloud Translation API* is enabled, "
"credentials **must** be created. This includes the *API key*."
msgstr ""
"Nu hvor projektet er oprettet, og *Cloud Translation API* er aktiveret, "
"**skal** der oprettes legitimationsoplysninger. Dette inkluderer *API-"
"nøglen*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:64
msgid ""
"To begin this process, click :menuselection:`Credentials` in the left "
"sidebar menu."
msgstr ""
"For at påbegynde denne proces skal du klikke "
"på :menuselection:`Legitimationsoplysninger` i venstre sidebjælkemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:66
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Create Credentials` in the top menu, and "
"select :guilabel:`API key` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Opret legitimationsoplysninger` i topmenuen, og "
"vælg :guilabel:`API-nøgle` fra rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:69
msgid "Create an API key in the Google API console."
msgstr "Opret en API-nøgle i Google API-konsollen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:73
msgid "Copy the :guilabel:`API key` for use in the next section."
msgstr "Kopier :guilabel:`API-nøglen` til brug i næste afsnit."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:76
msgid "For security purposes, the usage of the *API key* can be restricted."
msgstr "Af sikkerhedsmæssige årsager kan brugen af *API-nøglen* begrænses."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:78
msgid ""
"To do that, go to the *API restrictions* by clicking on :guilabel:`Edit API "
"key` in the pop-over window, or by clicking on the listed API key on "
"the :guilabel:`Credentials` page. From here, key restrictions can be set. "
"This includes setting an application to restrict the use of the API key, and "
"whether this API key can call any API."
msgstr ""
"For at gøre det skal du gå til *API-restriktioner* ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Rediger API-nøgle` i pop-over-vinduet eller ved at klikke på "
"den anførte API-nøgle på siden :guilabel:`Legitimationsoplysninger`. Herfra "
"kan der indstilles nøglerestriktioner. Dette omfatter indstilling af en "
"applikation for at begrænse brugen af API-nøglen, og om denne API-nøgle kan "
"kalde en hvilken som helst API."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:83
msgid ""
"It is recommended that the Odoo *Translate API* be restricted to **only** "
"allow requests from the configured Odoo database and to the *Cloud "
"Translation API*."
msgstr ""
"Det anbefales, at Odoo *Translate API* begrænses til **kun** at tillade "
"anmodninger fra den konfigurerede Odoo-database og til *Cloud Translation "
"API*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:86
msgid ""
"To add the website restriction, click :guilabel:`Websites`, under "
"the :guilabel:`Set an application restriction`. Then, enter the address of "
"the database *Google Translate* is being used in, by clicking "
"on :guilabel:`Add`. Lastly, add the :abbr:`URL (Uniform Resource Locator)`, "
"and click :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje hjemmesiderestriktionen skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Hjemmesider` under :guilabel:`Angiv en "
"applikationsrestriktion`. Indtast derefter adressen på den database, *Google "
"Translate* bruges i, ved at klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj`. Tilføj til "
"sidst :abbr:`URL (Uniform Resource Locator)`, og klik på :guilabel:`Udført`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:91
msgid ""
"To restrict use of the key to a selected API, first, "
"select :guilabel:`Restrict key`, under the :guilabel:`API restrictions` "
"section. Then use the drop-down menu to choose the API being configured "
"(*Cloud Translation API*)."
msgstr ""
"For at begrænse brugen af nøglen til en valgt API skal du først "
"vælge :guilabel:`Begræns nøgle` under afsnittet :guilabel:`API-"
"restriktioner`. Brug derefter rullemenuen til at vælge den API, der "
"konfigureres (*Cloud Translation API*)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:96
msgid "Save the API key: copy the API key and store it somewhere secure."
msgstr "Gem API-nøglen: kopier API-nøglen og opbevar den et sikkert sted."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:97
msgid "Do **not** share the API key publicly or expose it in client-side code."
msgstr ""
"Del **ikke** API-nøglen offentligt, og udsæt den ikke i kode på klientsiden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:102
msgid ""
"To access the integration in Odoo, navigate to the :menuselection:`Settings "
"app --> Discuss section`. Enter the API key into the field "
"labeled :guilabel:`Message Translation`. Then, :guilabel:`Save` the "
"settings, and *Google Translate* can be used in any chatter throughout the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"For at få adgang til integrationen i Odoo skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger-app --> Beskeder-afsnit`. Indtast API-"
"nøglen i feltet mærket :guilabel:`Beskedoversættelse`. :guilabel:`Gem` "
"derefter indstillingerne, og *Google Translate* kan bruges i enhver chatter "
"i hele databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:107
msgid "Odoo configuration of the API key from the *Google API Console*."
msgstr "Odoo-konfiguration af API-nøglen fra *Google API Console*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:112
msgid "Translate chatter"
msgstr "Oversæt chatter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:114
msgid ""
"To translate a user's text from another language, click the :guilabel:`... "
"(three dot)` icon menu to the right of the chatter. Then, "
"select :guilabel:`Translate`. The content translates to the *language* set "
"on the user's preferences."
msgstr ""
"For at oversætte en brugers tekst fra et andet sprog skal du klikke på "
"menuikonet :guilabel:`... (tre prikker)` til højre for chatteren. Vælg "
"derefter :guilabel:`Oversæt`. Indholdet oversættes til det *sprog*, der er "
"angivet i brugerens præferencer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:118
msgid "Google Translate present in an Odoo database's chatter."
msgstr "Google Translate til stede i en Odoo-databases chatter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/google_translate.rst:123
msgid ":ref:`language/install`"
msgstr ":ref:`language/install`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:5
msgid "Mail plugins"
msgstr "E-mailplugins"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:7
msgid ""
"Mail plugins are connectors that bridge an Odoo database with email inboxes. "
"With plugins, interact with an Odoo database directly from an email inbox in "
"the following ways:"
msgstr ""
"Mail-plugins er forbindelser, der bygger bro mellem en Odoo-database og e-"
"mail-indbakker. Med plugins kan du interagere med en Odoo-database direkte "
"fra en e-mail-indbakke på følgende måder:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:10
msgid "Log emails in the chatter of related Odoo records."
msgstr "Log e-mails i chatteren på relaterede Odoo-poster."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:11
msgid "Search for and create opportunities, tickets, and tasks."
msgstr "Søg efter og opret salgsmuligheder, sager og opgaver."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:12
msgid "Open related Odoo records from an email inbox."
msgstr "Åbn relaterede Odoo-poster fra en e-mail-indbakke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:13
msgid "Create Odoo contacts."
msgstr "Opret Odoo-kontakter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:18
msgid "Mail plugin features"
msgstr "Funktioner i mail-plugin"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:21
msgid ""
"The options available in mail plugins will vary based on the applications "
"installed in the database."
msgstr ""
"De tilgængelige muligheder i mail-plugins varierer afhængigt af de apps, der "
"er installeret i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:25
msgid "Create a contact"
msgstr "Opret en kontakt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:27
msgid ""
"To create a contact record in Odoo from an email, click the :icon:`fa-plus-"
"circle` :guilabel:`(New)` icon."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en kontaktpost i Odoo fra en e-mail skal du klikke på ikonet "
":icon:`fa-plus-circle` :guilabel:`(Ny)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:31
msgid ""
"A contact record **must** be created before a lead/opportunity can be "
"created."
msgstr ""
"En kontaktpost **skal** oprettes, før et lead/en mulighed kan oprettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:34
msgid "Create an opportunity"
msgstr "Opret en mulighed"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:36
msgid ""
"To create an opportunity from an email, click the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`(New)` icon next to :guilabel:`Opportunities`. Doing so "
"opens a new opportunity record in Odoo in a new tab. The subject of the "
"email is used as the opportunity title, and the content of the email is "
"added to the :guilabel:`Notes` tab of the opportunity."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en mulighed fra en e-mail, klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` ved siden af :guilabel:`Muligheder`. Dette åbner en "
"ny mulighedspost i Odoo i en ny fane. E-mailens emne bruges som "
"mulighedstitel, og e-mailens indhold tilføjes til fanen :guilabel:`Noter` på "
"muligheden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:42
msgid "Create a task"
msgstr "Opret en opgave"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:44
msgid ""
"To create a task from an email, click the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(New)` "
"icon next to :guilabel:`Tasks`. Then, enter the title of the project where "
"the task should be created in the resulting field, and select the "
"appropriate project from the resulting list. This opens a new task record in "
"Odoo in a new tab. The subject of the email is used as the task title, and "
"the content of the email is added to the :guilabel:`Description` tab."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en opgave fra en e-mail skal du klikke på :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`(plus)`-ikonet ved siden af :guilabel:`Tasks`. Indtast "
"derefter titlen på projektet, hvor opgaven skal oprettes i det viste felt, "
"og vælg det relevante projekt fra listen. Dette åbner en ny opgavepost i "
"Odoo i en ny fane. E-mailens emne bruges som opgavetitel, og e-mailens "
"indhold tilføjes til fanen :guilabel:`Description`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:51
msgid "Create a ticket"
msgstr "Opret en sag"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:53
msgid ""
"To create a ticket from an email, click the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`(New)` icon next to :guilabel:`Tickets`. Doing so opens a "
"new ticket record in Odoo in a new tab. The subject of the email is used as "
"the ticket title, and the content of the email is added to "
"the :guilabel:`Description` tab of the ticket."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en sag fra en e-mail skal du klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-plus` "
":guilabel:`(Ny)` ud for :guilabel:`Sager`. Dette åbner en ny sagspost i Odoo "
"i en ny fane. E-mailens emne bruges som sagens titel, og indholdet af e-"
"mailen føjes til sagens fane :guilabel:`Beskrivelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:59
msgid "Email providers"
msgstr "E-mailudbydere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:61
msgid "Mail plugins are available for Outlook and Gmail:"
msgstr "Mail-plugins er tilgængelige til Outlook og Gmail:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:64
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:3
msgid "Outlook plugin"
msgstr "Outlook-plugin"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:64
msgid ""
"Learn how to set up the Outlook plugin and connect it to an Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Lær, hvordan du konfigurerer Outlook-pluginet og forbinder det til en Odoo-"
"database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:70
msgid "Gmail plugin"
msgstr "Gmail-plugin"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins.rst:70
msgid ""
"Learn how to set up the Gmail plugin and connect it to an Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Lær, hvordan du konfigurerer Gmail-pluginet og forbinder det til en Odoo-"
"database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:3
msgid "Gmail Plugin"
msgstr "Gmail-plugin"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Gmail plugin connects an Odoo database to a Gmail inbox, which enables "
"users to create Odoo records (such as opportunities, tasks, and tickets) "
"directly in Gmail."
msgstr ""
"Gmail-pluginet forbinder en Odoo-database med en Gmail-indbakke, hvilket gør "
"det muligt for brugere at oprette Odoo-poster (såsom salgsmuligheder, "
"opgaver og sager) direkte i Gmail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:9
msgid ""
"Learn how Odoo handles your data by reading Odoo's `Privacy Policy <https://"
"www.odoo.com/privacy>`_ and :doc:`Terms and Conditions <../../../../legal>`."
msgstr ""
"Zjistěte, jak Odoo nakládá s vašimi daty, přečtěte si `Zásady ochrany "
"osobních údajů <https://www.odoo.com/privacy>`_ a :doc:`Smluvní podmínky "
"<../../../../legal>` Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:15
msgid "Install the Gmail Plugin"
msgstr "Installer Gmail-pluginet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:18
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:19
msgid ""
"Make sure to check the database version in the :menuselection:`Settings app "
"--> General Settings`, at the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for at tjekke databaseversionen i :menuselection:`Settings app --> "
"General Settings` nederst på siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:21
msgid ""
"For database versions earlier than 19.2, see the `19.0 documentation "
"<https://www.odoo.com/documentation/19.0/applications/general/integrations/"
"mail_plugins/gmail.html>`_ for installation instructions."
msgstr ""
"For databaseversioner før 19.2 henvises til `19.0-dokumentationen <https://"
"www.odoo.com/documentation/19.0/applications/general/integrations/"
"mail_plugins/gmail.html>`_ for installationsvejledning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:26
msgid "From the Google Workspace Marketplace"
msgstr "Fra Google Workspace Marketplace"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:28
msgid ""
"To install the Odoo Gmail plugin, sign in to the Gmail account to be "
"connected to Odoo, then go to the `Odoo Inbox Addin <https://"
"workspace.google.com/marketplace/app/odoo_inbox_addin/546131068990>`_ page "
"in the Google Workspace Marketplace. Click :guilabel:`Install` and a pop-up "
"window appears. Click :guilabel:`Continue` and select the checkbox next "
"to :guilabel:`Select all` to grant the necessary permissions, then "
"click :guilabel:`Continue` one more time to confirm the installation of the "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"For at installere Odoo Gmail-pluginet skal du logge ind på den Gmail-konto, "
"der skal forbindes til Odoo, og derefter gå til siden `Odoo Inbox Addin "
"<https://workspace.google.com/marketplace/app/odoo_inbox_addin/546131068990>"
"`_ i Google Workspace Marketplace. Klik på :guilabel:`Installer`, og et pop "
"op-vindue vises. Klik på :guilabel:`Fortsæt`, og markér afkrydsningsfeltet "
"ud for :guilabel:`Vælg alle` for at give de nødvendige tilladelser, og klik "
"derefter endnu en gang på :guilabel:`Fortsæt` for at bekræfte installationen "
"af pluginet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:36
msgid "From the Gmail inbox"
msgstr "Fra Gmail-indbakken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:38
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the plugin can be installed directly from the Gmail inbox. To "
"do so, click the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(Get Add-ons)` icon on the right-"
"hand side panel. If the side panel is not visible, click the :icon:`fa-"
"chevron-left` :guilabel:`(Show side panel)` icon in the bottom-right corner "
"of the inbox to expand it."
msgstr ""
"Pluginet kan også installeres direkte fra Gmail-indbakken. For at gøre dette "
"skal du klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(Hent "
"tilføjelsesprogrammer)` i sidepanelet til højre. Hvis sidepanelet ikke er "
"synligt, skal du klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-chevron-left` :guilabel:`(Vis "
"sidepanel)` i nederste højre hjørne af indbakken for at udvide det."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:43
msgid "Plus sign icon on the Gmail inbox side panel."
msgstr "Plusikon på sidepanelet i Gmail-indbakken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:46
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Search apps`, then type `Odoo` and press Enter."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Søg efter apps`, skriv derefter `Odoo`, og tryk på Enter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:48
msgid "Odoo Inbox Addin in Google Workspace Marketplace."
msgstr "Odoo Inbox Addin i Google Workspace Marketplace."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:51
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Odoo Inbox Addin`, then click :guilabel:`Install`, and a "
"pop-up window appears. Click :guilabel:`Continue` and select the checkbox "
"next to :guilabel:`Select all` to grant the necessary permissions, then "
"click :guilabel:`Continue` one more time to confirm the installation of the "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Odoo Inbox Addin`, klik derefter på "
":guilabel:`Installer`, og et pop op-vindue vises. Klik på "
":guilabel:`Fortsæt`, og markér afkrydsningsfeltet ud for :guilabel:`Vælg "
"alle` for at give de nødvendige tilladelser, og klik derefter endnu en gang "
"på :guilabel:`Fortsæt` for at bekræfte installationen af pluginet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:57
msgid ""
"If the plugin does not appear in the side panel after installation, refresh "
"the page."
msgstr ""
"Hvis pluginet ikke vises i sidepanelet efter installationen, skal du "
"genindlæse siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:60
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:49
msgid "Connect an Odoo database"
msgstr "Forbind en Odoo-database"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:62
msgid ""
"To open the plugin, click on the Odoo icon in the right-hand side panel. The "
"plugin panel opens between the inbox and the right-hand side panel. "
"Click :guilabel:`Login`. Enter the Odoo database URL and "
"click :guilabel:`Login`, or click :guilabel:`Sign Up` to create an Odoo "
"account, and a pop-up window opens. Click :guilabel:`Allow` in the pop-up "
"window to let the Gmail plugin connect to the database."
msgstr ""
"For at åbne pluginnet skal du klikke på Odoo-ikonet i panelet i højre side. "
"Plugin-panelet åbnes mellem indbakken og panelet i højre side. Klik på "
":guilabel:`Log ind`. Indtast Odoo-databassens URL, og klik på :guilabel:`Log "
"ind`, eller klik på :guilabel:`Opret konto` for at oprette en Odoo-konto, "
"hvorefter et pop op-vindue åbnes. Klik på :guilabel:`Tillad` i pop op-"
"vinduet for at give Gmail-pluginnet tilladelse til at oprette forbindelse "
"til databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/gmail.rst:69
msgid ""
"Use the general URL for the database, not the URL of a specific page in the "
"database. For example, use `https://mycompany.odoo.com`, not `https://"
"mycompany.odoo.com/web#cids=1&action=menu`."
msgstr ""
"Brug den generelle URL for databasen, ikke URL'en for en bestemt side i "
"databasen. Brug f.eks. `https://mycompany.odoo.com`, ikke `https://"
"mycompany.odoo.com/web#cids=1&action=menu`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Outlook plugin connects an Odoo database to an Outlook inbox, which "
"enables users to create Odoo records (such as opportunities, tasks, and "
"tickets) directly in Outlook."
msgstr ""
"Outlook-pluginnet forbinder en Odoo-database med en Outlook-indbakke, "
"hvilket gør det muligt for brugere at oprette Odoo-poster (f.eks. "
"salgsmuligheder, opgaver og sager) direkte i Outlook."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Outlook plugin is available for both the desktop and web versions of "
"Outlook. See `Microsoft's add-in article <https://support.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/office/use-add-ins-in-outlook-1ee261f9-49bf-4ba6-b3e2-2ba7bcab64c8>`_."
msgstr ""
"Outlook-pluginet er tilgængeligt til både desktop- og webversioner af "
"Outlook. Se `Microsofts artikel om tilføjelser <https://"
"support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/use-add-ins-in-outlook-1ee261f9-49bf-4ba6-"
"b3e2-2ba7bcab64c8>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:16
msgid "Install the Outlook plugin"
msgstr "Installér Outlook-plugin"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:22
msgid ""
"For database versions earlier than 19.2, see the `19.0 documentation "
"<https://www.odoo.com/documentation/19.0/applications/general/integrations/"
"mail_plugins/outlook.html>`_ for installation instructions."
msgstr ""
"For databaseversioner før 19.2 henvises til `19.0-dokumentationen <https://"
"www.odoo.com/documentation/19.0/applications/general/integrations/"
"mail_plugins/outlook.html>`_ for installationsvejledning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:27
msgid "From the Microsoft Marketplace"
msgstr "Fra Microsoft Marketplace"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:29
msgid ""
"To install the Odoo Outlook plugin, go to the `Odoo Inbox Addin <https://"
"marketplace.microsoft.com/en-us/product/WA200009923?tab=Overview>`_ page in "
"the Microsoft Marketplace and click :guilabel:`Get it now`. Sign in to the "
"Outlook account to be connected to Odoo. Fill out the :guilabel:`Name` "
"and :guilabel:`Country / region` fields, then click :guilabel:`Get it now` "
"one more time to grant the necessary permissions, and the page redirects to "
"the Outlook inbox. Click :guilabel:`Add` to confirm the installation of the "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"For at installere Odoo Outlook-pluginnet skal du gå til siden `Odoo Inbox "
"Addin <https://marketplace.microsoft.com/en-us/product/"
"WA200009923?tab=Overview>`_ i Microsoft Marketplace og klikke på "
":guilabel:`Hent det nu`. Log ind på den Outlook-konto, der skal forbindes "
"til Odoo. Udfyld felterne :guilabel:`Navn` og :guilabel:`Land / område`, og "
"klik derefter på :guilabel:`Hent det nu` en gang til for at give de "
"nødvendige tilladelser, hvorefter siden omdirigerer til Outlook-indbakken. "
"Klik på :guilabel:`Tilføj` for at bekræfte installationen af pluginnet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:37
msgid "From the Outlook inbox"
msgstr "Fra Outlook-indbakken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:39
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the plugin can be installed directly from the Outlook inbox. "
"To do so, open an email in the Outlook inbox, click on the :guilabel:`Apps` "
"button in the top-right corner of the email, then click :guilabel:`Get add-"
"ins`. Click :guilabel:`Search add-ins`, then type `Odoo` and press Enter. "
"Click :guilabel:`Odoo Inbox Addin`, then click :guilabel:`Add` to confirm "
"the installation of the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Alternativt kan pluginnet installeres direkte fra Outlook-indbakken. For at "
"gøre dette skal du åbne en e-mail i Outlook-indbakken, klikke på knappen "
":guilabel:`Apps` i øverste højre hjørne af e-mailen og derefter klikke på "
":guilabel:`Hent tilføjelsesprogrammer`. Klik på :guilabel:`Søg efter "
"tilføjelsesprogrammer`, skriv derefter `Odoo`, og tryk på Enter. Klik på "
":guilabel:`Odoo Inbox Addin`, og klik derefter på :guilabel:`Tilføj` for at "
"bekræfte installationen af pluginnet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:45
msgid "Apps button in the Outlook inbox."
msgstr "Knappen Apps i Outlook-indbakken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:51
msgid ""
"To open the plugin, click on the :guilabel:`Apps` button in the top-right "
"corner of any email, and select :guilabel:`Odoo`. The plugin panel opens to "
"the right of the email."
msgstr ""
"For at åbne pluginnet skal du klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Apps` i øverste "
"højre hjørne af en vilkårlig e-mail og vælge :guilabel:`Odoo`. Plugin-"
"panelet åbnes til højre for e-mailen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:54
msgid ""
"Enter the Odoo database URL and click :guilabel:`Login`, or "
"click :guilabel:`Sign Up` to create an Odoo account. Click :guilabel:`Allow` "
"and a pop-up window opens. Click :guilabel:`Allow` in the pop-up window to "
"let the Outlook plugin connect to the database."
msgstr ""
"Indtast Odoo-databassens URL, og klik på :guilabel:`Log ind`, eller klik på "
":guilabel:`Opret konto` for at oprette en Odoo-konto. Klik på "
":guilabel:`Tillad`, hvorefter et pop op-vindue åbnes. Klik på "
":guilabel:`Tillad` i pop op-vinduet for at give Outlook-pluginnet tilladelse "
"til at oprette forbindelse til databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:3
msgid "Unsplash"
msgstr "Unsplash"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Unsplash** is a recognized stock photography library integrated with Odoo."
msgstr "**Unsplash** er et anerkendt stockfotobibliotek integreret med Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:7
msgid ""
"If your database is hosted on **Odoo Online**, you can access Unsplash "
"pictures without configuration."
msgstr ""
"Hvis din database hostes på **Odoo Online**, kan du få adgang til Unsplash-"
"billeder uden konfiguration."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:10
msgid ""
"If your database is hosted on **Odoo.sh or on-premise**, proceed as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Hvis din database hostes på **Odoo.sh eller on-premise**, skal du gøre "
"følgende:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:12
msgid ""
"To **generate an Unsplash access key**, create or sign in to an `Unsplash "
"account <https://unsplash.com>`_."
msgstr ""
"For at **generere en Unsplash-adgangsnøgle** skal du oprette eller logge ind "
"på en `Unsplash-konto <https://unsplash.com>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:15
msgid ""
"Access your `applications dashboard <https://unsplash.com/oauth/"
"applications>`_, click :guilabel:`New Application`, select all checkboxes, "
"and click :guilabel:`Accept terms`."
msgstr ""
"Gå til dit `applikationsdashboard <https://unsplash.com/oauth/"
"applications>`_, klik på :guilabel:`Ny applikation`, vælg alle "
"afkrydsningsfelter og klik på :guilabel:`Accepter vilkår`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:18
msgid ""
"In the pop-up window, enter your :guilabel:`Application Name`, starting with "
"the prefix `Odoo:` (e.g., `Odoo: connection`), so Unsplash recognizes it as "
"an Odoo instance. Then, add a :guilabel:`Description` and "
"click :guilabel:`Create application`."
msgstr ""
"Indtast dit :guilabel:`Applikationsnavn` i pop op-vinduet, startende med "
"præfikset `Odoo:` (f.eks. `Odoo: forbindelse`), så Unsplash genkender det "
"som en Odoo-instans. Tilføj derefter en :guilabel:`Beskrivelse` og klik "
"på :guilabel:`Opret applikation`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:22
msgid ""
"On the application details page, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Keys` section "
"and copy the :guilabel:`Access Key` and :guilabel:`Application ID`."
msgstr ""
"På siden med applikationsdetaljer skal du rulle ned til "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Nøgler` og kopiere :guilabel:`Adgangsnøgle` "
"og :guilabel:`Applikations-id`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:25
msgid ""
"In Odoo, go to :menuselection:`General Settings` and enable "
"the :guilabel:`Unsplash Image Library` feature. Then, enter the "
"Unsplash :guilabel:`Access Key` and :guilabel:`Application ID`."
msgstr ""
"I Odoo skal du gå til :menuselection:`Generelle indstillinger` og aktivere "
"funktionen :guilabel:`Unsplash-billedbibliotek`. Indtast derefter "
"Unsplash :guilabel:`Adgangsnøgle` og :guilabel:`Applikations-id`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/integrations/unsplash.rst:29
msgid ""
"As a non-Odoo Online user, you are limited to a test key with a maximum of "
"50 Unsplash requests per hour."
msgstr ""
"Som ikke-Odoo Online-bruger er du begrænset til en testnøgle med maksimalt "
"50 Unsplash-anmodninger i timen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:7
msgid "Internet of Things (IoT)"
msgstr "Internet of Things (IoT)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:9
msgid ""
"Odoo Internet of Things (IoT) allows to connect physical devices such as "
"barcode scanners, receipt printers, payment terminals, measurement tools, "
"etc. to an Odoo database using an IoT system."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Internet of Things (IoT) gør det muligt at forbinde fysiske enheder "
"såsom stregkodescannere, kvitteringsprintere, betalingsterminaler, "
"måleværktøjer osv. til en Odoo-database ved hjælp af et IoT-system."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:12
msgid "The following IoT systems are supported:"
msgstr "Følgende IoT-systemer understøttes:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:14
msgid ""
":doc:`IoT box <iot/iot_box>`: micro-computer, plug-and-play device (i.e., "
"the Odoo IoT program is pre-installed);"
msgstr ""
":doc:`IoT box <iot/iot_box>`: mikrocomputer, plug-and-play-enhed (dvs. Odoo "
"IoT-programmet er forudinstalleret);"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:16
msgid ""
":doc:`Windows virtual IoT <iot/windows_iot>`: Odoo IoT program for Windows "
"that can be installed on a Windows computer."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Windows virtual IoT <iot/windows_iot>`: Odoo IoT-program til Windows, "
"der kan installeres på en Windows-computer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:20
msgid ""
":abbr:`MRP (Material Requirement Planning)` devices, including cameras and "
"measurement tools, are not compatible with the Windows virtual IoT."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`MRP (Material Requirement Planning)`-enheder, herunder kameraer og "
"måleværktøjer, er ikke kompatible med den virtuelle Windows-IoT."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:22
msgid "Multiple IoT systems can be used at the same time."
msgstr "Flere IoT-systemer kan bruges på samme tid."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:23
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create a Windows Virtual Machine on a MacOS/Linux "
"computer. However, this option is not supported by Odoo, and no "
"troubleshooting assistance will be provided."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at oprette en virtuel Windows-maskine på en MacOS/Linux-"
"computer. Denne mulighed understøttes dog ikke af Odoo, og der vil ikke "
"blive ydet hjælp til fejlfinding."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:29
msgid "IoT box subscription"
msgstr "IoT box-abonnement"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:31
msgid ""
"An IoT box subscription is required for production use of IoT systems and "
"generating the :ref:`HTTPS certificate <iot/connect/https_certificate>`. It "
"is created automatically when an IoT system is :doc:`connected to the "
"database <iot/connect>`. If you have issues related to your subscription, "
"contact the database's account manager or Odoo partner for assistance."
msgstr ""
"Et IoT box-abonnement er påkrævet til produktionsbrug af IoT-systemer og "
"generering af :ref:`HTTPS-certifikatet <iot/connect/https_certificate>`. Det "
"oprettes automatisk, når et IoT-system er :doc:`forbundet til databasen <iot/"
"connect>`. Hvis du har problemer relateret til dit abonnement, skal du "
"kontakte databasens account manager eller Odoo-partner for hjælp."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot.rst:37
msgid ""
"`Odoo's compatible IoT devices <https://www.odoo.com/app/iot-hardware>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoos kompatible IoT-enheder <https://www.odoo.com/app/iot-hardware>`_"

