#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:6
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Forudsætninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:8
msgid ""
"To connect the IoT system to an Odoo database, the following prerequisites "
"must be met:"
msgstr ""
"For at forbinde IoT-systemet til en Odoo-database skal følgende "
"forudsætninger være opfyldt:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:10
msgid ""
"The Internet of Things (IoT) app must be :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Internet of Things (IoT)-appen skal være :ref:`installeret <general/"
"install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:11
msgid "The IoT system must be connected to the network."
msgstr "IoT-systemet skal være forbundet til netværket."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:12
msgid ""
"The device connecting to Odoo must be on the same network as the IoT system."
msgstr ""
"Enheden, der forbinder til Odoo, skal være på samme netværk som IoT-systemet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:15
msgid ""
"It is recommended to connect the IoT system to a **production** instance, as "
"other types of environments may cause issues (e.g., with :ref:`HTTPS "
"certificate generation <iot/https_certificate_iot/iot-eligibility>`)."
msgstr ""
"Det anbefales at forbinde IoT-systemet til en **produktions**instans, da "
"andre typer miljøer kan forårsage problemer (f.eks. med :ref:`HTTPS-"
"certifikatgenerering <iot/https_certificate_iot/iot-eligibility>`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`iot_box`"
msgstr ":doc:`iot_box`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:21
msgid ":doc:`windows_iot`"
msgstr ":doc:`windows_iot`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:26
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:12
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/footswitch.rst:14
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:16
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/screen.rst:11
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Forbindelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:28
msgid ""
"To connect the IoT system to an Odoo database, open the IoT app and "
"click :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
"For at forbinde IoT-systemet til en Odoo-database skal du åbne IoT-appen og "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Forbind`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:30
msgid ""
"The browser then scans the network to which the computer is connected for "
"available IoT systems. If an IoT system is detected, it is connected "
"automatically. If multiple IoT systems are found, select the appropriate one "
"in the popup that opens, then click :guilabel:`Connect`. If no IoT system is "
"detected automatically, try connecting it to the database using "
"a :ref:`pairing code <iot/connect/pairing-code>` or a :ref:`connection token "
"<iot/connect/token>`."
msgstr ""
"Browseren scanner derefter netværket, som computeren er forbundet til, for "
"tilgængelige IoT-systemer. Hvis et IoT-system registreres, forbindes det "
"automatisk. Hvis flere IoT-systemer findes, skal du vælge det relevante i "
"pop op-vinduet, der åbnes, og derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Forbind`. Hvis "
"intet IoT-system registreres automatisk, kan du prøve at forbinde det til "
"databasen ved hjælp af en :ref:`parringskode <iot/connect/pairing-code>` "
"eller et :ref:`forbindelsestoken <iot/connect/token>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:37
msgid ""
"The IoT system’s name is composed of either the :doc:`IoT box <iot_box>` or "
"the :doc:`Windows computer <windows_iot>`’s motherboard serial number, "
"followed by its :ref:`pairing code <iot/connect/pairing-code>`."
msgstr ""
"IoT-systemets navn består af enten :doc:`IoT box <iot_box>`'ens "
"eller :doc:`Windows-computerens <windows_iot>` bundkorts serienummer "
"efterfulgt af dets :ref:`parringskode <iot/connect/pairing-code>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:44
msgid "Connection using a pairing code"
msgstr "Forbindelse med en paringskode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:47
msgid ""
"The pairing code is valid for up to 2 hours after the IoT system powers on. "
"If the code is no longer valid, restart the IoT box or :ref:`restart the "
"Windows virtual IoT service <iot/windows_iot/restart>` to display another "
"pairing code. Alternatively, connect the IoT system to the database using "
"a :ref:`connection token <iot/connect/token>`."
msgstr ""
"Parringskoden er gyldig i op til 2 timer efter, at IoT-systemet tændes. Hvis "
"koden ikke længere er gyldig, skal du genstarte IoT box'en "
"eller :ref:`genstarte den virtuelle Windows-IoT-tjeneste <iot/windows_iot/"
"restart>` for at vise en anden parringskode. Alternativt kan du forbinde IoT-"
"systemet til databasen ved hjælp af et :ref:`forbindelsestoken <iot/connect/"
"token>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:51
msgid ""
"The pairing code is not displayed if the IoT system is already connected to "
"a database (e.g., a test database). If necessary, :ref:`disconnect the IoT "
"system from the database <iot/connect/disconnect>`."
msgstr ""
"Parringskoden vises ikke, hvis IoT-systemet allerede er forbundet til en "
"database (f.eks. en testdatabase). Om nødvendigt skal du :ref:`afbryde "
"forbindelsen mellem IoT-systemet og databasen <iot/connect/disconnect>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:55
msgid "Retrieve the IoT system's pairing code:"
msgstr "Hent IoT-systemets parringskode:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:61
msgid ""
"Connect the IoT box to an external monitor or a USB printer. If the IoT box "
"was already plugged prior to this, :ref:`restart it <iot/iot-box/homepage>`."
msgstr ""
"Slut IoT-boksen til en ekstern skærm eller en USB-printer. Hvis IoT-boksen "
"allerede var tilsluttet før dette, skal du :ref:`genstarte den <iot/iot-box/"
"homepage>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:64
msgid ""
"External monitor: The pairing code will be displayed on the screen after "
"(re)starting the IoT box."
msgstr ""
"Ekstern skærm: Parringskoden vises på skærmen efter (gen)start af IoT box'en."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:66
msgid ""
"USB-connected printer: The pairing code should be printed automatically."
msgstr "USB-tilsluttet printer: Parringskoden skal udskrives automatisk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:69
msgid ""
"If no external monitor or printer is connected to the IoT box, access "
"the :ref:`IoT box's homepage <iot/iot-box/homepage>`; the code is displayed "
"in the :guilabel:`Pairing Code` section."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der ikke er tilsluttet en ekstern skærm eller printer til IoT-boksen, "
"skal du gå til :ref:`IoT-boksens hjemmeside <iot/iot-box/homepage>`; koden "
"vises i sektionen :guilabel:`Paringskode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:75
msgid ""
"On the computer with the Windows virtual IoT installed, open the IoT "
"system's homepage in a web browser by navigating to the URL `http://"
"localhost:8069`. Then, scroll to the :guilabel:`Pairing Code` section."
msgstr ""
"På computeren med den installerede Windows virtuelle IoT skal du åbne IoT-"
"systemets hjemmeside i en webbrowser ved at navigere til URL'en `http://"
"localhost:8069`. Rul derefter ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Paringskode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:79
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:89
msgid "In Odoo, open the IoT app and click :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr "Åbn IoT-appen i Odoo, og klik på :guilabel:`Forbind`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:80
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Searching for an IoT Box` popup that opens, "
"click :guilabel:`Use Pairing Code`."
msgstr ""
"I pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Søger efter en IoT Box`, der åbnes, skal du "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Brug parringskode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:81
msgid "Enter the :guilabel:`Pairing code` and click :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr "Indtast :guilabel:`Parringskode`, og klik på :guilabel:`Forbind`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:86
msgid "Connection using a connection token"
msgstr "Forbindelse med et forbindelsestoken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:88
msgid ":ref:`Enable the developer mode <developer-mode>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Aktiver udviklertilstand <developer-mode>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:90
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Searching for an IoT Box` popup that opens, "
"click :guilabel:`Offline pairing`."
msgstr ""
"I pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Søger efter en IoT Box`, der åbnes, skal du "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Offline-parring`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:91
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Pair an IoT Box offline` popup that opens, copy "
"the :guilabel:`Token`."
msgstr ""
"I pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Par en IoT Box offline`, der åbnes, skal du "
"kopiere :guilabel:`Token`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:92
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:144
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:178
msgid ""
"Access the :ref:`IoT box's <iot/iot-box/homepage>` or :ref:`Windows virtual "
"IoT's <iot/windows-iot/homepage>` homepage."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :ref:`IoT-boksens <iot/iot-box/homepage>` eller :ref:`Windows virtuel "
"IoT's <iot/windows-iot/homepage>` hjemmeside."

