#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:153
msgid "HTTPS certificate"
msgstr "HTTPS-certifikat"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:155
msgid ""
":abbr:`HTTPS (Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)` is the secure, encrypted "
"version of :abbr:`HTTP (Hypertext Transfer Protocol)`. It uses :abbr:`TLS "
"(Transport Layer Security)` (previously :abbr:`SSL (Secure Sockets Layer)`) "
"certificates to authenticate the server and protect the data exchanged "
"between a browser and a website. Some network devices, such as payment "
"terminals, require a valid HTTPS certificate to communicate with the IoT "
"system; without it, they cannot interact properly."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`HTTPS (Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)` er den sikre, krypterede "
"version af :abbr:`HTTP (Hypertext Transfer Protocol)`. Den bruger :abbr:`TLS "
"(Transport Layer Security)`-certifikater (tidligere :abbr:`SSL (Secure "
"Sockets Layer)`) til at autentificere serveren og beskytte data, der "
"udveksles mellem en browser og en hjemmeside. Nogle netværksenheder, såsom "
"betalingsterminaler, kræver et gyldigt HTTPS-certifikat for at kommunikere "
"med IoT-systemet; uden det kan de ikke interagere korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:163
msgid ""
"In this documentation and throughout Odoo, the term *HTTPS certificate*  "
"refers to a valid SSL certificate that allows an HTTPS connection."
msgstr ""
"I denne dokumentation og gennem hele Odoo refererer udtrykket *HTTPS-"
"certifikat* til et gyldigt SSL-certifikat, der tillader en HTTPS-forbindelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:166
msgid ""
"When the IoT system is (re-)started and connected to a database, it "
"automatically downloads the HTTPS certificate if the database meets the "
"following eligibility criteria:"
msgstr ""
"Når IoT-systemet (gen)startes og forbindes til en database, downloader det "
"automatisk HTTPS-certifikatet, hvis databasen opfylder følgende "
"berettigelseskriterier:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/connect.rst:171
