#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:3
msgid "Connect a camera"
msgstr "Tilslut et kamera"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:5
msgid ""
"A camera can be connected to an :abbr:`IoT (Internet of Things)` box with an "
"Odoo database in just a few steps. Once a camera is connected to "
"an :abbr:`IoT (Internet of Things)` box, it can be used in a manufacturing "
"process, or it can be linked to a quality control point/quality check. Doing "
"so allows for the taking of pictures when a chosen quality control point/"
"check has been reached, or when a specific key is pressed during "
"manufacturing."
msgstr ""
"Et kamera kan tilsluttes en :abbr:`IoT (Internet of Things)`-boks med en "
"Odoo-database på få trin. Når et kamera er tilsluttet en :abbr:`IoT "
"(Internet of Things)`-boks, kan det bruges i en produktionsproces, eller det "
"kan knyttes til et kvalitetskontrolpunkt/kvalitetstjek. Dette gør det muligt "
"at tage billeder, når et valgt kvalitetskontrolpunkt/-tjek er nået, eller "
"når en bestemt tast trykkes under produktion."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:14
msgid ""
"To connect a camera to an :abbr:`IoT (Internet of Things)` box, simply "
"connect the two via cable. This is usually done with a :abbr:`USB (Universal "
"Serial Bus)` cable of some sort."
msgstr ""
"Pro připojení kamery k :abbr:`IoT (Internet of Things)` boxu jednoduše "
"připojte obě pomocí kabelu. To se obvykle provádí pomocí nějakého :abbr:`USB "
"(Universal Serial Bus)` kabelu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:17
msgid ""
"If the camera is `supported <https://www.odoo.com/page/iot-hardware>`_, "
"there is no need to set up anything, as it'll be detected as soon as it's "
"connected."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je kamera `podporována <https://www.odoo.com/page/iot-hardware>`_, "
"není třeba nic nastavovat, protože bude detekována, jakmile bude připojena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:20
msgid "Camera recognized on the IoT box."
msgstr "Kamera rozpoznaná v IoT boxu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:25
msgid "Link camera to quality control point in manufacturing process"
msgstr "Propojit kameru s kontrolním bodem kvality ve výrobním procesu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:27
msgid ""
"In the :menuselection:`Quality app`, a device can be set up on "
"a :guilabel:`Quality Control Point`. To do that, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Quality app --> Quality Control --> Control Points` and "
"open the desired :guilabel:`Control Point` that'll be linked to the camera."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaci :menuselection:`Kvalitet` lze zařízení nastavit "
"na :guilabel:`kontrolním bodě kvality`. Chcete-li to provést, přejděte "
"na :menuselection:`Kvalitet --> Kontrola kvality --> Kontrolní body` a "
"otevřete požadovaný :guilabel:`kontrolní bod`, který bude propojen s kamerou."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:31
msgid ""
"On the control point form, edit the control point by selecting "
"the :guilabel:`Type` field, and clicking on :guilabel:`Take a Picture` from "
"the drop-down menu. Doing so reveals a field called :guilabel:`Device`, "
"wherein the attached *device* can be selected. :guilabel:`Save` the changes, "
"if required."
msgstr ""
"Na formuláři kontrolního bodu upravte kontrolní bod výběrem "
"pole :guilabel:`typ` a kliknutím na :guilabel:`vyfotit` z rozbalovací "
"nabídky. Tím se zobrazí pole s názvem :guilabel:`zařízení`, ve kterém lze "
"vybrat připojené *zařízení*. V případě potřeby změny :guilabel:`uložte`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:36
msgid "Setting up the device on the quality control point."
msgstr "Nastavení zařízení na kontrolním bodě kvality."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:40
msgid ""
"The camera is now useable with the selected quality control point. When the "
"quality control point is reached during the manufacturing process, the "
"database prompts the operator to take a picture."
msgstr ""
"Kamera je nyní použitelná s vybraným kontrolním bodem kvality. Když je během "
"výrobního procesu dosaženo kontrolního bodu kvality, databáze vyzve "
"operátora k pořízení fotografie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:43
msgid "Graphic user interface of the device on the quality control point."
msgstr "Grafické uživatelské rozhraní zařízení na kontrolním bodě kvality."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:48
msgid ""
"Quality control points can also be accessed by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`IoT App --> Devices`. From here, select the device. There "
"is a :guilabel:`Quality Control Points` tab, where they can be added with "
"the device."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolní body kvality lze také zobrazit přechodem "
"na :menuselection:`aplikace IoT --> Zařízení`. Zde vyberte zařízení. "
"Existuje záložka :guilabel:`kontrolní body kvality`, kde lze přidat "
"kontrolní body se zařízením."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:53
msgid ""
"On a quality check form, the :guilabel:`Type` of check can also be specified "
"to :guilabel:`Take a Picture`. Navigate to :menuselection:`Quality app --> "
"Quality Control --> Quality Checks --> New` to create a new quality check "
"from the :guilabel:`Quality Checks` page."
msgstr ""
"Na formuláři kontroly kvality lze také specifikovat :guilabel:`typ` kontroly "
"jako :guilabel:`vyfotit`. Přejděte na :menuselection:`aplikace Kvalitet --> "
"Kontrola kvality --> Kontroly kvality --> Nový` a vytvořte novou kontrolu "
"kvality ze stránky :guilabel:`kontroly kvality`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:58
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:74
msgid ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_management/"
"quality_control_points`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_management/"
"quality_control_points`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/camera.rst:59
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:75
msgid ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_management/"
