#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:186
msgid "If the printer's name is still uncertain, take the following steps:"
msgstr "Hvis printerens navn stadig er usikkert, skal du følge disse trin:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:188
msgid "Take note of the listed printers on the CUPS page."
msgstr "Notér de printere, der er anført på CUPS-siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:189
msgid "Turn the printer off and refresh the page."
msgstr "Sluk for printeren, og opdater siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:190
msgid ""
"Compare the difference with the first list to see which printer disappeared."
msgstr ""
"Sammenlign forskellen med den første liste for at se, hvilken printer der "
"forsvandt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:191
msgid "Turn the printer back on and refresh the page again."
msgstr "Tænd for printeren igen, og opdater siden igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:192
msgid "Double-check the list again to see if the printer re-appears."
msgstr "Dobbelttjek listen igen for at se, om printeren dukker op igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:193
msgid ""
"The printer that disappeared and reappears again on the listed printers is "
"the name of the printer in question. It can be :guilabel:`Unknown` "
"under :guilabel:`Local printers`."
msgstr ""
"Den printer, der forsvandt og dukker op igen på listen over printere, er "
"navnet på den pågældende printer. Den kan være :guilabel:`Ukendt` "
"under :guilabel:`Lokale printere`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:196
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Add Printer` page, specify the printer's :guilabel:`Name` "
"using the following convention: "
"`<printer_name>__IMC_<param_1>_<param_2>_..._<param_n>__`, where:"
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Tilføj printer` skal du angive "
"printerens :guilabel:`Navn` ved hjælp af følgende konvention: "
"`<printer_name>__IMC_<param_1>_<param_2>_..._<param_n>__`, hvor:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:199
msgid ""
"`printer_name` is the printer's name. It can contain any character except "
"`_`, `/`, `#`, or ` ` (space character)."
msgstr ""
"`printer_name` er printerens navn. Det kan indeholde ethvert tegn undtagen "
"`_`, `/`, `#` eller ` ` (mellemrumstegn)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:201
msgid ""
"`IMC`: This stands for *Image Mode Column* (the simplified name for `ESC *`)."
msgstr ""
"`IMC`: Dette står for *Image Mode Column* (det forenklede navn for `ESC *`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:202
msgid "`param_1`: This stands for the specific parameter:"
msgstr "`param_1`: Dette står for den specifikke parameter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:204
msgid ""
"`SCALE<X>`: Scale of the picture (with the same aspect ratio). `X` should be "
"an integer describing the scale percentage that should be used. For example, "
"`100` is the original size, `50` is half the size, and `200` is twice the "
"size."
msgstr ""
"`SCALE<X>`: Billedets skalering (med samme billedformat). `X` skal være et "
"heltal, der beskriver den skaleringsprocent, der skal bruges. For eksempel "
"er `100` den oprindelige størrelse, `50` er halvdelen af størrelsen, og "
"`200` er dobbelt størrelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:207
msgid ""
"`LDV`: *Low Density Vertical* (will be set to *High Density Vertical* if not "
"specified)."
msgstr ""
"`LDV`: *Low Density Vertical* (vil blive sat til *High Density Vertical*, "
"hvis ikke angivet)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:208
msgid ""
"`LDH`: *Low Density Horizontal* (will be set to *High Density Horizontal* if "
"not specified)."
msgstr ""
"`LDH`: *Low Density Horizontal* (vil blive sat til *High Density "
"Horizontal*, hvis ikke angivet)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:211
msgid ""
"*Density* parameters might need to be configured in a particular way, "
"depending on the printer model."
msgstr ""
"*Density*-parametre skal muligvis konfigureres på en bestemt måde afhængigt "
"af printermodellen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:213
msgid ""
"Refer to `Epson's ESC * documentation <https://download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/"
"pos/reference_en/escpos/esc_asterisk.html>`_ to determine if the printer "
"requires these parameters to be set."
msgstr ""
"Se `Epsons ESC *-dokumentation <https://download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/pos/"
"reference_en/escpos/esc_asterisk.html>`_ for at afgøre, om printeren kræver, "
"at disse parametre indstilles."

