msgstr "`EPSON TMm 30II`: Navnet må ikke indeholde mellemrum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:228
msgid ""
"`EPSONTMm30II`: The name itself is correct, but it will not use `ESC *`."
msgstr ""
"`EPSONTMm30II`: Navnet i sig selv er korrekt, men det vil ikke bruge `ESC *`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:229
msgid "`EPSONTMm30II__IMC`: This name is missing the end `__`."
msgstr "`EPSONTMm30II__IMC`: Dette navn mangler slutningen `__`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:230
msgid ""
"`EPSONTMm30II__IMC_XDV__`: The parameter `XDV` does not match any existing "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"`EPSONTMm30II__IMC_XDV__`: Parameteren `XDV` matcher ingen eksisterende "
"parametre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:231
msgid ""
"`EPSONTMm30II__IMC_SCALE__`: The parameter `SCALE` is missing the scale "
"value."
msgstr "`EPSONTMm30II__IMC_SCALE__`: Parameteren `SCALE` mangler skalaværdien."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:233
msgid ""
"Once the printer's name has been defined using the appropriate naming "
"convention, click :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"Når printerens navn er blevet defineret ved hjælp af den passende "
"navnekonvention, klik på :guilabel:`Fortsæt`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:235
