#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:279
msgid "When adding the printer, CUPS displays the list of available printers:"
msgstr "Når printeren tilføjes, viser CUPS listen over tilgængelige printere:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:281
msgid "Administration menu, add printer selection."
