#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:345
msgid "DYMO LabelWriter print issue"
msgstr "DYMO LabelWriter udskrivningsproblem"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:347
msgid ""
"The DYMO LabelWriter has a known issue in printing with IoT systems. The "
"OpenPrinting CUPS server installs the printer using :guilabel:`Local RAW "
"Printer` drivers. In order to print anything, the correct :guilabel:`Make "
"and Model` needs to be set to reference the correct driver when using the "
"device."
msgstr ""
"DYMO LabelWriter har et kendt problem med udskrivning i IoT-systemer. "
"OpenPrinting CUPS-serveren installerer printeren ved hjælp "
"af :guilabel:`Local RAW Printer`-drivere. For at udskrive noget skal den "
"korrekte :guilabel:`Make and Model` indstilles for at referere til den "
"korrekte driver ved brug af enheden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:352
msgid ""
"Additionally, a new printer needs to be added to reduce the print delay that "
"occurs after updating the driver."
msgstr ""
"Derudover skal en ny printer tilføjes for at reducere den "
"udskrivningsforsinkelse, der opstår efter opdatering af driveren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:356
msgid ""
"The DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO printer is the recommended DYMO printer for use "
"with Odoo and IoT systems. This device combines two printers: a label "
"printer and a tape printer. When configuring the following processes, it is "
"essential to select the correct model (either DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO Label "
"(en) or DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO Tape (en)). For consistency, the following "
"processes outline configuration steps for the DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO Label "
"(en) model. Adjust the model selections as needed."
msgstr ""
"DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO-printeren er den anbefalede DYMO-printer til brug "
"med Odoo og IoT-systemer. Denne enhed kombinerer to printere: en labelpinter "
"og en tapeprinter. Når følgende processer konfigureres, er det vigtigt at "
"vælge den korrekte model (enten DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO Label (en) eller "
"DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO Tape (en)). For konsistens beskriver følgende "
"processer konfigurationstrin for DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO Label (en)-"
"modellen. Juster modelvalget efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:362
msgid ""
"DYMO Series 5 printers are not compatible with the :doc:`IoT box <../"
"iot_box>` and require pairing with a :doc:`Windows virtual IoT <../"
"windows_iot>`."
msgstr ""
"DYMO Series 5-printere er ikke kompatible med :doc:`IoT-boksen <../iot_box>` "
"og kræver parring med en :doc:`virtuel Windows IoT <../windows_iot>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:368
msgid "DYMO LabelWriter not printing"
msgstr "DYMO LabelWriter udskriver ikke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:370
msgid "If the DYMO LabelWriter fails to print, install a new driver:"
msgstr ""
"Hvis DYMO LabelWriter ikke kan udskrive, skal du installere en ny driver:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:372
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:408
