msgstr ""
"Klik på :menuselection:`Printere` i topmenuen, og klik derefter på printeren "
"på listen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:375
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Maintenance` in the first dropdown menu."
msgstr "Vælg :guilabel:`Vedligeholdelse` i den første rullemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:376
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Modify Printer` in the second dropdown menu."
msgstr "Vælg :guilabel:`Rediger printer` i den anden rullemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:378
msgid ""
"Modify the make and model of the DYMO LabelWriter. Maintenance and Modify "
"dropdown\n"
"menus highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Rediger fabrikat og model for DYMO LabelWriter. Vedligeholdelse og Rediger "
