"opdaterede :guilabel:`DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO Label` (eller hvilken DYMO-"
"printermodel der bruges)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:392
msgid ""
"Click the newly updated printer, then click the :guilabel:`Maintenance` "
