"LabelWriter 450 DUO Label)` (eller hvilken DYMO-printermodel der bruges). "
"Klik på :guilabel:`Fortsæt`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:415
msgid ""
"Add a printer screen on OpenPrinting CUPS with DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO "
"Label\n"
"highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj printer-skærmen på OpenPrinting CUPS med DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO "
