msgstr ""
"Omdøb printer-siden i flowet 'Tilføj en printer' med navnefeltet fremhævet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:425
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Model` field to :guilabel:`DYMO LabelWriter 450 DUO Label "
"(en)` (or whichever DYMO printer model is being used), then "
