"Label (en)` (eller hvilken DYMO-printermodel der bruges) og klik derefter "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj printer` for at fuldføre installationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:429
msgid ""
"Choose model screen on the OpenPrinting CUPS console with model and add a "
