"et dedikeret Mettler USB-til-proprietært RJ45-kabel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:37
msgid ""
"The official Mettler USB-to-RJ45 cable (Mettler part number 72256236) must "
"be used. Contact Mettler or a partner to purchase an authentic cable. **No "
"other** cable works for this configuration."
msgstr ""
"Det officielle Mettler USB-til-RJ45-kabel (Mettler varenummer 72256236) skal "
"bruges. Kontakt Mettler eller en partner for at købe et ægte kabel. **Ingen "
"andre** kabler virker til denne konfiguration."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:41
msgid ""
"To configure the Ariva S scale for IoT system recognition, refer to the "
"`Mettler's Setup Guide for Ariva S series scales <https://www.mt.com/dam/"
"RET_DOCS/Ariv.pdf>`_ and follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere Ariva S-vægten til genkendelse i IoT-systemet henvises "
"der til `Mettlers opsætningsvejledning til vægte i Ariva S-serien <https://"
"www.mt.com/dam/RET_DOCS/Ariv.pdf>`_ og følg disse trin:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:44
msgid "Hold the **>T<** button until :guilabel:`CONF` appears."
msgstr "Hold knappen **>T<** nede, indtil :guilabel:`CONF` vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:45
msgid ""
"Press **>T<** until :guilabel:`GRP 3` appears, then press **>0<** to confirm."
msgstr ""
"Tryk på **>T<** indtil :guilabel:`GRP 3` vises, og tryk derefter på **>0<** "
"for at bekræfte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:46
msgid ""
"At step :guilabel:`3.1`, make sure the value is set to :guilabel:`1` (USB "
"Virtual COM ports). Press **>T<** to cycle through the options."
msgstr ""
"Under trin :guilabel:`3.1` skal du sikre, at værdien er indstillet til "
":guilabel:`1` (USB Virtual COM ports). Tryk på **>T<** for at gennemgå "
"valgmulighederne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:48
msgid ""
"Press **>0<** until :guilabel:`3.6` and make sure the value is set "
"to :guilabel:`3` (8217 Mettler-Toledo (WO))."
msgstr ""
"Tryk på **>0<** indtil :guilabel:`3.6`, og sørg for, at værdien er "
"indstillet til :guilabel:`3` (8217 Mettler-Toledo (WO))."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:50
msgid ""
"Press **>0<** (multiple times if necessary) until :guilabel:`GRP 4` appears."
msgstr ""
"Tryk på **>0<** (flere gange hvis nødvendigt), indtil :guilabel:`GRP 4` "
"vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:51
msgid "Press **>T<** until :guilabel:`EXIT` appears."
msgstr "Tryk på **>T<**, indtil :guilabel:`EXIT` vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:54
msgid "Do **not** make any other changes unless otherwise needed."
msgstr "Foretag **ikke** andre ændringer, medmindre det er nødvendigt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:56
msgid "Press **>0<**."
msgstr "Tryk på **>0<**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:57
msgid "Press **>0<** again to :guilabel:`SAVE`; the scale restarts."
msgstr "Tryk på **>0<** igen for at :guilabel:`SAVE`; vægten genstarter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/scale.rst:58
msgid ""
"Reboot the :doc:`IoT box <../iot_box>` or :ref:`restart the Windows virtual "
"IoT service <iot/windows_iot/restart>`. The scale should then appear as "
"`Toledo 8217`."
msgstr ""
"Genstart :doc:`IoT-boksen <../iot_box>` eller :ref:`genstart den virtuelle "
"Windows IoT-tjeneste <iot/windows_iot/restart>`. Vægten bør derefter vises "
"som `Toledo 8217`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/screen.rst:3
msgid "Connect a screen"
msgstr "Tilslut en skærm"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/screen.rst:5
msgid ""
"The :doc:`IoT box <../iot_box>` can be connected to a screen, e.g. to ease "
"the IoT box's setup and/or serve as a :doc:`customer display </applications/"
"sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/customer_display>` to show customers "
