msgid ""
"Restart the :ref:`IoT box <iot/iot-box/homepage>` or the :ref:`Windows "
"virtual IoT service <iot/windows_iot/restart>`."
msgstr ""
"Genstart :ref:`IoT-boksen <iot/iot-box/homepage>` eller :ref:`den virtuelle "
"Windows IoT-tjeneste <iot/windows_iot/restart>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:33
msgid "The IoT system is connected to the Odoo database but cannot be reached"
msgstr "IoT-systemet er forbundet til Odoo-databasen, men kan ikke nås"

