msgstr ""
"Firewallen forhindrer HTTPS-certifikatet i at generere korrekt. I dette "
"tilfælde skal du deaktivere firewallen, indtil certifikatet er blevet "
"genereret korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:99
msgid ""
"Some devices, such as routers with a built-in firewall, can prevent the "
"HTTPS certificate from generating."
msgstr ""
"Nogle enheder, såsom routere med indbygget firewall, kan forhindre HTTPS-"
"certifikatet i at generere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:103
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "Fejl"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:105
msgid ""
"A specific error code is displayed on the IoT system's homepage if any "
"issues occur during the generation or reception of the :ref:`HTTPS "
"certificate <iot/connect/https_certificate>`."
msgstr ""
"Pokud se během generování nebo přijímání :ref:`HTTPS certifikátu <iot/"
"connect/https_certificate>` vyskytnou nějaké problémy, na domovské stránce "
"IoT systému se zobrazí specifický kód chyby."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:109
msgid ""
"When you access the IoT system's homepage, it automatically checks for an "
"HTTPS certificate and attempts to generate one if it is missing. If an error "
"appears, refresh the page to see if the issue is resolved."
msgstr ""
"Når du tilgår IoT-systemets hjemmeside, tjekker det automatisk for et HTTPS-"
"certifikat og forsøger at generere et, hvis det mangler. Hvis der vises en "
"fejl, genindlæs siden for at se, om problemet er løst."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:114
msgid "Missing credentials"
msgstr "Chybějící přihlašovací údaje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:116
msgid ""
"The contract and/or database :abbr:`UUID (Universal Unique Identifier)` is "
"missing from the IoT."
msgstr ""
"Kontrakten og/eller databasens :abbr:`UUID (Universal Unique Identifier)` "
"mangler fra IoT'en."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:118
msgid ""
"Verify that both values are correctly configured. To update "
"them, :ref:`access the IoT box's <iot/iot-box/homepage>` or :ref:`Windows "
"virtual IoT's homepage <iot/windows-iot/homepage>`, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cogs` (:guilabel:`cogs`) button, then click :guilabel:`Credentials`."
msgstr ""
"Kontroller, at begge værdier er korrekt konfigureret. For at opdatere dem "
"skal du :ref:`tilgå IoT-boksens <iot/iot-box/homepage>` eller :ref:`Windows "
"virtuel IoT's hjemmeside <iot/windows-iot/homepage>`, klikke på "
"knappen :icon:`fa-cogs` (:guilabel:`tandhjul`) og derefter klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Legitimationsoplysninger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:123
msgid ""
"To access the full request exception details with information regarding the "
"error, :ref:`enable the developer mode <developer-mode>`, click the IoT "
"system's card in the IoT app, and click :guilabel:`Download logs` on "
"the :ref:`IoT system's form <iot/connect/IoT-form>`. To define the log "
"levels recorded in the IoT system's log file, :ref:`access the IoT box's "
"<iot/windows-iot/homepage>` or :ref:`Windows virtual IoT's <iot/iot-box/"
"homepage>` homepage, click the :icon:`fa-cogs` (:guilabel:`cogs`) button, "
"then :guilabel:`Log level` at the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"For at få adgang til de fulde anmodningsundtagelsesdetaljer med information "
"om fejlen, :ref:`aktiver udviklertilstand <developer-mode>`, klik på IoT-"
"systemets kort i IoT-appen, og klik :guilabel:`Download logfiler` "
"på :ref:`IoT-systemets formular <iot/connect/IoT-form>`. For at definere "
"logniveauerne, der registreres i IoT-systemets logfil, :ref:`få adgang til "
"IoT-boxens <iot/windows-iot/homepage>` eller :ref:`Windows virtual IoT's "
"<iot/iot-box/homepage>` hjemmeside, klik på :icon:`fa-cogs` "
"(:guilabel:`tandhjul`)-knappen, derefter :guilabel:`Logniveau` nederst på "
"siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:130
msgid ""
"To address network-related issues, contact your system or network "
"administrator; these issues are beyond the scope of Odoo support services."
msgstr ""
"For at løse netværksrelaterede problemer skal du kontakte din system- eller "
"netværksadministrator; disse problemer ligger uden for Odoo-"
"supporttjenesternes omfang."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:134
msgid "Odoo.com not reachable"
msgstr "Odoo.com není dostupný"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:136
msgid ""
"The IoT system successfully reached `<https://www.odoo.com>`_ but received "
"an unexpected `HTTP response (status codes) <https://developer.mozilla.org/"
"en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status>`_."
msgstr ""
"IoT-systemet nåede <https://www.odoo.com>`_, men modtog et uventet `HTTP-"
"svar (statuskoder) <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/"
"Status>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:139
msgid "To solve this issue:"
msgstr "For at løse dette problem:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:141
msgid ""
"Open `<https://www.odoo.com>`_ in a web browser to check if the website is "
"temporarily down for maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Åbn <https://www.odoo.com>`_ i en webbrowser for at tjekke, om hjemmesiden "
"midlertidigt er nede på grund af vedligeholdelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:0
msgid ""
"If `<https://www.odoo.com>`_ is down for maintenance, wait for it to resume."
msgstr ""
"Hvis <https://www.odoo.com>`_ er nede på grund af vedligeholdelse, skal du "
"vente på, at den genoptages."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:0
msgid ""
"If the website is operational, open a `support ticket <https://www.odoo.com/"
"help>`_ and make sure to include the 3-digit HTTPS status code in the ticket."
msgstr ""
"Hvis hjemmesiden er operationel, åbn en `supportanmodning <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_, og sørg for at inkludere den 3-cifrede HTTPS-"
"statuskode i anmodningen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:148
msgid "Still no certificate?"
msgstr "Stále žádný certifikát?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:151
msgid ""
"If the IoT system successfully connected to `<https://www.odoo.com>`_, but "
"the server refused to provide the :ref:`HTTPS certificate <iot/connect/"
"https_certificate>`."
msgstr ""
"Pokud se IoT systém úspěšně připojil k `<https://www.odoo.com>`_, ale server "
"odmítl poskytnout :ref:`HTTPS certifikát <iot/connect/https_certificate>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:154
msgid ""
"Check that the IoT system and database meet the :ref:`eligibility "
"requirements <iot/https_certificate_iot/iot-eligibility>` for an HTTPS "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Kontroller, at IoT-systemet og databasen opfylder :ref:`berettigelseskravene "
"<iot/https_certificate_iot/iot-eligibility>` for et HTTPS-certifikat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:158
msgid "Grant Odoo support team access to an IoT Box"
msgstr "Udělte týmu podpory Odoo přístup k IoT Boxu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:160
msgid ""
"If you need to grant remote access to an IoT Box, you can provide a "
"Tailscale token on the IoT Box's homepage. This allows the Odoo support team "
"to access the IoT Box for troubleshooting securely."
msgstr ""
"Pokud potřebujete udělit vzdálený přístup k IoT Boxu, můžete na domovské "
"stránce IoT Boxu zadat Tailscale token. To umožní týmu podpory Odoo bezpečný "
"přístup k IoT Boxu za účelem řešení problémů."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:165
msgid ""
"Only enter a token from a trusted source, such as an official Odoo support "
"representative. Providing a token grants access to the IoT Box and your "
"entire local network, so it should be done with caution."
msgstr ""
"Zadávejte pouze token z důvěryhodného zdroje, jako je oficiální zástupce "
"podpory Odoo. Poskytnutí tokenu uděluje přístup k IoT Boxu a celé vaší "
"místní síti, proto by to mělo být prováděno opatrně."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:169
msgid ""
"On the :ref:`IoT Box's homepage <iot/iot-box/homepage>`, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cogs` (:guilabel:`cogs`) button, then click :guilabel:`Debugging Tools`. In "
"the pop-up window, enter the Tailscale token provided by the Odoo support "
"team and click :guilabel:`Enable`."
msgstr ""
"Na :ref:`domovské stránce IoT Boxu <iot/iot-box/homepage>` klikněte na "
"tlačítko :icon:`fa-cogs` (:guilabel:`ozubená kola`) a poté klikněte "
"na :guilabel:`Nástroje pro ladění`. V dialogovém okně zadejte Tailscale "
"token poskytnutý týmem podpory Odoo a klikněte na :guilabel:`Povolit`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:174
msgid ""
"**Remote Debug** is only available for :doc:`IoT boxes <../iot_box>`, not "
"the :doc:`Windows virtual IoT <../windows_iot>`."
msgstr ""
"**Vzdálené ladění** je dostupné pouze pro :doc:`IoT boxy <../iot_box>`, "
"nikoliv pro :doc:`Windows virtuální IoT <../windows_iot>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:178
msgid "Is the IoT Box down?"
msgstr "Je IoT Box mimo provoz?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:180
msgid ""
"If the IoT Box is down, you can still enable remote access for the Odoo "
"support team. Just provide the key in the only field displayed on "
"the :ref:`homepage <iot/iot-box/homepage>` and click :guilabel:`Enable`."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je IoT Box mimo provoz, stále můžete povolit vzdálený přístup pro tým "
"podpory Odoo. Stačí zadat klíč do jediného pole zobrazeného "
"na :ref:`domovské stránce <iot/iot-box/homepage>` a kliknout "
"na :guilabel:`Povolit`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:188
msgid ""
"Enabling remote access on a down IoT Box is only available from version "
"above v26.01.2026. If your IoT Box doesn't have this option, you will need "
"to :ref:`flash the IoT Box's card with the latest image <iot/updating_iot/"
"image-code>`."
msgstr ""
"Povolení vzdáleného přístupu na IoT Box mimo provoz je dostupné pouze od "
"verze vyšší než v26.01.2026. Pokud váš IoT Box tuto možnost nemá, budete "
"muset :ref:`přepsat kartu IoT Boxu s nejnovějším obrazem <iot/updating_iot/"
"image-code>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:7
msgid ""
"IoT Boxes and Virtual IoT Boxes update themselves automatically every week. "
"You can still force an update if you think your IoT system is not up-to-date "
"by accessing the :ref:`homepage <iot/iot-box/homepage>`, clicking "
"the :icon:`fa-cogs` (:guilabel:`cogs`) button at the top-right, "
"then :guilabel:`Update` in the :guilabel:`Version` section."
msgstr ""
"IoT-bokse og virtuelle IoT-bokse opdaterer automatisk sig selv hver uge. Du "
"kan stadig gennemtvinge en opdatering, hvis du mener, at dit IoT-system ikke "
"er opdateret, ved at åbne :ref:`startsiden <iot/iot-box/homepage>`, klikke "
"på knappen :icon:`fa-cogs` (:guilabel:`tandhjul`) øverst til højre og "
"derefter på :guilabel:`Opdater` i afsnittet :guilabel:`Version`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Do not turn off or unplug the IoT box** during the update process, as "
"doing so could leave the device in an inconsistent state, requiring the IoT "
"box to be reflashed with a new image."
msgstr ""
"**Sluk ikke for eller tag ikke stikket ud af IoT-boksen** under "
"opdateringsprocessen, da dette kan efterlade enheden i en inkonsistent "
"tilstand, hvilket kræver, at IoT-boksen flasher med et nyt image."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:17
msgid ""
"In extreme cases, you might need to perform a full reset of the IoT system, "
"which requires flashing the IoT box's SD card or uninstalling and "
"reinstalling the Windows virtual IoT package."
msgstr ""
"I ekstreme tilfælde kan det være nødvendigt at udføre en fuldstændig "
"nulstilling af IoT-systemet, hvilket kræver at IoT-boksens SD-kort flashes, "
"eller at den virtuelle Windows IoT-pakke afinstalleres og geninstalleres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:26
msgid ""
"A computer with a micro SD card reader/adapter is required to flash the "
"micro SD card."
msgstr ""
"En computer med en micro SD-kortlæser/adapter er påkrævet for at flashe "
"micro SD-kortet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:27
msgid ""
"An alternative software for flashing the micro SD card is `Raspberry Pi "
"Imager <https://www.raspberrypi.com/software/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Et alternativt program til flashning af micro SD-kortet er `Raspberry Pi "
"Imager <https://www.raspberrypi.com/software/>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:30
msgid ""
"`Download balenaEtcher <https://etcher.balena.io/#download-etcher>`_ (a free "
"and open-source tool for writing disk images to SD cards)."
msgstr ""
"`Download balenaEtcher <https://etcher.balena.io/#download-etcher>`_ (et "
"gratis open source-værktøj til at skrive diskaftryk til SD-kort)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:32
msgid "Insert the IoT box's micro SD card into the computer or adapter."
msgstr "Indsæt IoT-boksens micro SD-kort i computeren eller adapteren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:0
msgid ""
"Open balenaEtcher, click :guilabel:`Flash from URL`, and enter the following "
"URL:"
msgstr ""
"Åbn balenaEtcher, klik på :guilabel:`Flash from URL`, og indtast følgende "
"URL:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:0
msgid "`http://nightly.odoo.com/master/iotbox/iotbox-latest.zip`."
msgstr "`http://nightly.odoo.com/master/iotbox/iotbox-latest.zip`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:35
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Select target` and select the SD card."
msgstr "Klik på :guilabel:`Select target` og vælg SD-kortet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:36
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Flash` and wait for the process to finish."
msgstr "Klik på :guilabel:`Flash` og vent på, at processen er færdig."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:38
msgid "Flashing the SD card with balenaEtcher"
msgstr "Flashning af SD-kortet med balenaEtcher"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/updating_iot.rst:43
msgid ""
":ref:`Uninstall the program <iot/windows_iot/uninstall>` and :ref:`reinstall "
"<iot/windows-iot/installation>` the latest package."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Afinstaller programmet <iot/windows_iot/uninstall>` og "
":ref:`geninstaller <iot/windows-iot/installation>` den seneste pakke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:5
msgid "To start using an IoT box:"
msgstr "For at begynde at bruge en IoT-boks:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:7
msgid "Connect your :doc:`devices <devices>` to the IoT box."
msgstr "Tilslut dine :doc:`enheder <devices>` til IoT-boksen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:8
msgid ":ref:`Connect the IoT box to the network <iot/iot_box/network>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Tilslut IoT-boksen til netværket <iot/iot_box/network>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:9
msgid ":doc:`Connect the IoT box to your Odoo database <connect>`."
msgstr ":doc:`Tilslut IoT-boksen til din Odoo-database <connect>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Video: How to Set Up and Use the Odoo IoT Box: A Beginner's Guide <https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2_Dcm3r_7o>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Video: Sådan opsættes og bruges Odoo IoT-boksen: En begyndervejledning "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2_Dcm3r_7o>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:19
msgid "Network connection"
msgstr "Netværksforbindelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:21
msgid ""
"The IoT box can be connected to the network via :ref:`Ethernet <iot/iot_box/"
"network-ethernet>` or :ref:`Wi-Fi <iot/iot_box/network-wifi>`."
msgstr ""
"IoT-boksen kan tilsluttes netværket via :ref:`Ethernet <iot/iot_box/network-"
"ethernet>` eller :ref:`Wi-Fi <iot/iot_box/network-wifi>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:25
msgid ""
"It is recommended to connect the IoT box to the same network as "
"the :doc:`devices <devices>` it connects to."
msgstr ""
"Det anbefales at forbinde IoT-boksen til det samme netværk som de "
":doc:`enheder <devices>`, den opretter forbindelse til."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:29
msgid ""
"Never make the IoT box accessible from the public Internet. IoT systems are "
"designed to provide your database with access to devices on your local "
"network. Exposing them to the public Internet would create a **security "
"risk**."
msgstr ""
"Gør aldrig IoT-boksen tilgængelig fra det offentlige internet. IoT-systemer "
"er designet til at give din database adgang til enheder på dit lokale "
"netværk. At eksponere dem til det offentlige internet vil skabe en "
"**sikkerhedsrisiko**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:36
msgid "Ethernet"
msgstr "Ethernet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:38
msgid ""
"Plug the Ethernet cable into the IoT box's Ethernet port and an available "
"port on your router, then connect the IoT box to a power source."
msgstr ""
"Sæt Ethernet-kablet i IoT-boksens Ethernet-port og en ledig port på din "
"router, og tilslut derefter IoT-boksen til en strømkilde."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:44
msgid "Wi-Fi"
msgstr "Wi-Fi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:46
msgid ""
"Make sure no Ethernet cable is connected to the IoT box and follow these "
"steps:"
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at intet Ethernet-kabel er tilsluttet IoT-boksen, og følg disse "
"trin:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:48
msgid ""
"Connect the IoT box to a power source and wait a few minutes for it to power "
"on."
msgstr ""
"Tilslut IoT-boksen til en strømkilde, og vent et par minutter på, at den "
"tænder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:49
msgid ""
"Access the computer's Wi-Fi settings and select the IoT box's network. The "
"network name is in the format `IoTBox-xxxxxxxxxxxx` (where `xxxxxxxxxxxx` is "
"a unique identifier)."
msgstr ""
"Gå til computerens Wi-Fi-indstillinger, og vælg IoT-boksens netværk. "
"Netværksnavnet er i formatet `IoTBox-xxxxxxxxxxxx` (hvor `xxxxxxxxxxxx` er "
"en unik identifikator)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:51
msgid ""
"Connect to the IoT box's Wi-Fi network and sign in to it; the browser should "
"automatically open and redirect to the :ref:`IoT box's homepage <iot/iot-box/"
"homepage>`."
msgstr ""
"Opret forbindelse til IoT-boksens Wi-Fi-netværk, og log ind på det; "
"browseren bør automatisk åbne og omdirigere til :ref:`IoT-boksens startside "
"<iot/iot-box/homepage>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:53
msgid ""
"On the IoT box's homepage, click :guilabel:`Configure` next to "
"the :guilabel:`Internet Status` section."
msgstr ""
"På IoT-boksens hjemmeside skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Konfigurer` ved siden "
"af afsnittet :guilabel:`Internetstatus`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:55
msgid ""
"Wait a few minutes for the available networks to be scanned, select the "
"network, enter the Wi-Fi's password, and click :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
"Vent et par minutter på, at de tilgængelige netværk scannes, vælg netværket, "
"indtast Wi-Fi-adgangskoden, og klik på :guilabel:`Opret forbindelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:58
msgid "IoT box's WiFi hotspot"
msgstr "IoT-boksens WiFi-hotspot"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:63
msgid ""
"Once connected to the Wi-Fi network, the IoT box stops emitting its Wi-Fi "
"signal, and the computer should automatically reconnect to its original "
"network. If it does not, reconnect to it manually."
msgstr ""
"Når IoT-boksen er tilsluttet Wi-Fi-netværket, stopper den med at udsende sit "
"Wi-Fi-signal, og computeren bør automatisk oprette forbindelse til sit "
"oprindelige netværk igen. Hvis den ikke gør det, skal du oprette forbindelse "
"til det manuelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:66
msgid ""
"Depending on the operating system used, the browser might not open and "
"redirect to the IoT box's homepage. In this case, open the browser manually "
"and navigate to `http://10.11.12.1` or any URL starting with **http** (e.g., "
"`http://odoo.com`)."
msgstr ""
"Afhængigt af det anvendte styresystem åbner browseren muligvis ikke og "
"omdirigerer til IoT-boksens startside. I så fald skal du åbne browseren "
"manuelt og navigere til `http://10.11.12.1` eller en hvilken som helst URL, "
"der starter med **http** (f.eks. `http://odoo.com`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:71
msgid ""
"If the IoT box is connected to an :doc:`external monitor <devices/screen>`, "
"scan the first QR code displayed on the screen to connect to the network, "
"then scan the second QR code to access the IoT box's :ref:`homepage <iot/iot-"
"box/homepage>`. On the homepage, click :guilabel:`Configure` in "
"the :guilabel:`Internet Status` section, select the relevant Wi-Fi network, "
"enter the password, and click :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis IoT-boksen er tilsluttet en :doc:`ekstern skærm <devices/screen>`, skal "
"du scanne den første QR-kode, der vises på skærmen, for at oprette "
"forbindelse til netværket, og derefter scanne den anden QR-kode for at få "
"adgang til IoT-boksens :ref:`startside <iot/iot-box/homepage>`. På "
"startsiden skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Konfigurer` i afsnittet "
":guilabel:`Internetstatus`, vælge det relevante Wi-Fi-netværk, indtaste "
"adgangskoden og klikke på :guilabel:`Forbind`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:80
msgid "LED status"
msgstr "LED-status"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:82
msgid ""
"The IoT box features two LEDs, located to the right of the SD card slot, "
"that indicate its status and help with troubleshooting when no display is "
"connected. The LEDs can be interpreted as follows:"
msgstr ""
"IoT-boksen har to LED'er, placeret til højre for SD-kortpladsen, som angiver "
"dens status og hjælper med fejlfinding, når der ikke er tilsluttet en skærm. "
"LED'erne kan fortolkes således:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:85
msgid ""
"**Red LED lit**: The IoT box is not connected to the Internet. Ensure the "
"Ethernet cable is properly connected, or :ref:`connect the IoT box via Wi-Fi "
"<iot/iot_box/network-wifi>`."
msgstr ""
"**Rød LED lyser**: IoT-boksen er ikke forbundet til internettet. Kontroller, "
"at Ethernet-kablet er tilsluttet korrekt, eller :ref:`forbind IoT-boksen via "
"Wi-Fi <iot/iot_box/network-wifi>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:87
msgid ""
"**Green LED flashing**: The IoT box is waiting to :doc:`connect to a "
"database <connect>`."
msgstr ""
"**Grøn LED blinker**: IoT-boksen venter på at :doc:`oprette forbindelse til "
"en database <connect>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Green LED constantly lit**: The IoT box is connected to a database; no "
"further action is required."
msgstr ""
"**Grøn LED konstant tændt**: IoT-boksen er tilsluttet en database; ingen "
"yderligere handling er påkrævet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:94
msgid "IoT box homepage"
msgstr "IoT-boksens hjemmeside"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:96
msgid ""
"To access the IoT box's homepage on a device, first ensure the device is on "
"the same network as the IoT box. Then, if using the IoT app, "
"click :guilabel:`Homepage`, or open a browser on the device and navigate to "
"the IoT box's IP address."
msgstr ""
"For at få adgang til IoT-boksens startside på en enhed skal du først sikre "
"dig, at enheden er på det samme netværk som IoT-boksen. Hvis du bruger IoT-"
"appen, skal du derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Startside` eller åbne en "
"browser på enheden og navigere til IoT-boksens IP-adresse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:100
msgid "IoT box's homepage"
msgstr "IoT-boksens hjemmeside"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:104
msgid ""
"If the IP address is not already known, use any of the following methods to "
"retrieve it:"
msgstr ""
"Hvis IP-adressen ikke allerede kendes, kan du bruge en af følgende metoder "
"til at finde den:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:106
msgid ""
"While connected to the same network as the IoT box, open a web browser and "
"navigate to `http://iotbox.local`. The page automatically redirects to the "
"homepage, which displays the IP address."
msgstr ""
"Mens du er forbundet til det samme netværk som IoT-boksen, skal du åbne en "
"webbrowser og navigere til `http://iotbox.local`. Siden omdirigerer "
"automatisk til startsiden, som viser IP-adressen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:109
msgid ""
"Connect a `supported receipt or label printer <https://www.odoo.com/app/iot-"
"hardware>`_ using a USB cable, which then automatically prints a ticket with "
"the IP address."
msgstr ""
"Tilslut en `understøttet kvitterings- eller etiketprinter <https://"
"www.odoo.com/app/iot-hardware>`_ ved hjælp af et USB-kabel, hvorefter der "
"automatisk udskrives en bon med IP-adressen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:111
msgid ""
"Connect the IoT box to an :doc:`external monitor <devices/screen>`, which "
"then displays the IP address on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Slut IoT-boksen til en :doc:`ekstern skærm <devices/screen>`, som derefter "
"viser IP-adressen på skærmen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:113
msgid ""
"On IoT box images `L2026.05.25` and later, the IoT box IP address is "
"displayed as a discovered Bluetooth device for 5 minutes after booting."
msgstr ""
"På IoT-boks-aftryk `L2026.05.25` og nyere vises IoT-boksens IP-adresse som "
"en fundet Bluetooth-enhed i 5 minutter efter opstart."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:115
msgid ""
"Access the router's administrator interface, or use third-party software to "
"scan the network."
msgstr ""
"Åbn routerens administratorgrænseflade, eller brug tredjepartssoftware til "
"at scanne netværket."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:117
msgid "Status display with IoT box's IP address"
msgstr "Statusvisning med IoT-boksens IP-adresse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:122
msgid ""
"To manually restart the IoT box, access the :ref:`homepage <iot/iot-box/"
"homepage>`, then click the :icon:`fa-power-off` :guilabel:`(power off)` "
"button in the top-right corner."
msgstr ""
"For at genstarte IoT-boksen manuelt skal du åbne :ref:`startsiden <iot/iot-"
"box/homepage>` og derefter klikke på knappen :icon:`fa-power-off` :guilabel:`"
"(sluk)` i øverste højre hjørne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:124
msgid ""
"If the IoT box is connected to an :doc:`external monitor <devices/screen>` "
"or a :doc:`printer <devices/printer>`, its homepage can also be accessed by "
"scanning the displayed or printed QR code with a device connected to the "
"same network as the IoT box."
msgstr ""
"Hvis IoT-boksen er forbundet til en :doc:`ekstern skærm <devices/screen>` "
"eller en :doc:`printer <devices/printer>`, kan dens hjemmeside også tilgås "
"ved at scanne den viste eller printede QR-kode med en enhed, der er "
"forbundet til det samme netværk som IoT-boksen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_box.rst:127
msgid "To fully reboot the IoT box, unplug it and plug it back in."
msgstr ""
"For at genstarte IoT-boksen helt skal du trække stikket ud og sætte det i "
"igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:5
msgid "To start using the Windows virtual IoT:"
msgstr "Sådan begynder du at bruge den virtuelle Windows IoT:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:7
msgid ""
"Make sure the computer runs an updated version of Windows (Windows 10 or "
"Windows 11), whether it's a laptop, desktop, or server."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at computeren kører en opdateret version af Windows (Windows 10 "
"eller Windows 11), uanset om det er en bærbar computer, stationær computer "
"eller server."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:9
msgid ""
":ref:`Install the Windows virtual IoT <iot/windows-iot/installation>` on the "
"Windows computer."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Installer den virtuelle Windows IoT <iot/windows-iot/installation>` på "
"Windows-computeren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:10
msgid "Connect your :doc:`devices <devices>` to the Windows virtual IoT."
msgstr "Tilslut dine :doc:`enheder <devices>` til den virtuelle Windows IoT."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:11
msgid ":ref:`Configure the Windows Firewall <iot/windows-iot/firewall>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Konfigurer Windows Firewall <iot/windows-iot/firewall>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`Connect the Windows virtual IoT to your Odoo database <connect>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Tilslut den virtuelle Windows IoT til din Odoo-database <connect>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:15
msgid ""
":abbr:`MRP (Material Requirement Planning)` devices, including cameras and "
"measurement tools, are not compatible with Windows virtual IoT."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`MRP (Material Requirement Planning)`-enheder, herunder kameraer og "
"måleværktøjer, er ikke kompatible med Windows virtual IoT."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:17
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create a Windows Virtual Machine on a macOS/Linux "
"computer. However, this option is not supported by Odoo, and no "
"troubleshooting assistance will be provided."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at oprette en virtuel Windows-maskine på en macOS/Linux-"
"computer. Denne mulighed understøttes dog ikke af Odoo, og der ydes ingen "
"hjælp til fejlfinding."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:24
msgid ""
"Never make the Windows virtual IoT accessible from the public Internet. IoT "
"systems are designed to provide your database with access to devices on your "
"local network. Exposing them to the public Internet would create a "
"**security risk**."
msgstr ""
"Gør aldrig den virtuelle Windows IoT tilgængelig fra det offentlige "
"internet. IoT-systemer er designet til at give din database adgang til "
"enheder på dit lokale netværk. At eksponere dem til det offentlige internet "
"vil skabe en **sikkerhedsrisiko**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:31
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:33
msgid "To install the Windows virtual IoT on a Windows computer:"
msgstr "Sådan installerer du den virtuelle Windows IoT på en Windows-computer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:35
msgid ""
"Access `Odoo's download page <https://odoo.com/download>`_, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`Virtual IOT` section, and click :guilabel:`Download`."
msgstr ""
"Gå til `Odoos downloadside <https://odoo.com/download>`_, rul ned til "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Virtual IOT`, og klik på :guilabel:`Download`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:37
msgid ""
"Open the downloaded :file:`.exe` file, allow the app to make changes to your "
"device, select a language, and click :guilabel:`OK`."
msgstr ""
"Åbn den downloadede :file:`.exe`-fil, tillad appen at foretage ændringer på "
"din enhed, vælg et sprog, og klik på :guilabel:`OK`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:39
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Next`, then :guilabel:`I Agree` to accept the terms and "
"conditions and continue."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Næste`, derefter :guilabel:`Jeg accepterer` for at "
"acceptere vilkårene og betingelserne og fortsætte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:40
msgid ""
"Verify you have the required space on your computer and "
"click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr ""
"Kontroller, at du har den nødvendige plads på din computer, og klik "
"på :guilabel:`Næste`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:41
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Destination folder`, enter C:\\\\odoo and "
"click :guilabel:`Install`."
msgstr ""
"I :guilabel:`Destinationsmappe` indtast C:\\\\odoo og klik "
"på :guilabel:`Installer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:44
msgid ""
"Do not install Odoo's Windows virtual IoT in any Windows user directory, as "
"this can cause issues with :ref:`HTTPS certificate generation <iot/connect/"
"https_certificate>`."
msgstr ""
"Installer ikke Odoos virtuelle Windows IoT i nogen Windows-brugermappe, da "
"dette kan forårsage problemer med :ref:`generering af HTTPS-certifikat <iot/"
"connect/https_certificate>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:47
msgid ""
"Set up GPL Ghostscript: Click :guilabel:`Next`, agree to the terms and "
"conditions, click :guilabel:`Install`, then :guilabel:`Finish`."
msgstr ""
"Opsæt GPL Ghostscript: Klik på :guilabel:`Næste`, accepter vilkårene og "
"betingelserne, klik på :guilabel:`Installer`, derefter :guilabel:`Udfør`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:49
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Next` and :guilabel:`Finish` to complete the setup. "
"The :ref:`IoT system's homepage <iot/windows-iot/homepage>` automatically "
"opens in a web browser with the URL `http://localhost:8069`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Næste` og :guilabel:`Afslut` for at fuldføre "
"opsætningen. :ref:`IoT-systemets hjemmeside <iot/windows-iot/homepage>` "
"åbnes automatisk i en webbrowser med URL'en `http://localhost:8069`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:52
msgid ""
":ref:`Restart <iot/windows_iot/restart>` the Windows virtual IoT service."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Genstart <iot/windows_iot/restart>` Windows virtual IoT-tjenesten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:53
msgid ""
"Check that you can access the :ref:`IoT system's homepage <iot/windows-iot/"
"homepage>` in a web browser:"
msgstr ""
"Kontroller, at du kan få adgang til :ref:`IoT-systemets startside <iot/"
"windows-iot/homepage>` i en webbrowser:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:56
msgid "on the Windows virtual IoT computer, and"
msgstr "på den virtuelle Windows IoT-computer, og"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:57
msgid ""
"on another device **on the same network as the IoT system** by navigating to "
"the URL `http://xxx:8069` (where `xxx` is the IoT system's IP address)."
msgstr ""
"på en anden enhed **på samme netværk som IoT-systemet** ved at navigere til "
"URL'en `http://xxx:8069` (hvor `xxx` er IoT-systemets IP-adresse)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:59
msgid ""
"on another device **on the same network as the IoT system** by navigating to "
"the URL `https://xxx` (where `xxx` is the IoT system's IP address) to test "
"for :ref:`HTTPS <iot/connect/https_certificate>` connection."
msgstr ""
"på en anden enhed **på samme netværk som IoT-systemet** ved at navigere til "
"URL'en `https://xxx` (hvor `xxx` er IoT-systemets IP-adresse) for at "
"teste :ref:`HTTPS <iot/connect/https_certificate>`-forbindelsen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:64
msgid ""
"If you cannot access the :ref:`IoT system's homepage <iot/windows-iot/"
"homepage>` from another device, create a :ref:`Windows Firewall <iot/windows-"
"iot/firewall>` rule to allow communication through port `8069`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du ikke kan få adgang til :ref:`IoT-systemets startside <iot/windows-"
"iot/homepage>` fra en anden enhed, skal du oprette en :ref:`Windows Firewall "
"<iot/windows-iot/firewall>`-regel for at tillade kommunikation gennem port "
"`8069`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:69
msgid "Device connection"
msgstr "Enhedsforbindelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:71
msgid ""
"Most :doc:`devices <devices>` automatically connect to the Windows computer "
"used for the Windows Virtual IoT through `Windows Plug and Play (PnP) "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/kernel/"
"introduction-to-plug-and-play>`_. However, if Windows does not recognize the "
"device automatically upon connection, the administrator may need to manually "
"install the appropriate drivers."
msgstr ""
"De fleste :doc:`enheder <devices>` opretter automatisk forbindelse til den "
"Windows-computer, der bruges til Windows Virtual IoT, via `Windows Plug and "
"Play (PnP) <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/"
"kernel/introduction-to-plug-and-play>`_. Hvis Windows dog ikke genkender "
"enheden automatisk ved tilslutning, kan det være nødvendigt for "
"administratoren at installere de relevante drivere manuelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:78
msgid ""
"After connecting the devices to the computer, refresh the :ref:`IoT system's "
"homepage <iot/windows-iot/homepage>` to verify that the device is listed. If "
"the device does not appear, restart the IoT system from the :ref:`IoT "
"system's homepage <iot/windows-iot/homepage>`."
msgstr ""
"Når enhederne er forbundet til computeren, skal du genindlæse :ref:`IoT-"
"systemets startside <iot/windows-iot/homepage>` for at bekræfte, at enheden "
"er på listen. Hvis enheden ikke vises, skal du genstarte IoT-systemet fra "
":ref:`IoT-systemets startside <iot/windows-iot/homepage>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:85
msgid "Windows Firewall configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration af Windows Firewall"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:87
msgid ""
"Firewalls help keep devices secure but can sometimes block legitimate "
"connections. If the Windows virtual IoT isn't accessible on the :abbr:`LAN "
"(Local Area Network)`, for example, from another device, it could be due to "
"a firewall blocking the connection. To prevent this issue, configure "
"exceptions for network discovery in the :abbr:`OS (Operating System)` or "
"firewall settings."
msgstr ""
"Firewalls hjælper med at holde enheder sikre, men kan nogle gange blokere "
"legitime forbindelser. Hvis den virtuelle Windows IoT ikke er tilgængelig "
"på :abbr:`LAN (Local Area Network)`, for eksempel fra en anden enhed, kan "
"det skyldes, at en firewall blokerer forbindelsen. For at forhindre dette "
"problem skal du konfigurere undtagelser for netværksopdagelse i :abbr:`OS "
"(Operating System)` eller firewall-indstillingerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:93
msgid ""
"If third-party firewall software is installed on the Windows computer, refer "
"to the software's documentation to configure firewall exceptions."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der er installeret tredjepartsfirewallsoftware på Windows-computeren, "
"skal du se softwarens dokumentation for at konfigurere firewallundtagelser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:96
msgid ""
"To create a rule on Windows Defender and allow communication through the "
"required ports, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Følg disse trin for at oprette en regel i Windows Defender og tillade "
"kommunikation gennem de nødvendige porte:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:99
msgid ""
"Search the Windows start menu for `firewall` and select "
"the :guilabel:`Windows Defender Firewall with Advanced Security` app."
msgstr ""
"Søg i Windows-startmenuen efter `firewall`, og vælg appen :guilabel:`Windows "
"Defender Firewall with Advanced Security`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:101
msgid "In the left part of the window, select :guilabel:`Inbound Rules`."
msgstr "Vælg :guilabel:`Inbound Rules` i venstre side af vinduet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:102
msgid ""
"In the right part of the window, under :guilabel:`Actions`, "
"click :guilabel:`New Rule`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`New Rule` i højre side af vinduet "
"under :guilabel:`Actions`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:103
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`New Inbound Rule Wizard` that opens, select "
"the :guilabel:`Port` type of rule and click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr ""
"I :guilabel:`New Inbound Rule Wizard`, der åbnes, skal du vælge "
"regeltypen :guilabel:`Port` og klikke på :guilabel:`Next`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:105
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Protocols and Ports` page, make sure :guilabel:`TCP` "
"and :guilabel:`Specified local ports` are selected, enter the following in "
"the field: `8069, 80, 443`, and click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Protocols and Ports` skal du sikre dig, "
"at :guilabel:`TCP` og :guilabel:`Specified local ports` er valgt, indtaste "
"følgende i feltet: `8069, 80, 443`, og klikke på :guilabel:`Next`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:110
msgid ""
"Other ports may be required depending on your IoT devices. For example, add "
"port `9050` for the :doc:`/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/"
"terminals/worldline_axepta` payment terminals."
msgstr ""
"Andre porte kan være påkrævet afhængigt af dine IoT-enheder. Tilføj for "
"eksempel port `9050` til :doc:`/applications/sales/point_of_sale/"
"payment_methods/terminals/worldline_axepta`-betalingsterminalerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:114
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Action` page, select :guilabel:`Allow the connection` and "
"click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Action` skal du vælge :guilabel:`Allow the connection` "
"og klikke på :guilabel:`Next`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:116
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Profile` page, disable any connection type(s) that don't "
"apply to your Windows computer and click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Profile` skal du deaktivere eventuelle "
"forbindelsestyper, der ikke gælder for din Windows-computer, og klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Next`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:118
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Name` page, provide a :guilabel:`Name` (e.g., `Odoo`) and, "
"optionally, a brief :guilabel:`Description`, then click :guilabel:`Finish`."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Name` skal du angive et :guilabel:`Name` (f.eks. `Odoo`) "
"og eventuelt en kort :guilabel:`Description` og derefter klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Finish`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:122
msgid ""
"`Windows Firewall rules documentation <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"windows/security/operating-system-security/network-security/windows-firewall/"
"rules>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Windows Firewall rules documentation <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"windows/security/operating-system-security/network-security/windows-firewall/"
"rules>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:128
msgid "Windows virtual IoT homepage"
msgstr "Windows virtual IoT-hjemmeside"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:130
msgid ""
"To access the Windows virtual IoT's homepage, navigate to the URL `http://"
"localhost:8069` on the Windows virtual IoT computer or open a web browser "
"from another computer **on the same network as the IoT system** and navigate "
"to the URL `http://xxx:8069` (where `xxx` is the IoT system's IP address)."
msgstr ""
"For at få adgang til Windows virtual IoT's hjemmeside skal du navigere til "
"URL'en `http://localhost:8069` på Windows virtual IoT-computeren eller åbne "
"en webbrowser fra en anden computer **på samme netværk som IoT-systemet** og "
"navigere til URL'en `http://xxx:8069` (hvor `xxx` er IoT-systemets IP-"
"adresse)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:135
msgid ""
"Once the Windows virtual IoT is :doc:`connected to the Odoo database "
"<connect>`, its homepage can be accessed from Odoo by opening the IoT app, "
"clicking the relevant IoT box's card, and clicking :guilabel:`Homepage`."
msgstr ""
"Når den virtuelle Windows IoT er :doc:`forbundet til Odoo-databasen "
"<connect>`, kan dens hjemmeside tilgås fra Odoo ved at åbne IoT-appen, "
"klikke på det relevante IoT-boks-kort og klikke på :guilabel:`Homepage`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:139
msgid "Windows virtual IoT's homepage"
msgstr "Windows virtual IoT's hjemmeside"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:144
msgid ""
"Make sure the :ref:`Windows Firewall is configured <iot/windows-iot/"
"firewall>` to allow access."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at :ref:`Windows Firewall er konfigureret <iot/windows-iot/"
"firewall>` til at tillade adgang."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:149
msgid "Windows virtual IoT restart"
msgstr "Genstart af Windows virtual IoT"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:151
msgid ""
"To manually restart the Windows IoT server, search the Windows start menu "
"for `services` and select the Services app. Scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`odoo-server-xxx` service, right-click it, and "
"select :guilabel:`Start` or :guilabel:`Restart`."
msgstr ""
"For manuelt at genstarte Windows IoT-serveren skal du søge i Windows-"
"startmenuen efter `services` og vælge Services-appen. Rul ned "
"til :guilabel:`odoo-server-xxx`-tjenesten, højreklik på den og "
"vælg :guilabel:`Start` eller :guilabel:`Restart`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:158
msgid "Windows virtual IoT uninstall"
msgstr "Afinstallation af Windows virtual IoT"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:160
msgid ""
"To uninstall the Windows virtual IoT, `uninstall <https://"
"support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/uninstall-or-remove-apps-and-programs-in-"
"windows-4b55f974-2cc6-2d2b-d092-5905080eaf98#ID0EBD=Windows_11>`_ the Odoo "
"program on your Windows computer. Confirm the uninstallation and complete "
"the steps in the :guilabel:`Odoo Uninstall` dialog."
msgstr ""
"For at afinstallere Windows virtuel IoT, `afinstaller <https://"
"support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/uninstall-or-remove-apps-and-programs-in-"
"windows-4b55f974-2cc6-2d2b-d092-5905080eaf98#ID0EBD=Windows_11>`_ Odoo-"
"programmet på din Windows-computer. Bekræft afinstallationen og fuldfør "
"trinene i dialogen :guilabel:`Odoo Afinstaller`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:3
msgid "Offline mode"
msgstr "Offline-tilstand"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:6
msgid ""
"Odoo’s offline mode provides a solution for short-term interruptions; it is "
"not intended to offer full or long-term offline capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Odoos offlinetilstand giver en løsning på kortvarige afbrydelser; den er "
"ikke beregnet til at tilbyde fuld eller langsigtet offlinefunktionalitet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:9
msgid ""
"To ensure business continuity when connectivity is unreliable or "
"unavailable, such as while commuting or when working in locations with poor "
"or no coverage, Odoo makes certain functionality available offline for "
"logged-in users."
msgstr ""
"For at sikre forretningskontinuitet, når forbindelsen er upålidelig eller "
"utilgængelig – f.eks. under pendling eller ved arbejde på steder med dårlig "
"eller ingen dækning – gør Odoo visse funktioner tilgængelige offline for "
"brugere, der er logget ind."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:13
msgid ""
"As soon as the internet connection is no longer active, a :guilabel:`Working "
"offline` button appears in the database header. Views or records that were "
"previously opened while online can be reopened, regardless of whether they "
"were active in the browser at the moment connectivity was lost. Records can "
"be :ref:`edited, deleted, archived, unarchived, or created <general/offline-"
"mode/records-create-udpate>`, provided certain conditions are met. "
"Previously performed :ref:`search queries <general/offline-mode/search>` can "
"be run again."
msgstr ""
"Så snart internetforbindelsen ikke længere er aktiv, vises knappen "
":guilabel:`Arbejder offline` i databasens sidehoved. Visninger eller poster, "
"der tidligere blev åbnet online, kan genåbnes, uanset om de var aktive i "
"browseren i det øjeblik, forbindelsen blev afbrudt. Poster kan "
":ref:`redigeres, slettes, arkiveres, fjernes fra arkiv eller oprettes "
"<general/offline-mode/records-create-udpate>`, forudsat at visse betingelser "
"er opfyldt. Tidligere udførte :ref:`søgeforespørgsler <general/offline-mode/"
"search>` kan køres igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:20
msgid "Items that are not available offline are grayed out."
msgstr "Elementer, der ikke er tilgængelige offline, er nedtonede."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:22
msgid "Elements not available offline are grayed out"
msgstr "Elementer, der ikke er tilgængelige offline, er nedtonede"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:25
msgid ""
"Any changes made offline are :ref:`queued locally <general/offline-mode/"
"manage-changes>`; when connectivity is restored, changes are synced "
"automatically and reflected in your database."
msgstr ""
"Eventuelle ændringer foretaget offline :ref:`sættes i kø lokalt <general/"
"offline-mode/manage-changes>`; når forbindelsen genoprettes, synkroniseres "
"ændringerne automatisk og afspejles i din database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:29
msgid ""
"If you foresee connectivity issues, briefly open any views or records you "
"expect to need, and perform any searches so they can still be accessed if/"
"when connectivity is lost."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du forudser forbindelsesproblemer, kan du kortvarigt åbne de visninger "
"eller poster, du forventer at få brug for, og udføre søgninger, så de stadig "
"kan tilgås, hvis eller når forbindelsen mistes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:33
msgid ""
"Odoo supports offline access for apps and modules built using :doc:`standard "
"Odoo framework components </developer/reference/frontend/"
"framework_overview>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo understøtter offline adgang til apps og moduler bygget ved hjælp "
"af :doc:`standard Odoo framework-komponenter </developer/reference/frontend/"
"framework_overview>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:35
msgid ""
"For performance reasons, Odoo allocates a maximum of 2 GB for offline data. "
"When this limit is reached, the oldest data is removed to make room for the "
"most recent activity."
msgstr ""
"Af præstationsårsager allokerer Odoo maksimalt 2 GB til offline data. Når "
"denne grænse nås, fjernes de ældste data for at gøre plads til den seneste "
"aktivitet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:37
msgid ""
"Performing a hard refresh using `Ctrl + F5` or `Cmd + Shift + R`, e.g., for "
"troubleshooting reasons, removes all locally stored data. This impacts the "
"availability of views and records in offline mode."
msgstr ""
"Udfører du en hård opdatering ved hjælp af `Ctrl + F5` eller `Cmd + Shift + "
"R`, f.eks. af fejlfindingsårsager, fjernes alle lokalt gemte data. Dette "
"påvirker tilgængeligheden af visninger og poster i offline tilstand."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:44
msgid "Create and update records"
msgstr "Opret og opdater poster"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:46
msgid "When offline, records can be:"
msgstr "Når du er offline, kan poster:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:48
msgid ""
"created, provided a record of the same type was previously created while you "
"were online"
msgstr ""
"oprettes, forudsat at en post af samme type tidligere blev oprettet, mens du "
"var online"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:49
msgid ""
"edited, deleted, archived, or unarchived, provided they were previously "
"opened while you were online"
msgstr ""
"redigeres, slettes, arkiveres eller fjernes fra arkiv, forudsat at de "
"tidligere blev åbnet, mens du var online"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:53
msgid ""
"Attachments and images can be opened while offline, but cannot be uploaded "
"or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Vedhæftede filer og billeder kan åbnes, mens du er offline, men kan ikke "
"uploades eller slettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:58
msgid "Perform searches"
msgstr "Udfør søgninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:60
msgid ""
"Search queries that were previously performed while online can be repeated "
"offline. To repeat a previously performed search, click in the search bar, "
"then choose from the available searches."
msgstr ""
"Søgeforespørgsler, der tidligere blev udført online, kan gentages offline. "
"For at gentage en tidligere udført søgning skal du klikke i søgefeltet og "
"derefter vælge blandt de tilgængelige søgninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:63
msgid "Previous executed searches available via search bar"
msgstr "Tidligere udførte søgninger tilgængelige via søgefeltet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:70
msgid "Manage offline changes"
msgstr "Administrer offlineændringer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:72
msgid ""
"When you create or update a record offline, the changes are stored locally "
"in a temporary queue until the internet connection is restored."
msgstr ""
"Når du opretter eller opdaterer en post offline, gemmes ændringerne lokalt i "
"en midlertidig kø, indtil internetforbindelsen genoprettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:75
msgid ""
"To view pending changes while still offline, click the :guilabel:`Working "
"offline` button; modified records are listed, with a tag showing whether the "
"record was :guilabel:`Created`, :guilabel:`Edited`, :guilabel:`Archived`, "
"or :guilabel:`Unarchived`."
msgstr ""
"For at se afventende ændringer, mens du stadig er offline, skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Arbejder offline`; ændrede poster vises med et tag, der "
"viser, om posten blev :guilabel:`Oprettet`, :guilabel:`Redigeret`, "
":guilabel:`Arkiveret` eller :guilabel:`Afarkiveret`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:79
msgid "Hovering over an :guilabel:`Edited` tag reveals the changes made."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du holder musen over tagget :guilabel:`Redigeret`, vises de foretagne "
"ændringer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:82
msgid ""
"In the example, the :guilabel:`Office Design and Architecture` opportunity "
"was edited to change the :guilabel:`Salesperson` (technical field "
"name :guilabel:`user_id`) from `Mitchell Admin` to `Marc Demo` and "
"the :guilabel:`Expected Revenue` from `9000` to `15000`."
msgstr ""
"I eksemplet blev salgsmuligheden :guilabel:`Office Design and Architecture` "
"redigeret for at ændre :guilabel:`Sælger` (teknisk feltnavn "
":guilabel:`user_id`) fra `Mitchell Admin` til `Marc Demo` og "
":guilabel:`Forventet omsætning` fra `9000` til `15000`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:86
msgid "Dropdown on Working offline button showing list of changes made offline"
msgstr ""
"Rullemenu på knappen Arbejder offline, der viser en liste over ændringer "
"foretaget offline"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:90
msgid ""
"To make further changes to an edited record while still offline, click the "
"record to open it locally. To discard pending changes while still offline, "
"for example, if changes were made in error or in the wrong order, click "
"the :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(Discard offline changes)` icon."
msgstr ""
"For at foretage yderligere ændringer i en redigeret post, mens du stadig er "
"offline, skal du klikke på posten for at åbne den lokalt. For at forkaste "
"afventende ændringer, mens du stadig er offline, f.eks. hvis ændringerne "
"blev foretaget ved en fejl eller i forkert rækkefølge, skal du klikke på "
"ikonet :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(Kassér offlineændringer)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:97
msgid "Disable offline mode for specific views"
msgstr "Deaktiver offlinetilstand for specifikke visninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:99
msgid ""
"In some cases, for example, for reporting views, displaying outdated or "
"cached information may not be appropriate. To disable data caching for a "
"specific view and, as a result, make the view unavailable offline, follow "
"these steps:"
msgstr ""
"I visse tilfælde, f.eks. for rapportvisninger, er det måske ikke "
"hensigtsmæssigt at vise forældede eller cachede oplysninger. Følg disse trin "
"for at deaktivere datacaching for en bestemt visning og derved gøre "
"visningen utilgængelig offline:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:103
msgid "Open the view in question."
msgstr "Åbn den pågældende visning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:104
msgid "Activate :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`."
msgstr "Aktivujte :ref:`režim vývojáře <developer-mode>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:105
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-bug` :guilabel:`(bug)` icon in the database header, then "
"select :guilabel:`Action`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-bug` :guilabel:`(fejl)` i databasens sidehoved, og "
"vælg derefter :guilabel:`Handling`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:107
msgid "Disable :guilabel:`Data caching`."
msgstr "Deaktiver :guilabel:`Datacaching`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo defines a *user* as someone who has access to a database. An "
"administrator can add as many users as the company needs and, in order to "
"restrict the type of information each user can access, rules can be applied "
"to each user. Users and access rights can be added and changed at any point."
msgstr ""
"Odoo definerer en *bruger* som en person, der har adgang til en database. En "
"administrator kan tilføje så mange brugere, som virksomheden har brug for, "
"og for at begrænse den type information, hver bruger kan få adgang til, kan "
"der anvendes regler for hver bruger. Brugere og adgangsrettigheder kan "
"tilføjes og ændres når som helst."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`users/language`"
msgstr ":doc:`users/language`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:13
msgid ":doc:`users/access_rights`"
msgstr ":doc:`users/access_rights`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:14
msgid ":ref:`access-rights/superuser`"
msgstr ":ref:`access-rights/superuser`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:15
msgid ":ref:`access-rights/groups`"
msgstr ":ref:`access-rights/groups`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:20
msgid "Add individual users"
msgstr "Tilføj individuelle brugere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:22
msgid ""
"To add new users, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users section "
"--> Manage Users`, and click on :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje nye brugere skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger-app --> Brugere-sektion --> Administrer "
"brugere` og klikke på :guilabel:`Ny`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:25
msgid "View of the settings page emphasizing the manage users field in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Visning af indstillingssiden, der fremhæver feltet administrer brugere i "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:28
msgid ""
"Fill in the form with all the required information. Under the :doc:`Access "
"Rights <users/access_rights>` tab, choose the group within each application "
"the user can have access to."
msgstr ""
"Udfyld formularen med alle de påkrævede oplysninger. Under "
"fanen :doc:`Adgangsrettigheder <users/access_rights>` skal du vælge den "
"gruppe inden for hver applikation, som brugeren kan have adgang til."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:31
msgid ""
"The list of applications shown is based on the applications installed on the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Listen over viste applikationer er baseret på de applikationer, der er "
"installeret på databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:33
msgid "View of a user's form emphasizing the access rights tab in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Visning af en brugerformular, der fremhæver fanen adgangsrettigheder i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:36
msgid ""
"After filling out all the necessary fields on the page, :icon:`fa-cloud-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)`. An invitation email is automatically "
"sent to the user, using the email in the :guilabel:`Email Address` field. "
"The user must click on the link included in the email to accept the "
"invitation, and to create a database login."
msgstr ""
"Efter udfyldelse af alle nødvendige felter på siden skal du :icon:`fa-cloud-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(Gem manuelt)`. En invitations-e-mail sendes automatisk "
"til brugeren ved hjælp af e-mailen i feltet :guilabel:`E-mailadresse`. "
"Brugeren skal klikke på linket i e-mailen for at acceptere invitationen og "
"oprette et database-login."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:41
msgid ""
"View of a user's form with a notification that the invitation email has been "
"sent in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Visning af en brugerformular med en meddelelse om, at invitations-e-mailen "
"er blevet sendt i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:45
msgid ""
"If the company is on a monthly subscription plan, the database automatically "
"updates to reflect the added users. If the company is on a yearly or multi-"
"year plan, an expiration banner appears in the database. An upsell quotation "
"can be created by clicking the banner to update the subscription. "
"Alternatively, `send a support ticket <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_ to "
"resolve the issue."
msgstr ""
"Hvis virksomheden har en månedlig abonnementsplan, opdateres databasen "
"automatisk for at afspejle de tilføjede brugere. Hvis virksomheden har en "
"årlig eller flerårig plan, vises et udløbsbanner i databasen. Et "
"mersalgstilbud kan oprettes ved at klikke på banneret for at opdatere "
"abonnementet. Alternativt kan du `sende en supportanmodning <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_ for at løse problemet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:52
msgid "User type"
msgstr "Brugertype"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`User Type` can be chosen on the :guilabel:`Manage Users` page by "
"clicking on the search bar, and then :ref:`setting a filter <search/"
"preconfigured-filters>` for either :guilabel:`Internal User` "
"or :guilabel:`Portal User`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Brugertype` kan vælges på siden :guilabel:`Administrer brugere` "
"ved at klikke på søgefeltet og derefter :ref:`indstille et filter <search/"
"preconfigured-filters>` for enten :guilabel:`Intern bruger` "
"eller :guilabel:`Portalbruger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:58
msgid ""
"Odoo databases have three types of users: :guilabel:`Internal "
"User`, :guilabel:`Portal`, and :guilabel:`Public`. Users are considered "
"*internal database* users. Portal users are *external users*, who only have "
"access to the database portal to view records. Public users are those "
"visiting websites, via the website's frontend. See the documentation "
"on :doc:`users/user_portals`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo-databaser har tre typer brugere: :guilabel:`Internal "
"User`, :guilabel:`Portal` og :guilabel:`Public`. Brugere betragtes som "
"*interne databasebrugere*. Portalbrugere er *eksterne brugere*, som kun har "
"adgang til databaseportalen for at se poster. Offentlige brugere er dem, der "
"besøger hjemmesider via hjemmesidens frontend. Se dokumentationen "
"om :doc:`users/user_portals`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:63
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Portal` user option does **not** allow the administrator to "
"choose access rights. These users have specific access rights pre-set (such "
"as, record rules and restricted menus), and usually do not belong to the "
"usual Odoo groups."
msgstr ""
"Brugerindstillingen :guilabel:`Portal` tillader **ikke** administratoren at "
"vælge adgangsrettigheder. Disse brugere har specifikke forudindstillede "
"adgangsrettigheder (såsom registreringsregler og begrænsede menuer) og "
"tilhører normalt ikke de sædvanlige Odoo-grupper."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:68
msgid "User devices"
msgstr "Brugerenheder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:70
msgid ""
"For security purposes, when a user logs into the database, the various login "
"information, such as the IP address, is stored in the user's profile. It is "
"best practice to check this periodically, to ensure all access is from the "
"user, and no one else has accessed the database."
msgstr ""
"Af sikkerhedsmæssige årsager gemmes diverse login-oplysninger, såsom IP-"
"adressen, i brugerens profil, når en bruger logger ind i databasen. Det er "
"god praksis at kontrollere dette med jævne mellemrum for at sikre, at al "
"adgang kommer fra brugeren, og at ingen andre har fået adgang til databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:74
msgid ""
"To check the logged-in devices, click the user icon in the upper-right "
"corner, and click :guilabel:`My Preferences` to open the user's profile. "
"Click the *Security* tab to view a list of all devices the user has logged "
"into the database with. Any device currently logged into the system displays "
"a green circle next to the device name on the Kanban card."
msgstr ""
"For at kontrollere de enheder, der er logget ind, skal du klikke på "
"brugerikonet i øverste højre hjørne og klikke på :guilabel:`Mine "
"præferencer` for at åbne brugerens profil. Klik på fanen *Sikkerhed* for at "
"se en liste over alle enheder, som brugeren har logget ind på databasen med. "
"Enhver enhed, der aktuelt er logget ind på systemet, viser en grøn cirkel ud "
"for enhedsnavnet på Kanban-kortet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:79
msgid "The Kanban view of all user devices."
msgstr "Kanban-visningen af alle brugerenheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:83
msgid "Revoke devices"
msgstr "Tilbagekalde enheder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:85
msgid ""
"If a listed device is **not** a legitimate user device and could be a "
"potential security risk, remove the device and revoke access by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Log out` button."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en angivet enhed **ikke** er en legitim brugerenhed og kan udgøre en "
"potentiel sikkerhedsrisiko, skal du fjerne enheden og tilbagekalde adgangen "
"ved at klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Log ud`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:88
msgid ""
"An :guilabel:`Access Control` pop-up window loads, requesting the user to "
"confirm their identity. Enter the user's password, then "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm Password`."
msgstr ""
"Et pop op-vindue for :guilabel:`Adgangskontrol` indlæses og beder brugeren "
"om at bekræfte sin identitet. Indtast brugerens adgangskode, og klik "
"derefter på :guilabel:`Bekræft adgangskode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:91
msgid ""
"The device disappears from the *Security* tab and can no longer be used to "
"log into the database."
msgstr ""
"Enheden forsvinder fra fanen *Sikkerhed* og kan ikke længere bruges til at "
"logge ind på databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:93
msgid ""
"The security pop-up window asking to verify the account with a password."
msgstr ""
"Pop op-vinduet med sikkerhed, der beder om at verificere kontoen med en "
"adgangskode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:99
msgid "Deactivate users"
msgstr "Deaktivere brugere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:101
msgid ""
"To deactivate (i.e. archive) a user, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings "
"app --> Users section --> Manage Users`. Then, tick the checkbox to the left "
"of the users to be deactivated."
msgstr ""
"For at deaktivere (dvs. arkivere) en bruger skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger-app --> Brugere-sektion --> Administrer "
"brugere`. Sæt derefter flueben til venstre for de brugere, der skal "
"deaktiveres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:104
msgid ""
"After selecting the appropriate user to be archived, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, and select :guilabel:`Archive` from the "
"resulting drop-down menu. Then, click :guilabel:`OK` from "
"the :guilabel:`Confirmation` pop-up window that appears."
msgstr ""
"Efter at have valgt den relevante bruger, der skal arkiveres, skal du klikke "
"på ikonet :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Handlinger)` og "
"vælge :guilabel:`Arkiver` fra den viste rullemenu. Klik derefter "
"på :guilabel:`OK` i pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Bekræftelse`, der vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:109
msgid "Error: too many users"
msgstr "Fejl: for mange brugere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:111
msgid ""
"If there are more users in an Odoo database than provisioned in the Odoo "
"Enterprise subscription, the following message is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der er flere brugere i en Odoo-database end der er afsat i Odoo "
"Enterprise-abonnementet, vises følgende meddelelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:114
msgid "Too many users on a database error message."
msgstr "Fejlmeddelelse om for mange brugere på en database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:117
msgid ""
"When the message appears, the database administrator has 30 days to act "
"before the database expires. The countdown is updated every day."
msgstr ""
"Når meddelelsen vises, har databaseadministratoren 30 dage til at handle, "
"før databasen udløber. Nedtællingen opdateres hver dag."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:120
msgid "To resolve the issue, either:"
msgstr "For at løse problemet skal du enten:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:122
msgid ""
"Add more users to the subscription by clicking the :guilabel:`Upgrade your "
"subscription` link displayed in the message to validate the upsell "
"quotation, and pay for the extra users."
msgstr ""
"Tilføje flere brugere til abonnementet ved at klikke på "
"linket :guilabel:`Opgrader dit abonnement`, som vises i meddelelsen, for at "
"validere mersalgstilbuddet og betale for de ekstra brugere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:124
msgid ""
":ref:`Deactivate users <users/deactivate>`, and reject the upsell quotation."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Deaktivere brugere <users/deactivate>` og afvise mersalgstilbuddet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:127
msgid ""
"If the company is on a monthly subscription plan, the database automatically "
"updates to reflect the added users. If the company is on a yearly or multi-"
"year plan, an expiration banner appears in the database. An upsell quotation "
"can be created by clicking the banner to update the subscription. "
"Alternatively, users can `send a support ticket <https://www.odoo.com/"
"help>`_ to resolve the issue."
msgstr ""
"Hvis virksomheden har en månedsabonnementsplan, opdateres databasen "
"automatisk for at afspejle de tilføjede brugere. Hvis virksomheden har en "
"årlig eller flerårig plan, vises et udløbsbanner i databasen. Et "
"mersalgstilbud kan oprettes ved at klikke på banneret for at opdatere "
"abonnementet. Alternativt kan brugere `sende en supportanmodning <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_ for at løse problemet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:133
msgid ""
"Once the database has the correct number of users, the expiration message "
"disappears automatically after a few days, when the next verification occurs."
msgstr ""
"Når databasen har det korrekte antal brugere, forsvinder udløbsmeddelelsen "
"automatisk efter et par dage, når den næste verifikation finder sted."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:139
msgid "Password management"
msgstr "Adgangskodeadministration"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:141
msgid ""
"Password management is an important part of granting users autonomous access "
"to the database at all times. Odoo offers a few different methods to reset a "
"user's password."
msgstr ""
"Adgangskodeadministration er en vigtig del af at give brugere autonom adgang "
"til databasen til enhver tid. Odoo tilbyder et par forskellige metoder til "
"at nulstille en brugers adgangskode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:145
msgid ""
"To enforce a minimum password length requirement, :ref:`install <general/"
"install>` the :guilabel:`Password Policy` (`auth_password_policy`) module. "
"Then, open the :guilabel:`Settings` app, navigate to the *Permissions* "
"section, and enter the desired password length in the :guilabel:`Minimum "
"Password Length` field. By default, the value is `8`."
msgstr ""
"For at håndhæve et krav om minimumslængde for adgangskode skal du "
":ref:`installere <general/install>` modulet :guilabel:`Adgangskodepolitik` "
"(`auth_password_policy`). Åbn derefter appen :guilabel:`Indstillinger`, gå "
"til afsnittet *Rettigheder*, og indtast den ønskede adgangskodelængde i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Minimum adgangskodelængde`. Som standard er værdien `8`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:153
msgid "Reset password"
msgstr "Nulstil adgangskode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:155
msgid ""
"Sometimes, users might wish to reset their personal password for added "
"security, so they are the only ones with access to the password. Odoo offers "
"two different reset options: one initiated by the user to reset the "
"password, and another where the administrator triggers a reset."
msgstr ""
"Nogle gange ønsker brugere måske at nulstille deres personlige adgangskode "
"for øget sikkerhed, så de er de eneste med adgang til adgangskoden. Odoo "
"tilbyder to forskellige nulstillingsmuligheder: en initieret af brugeren til "
"at nulstille adgangskoden og en anden, hvor administratoren udløser en "
"nulstilling."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:162
msgid "Enable password reset from login page"
msgstr "Aktiver adgangskode-nulstilling fra loginside"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:164
msgid ""
"It is possible to enable/disable password resets directly from the login "
"page. This action is completed by the individual user, and this setting is "
"enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"Det er muligt at aktivere/deaktivere adgangskode-nulstillinger direkte fra "
"loginsiden. Denne handling udføres af den enkelte bruger, og denne "
"indstilling er aktiveret som standard."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:167
msgid ""
"To change this setting, go to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Permissions` "
"section, activate :guilabel:`Password Reset`, and then "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"For at ændre denne indstilling skal du gå til :menuselection:`Indstillinger-"
"appen --> Tilladelser`-sektionen, aktivere :guilabel:`Adgangskode-"
"nulstilling` og derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Gem`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:170
msgid "Enabling Password Reset in Odoo Settings."
msgstr "Aktivering af adgangskode-nulstilling i Odoo-indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:173
msgid ""
"On the login page, click :guilabel:`Reset Password` to initiate the password "
"reset process, and have a reset-token sent to the email on file."
msgstr ""
"På loginsiden skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Nulstil adgangskode` for at "
"starte adgangskode-nulstillingsprocessen og få sendt et nulstillingstoken "
"til den registrerede e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:179
msgid "Send reset instructions"
msgstr "Send nulstillingsinstruktioner"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:181
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users & Companies --> Users`, select "
"the user from the list, and click on :guilabel:`Send Password Reset "
"Instructions` on the user form. An email is automatically sent to them with "
"password reset instructions."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :menuselection:`Indstillinger-appen --> Brugere og virksomheder --> "
"Brugere`, vælg brugeren fra listen, og klik på :guilabel:`Send instruktioner "
"til adgangskode-nulstilling` på brugerformularen. En e-mail sendes "
"automatisk til dem med instruktioner til adgangskode-nulstilling."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:186
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Send Password Reset Instructions` button **only** appears if "
"the Odoo invitation email has already been confirmed by the user. Otherwise, "
"a :guilabel:`Re-send Invitation Email` button appears."
msgstr ""
"Knappen :guilabel:`Send Password Reset Instructions` vises **kun**, hvis "
"Odoo-invitationsmailen allerede er blevet bekræftet af brugeren. Ellers "
"vises en :guilabel:`Re-send Invitation Email`-knap."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:190
msgid ""
"This email contains all the instructions needed to reset the password, along "
"with a link redirecting the user to an Odoo login page."
msgstr ""
"Denne e-mail indeholder alle de instruktioner, der er nødvendige for at "
"nulstille adgangskoden, sammen med et link, der omdirigerer brugeren til en "
"Odoo login-side."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:193
msgid "Example of an email with a password reset link for an Odoo account."
msgstr ""
"Eksempel på en e-mail med et link til nulstilling af adgangskode for en Odoo-"
"konto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:199
msgid "Change user password"
msgstr "Ændre brugeradgangskode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:201
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users & Companies --> Users`, and "
"select a user to access its form. Click on the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, and select :guilabel:`Change Password` from "
"the resulting drop-down menu. Enter a new password in the :guilabel:`New "
"Password` column of the :guilabel:`Change Password` pop-up window that "
"appears, and confirm the change by clicking :guilabel:`Change Password`."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users & Companies --> Users`, og "
"vælg en bruger for at åbne dens formular. Klik på :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)`-ikonet, og vælg :guilabel:`Change Password` fra "
"den resulterende rullemenu. Indtast en ny adgangskode i "
"kolonnen :guilabel:`New Password` i pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Change "
"Password`, der vises, og bekræft ændringen ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Change Password`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:207
msgid "Change a user's password on Odoo."
msgstr "Ændre en brugers adgangskode i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:211
msgid ""
"This operation only modifies the password of the users locally, and does "
"**not** affect their Odoo account."
msgstr ""
"Denne operation ændrer kun brugerens adgangskode lokalt og påvirker **ikke** "
"deres Odoo-konto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:214
msgid ""
"If the Odoo password needs to be changed, use the :ref:`send the password "
"reset <users/reset-password-email>`. Odoo.com passwords grant access to the "
"*My Databases* page, and other portal features."
msgstr ""
"Hvis Odoo-adgangskoden skal ændres, skal du bruge :ref:`send the password "
"reset <users/reset-password-email>`. Odoo.com-adgangskoder giver adgang til "
"siden *My Databases* og andre portalfunktioner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:218
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Change Password`, the page is redirected to an "
"Odoo login page where the database can be re-accessed using the new password."
msgstr ""
"Efter at have klikket på :guilabel:`Change Password` omdirigeres siden til "
"en Odoo-loginside, hvor databasen kan tilgås igen ved hjælp af den nye "
"adgangskode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:224
msgid "Multi companies"
msgstr "Flere selskaber"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:226
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Companies` field on a user form determines which companies a "
"user can access. To configure multi-company access, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users section --> Manage Users`. Then "
"select the desired user to open their user form."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Virksomheder` på en brugerformular bestemmer, hvilke "
"virksomheder en bruger har adgang til. For at konfigurere adgang til flere "
"virksomheder skal du gå til :menuselection:`Appen Indstillinger --> "
"afsnittet Brugere --> Administrer brugere`. Vælg derefter den ønskede bruger "
"for at åbne dennes brugerformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:230
msgid ""
"In the *Access Rights* tab, under the *Roles* section, configure "
"the :guilabel:`Companies` and :guilabel:`Default Company` fields:"
msgstr ""
"På fanen *Adgangsrettigheder* under afsnittet *Roller* konfigureres felterne "
":guilabel:`Virksomheder` og :guilabel:`Standardvirksomhed`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:233
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Companies`: Select one or more companies the user can access. The "
"user's access and editing permissions are determined by their assigned "
"access rights."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Virksomheder`: Vælg en eller flere virksomheder, som brugeren har "
"adgang til. Brugerens adgangs- og redigeringstilladelser bestemmes af de "
"tildelte adgangsrettigheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:235
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Company`: Select the company that is automatically "
"selected when the user logs in. Only one company can be set as the default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Standardvirksomhed`: Vælg den virksomhed, der automatisk vælges, "
"når brugeren logger ind. Kun én virksomhed kan angives som standard."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:239
msgid ""
"Incorrectly configuring multi-company access can result in inconsistent "
"behavior across companies. Only experienced Odoo users should modify user "
"access rights in databases with a multi-company configuration. For technical "
"explanations, refer to the developer documentation on :doc:`../../../"
"developer/howtos/company`."
msgstr ""
"Forkert konfiguration af adgang til flere virksomheder kan medføre "
"inkonsekvent adfærd på tværs af virksomheder. Kun erfarne Odoo-brugere bør "
"ændre brugeres adgangsrettigheder i databaser med en konfiguration for flere "
"virksomheder. For tekniske forklaringer henvises til udviklerdokumentationen "
"om :doc:`../../../developer/howtos/company`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:244
msgid "View of a user's form emphasizing the multi companies field in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Visning af en brugerformular, der fremhæver feltet multi companies i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:248
msgid ":doc:`companies`"
msgstr ":doc:`companies`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:78
msgid "Two-factor authentication"
msgstr "2-trins godkendelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:8
msgid ""
"*Two-factor authentication (2FA)* is a security measure that helps prevent "
"unauthorized access to user accounts."
msgstr ""
"*Dvoufaktorové ověřování (2FA)* je bezpečnostní opatření, které pomáhá "
"zabránit neoprávněnému přístupu k uživatelským účtům."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:11
msgid ""
"Practically, |2fa| means storing a secret in an *authenticator*, usually on "
"a mobile phone, and exchanging a code from the authenticator when logging in."
msgstr ""
"Prakticky |2fa| znamená uložení tajemství v *autentizátoru*, obvykle na "
"mobilním telefonu, a výměnu kódu z autentizátoru při přihlašování."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:14
msgid ""
"This means an unauthorized user would need to guess the account password and "
"have access to the authenticator, which is a more difficult proposition."
msgstr ""
"To znamená, že neoprávněný uživatel by musel uhodnout heslo k účtu a mít "
"přístup k autentizátoru, což je obtížnější."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:18
msgid ""
"Some governments, such as the :doc:`Australian <../../finance/"
"fiscal_localizations/australia>` government, require |2fa|. For "
"these :doc:`fiscal localizations <../../finance/fiscal_localizations>`, it "
"is not possible to deactivate |2fa|."
msgstr ""
"Nogle regeringer, såsom den :doc:`australske <../../finance/"
"fiscal_localizations/australia>` regering, kræver |2fa|. For "
"disse :doc:`skattemæssige lokaliseringer <../../finance/"
"fiscal_localizations>` er det ikke muligt at deaktivere |2fa|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:23
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Krav"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:26
msgid ""
"These lists are just examples. They are **not** endorsements of any specific "
"software."
msgstr ""
"Disse lister er blot eksempler. De er **ikke** anbefalinger af nogen "
"specifik software."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:28
msgid ""
"Phone-based authenticators are the easiest and most commonly used. Examples "
"include:"
msgstr ""
"Telefonbaserede authenticators er de nemmeste og mest anvendte. Eksempler "
"omfatter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:30
msgid "`Authy <https://authy.com/>`_"
msgstr "`Authy <https://authy.com/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:31
msgid "`FreeOTP <https://freeotp.github.io/>`_"
msgstr "`FreeOTP <https://freeotp.github.io/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:32
msgid ""
"`Google Authenticator <https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/1066447?"
"hl=en>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google Authenticator <https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/1066447?"
"hl=en>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:33
msgid "`LastPass Authenticator <https://lastpass.com/auth/>`_"
msgstr "`LastPass Authenticator <https://lastpass.com/auth/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:34
msgid ""
"`Microsoft Authenticator <https://www.microsoft.com/en-gb/account/"
"authenticator?cmp=h66ftb_42hbak>`_"
msgstr ""
"<https://www.microsoft.com/en-gb/account/authenticator?cmp=h66ftb_42hbak>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:37
msgid "Password managers are another option. Common examples include:"
msgstr ""
"Adgangskodehåndteringer er en anden mulighed. Almindelige eksempler "
"inkluderer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:39
msgid "`1Password <https://support.1password.com/one-time-passwords/>`_"
msgstr "`1Password <https://support.1password.com/one-time-passwords/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:40
msgid "`Bitwarden <https://bitwarden.com/help/article/authenticator-keys/>`_"
msgstr "`Bitwarden <https://bitwarden.com/help/article/authenticator-keys/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:43
msgid ""
"The remainder of this document uses Google Authenticator as an example, as "
"it is one of the most commonly used. This is **not** an endorsement of the "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Resten af dette dokument bruger Google Authenticator som eksempel, da det er "
"en af de mest anvendte. Dette er **ikke** en anbefaling af produktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:49
msgid "Two-factor authentication setup"
msgstr "Opsætning af tofaktorgodkendelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:51
msgid ""
"After selecting an authenticator, log in to Odoo, then click the profile "
"avatar in the upper-right corner, and select :guilabel:`My Preferences` from "
"the resulting drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Efter du har valgt en godkender, skal du logge ind på Odoo, klikke på "
"profilavataren i øverste højre hjørne og vælge :guilabel:`Mine "
"indstillinger` fra den viste rullemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:54
msgid "Click the *Security* tab, then click :guilabel:`Enable 2FA`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på fanen *Sikkerhed*, og klik derefter på :guilabel:`Aktivér 2FA`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:56
msgid "The account secuirty tab in a user profile."
msgstr "Fanen for kontosikkerhed i en brugerprofil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:59
msgid ""
"This generates an *Access Control* pop-up window that requires password "
"confirmation to continue. Enter the Odoo account password, then "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm Password`. Next, a *Two-Factor Authentication "
"Activation* pop-up window appears, with a |QR|."
msgstr ""
"Dette åbner et pop op-vindue med *Adgangskontrol*, som kræver bekræftelse af "
"adgangskoden for at fortsætte. Indtast adgangskoden til Odoo-kontoen, og "
"klik derefter på :guilabel:`Bekræft adgangskode`. Herefter vises et pop op-"
"vindue til *Aktivering af tofaktorgodkendelse* med en |QR|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:63
msgid "The 2fa authentication QR code in Odoo."
msgstr "2fa-autentificerings QR-koden i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:66
msgid "Using the desired authenticator application, scan the |QR| code."
msgstr "Brug den ønskede godkendelsesapplikation til at scanne |QR|-koden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:69
msgid ""
"If scanning the screen is not possible (e.g., the setup is being completed "
"on the *same* device as the authenticator application), click the "
"provided :guilabel:`Cannot scan it?` link, or copying the code to set up the "
"authenticator manually, is an alternative."
msgstr ""
"Hvis det ikke er muligt at scanne skærmen (f.eks. hvis opsætningen "
"gennemføres på *samme* enhed som autentificeringsapplikationen), kan du "
"klikke på det viste link :guilabel:`Kan ikke scanne den?` eller kopiere "
"koden for at opsætte autentificeringsappen manuelt som et alternativ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:73
msgid "A 2fa secret code on an authentication popup."
msgstr "En 2fa-hemmelig kode på en autentificeringspopup."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:76
msgid "Afterwards, the authenticator should display a *verification code*."
msgstr "Derefter skal godkenderen vise en *bekræftelseskode*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:78
msgid "A view of the Google authenticator app with the six digit code for 2fa."
msgstr ""
"En visning af Google authenticator-appen med den sekscifrede kode til 2fa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:81
msgid ""
"Enter the code into the :guilabel:`Verification code` field, then "
"click :guilabel:`Enable Two-Factor Authentication`."
msgstr ""
"Indtast koden i feltet :guilabel:`Bekræftelseskode`, og klik derefter "
"på :guilabel:`Aktivér tofaktorgodkendelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:84
msgid ""
"The success message that appears in a user profile when 2fa is successfully "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Succesmeddelelsen, der vises i en brugerprofil, når 2fa er aktiveret korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:88
msgid "Logging in"
msgstr "Log ind"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:90
msgid "To confirm |2fa| setup is complete, log out of Odoo."
msgstr ""
"For at bekræfte, at |2fa|-opsætningen er fuldført, skal du logge ud af Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:92
msgid ""
"On the login page, input the username and password, then "
"click :guilabel:`Log in`. On the :guilabel:`Two-factor Authentication` page, "
"input the code provided by the chosen authenticator in "
"the :guilabel:`Authentication Code` field, then click :guilabel:`Log in`."
msgstr ""
"På login-siden skal du indtaste brugernavn og adgangskode og derefter klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Log ind`. På siden :guilabel:`Tofaktorgodkendelse` skal du "
"indtaste koden fra den valgte godkender i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Godkendelseskode` og derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Log "
"ind`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:96
msgid "The login page with 2fa enabled."
msgstr "Login-siden med 2fa aktiveret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:100
msgid ""
"If a user loses access to their authenticator, an administrator **must** "
"deactivate |2fa| on the account before the user can log in."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en bruger mister adgang til deres godkender, **skal** en administrator "
"deaktivere |2fa| på kontoen, før brugeren kan logge ind."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:104
msgid "Enforce two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Gennemtving tofaktorgodkendelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:106
msgid ""
"To enforce |2fa| for every user in the database, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Settings` app. In the :guilabel:`Permissions` section, "
"tick the checkbox labeled :guilabel:`Enforce two-factor authentication`. "
"Then, use the radio buttons to choose whether to apply this setting "
"to :guilabel:`Employees only` or :guilabel:`All users`."
msgstr ""
"For at gennemtvinge |2fa| for alle brugere i databasen skal du gå til "
"appen :menuselection:`Indstillinger`. I afsnittet :guilabel:`Rettigheder` "
"skal du markere afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Gennemtving "
"tofaktorgodkendelse`. Brug derefter alternativknapperne til at vælge, om "
"denne indstilling skal gælde for :guilabel:`Kun medarbejdere` "
"eller :guilabel:`Alle brugere`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:112
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`All users` applies the setting to portal users in "
"addition to employees."
msgstr ""
"Når du vælger :guilabel:`Alle brugere`, anvendes indstillingen også på "
"portalbrugere ud over medarbejdere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:114
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save` to commit any unsaved changes."
msgstr "Klik på :guilabel:`Gem` for at gemme eventuelle ikke-gemte ændringer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:116
msgid "The enforce two factor setting in the Settings application."
msgstr ""
"Indstillingen for gennemtvingelse af tofaktorgodkendelse i applikationen "
"Indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:120
msgid ""
"If users are frequently required to log in again and complete two-factor "
"authentication, it may be due to session or inactivity timeout policies "
"configured for one or more of their user groups."
msgstr ""
"Hvis brugere ofte skal logge ind igen og gennemføre tofaktorautentifikation, "
"kan det skyldes politikker for session eller inaktivitetstimeout, der er "
"konfigureret for en eller flere af deres brugergrupper."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:123
msgid ""
"Administrators can configure these policies using the *Timeouts* settings "
"available on user groups when the *auth_timeout* module is installed. "
"See :ref:`Session and inactivity timeouts <general/users/access_rights/"
"timeouts>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Administratorer kan konfigurere disse politikker ved hjælp af *Timeouts*-"
"indstillingerne, der er tilgængelige på brugergrupper, når *auth_timeout*-"
"modulet er installeret. Se :ref:`Session og inaktivitetstimeouts <general/"
"users/access_rights/timeouts>` for mere information."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:3
msgid "Access rights"
msgstr "Adgangsrettigheder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:5
msgid ""
"*Access rights* are permissions that determine the content and applications "
"users can access and edit. In Odoo, these permissions can be set for "
"individual users or for groups of users. Limiting permissions to only those "
"who need them ensures that users do not modify or delete anything they "
"should not have access to."
msgstr ""
"*Adgangsrettigheder* er tilladelser, der bestemmer, hvilket indhold og "
"hvilke applikationer brugere kan få adgang til og redigere. I Odoo kan disse "
"tilladelser indstilles for individuelle brugere eller for grupper af "
"brugere. Begrænsning af tilladelser til kun dem, der har brug for dem, "
"sikrer, at brugere ikke ændrer eller sletter noget, de ikke bør have adgang "
"til."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:10
msgid "**Only** an *administrator* can change access rights."
msgstr "**Kun** en *administrator* kan ændre adgangsrettigheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:13
msgid ""
"Making changes to access rights can have a detrimental impact on the "
"database. This includes *impotent admin*, which means that no user in the "
"database can make changes to the access rights. For this reason, Odoo "
"recommends contacting an Odoo Business Analyst, or our Support Team, before "
"making changes."
msgstr ""
"Ændring af adgangsrettigheder kan have en skadelig indvirkning på databasen. "
"Dette inkluderer *impotent admin*, hvilket betyder, at ingen bruger i "
"databasen kan foretage ændringer af adgangsrettighederne. Af denne grund "
"anbefaler Odoo at kontakte en Odoo Business Analyst eller vores supportteam, "
"før der foretages ændringer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:19
msgid ""
"A user **must** have the specific *Administration* access rights set on "
"their user profile, in order to make changes on another user's settings for "
"access rights."
msgstr ""
"En bruger **skal** have de specifikke *Administration* adgangsrettigheder "
"indstillet på deres brugerprofil for at kunne foretage ændringer af en anden "
"brugers indstillinger for adgangsrettigheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:22
msgid ""
"To access this setting, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Manage "
"users --> select a user --> Access Rights tab --> Administration section --> "
"Administration field`."
msgstr ""
"For at få adgang til denne indstilling skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger-app --> Administrer brugere --> vælg en "
"bruger --> fanen Adgangsrettigheder --> sektionen Administration --> feltet "
"Administration`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:25
msgid ""
"Once at the setting, an already existing administrator **must** change the "
"setting in the :guilabel:`Administration` field to :guilabel:`Access Rights`."
msgstr ""
"Når du er ved indstillingen, **skal** en eksisterende administrator ændre "
"indstillingen i feltet :guilabel:`Administration` "
"til :guilabel:`Adgangsrettigheder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:28
msgid ""
"Once complete, click :guilabel:`Save` to save the changes, and implement the "
"user as an administrator."
msgstr ""
"Når det er fuldført, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Gem` for at gemme "
"ændringerne og implementere brugeren som administrator."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:34
msgid "Manage roles"
msgstr "Håndter roller"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:36
msgid ""
":ref:`Individual users <users/add-individual>` are assigned a *Role* when "
"they are added to the database. Roles determine the level of access a user "
"has, while the specific access rights associated with each role are defined "
"by :ref:`groups <access-rights/groups>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Individuelle brugere <users/add-individual>` tildeles en *Rolle*, når "
"de tilføjes til databasen. Roller afgør brugerens adgangsniveau, mens de "
"specifikke adgangsrettigheder knyttet til hver rolle defineres af "
":ref:`grupper <access-rights/groups>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:40
msgid "The available internal roles are:"
msgstr "De tilgængelige interne roller er:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:42
msgid ""
"*User*: An internal user that typically has access to the back end and can "
"create and edit records but has less overall access than an administrator."
msgstr ""
"*Bruger*: En intern bruger, der typisk har adgang til backenden og kan "
"oprette og redigere poster, men har mindre samlet adgang end en "
"administrator."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:44
msgid ""
"*Administrator*: An internal user with access to technical features, product "
"creation, export, and other advanced permissions."
msgstr ""
"*Administrator*: En intern bruger med adgang til tekniske funktioner, "
"produktoprettelse, eksport og andre avancerede tilladelser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:46
msgid ""
"*Light*: A user with limited access to essential Odoo features. A light user "
"can be linked to an employee record to provide limited access to the "
"database, or can exist solely as an employee record without login access. "
"When login access is granted, light users can:"
msgstr ""
"*Light*: En bruger med begrænset adgang til vigtige Odoo-funktioner. En "
"light-bruger kan knyttes til en medarbejderpost for at give begrænset adgang "
"til databasen eller kan eksistere udelukkende som en medarbejderpost uden "
"loginadgang. Når der gives loginadgang, kan light-brugere:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:50
msgid "Manage personal and employee-related information."
msgstr "Administrere personlige og medarbejderrelaterede oplysninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:51
msgid "Submit leave and expense requests."
msgstr "Indsende fraværs- og udgiftsanmodninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:52
msgid "Access the **Planning** app and worksheets."
msgstr "Få adgang til appen **Planlægning** og arbejdssedler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:53
msgid "Connect to **Point of Sale** sessions as an employee."
msgstr "Oprette forbindelse til **Kassesystem**-sessioner som medarbejder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:54
msgid "Read **Knowledge** articles."
msgstr "Læse **Viden**-artikler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:55
msgid "Perform warehouse barcode scanning operations."
msgstr "Udføre stregkodescanning på lageret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:57
msgid ""
"Light users do not have access to core business applications such as "
"**Sales**, **Purchases**, **Projects**, or **Accounting**, or to advanced "
"features reserved for standard or custom users."
msgstr ""
"Light-brugere har ikke adgang til centrale forretningsapps som **Salg**, "
"**Indkøb**, **Projekt** eller **Regnskab** eller til avancerede funktioner "
"reserveret til standard- eller tilpassede brugere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:61
msgid ""
"A *Light* user is automatically upgraded to a *User* role if they are "
"granted access beyond their default reduced permissions. See `Pricing Page "
"<https://www.odoo.com/pricing>`_ for more details."
msgstr ""
"En *Light*-bruger opgraderes automatisk til en *Bruger*-rolle, hvis brugeren "
"tildeles adgang ud over sine reducerede standardtilladelser. Se `prissiden "
"<https://www.odoo.com/pricing>`_ for flere oplysninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:65
msgid "Portal users"
msgstr "Portalbrugere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:67
msgid ""
"The *Portal* role can be used for external users. It is assigned to a "
"customer or supplier who accesses their own data through the portal."
msgstr ""
"Rollen *Portal* kan bruges til eksterne brugere. Den tildeles en kunde eller "
"leverandør, der tilgår sine egne data via portalen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:70
msgid ""
"To grant portal access, navigate to the :menuselection:`Contacts` "
"application, and select a record. Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon, then select :guilabel:`Grant portal "
"access` from the drop-down."
msgstr ""
"For at give portaladgang skal du gå til appen :menuselection:`Kontakter` og "
"vælge en post. Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(lodret "
"ellipse)`, og vælg derefter :guilabel:`Giv portaladgang` i rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:77
msgid "Manage user permissions"
msgstr "Administrer brugertilladelser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:79
msgid ""
"The access rights for :ref:`individual users <users/add-individual>` are set "
"when the user is added to the database, but they can be adjusted at any "
"point in the user's profile."
msgstr ""
"Adgangsrettighederne for :ref:`individuelle brugere <users/add-individual>` "
"indstilles, når brugeren tilføjes til databasen, men de kan justeres når som "
"helst i brugerens profil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:82
msgid ""
"To make changes to a user's rights, click the desired user to edit their "
"profile."
msgstr ""
"For at foretage ændringer i en brugers rettigheder skal du klikke på den "
"ønskede bruger for at redigere deres profil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:84
msgid ""
"Users menu in the Users & Companies section of the Settings app of Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Brugermenuen i sektionen Brugere & virksomheder i Odoo's Indstillinger-app."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:87
msgid ""
"On the user's profile page, in the :guilabel:`Access Rights` tab, scroll "
"down to view the current permissions."
msgstr ""
"På brugerens profilside, i fanen :guilabel:`Adgangsrettigheder`, skal du "
"rulle ned for at se de aktuelle tilladelser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:90
msgid ""
"The permissions available on the *Access Rights* tab are determined by the "
"groups associated with the user's role. Roles provide a predefined set of "
"permissions, while groups define the specific access rights granted to users."
msgstr ""
"De tilgængelige tilladelser under fanen *Adgangsrettigheder* bestemmes af de "
"grupper, der er knyttet til brugerens rolle. Roller giver et foruddefineret "
"sæt af tilladelser, mens grupper definerer de specifikke adgangsrettigheder, "
"der tildeles brugere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:94
msgid ""
"For each app, use the drop-down menu to select what level of permission this "
"user should have. The options vary for each section, yet the most common "
"are: :guilabel:`Blank/None`, :guilabel:`User: Own "
"Documents`, :guilabel:`User: All Documents`, or :guilabel:`Administrator`."
msgstr ""
"For hver app skal du bruge rullemenuen til at vælge, hvilket "
"tilladelsesniveau denne bruger skal have. Mulighederne varierer for hver "
"sektion, men de mest almindelige er: :guilabel:`Tom/"
"Ingen`, :guilabel:`Bruger: Egne dokumenter`, :guilabel:`Bruger: Alle "
"dokumenter` eller :guilabel:`Administrator`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:98
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Administration` field in the :guilabel:`Access Rights` tab "
"has the following options: :guilabel:`Settings` or :guilabel:`Access Rights`."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Administration` i fanen :guilabel:`Adgangsrettigheder` har "
"følgende muligheder: :guilabel:`Indstillinger` "
"eller :guilabel:`Adgangsrettigheder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:101
msgid "The Sales apps drop-down menu to set the user's level of permissions."
msgstr "Salg-appens rullemenu til at indstille brugerens tilladelsesniveau."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:107
msgid "Manage specific permissions"
msgstr "Administrer specifikke tilladelser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:109
msgid ""
"While access rights are typically assigned in bundles under specific roles, "
"they can also be set as explicit permissions."
msgstr ""
"Mens adgangsrettigheder typisk tildeles i bundter under specifikke roller, "
"kan de også indstilles som eksplicitte tilladelser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:113
msgid ""
"When a user is assigned the :guilabel:`Administrator` permission for "
"**Timesheets**, it gives them full access to that app. That user, while "
"holding full access, can *still* have their ability to manage *their own* "
"timesheets restricted — such as in the case of a salaried payroll "
"administrator who does not need to track time."
msgstr ""
"Når en bruger tildeles :guilabel:`Administrator`-tilladelsen for "
"**Timesedler**, giver det dem fuld adgang til den app. Denne bruger kan, "
"mens de har fuld adgang, *stadig* få deres mulighed for at administrere "
"*deres egne* timesedler begrænset — som i tilfældet med en lønnet "
"lønningsadministrator, der ikke behøver at spore tid."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:118
msgid ""
"To manage specific permissions, :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` must "
"be enabled."
msgstr ""
"For at administrere specifikke tilladelser skal :ref:`udviklertilstand "
"<developer-mode>` være aktiveret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:120
msgid ""
"After that, navigate to the :menuselection:`Settings` app. Then "
"click :guilabel:`Manage Users`, select a user, and go to "
"the :guilabel:`Technical Access Rights` tab. From here, :guilabel:`Groups` "
"can be edited, and specific access rights can be managed across the various "
"sections. If no changes are made to these groups, then their permissions "
"will mirror the selections made in the :guilabel:`Access Rights` tab."
msgstr ""
"Derefter skal du navigere til :menuselection:`Indstillinger`-appen. Klik "
"derefter på :guilabel:`Administrer brugere`, vælg en bruger og gå til "
"fanen :guilabel:`Tekniske adgangsrettigheder`. Herfra "
"kan :guilabel:`Grupper` redigeres, og specifikke adgangsrettigheder kan "
"administreres på tværs af de forskellige sektioner. Hvis der ikke foretages "
"ændringer i disse grupper, vil deres tilladelser afspejle de valg, der er "
"foretaget i fanen :guilabel:`Adgangsrettigheder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Selected groups`: a list of detailed access rights, set by "
"choices made in the :guilabel:`Access Rights` tab."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valgte grupper`: en liste over detaljerede adgangsrettigheder, "
"indstillet af valg foretaget i fanen :guilabel:`Adgangsrettigheder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Groups added automatically`: *implied* permissions that are "
"*inherited* with the explicit permissions already granted to the user. The "
"values here will match the values listed under a given *Group*'s form "
"located under the :menuselection:`Users & Companies --> Groups` menu, in "
"the :guilabel:`Inherited` tab."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Grupper tilføjet automatisk`: *implicitte* tilladelser, der er "
"*nedarvet* med de eksplicitte tilladelser, som allerede er tildelt brugeren. "
"Værdierne her vil matche værdierne anført under en given *Gruppes* formular "
"placeret under menuen :menuselection:`Brugere & virksomheder --> Grupper`, i "
"fanen :guilabel:`Nedarvet`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:133
msgid "The technical access rights tab opened up for a user profile."
msgstr "Fanen tekniske adgangsrettigheder åbnet for en brugerprofil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:137
msgid ""
"When the *Sales Administrator* permission set is assigned to a user, the "
"*Canned Responses Administrator* permissions are inherited automatically. "
"These assignments are reflected across the values listed in "
"the :guilabel:`Selected Groups` and :guilabel:`Groups added automatically` "
"tables, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Når tilladelsessættet *Sales Administrator* tildeles en bruger, arves "
"tilladelserne *Canned Responses Administrator* automatisk. Disse tildelinger "
"afspejles på tværs af værdierne vist i henholdsvis "
"tabellerne :guilabel:`Valgte grupper` og :guilabel:`Grupper tilføjet "
"automatisk`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:142
msgid ""
"To add a permission to this user profile, click :guilabel:`Add a line` in "
"the :guilabel:`Selected groups` table, and then add permissions to this user "
"profile. To remove a permission, click the :icon:`fa-"
"times` :guilabel:`(cancel)` icon at the end of that permission's row."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje en tilladelse til denne brugerprofil skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj en linje` i tabellen :guilabel:`Valgte grupper` og "
"derefter tilføje tilladelser til denne brugerprofil. For at fjerne en "
"tilladelse skal du klikke på :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(annuller)`-ikonet "
"i slutningen af tilladelsens række."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:147
msgid ""
"Removing permissions from the :guilabel:`Selected Groups` list can impact "
"what permissions are listed in the :guilabel:`Groups added automatically` "
"list, since selected permission groups inform what permission groups are "
"added automatically."
msgstr ""
"Fjernelse af tilladelser fra listen :guilabel:`Valgte grupper` kan påvirke, "
"hvilke tilladelser der er anført i listen :guilabel:`Grupper tilføjet "
"automatisk`, da valgte tilladelsesgrupper informerer om, hvilke "
"tilladelsesgrupper der tilføjes automatisk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:151
msgid ""
"Clicking on the permission itself will open a group management form. Learn "
"more about :ref:`managing groups <access-rights/groups>`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknutím na samotné oprávnění se otevře formulář pro správu skupin. Další "
"informace o :ref:`správě skupin <access-rights/groups>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:154
msgid ""
"Any permission in the :guilabel:`Groups added automatically` section is "
"implied or required by the permission shown in the :guilabel:`Selected "
"groups` section. These cannot be removed, but more users can be given these "
"permissions by clicking on the permission itself, and then adding the user "
"to that permission's group."
msgstr ""
"Enhver tilladelse i sektionen :guilabel:`Grupper tilføjet automatisk` er "
"impliceret eller krævet af tilladelsen vist i sektionen :guilabel:`Valgte "
"grupper`. Disse kan ikke fjernes, men flere brugere kan få disse tilladelser "
"ved at klikke på selve tilladelsen og derefter tilføje brugeren til "
"tilladelsens gruppe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:160
msgid ""
"Any permission in green is already provided by another permission (for "
"example, setting the :guilabel:`Website` app's permission "
"to :guilabel:`Editor and Designer` will also give that user "
"the :guilabel:`Restricted Editor` permission)."
msgstr ""
"Jakékoli oprávnění označené zeleně je již poskytováno jiným oprávněním "
"(například nastavení oprávnění aplikace :guilabel:`Hjemmeside` "
"na :guilabel:`Editor and Designer` dá danému uživateli také "
"oprávnění :guilabel:`Restricted Editor`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:163
msgid ""
"Any permissions in red are conflicting and cannot be active at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Jakákoli oprávnění označená červeně jsou konfliktní a nemohou být aktivní "
"současně."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:164
msgid ""
"Any permissions in *italics* are implied by a :guilabel:`Selected group` "
"(these are usually found in the :guilabel:`Groups added automatically`)."
msgstr ""
"Alle tilladelser i *kursiv* er impliceret af en :guilabel:`Valgt gruppe` "
"(disse findes normalt i :guilabel:`Grupper tilføjet automatisk`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:170
msgid "Create and modify groups"
msgstr "Vytvářet a upravovat skupiny"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:172
msgid ""
"*Groups* are app-specific sets of permissions that are used to manage common "
"access rights for a large amount of users. Administrators can modify the "
"existing groups in Odoo, or create new ones to define rules for models "
"within an application."
msgstr ""
"*Skupiny* jsou sady oprávnění specifických pro aplikace, které se používají "
"ke správě běžných přístupových práv pro velké množství uživatelů. "
"Administrátoři mohou upravovat existující skupiny v Odoo nebo vytvářet nové "
"k definování pravidel pro modely v rámci aplikace."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:176
msgid ""
"To access groups, first activate Odoo's :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>`, then go to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users & Companies --> "
"Groups`."
msgstr ""
"Pro přístup ke skupinám nejprve aktivujte :ref:`režim pro vývojáře "
"<developer-mode>` v Odoo a poté přejděte na :menuselection:`Settings app --> "
"Users & Companies --> Groups`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:179
msgid ""
"Groups menu in the Users & Companies section of the Settings app of Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Menu Skupiny v sekci Uživatelé a společnosti v aplikaci Nastavení systému "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:182
msgid ""
"To create a new group from the :guilabel:`Groups` page, "
"click :guilabel:`Create`. Then, from the blank group form, select "
"an :guilabel:`Application`, and complete the group form (detailed below)."
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li vytvořit novou skupinu na stránce :guilabel:`Groups`, klikněte "
"na :guilabel:`Create`. Poté z prázdného formuláře skupiny "
"vyberte :guilabel:`Application` a vyplňte formulář skupiny (podrobně níže)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:185
msgid ""
"To modify an existing group, click an existing group from the list displayed "
"on the :guilabel:`Groups` page, and edit the contents of the form."
msgstr ""
"For at ændre en eksisterende gruppe skal du klikke på en eksisterende gruppe "
"fra listen vist på siden :guilabel:`Grupper` og redigere indholdet af "
"formularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:188
msgid ""
"Enter a :guilabel:`Name` for the group and select the checkbox next "
"to :guilabel:`Share Group`, if this group was created to set access rights "
"for sharing data with some users."
msgstr ""
"Indtast et :guilabel:`Navn` til gruppen, og markér afkrydsningsfeltet ud for "
":guilabel:`Delingsgruppe`, hvis denne gruppe blev oprettet til at fastsætte "
"adgangsrettigheder til deling af data med visse brugere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:192
msgid ""
"Always test the settings being changed to ensure they are being applied to "
"the correct users."
msgstr ""
"Vždy otestujte měněná nastavení, abyste se ujistili, že jsou aplikována na "
"správné uživatele."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:194
msgid ""
"The group form contains multiple tabs for managing all elements of the "
"group. In each tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add a new row for users "
"or rules, and click the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(cancel)` icon to remove "
"a row."
msgstr ""
"Formulář skupiny obsahuje několik záložek pro správu všech prvků skupiny. V "
"každé záložce klikněte na :guilabel:`Add a line` pro přidání nového řádku "
"pro uživatele nebo pravidla a klikněte na ikonu :icon:`fa-"
"times` :guilabel:`(cancel)` pro odstranění řádku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:198
msgid "Tabs in the Groups form to modify the settings of the group."
msgstr "Záložky ve formuláři Skupiny pro úpravu nastavení skupiny."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:201
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Users` tab: lists the current users in the group. Users listed in "
"black have administrative rights. Users without administrative access appear "
"in blue. Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add users to this group."
msgstr ""
"Záložka :guilabel:`Users`: uvádí aktuální uživatele ve skupině. Uživatelé "
"uvedení černě mají administrátorská práva. Uživatelé bez administrátorského "
"přístupu jsou zobrazeni modře. Klikněte na :guilabel:`Add a line` pro "
"přidání uživatelů do této skupiny."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:204
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Inherited` tab: Inherited means that users added to this group "
"are automatically added to the groups listed on this tab. "
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add inherited groups."
msgstr ""
"Záložka :guilabel:`Inherited`: Zděděné znamená, že uživatelé přidaní do této "
"skupiny jsou automaticky přidáni do skupin uvedených na této záložce. "
"Klikněte na :guilabel:`Add a line` pro přidání zděděných skupin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:208
msgid ""
"For example, if the group *Sales/Administrator* lists the group *Website/"
"Restricted Editor* in its :guilabel:`Inherited` tab, then any users added to "
"the *Sales/Administrator* group automatically receive access to the *Website/"
"Restricted Editor* group, as well."
msgstr ""
"Například pokud skupina *Sales/Administrator* uvádí skupinu *Website/"
"Restricted Editor* ve své záložce :guilabel:`Inherited`, pak všichni "
"uživatelé přidaní do skupiny *Sales/Administrator* automaticky získají "
"přístup také ke skupině *Website/Restricted Editor*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Menus` tab: defines which models the group can have access to. "
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add a specific menu."
msgstr ""
"Záložka :guilabel:`Menus`: definuje, ke kterým modelům může mít skupina "
"přístup. Klikněte na :guilabel:`Add a line` pro přidání konkrétního menu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Views` tab: lists which views in Odoo the group has access to. "
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add a view to the group."
msgstr ""
"Záložka :guilabel:`Views`: uvádí, ke kterým zobrazením v Odoo má skupina "
"přístup. Klikněte na :guilabel:`Add a line` pro přidání zobrazení do skupiny."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:216
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Access Rights` tab: lists the first level of rights (models) that "
"this group has. The :guilabel:`Name` column represents the name for the "
"current group's access to the model selected in the :guilabel:`Model` column."
msgstr ""
"Záložka :guilabel:`Access Rights`: uvádí první úroveň práv (modely), které "
"tato skupina má. Sloupec :guilabel:`Name` představuje název pro přístup "
"aktuální skupiny k modelu vybranému ve sloupci :guilabel:`Model`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:220
msgid ""
"To link a new access right to a group, click :guilabel:`Add a line`. Select "
"the appropriate model from the :guilabel:`Model` drop-down, then enter a "
"name for the access right in the :guilabel:`Name` column. For each model, "
"enable the following options as appropriate:"
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li propojit nové přístupové právo se skupinou, klikněte "
"na :guilabel:`Add a line`. Vyberte příslušný model z rozbalovací "
"nabídky :guilabel:`Model` a poté zadejte název přístupového práva do "
"sloupce :guilabel:`Name`. Pro každý model povolte následující možnosti podle "
"potřeby:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:224
msgid ":guilabel:`Read`: Users can see the object's existing values."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Read`: Uživatelé mohou zobrazit existující hodnoty objektu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:225
msgid ":guilabel:`Write`: Users can edit the object's existing values."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Skriv`: Brugere kan redigere objektets eksisterende værdier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:226
msgid ":guilabel:`Create`: Users can create new values for the object."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Opret`: Brugere kan oprette nye værdier for objektet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:227
msgid ":guilabel:`Delete`: Users can delete values for the object."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Slet`: Brugere kan slette værdier for objektet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:230
msgid ""
"While there are no conventions for naming access rights, it is advisable to "
"choose a name that identifies its purpose."
msgstr ""
"Selvom der ikke er konventioner for navngivning af adgangsrettigheder, er "
"det tilrådeligt at vælge et navn, der identificerer formålet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:233
msgid ""
"For example, the access that purchase managers have to "
"the :guilabel:`Contact` model could be named `res.partner.purchase.manager`. "
"This consists of the technical name of the model, followed by a name "
"identifying the group of users in question."
msgstr ""
"For eksempel kunne den adgang, som indkøbschefer har til "
"modellen :guilabel:`Kontakt`, navngives `res.partner.purchase.manager`. "
"Dette består af modellens tekniske navn efterfulgt af et navn, der "
"identificerer den pågældende brugergruppe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:237
msgid "Name of access rights to a model."
msgstr "Navn på adgangsrettigheder til en model."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:240
msgid ""
"To find the model's technical name from the current view, first enter a "
"placeholder text in the :guilabel:`Name` field, then click "
"the :guilabel:`Model` name, then the :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` icon."
msgstr ""
"For at finde modellens tekniske navn fra den aktuelle visning skal du først "
"indtaste en pladsholdertekst i feltet :guilabel:`Navn`, derefter klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Model`-navnet og derefter på ikonet :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`(Internt link)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:244
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Record Rules`: lists the second layer of editing and visibility "
"rights. :guilabel:`Record Rules` overwrite, or refine, the group's access "
"rights. Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add a record rule to this group. For "
"each rule, choose values for the following options:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Postreglen`: viser det andet lag af redigerings- og "
"synlighedsrettigheder. :guilabel:`Postregler` overskriver eller forfiner "
"gruppens adgangsrettigheder. Klik på :guilabel:`Tilføj en linje` for at "
"tilføje en postregel til denne gruppe. For hver regel skal du vælge værdier "
"for følgende muligheder:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:248
msgid ":guilabel:`Apply for Read`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Anvend til læsning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:249
msgid ":guilabel:`Apply for Write`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Anvend til skrivning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:250
msgid ":guilabel:`Apply for Create`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Anvend til oprettelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:251
msgid ":guilabel:`Apply for Delete`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Anvend til sletning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:254
msgid ""
"Record rules are written using a *domain*, or conditions that filter data. A "
"domain expression is a list of such conditions. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Postregler skrives ved hjælp af et *domæne* eller betingelser, der filtrerer "
"data. Et domæneudtryk er en liste over sådanne betingelser. For eksempel:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:257
msgid ""
"`[('mrp_production_ids', 'in', "
"user.partner_id.commercial_partner_id.production_ids.ids)]`"
msgstr ""
"`[('mrp_production_ids', 'in', "
"user.partner_id.commercial_partner_id.production_ids.ids)]`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:259
msgid ""
"This record rule is to enable MRP consumption warnings for subcontractors."
msgstr ""
"Denne postregel skal aktivere MRP-forbrugsadvarsler for underleverandører."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:261
msgid ""
"Odoo has a library of preconfigured record rules for ease of use. Users "
"without knowledge of domains (and domain expressions) should consult an Odoo "
"Business Analyst, or the Odoo Support Team, before making changes."
msgstr ""
"Odoo har et bibliotek af prækonfigurerede postregler for at lette brugen. "
"Brugere uden kendskab til domæner (og domæneudtryk) bør konsultere en Odoo "
"Business Analyst eller Odoo Support Team, før de foretager ændringer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:268
msgid "Session and inactivity timeouts"
msgstr "Session og inaktivitetstimeouts"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:270
msgid ""
"When the `auth_timeout` module is installed, administrators can configure "
"automatic logout rules for users assigned to a specific user group. This "
"module may be installed automatically by certain localizations (for example, "
"the Australian Payroll localization)."
msgstr ""
"Når `auth_timeout`-modulet er installeret, kan administratorer konfigurere "
"automatiske logud-regler for brugere tildelt en specifik brugergruppe. Dette "
"modul kan installeres automatisk af visse lokaliseringer (for eksempel den "
"australske lønlokalisering)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:274
msgid ""
"Once installed, a *Timeouts* tab appears on user group forms. This tab "
"allows administrators to define how long users can remain logged in under "
"different conditions."
msgstr ""
"Når det er installeret, vises en *Timeouts*-fane på brugergruppeformularer. "
"Denne fane giver administratorer mulighed for at definere, hvor længe "
"brugere kan forblive logget ind under forskellige forhold."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:277
msgid "Two types of timeouts can be configured:"
msgstr "To typer af timeouts kan konfigureres:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:280
msgid "Inactivity timeout"
msgstr "Inaktivitetstimeout"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:282
msgid ""
"*Inactivity timeout* controls whether users are automatically logged out "
"after a period of inactivity."
msgstr ""
"*Inaktivitetstimeout* kontrollerer, om brugere automatisk logges ud efter en "
"periode med inaktivitet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:285
msgid ""
"To enable inactivity timeout, click the *Timeouts* tab and select "
"the :guilabel:`Inactivity` checkbox. Next, choose either :guilabel:`Screen "
"lock` or :guilabel:`Screen lock with two-factor authentication` from the "
"drop-down menu. This determines whether the user must complete 2FA "
"verification when logging back in."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere inaktivitetstimeout skal du klikke på fanen *Timeouts* og "
"markere afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Inaktivitet`. Vælg derefter "
"enten :guilabel:`Skærmlås` eller :guilabel:`Skærmlås med "
"tofaktorgodkendelse` fra rullemenuen. Dette afgør, om brugeren skal "
"gennemføre 2FA-bekræftelse, når vedkommende logger ind igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:290
msgid ""
"Then, enter the desired amount of time before enforcing screen lock, and "
"select a unit of measure from the drop-down menu. Inactivity can be measured "
"in minutes, hours, or days."
msgstr ""
"Indtast derefter den ønskede tid, før skærmlås håndhæves, og vælg en "
"måleenhed fra rullemenuen. Inaktivitet kan måles i minutter, timer eller "
"dage."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:294
msgid "Session timeout"
msgstr "Sessionstimeout"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:296
msgid ""
"*Session timeout* controls whether users are logged out after a fixed "
"session duration, regardless of activity."
msgstr ""
"*Timeout for session* styrer, om brugere logges ud efter en fast "
"sessionvarighed, uanset aktivitet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:299
msgid ""
"To enable session timeout, click on the *Timeouts* tab, and select "
"the :guilabel:`Session` checkbox. Next, choose either :guilabel:`Logout` "
"or :guilabel:`Logout with two-factor authentication` from the drop-down "
"menu. This determines whether the user must complete 2FA verification when "
"logging back in."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere sessions-timeout skal du klikke på fanen *Timeouts* og "
"markere afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Session`. Vælg derefter enten "
":guilabel:`Log ud` eller :guilabel:`Log ud med totrinsgodkendelse` fra "
"rullemenuen. Dette afgør, om brugeren skal gennemføre 2FA-bekræftelse ved "
"fornyet login."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:304
msgid ""
"Then, enter the desired amount of time before the user is logged out, and "
"select a unit of measure from the drop-down menu. Session timeouts can be "
"measured in minutes, hours, or days."
msgstr ""
"Angiv derefter den ønskede tid, før brugeren logges ud, og vælg en måleenhed "
"fra rullemenuen. Session timeouts kan måles i minutter, timer eller dage."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:310
msgid "Superuser mode"
msgstr "Superbrugertilstand"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:312
msgid ""
"*Superuser mode* allows the user to bypass record rules and access rights. "
"To activate *Superuser mode*, first, activate :ref:`developer mode "
"<developer-mode>`. Then, navigate to the *debug* menu, represented by "
"a :icon:`fa-bug` :guilabel:`(debug)` icon, located in the top banner."
msgstr ""
"*Superbrugertilstand* giver brugeren mulighed for at omgå postregler og "
"adgangsrettigheder. For at aktivere *superbrugertilstand* skal du først "
"aktivere :ref:`udviklertilstand <developer-mode>`. Naviger derefter til "
"*fejlretnings*menuen, repræsenteret af et :icon:`fa-"
"bug` :guilabel:`(fejlretning)`-ikon, der findes i topbanneret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:316
msgid ""
"Finally, towards the bottom of the menu, click :guilabel:`Become Superuser`."
msgstr "Klik til sidst nederst i menuen på :guilabel:`Bliv superbruger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:319
msgid ""
"Only users with *Settings* access for the *Administration* section of the "
"*Access Rights* (in their user profile) are allowed to log in to *Superuser "
"mode*."
msgstr ""
"Kun brugere med *Indstillinger*-adgang til *Administration*-sektionen af "
"*Adgangsrettigheder* (i deres brugerprofil) har tilladelse til at logge ind "
"i *superbrugertilstand*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:323
msgid ""
"*Superuser mode* allows for circumvention of record rules and access rights, "
"and therefore, should be exercised with extreme caution."
msgstr ""
"*Superuser-tilstand* giver mulighed for at omgå registreringsregler og "
"adgangsrettigheder og bør derfor bruges med ekstrem forsigtighed."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:326
msgid ""
"Upon exiting *Superuser mode*, users may be locked out of the database, due "
"to changes that were made. This can cause *impotent admin*, or an "
"administrator without the ability to change access rights/settings."
msgstr ""
"Ved afslutning af *Superuser-tilstand* kan brugere blive låst ude af "
"databasen på grund af ændringer, der er foretaget. Dette kan forårsage "
"*impotent admin*, eller en administrator uden mulighed for at ændre "
"adgangsrettigheder/indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:330
msgid ""
"In this case contact Odoo Support here: `new help ticket <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_. The support team is able to restore access using a "
"support login."
msgstr ""
"I dette tilfælde skal du kontakte Odoo Support her: `ny support-ticket "
"<https://www.odoo.com/help>`_. Supportteamet kan gendanne adgangen ved hjælp "
"af et support-login."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:333
msgid ""
"To leave *Superuser mode*, log out of the account, by navigating to the "
"upper-right corner, and clicking on the :guilabel:`OdooBot` username. Then, "
"select the :guilabel:`Log out` option."
msgstr ""
"For at forlade *Superuser-tilstand* skal du logge ud af kontoen ved at "
"navigere til øverste højre hjørne og klikke på "
"brugernavnet :guilabel:`OdooBot`. Vælg derefter muligheden :guilabel:`Log "
"ud`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:337
msgid ""
"An alternative way to activate *Superuser mode* is to log in as a superuser. "
"To do that, navigate to the login screen, and enter the "
"appropriate :guilabel:`Email` and :guilabel:`Password`."
msgstr ""
"En alternativ måde at aktivere *Superuser-tilstand* er at logge ind som "
"superbruger. For at gøre det skal du navigere til login-skærmen og indtaste "
"den relevante :guilabel:`Email` og :guilabel:`Password`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/access_rights.rst:340
msgid ""
"Instead of clicking :guilabel:`Login`, click :guilabel:`Log in as superuser`."
msgstr ""
"I stedet for at klikke på :guilabel:`Login` skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Log "
"ind som superuser`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:3
msgid "Microsoft Azure sign-in authentication"
msgstr "Microsoft Azure sign-in-godkendelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Microsoft Azure OAuth sign-in authentication is a useful function that "
"allows Odoo users to sign in to their database with their Microsoft Azure "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Azure OAuth sign-in-godkendelsen er en nyttig funktion, der giver "
"Odoo-brugere mulighed for at logge ind på deres database med deres Microsoft "
"Azure-konto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:8
msgid ""
"This is particularly helpful if the organization uses Azure Workspace, and "
"wants employees within the organization to connect to Odoo using their "
"Microsoft Accounts."
msgstr ""
"Dette er særligt nyttigt, hvis organisationen bruger Azure Workspace og "
"ønsker, at medarbejdere i organisationen kan oprette forbindelse til Odoo "
"ved hjælp af deres Microsoft-konti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:12
msgid ""
"Databases hosted on Odoo.com should not use OAuth login for the owner or "
"administrator of the database as it would unlink the database from their "
"Odoo.com account. If OAuth is set up for that user, the database will no "
"longer be able to be duplicated, renamed, or otherwise managed from the "
"Odoo.com portal."
msgstr ""
"Databaser hostet på Odoo.com bør ikke bruge OAuth-login til ejeren eller "
"administratoren af databasen, da det ville afbryde forbindelsen mellem "
"databasen og deres Odoo.com-konto. Hvis OAuth er konfigureret til denne "
"bruger, vil databasen ikke længere kunne duplikeres, omdøbes eller på anden "
"måde administreres fra Odoo.com-portalen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:18
msgid ":doc:`../../productivity/calendar/outlook`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../productivity/calendar/outlook`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:19
msgid ":doc:`../email_communication/azure_oauth`"
msgstr ":doc:`../email_communication/azure_oauth`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:24
msgid ""
"Integrating the Microsoft sign-in function requires configuration on "
"Microsoft and Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Integration af Microsoft sign-in-funktionen kræver konfiguration på både "
"Microsoft og Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:27
msgid "Odoo System Parameter"
msgstr "Odoo-systemparameter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:29
msgid ""
"First activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, and then go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> System Parameters`."
msgstr ""
"Aktiver først :ref:`udviklertilstand <developer-mode>`, og gå derefter "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> Teknisk --> Systemparametre`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:32
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` and in the blank row that appears, add the following "
"system parameter `auth_oauth.authorization_header` to the :guilabel:`Key` "
"field, and set the :guilabel:`Value` to `1`. Then click :guilabel:`Save` to "
"finish."
msgstr ""
"Klikněte na :guilabel:`Nový` a na prázdný řádek, který se objeví, přidejte "
"následující systémový parametr `auth_oauth.authorization_header` do "
"pole :guilabel:`Klíč` a nastavte :guilabel:`Hodnota` na `1`. Poté klikněte "
"na :guilabel:`Uložit`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:37
msgid "Microsoft Azure dashboard"
msgstr "Microsoft Azure-dashboard"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:42
msgid ""
"Now that the system parameters in Odoo have been set up, it's time to create "
"a corresponding application inside of Microsoft Azure. To get started "
"creating the new application, go to `Microsoft's Azure Portal <https://"
"portal.azure.com/>`_. Log in with the :guilabel:`Microsoft Outlook Office "
"365` account if there is one, otherwise, log in with a "
"personal :guilabel:`Microsoft account`."
msgstr ""
"Nu hvor systemparametrene i Odoo er blevet konfigureret, er det tid til at "
"oprette en tilsvarende applikation i Microsoft Azure. For at komme i gang "
"med at oprette den nye applikation skal du gå til `Microsofts Azure Portal "
"<https://portal.azure.com/>`_. Log ind med :guilabel:`Microsoft Outlook "
"Office 365`-kontoen, hvis der er en, ellers log ind med en "
"personlig :guilabel:`Microsoft-konto`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:49
msgid ""
"A user with administrative access to the *Azure Settings* must connect and "
"perform the following configuration steps below."
msgstr ""
"En bruger med administrativ adgang til *Azure Settings* skal oprette "
"forbindelse og udføre følgende konfigurationstrin nedenfor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:52
msgid ""
"Next, navigate to the section labeled :guilabel:`Manage Microsoft Entra ID` "
"(formally *Azure Active Directory*). The location of this link is usually in "
"the center of the page."
msgstr ""
"Naviger derefter til sektionen mærket :guilabel:`Administrer Microsoft Entra "
"ID` (tidligere *Azure Active Directory*). Placeringen af dette link er "
"normalt i midten af siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:55
msgid ""
"Now, click on the :guilabel:`Add (+)` icon, located in the top menu, and "
"then select :guilabel:`App registration` from the drop-down menu. On "
"the :guilabel:`Register an application` screen, rename the :guilabel:`Name` "
"field to `Odoo Login OAuth` or a similarly recognizable title. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Supported account types` section select the option "
"for :guilabel:`Accounts in this organizational directory only (Default "
"Directory only - Single tenant)`."
msgstr ""
"Klik nu på ikonet :guilabel:`Tilføj (+)` i øverste menu, og vælg "
"derefter :guilabel:`App-registrering` fra rullemenuen. På "
"skærmen :guilabel:`Registrer en applikation` skal du omdøbe "
"feltet :guilabel:`Navn` til `Odoo Login OAuth` eller en lignende genkendelig "
"titel. Under sektionen :guilabel:`Understøttede kontotyper` skal du vælge "
"muligheden :guilabel:`Konti kun i denne organisationsmappe (kun "
"standardmappe - enkelt lejer)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:62
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Supported account types` can vary by Microsoft account type "
"and end use of the OAuth. For example: Is the login meant for internal users "
"within one organization or is it meant for customer portal access? The above "
"configuration is used for internal users in an organization."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Understøttede kontotyper` kan variere afhængigt af Microsoft-"
"kontotype og slutbrug af OAuth. For eksempel: Er login'et beregnet til "
"interne brugere i én organisation, eller er det beregnet til "
"kundeportaladgang? Ovenstående konfiguration bruges til interne brugere i en "
"organisation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:67
msgid ""
"Choose :guilabel:`Personal Microsoft accounts only` if the target audience "
"is meant for portal users. Choose :guilabel:`Accounts in this organizational "
"directory only (Default Directory only - Single tenant)` if the target "
"audience is company users."
msgstr ""
"Vælg :guilabel:`Kun personlige Microsoft-konti`, hvis målgruppen er beregnet "
"til portalbrugere. Vælg :guilabel:`Konti kun i denne organisationsmappe (Kun "
"standardmappe - Enkelt lejer)`, hvis målgruppen er virksomhedsbrugere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:71
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Redirect URL` section, select :guilabel:`Web` as the "
"platform, and then input `https://<odoo base url>/auth_oauth/signin` in "
"the :guilabel:`URL` field. The Odoo base :abbr:`URL (Uniform Resource "
"Locator)` is the canonical domain at which your Odoo instance can be reached "
"(e.g. *mydatabase.odoo.com* if you are hosted on Odoo.com) in "
"the :guilabel:`URL` field. Then, click :guilabel:`Register`, and the "
"application is created."
msgstr ""
"Under afsnittet :guilabel:`Omdirigerings-URL` skal du vælge :guilabel:`Web` "
"som platform og derefter indtaste `https://<odoo base url>/auth_oauth/"
"signin` i feltet :guilabel:`URL`. Odoo-base-:abbr:`URL'en (Uniform Resource "
"Locator)` er det kanoniske domæne, som din Odoo-instans kan nås på (f.eks. "
"*mindatabase.odoo.com*, hvis du hostes på Odoo.com) i "
"feltet :guilabel:`URL`. Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Registrer`, og "
"applikationen oprettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:78
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Godkendelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:80
msgid ""
"Edit the new app's authentication by clicking on "
"the :guilabel:`Authentication` menu item in the left menu after being "
"redirected to the application's settings from the previous step."
msgstr ""
"Rediger den nye apps godkendelse ved at klikke på "
"menupunktet :guilabel:`Godkendelse` i venstre menu efter omdirigering til "
"applikationens indstillinger fra forrige trin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:83
msgid ""
"Next, the type of *tokens* needed for the OAuth authentication will be "
"chosen. These are not currency tokens but rather authentication tokens that "
"are passed between Microsoft and Odoo. Therefore, there is no cost for these "
"tokens; they are used merely for authentication purposes between "
"two :abbr:`APIs (application programming interfaces)`. Select the tokens "
"that should be issued by the authorization endpoint by scrolling down the "
"screen and check the boxes labeled: :guilabel:`Access tokens (used for "
"implicit flows)` and :guilabel:`ID tokens (used for implicit and hybrid "
"flows)`."
msgstr ""
"Dernæst vælges den type *tokens*, der er nødvendig til OAuth-godkendelse. "
"Disse er ikke valutatokens, men snarere godkendelsestokens, der udveksles "
"mellem Microsoft og Odoo. Derfor er der ingen omkostninger for disse tokens; "
"de bruges udelukkende til godkendelsesformål mellem to :abbr:`API'er "
"(applikationsprogrammeringsgrænseflader)`. Vælg de tokens, der skal udstedes "
"af godkendelsesendepunktet ved at scrolle ned på skærmen og markere "
"afkrydsningsfelterne mærket: :guilabel:`Adgangstokens (bruges til implicitte "
"flow)` og :guilabel:`ID-tokens (bruges til implicitte og hybride flow)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:91
msgid "Authentication settings and endpoint tokens."
msgstr "Godkendelsesindstillinger og endepunktstokens."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:94
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save` to ensure these settings are saved."
msgstr "Klik på :guilabel:`Gem` for at sikre, at disse indstillinger gemmes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:97
msgid "Gather credentials"
msgstr "Indsaml legitimationsoplysninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:99
msgid ""
"With the application created and authenticated in the Microsoft Azure "
"console, credentials will be gathered next. To do so, click on "
"the :guilabel:`Overview` menu item in the left-hand column. Select and copy "
"the :guilabel:`Application (client) ID` in the window that appears. Paste "
"this credential to a clipboard / notepad, as this credential will be used in "
"the Odoo configuration later."
msgstr ""
"Med applikationen oprettet og godkendt i Microsoft Azure-konsollen indsamles "
"legitimationsoplysninger nu. Klik på menupunktet :guilabel:`Oversigt` i "
"venstre kolonne. Vælg og kopier :guilabel:`Applikations-id (klient-id)` i "
"vinduet, der vises. Indsæt denne legitimationsoplysning i en udklipsholder/"
"notesblok, da denne legitimationsoplysning bruges i Odoo-konfigurationen "
"senere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:104
msgid ""
"After finishing this step, click on :guilabel:`Endpoints` on the top menu "
"and click the *copy icon* next to :guilabel:`OAuth 2.0 authorization "
"endpoint (v2)` field. Paste this value in the clipboard / notepad."
msgstr ""
"Når dette trin er afsluttet, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Endepunkter` i "
"topmenuen og klikke på *kopiikonet* ved siden af feltet :guilabel:`OAuth 2.0-"
"godkendelsesendepunkt (v2)`. Indsæt denne værdi i udklipsholderen/"
"notesblokken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:108
msgid "Application ID and OAuth 2.0 authorization endpoint (v2) credentials."
msgstr ""
"Applikations-id og OAuth 2.0-godkendelsesendepunkt (v2) "
"legitimationsoplysninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:114
msgid ""
"Odoo needs permission to read the signed-in user's profile information from "
"Microsoft Graph during the OAuth flow. At minimum, ensure the delegated "
"permission :guilabel:`User.Read` is granted on the Azure app registration. "
"Otherwise, the login process may fail or be unable to correctly link the "
"Microsoft account to the Odoo user."
msgstr ""
"Odoo potřebuje oprávnění ke čtení informací o profilu přihlášeného uživatele "
"z Microsoft Graph během toku OAuth. Minimálně zajistěte, aby byla v "
"registraci aplikace Azure udělena delegovaná "
"oprávnění :guilabel:`User.Read`. Jinak může proces přihlášení selhat nebo "
"nebude moci správně propojit účet Microsoft s uživatelem Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`User.Read` is often added by default for new app registrations, "
"but it should be explicitly verified here."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`User.Read` je často přidáno standardně pro nové registrace "
"aplikací, ale mělo by být zde explicitně ověřeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:123
msgid ""
"To configure this, click on the :guilabel:`Manage` menu item in the left-"
"hand column, then:"
msgstr ""
"Pro konfiguraci klikněte na položku nabídky :guilabel:`Spravovat` v levém "
"sloupci a poté:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:125
msgid "Click :guilabel:`API permissions` in the left menu."
msgstr "Klikněte na :guilabel:`Oprávnění API` v levé nabídce."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:126
msgid "Click :guilabel:`(+) Add a Permission`."
msgstr "Klikněte na :guilabel:`(+) Přidat oprávnění`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:127
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Microsoft Graph` under :guilabel:`Commonly Used Microsoft "
"APIs`."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte :guilabel:`Microsoft Graph` pod :guilabel:`Běžně používaná rozhraní "
"API společnosti Microsoft`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:128
msgid "Choose :guilabel:`Delegated Permissions`."
msgstr "Zvolte :guilabel:`Delegovaná oprávnění`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:129
msgid ""
"Search for :guilabel:`User.Read`, select it, and click :guilabel:`Add "
"permissions`."
msgstr ""
"Vyhledejte :guilabel:`User.Read`, vyberte ho a klikněte na :guilabel:`Přidat "
"oprávnění`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:132
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:111
msgid "Odoo setup"
msgstr "Odoo-opsætning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:134
msgid ""
"Finally, the last step in the Microsoft Azure OAuth configuration is to "
"complete the setup in Odoo. Navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Integrations` and enable the checkbox for :guilabel:`OAuth Authentication`. "
"Click :guilabel:`Save` to save the changes and refresh the page. Scroll down "
"to the :menuselection:`Integrations` section, and click on :guilabel:`OAuth "
"Providers`. Then click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Posledním krokem konfigurace Microsoft Azure OAuth je dokončení nastavení v "
"Odoo. Přejděte na :menuselection:`Nastavení --> Integrace` a povolte "
"zaškrtávací políčko pro :guilabel:`Ověřování OAuth`. Klikněte "
"na :guilabel:`Uložit`, uložte změny a obnovte stránku. Posuňte se dolů do "
"sekce :menuselection:`Integrace` a klikněte na :guilabel:`Poskytovatelé "
"OAuth`. Poté klikněte na :guilabel:`Nový`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:140
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Provider name` as `Azure`. Paste "
"the :guilabel:`Application (client) ID` from the previous section into "
"the :guilabel:`Client ID` field. After completing this, paste the "
"new :guilabel:`OAuth 2.0 authorization endpoint (v2)` value into "
"the :guilabel:`Authorization URL` field."
msgstr ""
"Zadejte :guilabel:`Název poskytovatele` jako `Azure`. Vložte :guilabel:`ID "
"aplikace (klienta)` z předchozí sekce do pole :guilabel:`ID klienta`. Po "
"dokončení vložte novou hodnotu :guilabel:`Koncový bod autorizace OAuth 2.0 "
"(v2)` do pole :guilabel:`Autorizační URL`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:145
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`UserInfo URL` field, paste the following :abbr:`URL "
"(Uniform Resource Locator)`: `https://graph.microsoft.com/oidc/userinfo`"
msgstr ""
"I feltet :guilabel:`UserInfo-URL` skal du indsætte følgende :abbr:`URL "
"(Uniform Resource Locator)`: `https://graph.microsoft.com/oidc/userinfo`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:148
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Scope` field, paste the following value: `openid profile "
"email`. Next, the Windows logo can be used as the CSS class on the login "
"screen by entering the following value: `fa fa-fw fa-windows`, in "
"the :guilabel:`CSS class` field."
msgstr ""
"I feltet :guilabel:`Omfang` skal du indsætte følgende værdi: `openid profile "
"email`. Dernæst kan Windows-logoet bruges som CSS-klassen på loginskærmen "
"ved at indtaste følgende værdi: `fa fa-fw fa-windows` i "
"feltet :guilabel:`CSS-klasse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:152
msgid ""
"Check the box next to the :guilabel:`Allowed` field to enable the OAuth "
"provider. Finally, add `Microsoft Azure` to the :guilabel:`Login button "
"label` field. This text will appear next to the Windows logo on the login "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Marker afkrydsningsfeltet ved siden af feltet :guilabel:`Tilladt` for at "
"aktivere OAuth-udbyderen. Tilføj endelig `Microsoft Azure` til "
"feltet :guilabel:`Loginknap-etiket`. Denne tekst vises ved siden af Windows-"
"logoet på loginsiden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:156
msgid "Odoo provider setup in the Settings application."
msgstr "Odoo-udbyderopsætning i applikationen Indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:159
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Save` the changes to complete the OAuth authentication setup in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Gem` ændringerne for at fuldføre OAuth-godkendelsesopsætningen i "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:162
msgid "User experience flows"
msgstr "Brugeroplevelsesflow"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:164
msgid ""
"For a user to log in to Odoo using Microsoft Azure, the user must be on "
"the :menuselection:`Odoo password reset page`. This is the only way that "
"Odoo is able to link the Microsoft Azure account and allow the user to log "
"in."
msgstr ""
"For at en bruger kan logge ind på Odoo ved hjælp af Microsoft Azure, skal "
"brugeren være på :menuselection:`Odoo-adgangskode nulstillingsside`. Dette "
"er den eneste måde, hvorpå Odoo kan linke Microsoft Azure-kontoen og tillade "
"brugeren at logge ind."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:169
msgid ""
"Existing users must :ref:`reset their password <users/reset-password>` to "
"access the :menuselection:`Odoo password reset page`. New Odoo users must "
"click the new user invitation link that was sent via email, then click "
"on :guilabel:`Microsoft Azure`. Users should not set a new password."
msgstr ""
"Eksisterende brugere skal :ref:`nulstille deres adgangskode <users/reset-"
"password>` for at få adgang til :menuselection:`Odoo-adgangskode "
"nulstillingsside`. Nye Odoo-brugere skal klikke på det nye "
"brugerinvitationslink, der blev sendt via e-mail, og derefter klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Microsoft Azure`. Brugere bør ikke angive en ny adgangskode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:174
msgid ""
"To sign in to Odoo for the first time using the Microsoft Azure OAuth "
"provider, navigate to the :menuselection:`Odoo password reset page` (using "
"the new user invitation link). A password reset page should appear. Then, "
"click on the option labeled :guilabel:`Microsoft Azure`. The page will "
"redirect to the Microsoft login page."
msgstr ""
"For at logge ind på Odoo første gang ved hjælp af Microsoft Azure OAuth-"
"udbyderen skal du navigere til :menuselection:`Odoo-adgangskode "
"nulstillingsside` (ved hjælp af det nye brugerinvitationslink). En side til "
"nulstilling af adgangskode skulle vises. Klik derefter på muligheden "
"mærket :guilabel:`Microsoft Azure`. Siden omdirigerer til Microsoft-"
"loginsiden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:179
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Microsoft Email Address` and click :guilabel:`Next`. "
"Follow the process to sign in to the account. Should :abbr:`2FA (Two Factor "
"Authentication)` be turned on, then an extra step may be required."
msgstr ""
"Indtast :guilabel:`Microsoft Email Address` og klik på :guilabel:`Next`. "
"Følg processen for at logge ind på kontoen. Hvis :abbr:`2FA (Two Factor "
"Authentication)` er aktiveret, kan der være behov for et ekstra trin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/azure.rst:183
msgid ""
"Finally, after logging in to the account, the page will redirect to a "
"permissions page where the user will be prompted to :guilabel:`Accept` the "
"conditions that the Odoo application will access their Microsoft information."
msgstr ""
"Endelig, efter login på kontoen, vil siden omdirigere til en "
"tilladelsesside, hvor brugeren vil blive bedt om at :guilabel:`Accept` "
"betingelserne for, at Odoo-applikationen får adgang til deres Microsoft-"
"oplysninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:3
msgid "Facebook sign-in authentication"
msgstr "Facebook-login-godkendelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Facebook* OAuth sign-in function allows Odoo users to sign in to their "
"database with their Facebook account."
msgstr ""
"*Facebook* OAuth-login-funktionen giver Odoo-brugere mulighed for at logge "
"ind på deres database med deres Facebook-konto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:9
msgid ""
"Databases housed on Odoo.com should **not** use OAuth login for the owner or "
"administrator of the database, as it would unlink the database from their "
"Odoo.com account. If OAuth is setup for that user, the database can no "
"longer be duplicated, renamed, or otherwise managed from the Odoo.com portal."
msgstr ""
"Databaser, der er hostet på Odoo.com, bør **ikke** bruge OAuth-login til "
"ejeren eller administratoren af databasen, da det ville fjerne koblingen "
"mellem databasen og deres Odoo.com-konto. Hvis OAuth er konfigureret for den "
"bruger, kan databasen ikke længere duplikeres, omdøbes eller på anden måde "
"administreres fra Odoo.com-portalen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:15
msgid "Meta for Developers setup"
msgstr "Opsætning af Meta for Developers"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:17
msgid ""
"Go to `Meta for Developers <https://developers.facebook.com/>`_ and log in. "
"Click :guilabel:`My Apps`. On the :guilabel:`Apps` page, "
"click :guilabel:`Create App`."
msgstr ""
"Gå til `Meta for Developers <https://developers.facebook.com/>`_ og log ind. "
"Klik på :guilabel:`My Apps`. På siden :guilabel:`Apps` skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Create App`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:20
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Use cases` page, select :guilabel:`Authenticate and "
"request data from users with Facebook Login`, then click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Use cases` skal du vælge :guilabel:`Authenticate and "
"request data from users with Facebook Login` og derefter klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Next`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:23
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Add an app name` field, enter `Odoo Login OAuth`, or a "
"similar title."
msgstr ""
"I feltet :guilabel:`Add an app name` skal du indtaste `Odoo Login OAuth` "
"eller en lignende titel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:26
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`App contact email` automatically defaults to the email "
"address associated with the Meta account. If this email address is not "
"regularly monitored, it may be wise to use another email address."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`App contact email` indstilles automatisk til den e-mailadresse, "
"der er tilknyttet Meta-kontoen. Hvis denne e-mailadresse ikke overvåges "
"regelmæssigt, kan det være klogt at bruge en anden e-mailadresse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:30
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Next`. Review the :guilabel:`Publishing requirements`, "
"the :guilabel:`Meta Platform Terms`, and :guilabel:`Developer Policies`. "
"Then, click :guilabel:`Create app`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Next`. Gennemgå :guilabel:`Publishing "
"requirements`, :guilabel:`Meta Platform Terms` og :guilabel:`Developer "
"Policies`. Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Create app`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:34
msgid "Clicking :guilabel:`Create app` may require password re-entry."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Create app` kan kræve, at adgangskoden indtastes igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:37
msgid "Customize app"
msgstr "Tilpas app"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:39
msgid ""
"After the new app is created, the :guilabel:`Dashboard` page appears, with a "
