#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:3
msgid "LDAP authentication"
msgstr "LDAP-godkendelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:5
msgid ""
"To configure :abbr:`LDAP (Lightweight Directory Access Protocol)` "
"authentication in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Sådan konfigurerer du :abbr:`LDAP (Lightweight Directory Access Protocol)`-"
"godkendelse i Odoo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:7
msgid ""
"Open the Settings app, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Integrations` section, "
"and enable :guilabel:`LDAP Authentication`."
msgstr ""
"Åbn Indstillinger-appen, rul ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Integrationer` og "
"aktiver :guilabel:`LDAP-godkendelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:9
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Save`, then go back to the :guilabel:`Integrations` section "
"and click :guilabel:`LDAP Server`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Gem`, gå derefter tilbage til "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Integrationer` og klik på :guilabel:`LDAP-server`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:11
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Set up your LDAP Server` list, click :guilabel:`New`, then "
"select the required company in the dropdown list."
msgstr ""
"På listen :guilabel:`Opsæt din LDAP-server` skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Ny` "
"og derefter vælge den nødvendige virksomhed på rullelisten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:13
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Server information` section, enter the server's IP address "
"and port in the :guilabel:`LDAP server address` and :guilabel:`LDAP Server "
"port` fields, respectively."
msgstr ""
"I afsnittet :guilabel:`Serveroplysninger` skal du angive serverens IP-"
"adresse og port i felterne :guilabel:`LDAP-serveradresse` og :guilabel:`LDAP-"
"serverport`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:15
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Use TLS` to request secure TLS/SSL encryption when "
"connecting to the LDAP server, providing the server has StartTLS enabled."
msgstr ""
"Aktiver :guilabel:`Brug TLS` for at anmode om sikker TLS/SSL-kryptering ved "
"forbindelse til LDAP-serveren, forudsat at serveren har StartTLS aktiveret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:17
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Login information` section, enter the ID and password of "
"the account used to query the server in the :guilabel:`LDAP binddn` "
"and :guilabel:`LDAP password` fields, respectively. If the fields are left "
"empty, the server will perform the query anonymously."
msgstr ""
"I afsnittet :guilabel:`Loginoplysninger` skal du angive ID og adgangskode "
"for den konto, der bruges til at forespørge serveren, i "
"felterne :guilabel:`LDAP binddn` og :guilabel:`LDAP-adgangskode`. Hvis "
"felterne efterlades tomme, udfører serveren forespørgslen anonymt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:20
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Process parameter` section, enter:"
msgstr "I afsnittet :guilabel:`Procesparameter` skal du angive:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:22
msgid ""
"the LDAP server's name in the :guilabel:`LDAP base` field using LDAP format "
"(e.g., ``dc=example,dc=com``);"
msgstr ""
"LDAP-serverens navn i feltet :guilabel:`LDAP-base` ved hjælp af LDAP-format "
"(f.eks. ``dc=example,dc=com``);"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:24
msgid "``uid=%s`` in the :guilabel:`LDAP filter` field."
msgstr "``uid=%s`` i feltet :guilabel:`LDAP-filter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:26
msgid "In the :guilabel:`User information` section:"
msgstr "I afsnittet :guilabel:`Brugeroplysninger`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:28
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Create user` to create a user profile in Odoo the first "
"time someone logs in using LDAP;"
msgstr ""
"Aktiver :guilabel:`Opret bruger` for at oprette en brugerprofil i Odoo "
"første gang nogen logger ind med LDAP;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:30
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`User template` to be used to create the new user "
"profiles. If no template is selected, the administrator's profile is used."
msgstr ""
"Vælg den :guilabel:`Brugerskabelon`, der skal bruges til at oprette de nye "
"brugerprofiler. Hvis ingen skabelon er valgt, bruges administratorens profil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/ldap.rst:34
msgid ""
"When using Microsoft Active Directory (AD) for LDAP authentication, if users "
