#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:5
msgid "User portals"
msgstr "Brugerportaler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:9
msgid ""
"The user portal is a module available by default in Odoo. Users, both "
"customers and vendors, can be granted :doc:`access to the portal </"
"applications/general/users/access_rights>` by businesses in order to view "
"certain documents or information within an Odoo database. For example, some "
"common use cases for providing portal access include allowing customers and "
"vendors to:"
msgstr ""
"Brugerportalen er et modul, der er tilgængeligt som standard i Odoo. "
"Brugere, både kunder og leverandører, kan få :doc:`adgang til portalen </"
"applications/general/users/access_rights>` af virksomheder for at se "
"bestemte dokumenter eller oplysninger i en Odoo-database. For eksempel "
"omfatter nogle almindelige use cases for at give portaladgang at tillade "
"kunder og leverandører at:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:14
msgid "Follow, view, and pay orders"
msgstr "Følge, se og betale ordrer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:15
msgid ""
"Follow, download, or pay invoices, including partial payments and down "
"payments"
msgstr ""
"Følge, downloade eller betale fakturaer, inklusive delvise betalinger og "
"acontobetalinger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:16
msgid "Manage :ref:`product returns <ecommerce/handling/returns>`"
msgstr "Administrer :ref:`produktreturneringer <ecommerce/handling/returns>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:17
msgid "Manage payment methods"
msgstr "Administrere betalingsmetoder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:18
msgid "Manage subscriptions"
msgstr "Administrere abonnementer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:19
msgid "Add, remove, or modify their addresses"
msgstr "Tilføje, fjerne eller ændre deres adresser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:20
msgid "Configure connection parameters between Odoo and 3rd-party services"
msgstr "Konfigurere forbindelsesparametre mellem Odoo og tredjepartstjenester"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals.rst:23
msgid ""
"Portal users only have read/view access, and will **not** be able to edit "
"any documents in the database."
msgstr ""
"Portalbrugere har kun læse-/visningstilladelse og vil **ikke** kunne "
"redigere nogen dokumenter i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:3
msgid "Granting portal access"
msgstr "Tildeling af portaladgang"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:5
msgid ""
"For the customers and vendors of a business to begin using a user portal, "
"they must first be granted access by the business. The process to do this "
"begins in the **Contacts** application."
msgstr ""
"For at kunder og leverandører af en virksomhed kan begynde at bruge en "
"brugerportal, skal de først tildeles adgang af virksomheden. Processen til "
"at gøre dette begynder i applikationen **Adressebog**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:9
msgid "Adding portal access to a contact"
msgstr "Tilføjelse af portaladgang til en kontakt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:11
msgid ""
"From the main Odoo dashboard, open the :guilabel:`Contacts` application. If "
"the contact to be granted access is not yet in the database, create an entry "
"for them by clicking the :guilabel:`New` button and entering their details. "
"Otherwise, choose an existing contact, then click on the :icon:`fa-"
"gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)` drop-down menu and select :guilabel:`Grant "
"portal access`."
msgstr ""
"Fra hovedoversigten i Odoo åbnes applikationen :guilabel:`Adressebog`. Hvis "
"kontakten, der skal tildeles adgang, endnu ikke er i databasen, oprettes en "
"post for dem ved at klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Ny` og indtaste deres "
"oplysninger. Ellers vælges en eksisterende kontakt, klik derefter på "
"rullemenuen :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`Handlinger` og vælg :guilabel:`Tildel "
"portaladgang`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:16
msgid "Use the Contacts application to give portal access to users."
msgstr "Brug Adressebog-applikationen til at give portaladgang til brugere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:19
msgid ""
"This brings up the :guilabel:`Portal Access Management` window, which has "
"three fields:"
msgstr ""
"Dette åbner vinduet :guilabel:`Administration af portaladgang`, som har tre "
"felter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:21
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contact`: This field is automatically populated with the name on "
"the contact."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kontakt`: Dette felt udfyldes automatisk med navnet på kontakten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:22
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email`: This field shows the contact's email address used to log "
"into the portal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`E-mail`: Dette felt viser kontaktens e-mailadresse, der bruges "
"til at logge ind på portalen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Latest Authentication`: The last time the user accessed the "
"portal appears on this line. If the user has never accessed the portal, it "
"is blank."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Seneste godkendelse`: Sidste gang brugeren tilgik portalen vises "
"på denne linje. Hvis brugeren aldrig har tilgået portalen, er den blank."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:26
msgid ""
"To grant portal access, first enter the email address the contact will use "
"to log into the portal. This may have been automatically entered by the "
"system if an existing contact is being granted access. Then click "
"the :guilabel:`Grant Access` button to finish."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele portaladgang indtastes først den e-mailadresse, kontakten vil "
"bruge til at logge ind på portalen. Dette kan være blevet automatisk "
"indtastet af systemet, hvis en eksisterende kontakt tildeles adgang. Klik "
"derefter på knappen :guilabel:`Tildel adgang` for at afslutte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:30
msgid "Grant access in the Portal Access Management window."
msgstr "Tildel adgang i vinduet Administration af portaladgang."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:34
msgid ""
"When portal access is granted to a Company, all contacts affiliated with "
"that company are granted portal access. Individual contacts can be removed "
"as needed."
msgstr ""
"Når portaladgang gives til en virksomhed, får alle kontakter tilknyttet den "
"pågældende virksomhed portaladgang. Enkelte kontakter kan fjernes efter "
"behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:38
msgid "Granting access to multiple users at once"
msgstr "Tildele adgang til flere brugere på én gang"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:40
msgid ""
"To grant portal access to multiple users from a single company at once, "
"navigate to the contact listing for that company, then "
"click :menuselection:`Action --> Grant portal access` to view a list of the "
"company's related contacts. Click :guilabel:`Grant Access` for each contact "
"that needs portal access. An email is sent to the specified email address, "
"indicating that the contact is now a portal user for that Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele portaladgang til flere brugere fra en enkelt virksomhed på én "
"gang navigeres til kontaktlisten for den pågældende virksomhed, klik "
"derefter på :menuselection:`Handling --> Tildel portaladgang` for at se en "
"liste over virksomhedens relaterede kontakter. Klik på :guilabel:`Tildel "
"adgang` for hver kontakt, der har brug for portaladgang. Der sendes en e-"
"mail til den angivne e-mailadresse, der angiver, at kontakten nu er en "
"portalbruger for den pågældende Odoo-database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:46
msgid "Grant access to multiple users at once."
msgstr "Tildel adgang til flere brugere på én gang."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:52
msgid "Revoking portal access"
msgstr "Tilbagekalde portaladgang"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:54
msgid ""
"Some situations may require revoking an individual's portal access, such as "
"when they retire or leave a company. Portal access can be revoked from a "
"contact at any time by navigating to a contact, "
"clicking :menuselection:`Action --> Grant portal access`, and then "
"clicking :guilabel:`Revoke Access`."
msgstr ""
"Nogle situationer kan kræve tilbagekaldelse af en persons portaladgang, "
"f.eks. når de går på pension eller forlader en virksomhed. Portaladgang kan "
"tilbagekaldes fra en kontakt når som helst ved at navigere til en kontakt, "
"klikke på :menuselection:`Handling --> Tildel portaladgang` og derefter "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Tilbagekald adgang`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/portal_access.rst:59
msgid "Revoke access from a user."
msgstr "Tilbagekald adgang fra en bruger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:3
msgid "Updating portal info"
msgstr "Opdatering af portalinfo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:5
msgid ""
"There may be times when a user would like to make changes to their contact, "
"security, or payment information connected to their portal account. Portal "
"users can update most information by logging into their account and making "
"the changes themselves, but some updates may require a user with "
"administrator access rights."
msgstr ""
"Der kan være tidspunkter, hvor en bruger gerne vil foretage ændringer af "
"deres kontakt-, sikkerheds- eller betalingsoplysninger tilknyttet deres "
"portalkonto. Portalbrugere kan opdatere de fleste oplysninger ved at logge "
"ind på deres konto og foretage ændringerne selv, men nogle opdateringer kan "
"kræve en bruger med administratoradgangsrettigheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:10
msgid ""
"Updating user information begins with logging into the user portal. Once a "
"user has logged in and is on the portal dashboard, they can begin making "
"changes to their information."
msgstr ""
"Opdatering af brugeroplysninger begynder med at logge ind på brugerportalen. "
"Når en bruger har logget ind og er på portaldashboardet, kan de begynde at "
"foretage ændringer af deres oplysninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:14
msgid ""
"Passwords for portal users and Odoo.com users remain separate, even if the "
"same email address is used."
msgstr ""
"Adgangskoder for portalbrugere og Odoo.com-brugere forbliver separate, selv "
"hvis den samme e-mailadresse bruges."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:18
msgid "User-driven updates"
msgstr "Brugerdrevne opdateringer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:21
msgid "Update contact info"
msgstr "Opdatering af kontaktinfo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:23
msgid ""
"From the portal dashboard, click the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`Edit "
"information` button under the user contact information. This brings up a new "
"page where contact information can be updated."
msgstr ""
"Fra portaldashboardet klikkes på knappen :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`Rediger oplysninger` under brugerens kontaktoplysninger. "
"Dette åbner en ny side, hvor kontaktoplysninger kan opdateres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:26
msgid "On this screen, users can update their:"
msgstr "På denne skærm kan brugere opdatere deres:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:28
msgid ":guilabel:`Your name`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Dit navn`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:30
msgid ":guilabel:`Phone`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Telefon`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:31
msgid "Company name"
msgstr "Firmanavn"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:32
msgid "Mailing address"
msgstr "Postadresse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:33
msgid "Invoice delivery preference"
msgstr "Præference for fakturaleverance"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:35
msgid ""
"Additonal fields and descriptions may appear depending on the user's "
"location and the location of the company that created the portal."
msgstr ""
"Yderligere felter og beskrivelser kan vises afhængigt af brugerens placering "
"og placeringen af det firma, der oprettede portalen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:38
msgid ""
"Once users have updated their information, they can click :guilabel:`Save "
"Address` to save any changes they've made or :guilabel:`Discard` to return "
"to the portal dashboard. By default, the only fields that need to be filled "
"out to save users' information are their names, emails, phone numbers, and "
"addresses."
msgstr ""
"Når brugere har opdateret deres oplysninger, kan de klikke på :guilabel:`Gem "
"adresse` for at gemme eventuelle ændringer, de har foretaget, "
"eller :guilabel:`Kassér` for at vende tilbage til portalens dashboard. Som "
"standard er de eneste felter, der skal udfyldes for at gemme brugernes "
"oplysninger, deres navne, e-mails, telefonnumre og adresser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:44
msgid ""
"Once the system has generated any documents for a user's account, their "
"country **cannot** be updated. If users need to update their country at that "
"point, they must reach out to a user with administrator access rights."
msgstr ""
"Når systemet har genereret dokumenter for en brugers konto, **kan** deres "
"land **ikke** opdateres. Hvis brugere har brug for at opdatere deres land på "
"det tidspunkt, skal de kontakte en bruger med "
"administratoradgangsrettigheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:51
msgid "Update payment info"
msgstr "Opdater betalingsoplysninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:53
msgid ""
"From the portal dashboard, click the :guilabel:`Payment methods` button. "
"This brings up a new page that shows any saved payment methods."
msgstr ""
"Fra portalens dashboard skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Betalingsmetoder`. Dette åbner en ny side, der viser "
"eventuelle gemte betalingsmetoder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:56
msgid ""
"To add a new payment option, choose from the available payment methods, "
"enter the new payment information, and click :guilabel:`Save` to save the "
"details. To remove a payment option, click the :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`(Delete payment method)` icon, then click "
"the :guilabel:`Confirm Deletion` button."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje en ny betalingsmulighed skal du vælge blandt de tilgængelige "
"betalingsmetoder, indtaste de nye betalingsoplysninger og klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Gem` for at gemme detaljerne. For at fjerne en "
"betalingsmulighed skal du klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(Slet "
"betalingsmetode)` og derefter klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Bekræft sletning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:62
msgid ""
"Users that need to update payment information **must** delete any existing "
"information and enter their new or updated info. Payment information "
"**cannot** be edited and must be re-entered."
msgstr ""
"Brugere, der har brug for at opdatere betalingsoplysninger, **skal** slette "
"eventuelle eksisterende oplysninger og indtaste deres nye eller opdaterede "
"oplysninger. Betalingsoplysninger **kan ikke** redigeres og skal indtastes "
"igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:66
msgid "Update passwords and manage security"
msgstr "Opdater adgangskoder og administrer sikkerhed"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:68
msgid ""
"From the portal dashboard, click the :guilabel:`Connection & Security` "
"button. This brings up a new page with five sections. The following sections "
"can each be edited and updated."
msgstr ""
"Fra portalens dashboard skal du klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Forbindelse og "
"sikkerhed`. Dette åbner en ny side med fem sektioner. Følgende sektioner kan "
"hver især redigeres og opdateres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:72
msgid "Change Password"
msgstr "Skift adgangskode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:74
msgid ""
"Here the user can enter their current password and a new password they wish "
"to change to. The new password can be saved by clicking :guilabel:`Change "
"Password`."
msgstr ""
"Her kan brugeren indtaste deres nuværende adgangskode og en ny adgangskode, "
"de ønsker at skifte til. Den nye adgangskode kan gemmes ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Skift adgangskode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:80
msgid ""
"The user's currrent 2FA status is shownn as an alert. If 2FA is not enabled, "
"an :guilabel:`Enable two-factor authentication` link appears. If it is "
"enabled, a link reading :guilabel:`Disable two-factor authentication` "
"appears instead."
msgstr ""
"Brugerens nuværende 2FA-status vises som en advarsel. Hvis 2FA ikke er "
"aktiveret, vises et link med teksten :guilabel:`Aktivér to-faktor-"
"godkendelse`. Hvis det er aktiveret, vises i stedet et link med "
"teksten :guilabel:`Deaktivér to-faktor-godkendelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:85
msgid ""
"Clicking the :icon:`fa-info-circle` :guilabel:`(Documentation)` icon opens a "
"page that explains how two-factor authentication (2FA) works."
msgstr ""
"Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-info-circle` :guilabel:`(Dokumentation)` for at "
"åbne en side, der forklarer, hvordan to-faktor-godkendelse (2FA) fungerer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:89
msgid "Passkeys"
msgstr "Adgangsnøgler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:91
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add Passkey` to create a passkey that simplifies the login "
"process. Any previously created passkeys are shown here, alongside "
"information on when they were created and when they were last used. When "
"creating a passkey, Odoo asks for a password to confirm account ownership "
"before allowing a passkey to be set. Once account ownership has been "
"confirmed, the passkey must be named to differentiate it from other "
"passkeys. Clicking :guilabel:`Create` brings up a browser prompt to create "
"the passkey. Complete the passkey creation process in the browser. They can "
"be renamed by clicking the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(pencil)` button or "
"deleted by clicking their :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(trash can)` button."
msgstr ""
"Kliknutím na :guilabel:`Přidat přístupový klíč` vytvoříte přístupový klíč, "
"který zjednodušuje proces přihlášení. Všechny dříve vytvořené přístupové "
"klíče jsou zde zobrazeny spolu s informacemi o tom, kdy byly vytvořeny a kdy "
"byly naposledy použity. Při vytváření přístupového klíče Odoo požádá o heslo "
"pro potvrzení vlastnictví účtu, než umožní nastavení přístupového klíče. Po "
"potvrzení vlastnictví účtu musí být přístupový klíč pojmenován, aby se "
"odlišil od ostatních přístupových klíčů. Kliknutí na :guilabel:`Vytvořit` "
"zobrazí výzvu prohlížeče k vytvoření přístupového klíče. Dokončete proces "
"vytváření přístupového klíče v prohlížeči. Přístupové klíče lze přejmenovat "
"kliknutím na tlačítko :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(tužka)` nebo odstranit "
"kliknutím na tlačítko :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(koš)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:101
msgid "Revoke All Sessions"
msgstr "Odvolat všechny relace"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:103
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`Log out from all devices` button brings up a pop-up "
"prompting the user to enter their password. Once they do so and "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm Password`, the system logs them out of all sessions "
"except for the current one."
msgstr ""
"Kliknutí na tlačítko :guilabel:`Odhlásit ze všech zařízení` zobrazí "
"vyskakovací okno, které vyzve uživatele k zadání hesla. Jakmile tak učiní a "
"klikne na :guilabel:`Potvrdit heslo`, systém je odhlásí ze všech relací "
"kromě aktuální."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:108
msgid "Delete Account"
msgstr "Smazat účet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:110
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`Delete Account` button brings up a pop-up to "
"completely and irrevocably delete the user's account. Users must enter their "
"password and their login name to complete the process. They can also choose "
"to have their email address and phone number added to an internal block list "
"to prevent any future communication."
msgstr ""
"Kliknutí na tlačítko :guilabel:`Smazat účet` zobrazí vyskakovací okno pro "
"úplné a neodvolatelné smazání uživatelského účtu. Uživatelé musí zadat své "
"heslo a přihlašovací jméno pro dokončení procesu. Mohou si také zvolit, že "
"jejich e-mailová adresa a telefonní číslo budou přidány do interního "
"blokového seznamu, aby se zabránilo jakékoli budoucí komunikaci."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:116
msgid "Administrator-driven updates"
msgstr "Aktualizace řízené správcem"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:119
msgid "Accessing user information as an administrator"
msgstr "Přístup k informacím o uživateli jako správce"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:121
msgid ""
"First, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users` and "
"click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Manage Users` Then, click "
"the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(Remove)` icon to clear "
"the :guilabel:`Internal Users` search filter and use the :icon:`fa-sort-"
"desc` :guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` button to add :guilabel:`Portal "
"Users` as a filter. After making this selection, search for and open the "
"portal user that needs to be edited."
msgstr ""
"Nejprve přejděte na :menuselection:`Aplikace Nastavení --> Uživatelé` a "
"klikněte na :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Spravovat uživatele`. Poté "
"klikněte na ikonu :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(Odstranit)` pro vymazání "
"vyhledávacího filtru :guilabel:`Interní uživatelé` a použijte "
"tlačítko :icon:`fa-sort-desc` :guilabel:`(Přepnout vyhledávací panel)` pro "
"přidání :guilabel:`Portáloví uživatelé` jako filtr. Po provedení tohoto "
"výběru vyhledejte a otevřete portálového uživatele, který potřebuje být "
"upraven."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:128
msgid "Update email address"
msgstr "Aktualizovat e-mailovou adresu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:130
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`(Email)` field shows the email address "
"the user uses to log into the Odoo database. A user with administrator "
"access rights can make any necessary changes by clicking into the field and "
"updating the user's email address."
msgstr ""
"Pole :icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`(E-mail)` zobrazuje e-mailovou adresu, "
"kterou uživatel používá k přihlášení do databáze Odoo. Uživatel s "
"přístupovými právy správce může provést potřebné změny kliknutím do pole a "
"aktualizací e-mailové adresy uživatele."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:135
msgid ""
"Users **cannot** change their own login usernames. Changing the :icon:`fa-"
"key` :guilabel:`(Login)` only changes the *username* on the user's portal "
"login. Users' email addresses can be changed in the :guilabel:`Manage Users` "
"module, the **Contacts** app, or by the users themselves in the portal."
msgstr ""
"Uživatelé **nemohou** měnit svá vlastní přihlašovací uživatelská jména. "
"Změna :icon:`fa-key` :guilabel:`(Přihlášení)` změní pouze *uživatelské "
"jméno* při přihlášení uživatele na portál. E-mailové adresy uživatelů lze "
"změnit v modulu :guilabel:`Spravovat uživatele`, aplikaci **Adressebog** "
"nebo samotnými uživateli na portálu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:141
msgid "Update passwords"
msgstr "Aktualizovat hesla"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:143
msgid ""
"Users' security settings can be adjusted under the :guilabel:`Security` tab "
"on their Contact form. Under the :guilabel:`Security` tab, there are options "
"to:"
msgstr ""
"Nastavení zabezpečení uživatelů lze upravit na kartě :guilabel:`Zabezpečení` "
"na jejich kontaktním formuláři. Na kartě :guilabel:`Zabezpečení` jsou "
"možnosti:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:146
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Change password` Click the :guilabel:`Change password` button to "
"bring up a form that shows what logins the user has access to and enter a "
"new password. Click :guilabel:`Change Password` to save the password or "
"click :guilabel:`Cancel` to return to the previous screen."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Změnit heslo`. Kliknutím na tlačítko :guilabel:`Změnit heslo` "
"zobrazíte formulář, který ukazuje, k jakým přihlášením má uživatel přístup, "
"a zadejte nové heslo. Klikněte na :guilabel:`Změnit heslo` pro uložení hesla "
"nebo klikněte na :guilabel:`Zrušit` pro návrat na předchozí obrazovku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invite to use 2FA`. Click the :guilabel:`Invite to use 2FA` "
"button to bring up a pop-up notification that an invitation to use two-"
"factor authentication was sent."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pozvat k použití 2FA`. Kliknutím na tlačítko :guilabel:`Pozvat k "
"použití 2FA` zobrazíte vyskakovací meddelelse, že byla odeslána pozvánka k "
"použití dvoufaktorového ověřování."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/user_portals/updating_portal_info.rst:153
msgid ":doc:`Access rights </applications/general/users/access_rights>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Přístupová práva </applications/general/users/access_rights>`"

